te Tier 8 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the near total dark.Complete 10 Delving Missions on Tier 9Complete Tier 9 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)So deeply have you delved that you are now a terror to the things that lurk in the darkness. You are the deepest delver.Complete delving missions throughout the world at all different tiers.Complete the deed There and Back AgainComplete the deed A Memory of LightComplete the deed Shadows EngulfComplete the deed The Deepest, Darkest CrevasseComplete the deed Panic in the DeepComplete the deed Darkest SecretsComplete the deed Darkest NightComplete the deed Deepest Delving ConquerorComplete the deed Deepest Delving LiberatorComplete the deed Wrath of the LightYou have fought the forces of evil and triumphed over and over in the greater dark.Complete 100 Delving Missions on Tier 8Complete Tier 8 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed countless times in the near total dark.Complete 100 Delving Missions on Tier 9Complete Tier 9 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You have been down to the deepest delvings, fought the darkest shadow, and come back triumphant.Complete a mission at every delving tier onceComplete the deed The Adventure Begins...Complete the deed A Dim LightComplete the deed Shadows UnfurlComplete the deed A Deep, Dark CrevasseComplete the deed Unease in the DeepComplete the deed Dark SecretsComplete the deed NightComplete the deed Deep Delving ConquerorComplete the deed Deep Delving LiberatorComplete the deed Light's HopeYou have explored the depths of evil and triumphed over the greater darkness.Complete many high tier delvings in 3 and 6-person instances.Complete a Delving 3-person Instance on Tier 8Complete a Delving 3-person Instance on Tier 10Complete a Delving 3-person Instance on Tier 12Complete a Delving 6-person Instance on Tier 8Complete a Delving 6-person Instance on Tier 10Complete a Delving 6-person Instance on Tier 12You are starting to explore further in the dark, pushing the shadows back.Complete 10 Delving Missions on Tier 5Complete Tier 5 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)You have delved in the darkness and triumphed against the shadow many times.Complete 50 delvings on any difficultyComplete any tier of delvings (${NUMBER}/50)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the supreme dark.Complete a Delving Mission on Tier 10Complete a Tier 10 Delving MissionYou have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the supreme dark.Complete a Delving 3-person Instance on Tier 10Complete a Delving 3-person Instance on Tier 10You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the supreme dark.Complete a Delving 6-person Instance on Tier 10Complete a Delving 6-person Instance on Tier 10You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the supreme dark.Complete 10 Delving Missions on Tier 10Complete Tier 10 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)You are a master of the light.Complete 1000 delvings on any difficultyComplete any tier of delvings (${NUMBER}/1000)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the greater dark.Complete a Delving Mission on Tier 7Complete a Tier 7 Delving MissionYou have spent days exploring further into the dark, pushing the shadows back.Complete 100 Delving Missions on Tier 5Complete Tier 5 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed repeatedly in the lesser dark.Complete 10 Delving Missions on Tier 3Complete Tier 3 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed over and over in the lesser dark.Complete 100 Delving Missions on Tier 3Complete Tier 3 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed in the lesser dark.Complete a Delving Mission on Tier 3Complete a Tier 3 Delving MissionYou have fought the forces of evil and triumphed countless times in the lesser dark.Complete 100 Delving Missions on Tier 4Complete Tier 4 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You have fought the forces of evil and triumphed repeatedly in the lesser dark.Complete 10 Delving Missions on Tier 1Complete Tier 1 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/10)You have spent a great deal of time working through some tougher missions and competing against the lesser enemies in the darkness.Complete 100 Tier 1 Delving MissionsComplete Tier 1 Delving Missions (${NUMBER}/100)You are starting to explore further in the dark, pushing the shadows back.Complete a Delving Mission on Tier 5Complete a Tier 5 Delving MissionThe enemies of Urush Dâr use the poison glands of the usan-kûni on their blades. We must do our best to reduce this practice.Your mission is to travel to Dul Râkh and stop the Anâkhi cultists there from producing more of their deadly poisons. If you can, slay their head apothecary Goródha as well.Defeat Anâkhi cultists (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Goródha has shown herself. You must defeat her to stop the Anâkhi's poison production!Goródha has shown herself in Dul Râkh. Find and defeat her!Goródha has shown herself. You must defeat her to stop the Anâkhi's poison production!Find and defeat Goródha'Those cultists won't be a problem any time soon thanks to you. We should return to Ub Nishir.'Completing this quest will turn your difficulty back down to normal levels.Completing this quest will return you to normal difficulty and permanently prevent the completion of any difficulty based deeds.Speak with the Hardened Traveller'Greetings traveller. I watch those who stride the roads of Middle-earth in search of challenge and adventure. Yet there are those who become weary of battle and wish to explore the world in relative peace.'

'If you seek to tread upon gentler roads once again, I can set your feet upon that path.'

<rgb=#FFFF00>Completing this quest will return the game to its normal difficulty.</rgb>'Are you certain you wish to return to the easier path? 'Tis entirely understandable - such harsh endeavours are surely not for everyone.'

<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will also PERMANENTLY prevent the completion of any difficulty title deeds, those you are pursuing now, and any you may want to pursue in the future!</rgb>Completing this quest will increase the threat posed by monsters you encounter during your travel through the landscapes of Middle-earth, while also providing a small bonus to experience gained in combat.Completing this quest will change your current difficulty.Speak with the Hardened Traveller'Greetings traveller. I watch those who stride the roads of Middle-earth in search of challenge and adventure, and you seem just the sort. Indeed there are some who prefer even greater challenges to overcome, and I can assist you with this!

'Should you accept my boon, you will find your enemies on the roads and fields of Middle-earth becoming stronger and more dangerous in your quest for glory - is this what you desire?'

