<rgb=#FFFF00>Completing this quest will increase the difficulty of enemies on landscape and in missions!</rgb>The civilians inside Emax Dûl's Servant's Quarters are under the control of the Thardúth. Sorkamâl the Forbearing has discovered a way to free their minds and get them out. Use her scroll to free their minds and collect needed supplies for Mizâdi's war effort.Sorkamâl the Forbearing has discovered a way to free their minds and get them out. Use her scroll to free their minds and collect needed supplies for Mizâdi's war effort.

Speak to Sorkamâl to be given the scroll.Speak to Sorkamâl the ForbearingSeek out enthralled servants. Free them from control and gather additional supplies throughout the area for the war effort.Use <rgb=#00ff00>Free Mind</rgb> on enthralled servants (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gather supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Seek out and defeat the Elder Orcs near the entrance.Defeat the Elder Orc reinforcements near the entranceDefeat Daithúch Wound-drinker and his minions to escape.Defeat Daithúch Wound-drinker and his minions'Not only we were able to secure needed supplies, more importantly we may have a method to free our enthralled people. Thank you.'<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the skill 'Free Mind' on Enthralled Servants to advance the quest.</rgb>Dol Amroth has several groups and factions within it. To defend the city fully, you must earn the trust and support of all of them.Dol Amroth has several groups and factions within it. To defend the city fully, you must earn the trust and support of all of them.Attain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Bank FactionAttain Acquintance with the Dol Amroth - Docks FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Armoury FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Great Hall FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Mason FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Warehouse FactionAttain Acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Swan-knights FactionCaras Gelebren, the Silver Bastion, was once the capital of Tham Mírdain and the jewel of Eregion. Alas, it was brought to ruin long ago when Sauron, seeking to lay claim to the Rings of Power, gathered his vast armies and destroyed all of Eregion.Celebrimbor is leading the defence of Caras Gelebren against the armies of the Enemy.

You should talk to Celebrimbor.Talk to CelebrimborAfter destroying the lower city, the Enemy has renewed the assault on Caras Gelebren.

