<rgb=#00FF00>This quest will fail if there are no longer Glory Seeking Monster Players in the Ettenmoors.</rgb>Captain-General Tordúr asks that you wade into the battle in the Ettenmoors and promises to fuel you with his strength as you battle and defeat the enemy.Seek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.Defeat enemies of the Free People (${NUMBER}/5)Continue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.Defeat enemies of the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Continue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.Defeat enemies of the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Seek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.Defeat enemies of the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Seek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.Defeat enemies of the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})'${PLAYER}, I ask you to champion our cause in the Ettenmoors. I shall afford you a measure of strength should you endeavour to assail and bring low every enemy out of Angmar you discover.

