She hands you another pouch of small explosives.

'If we want to do as much damage as we can, we need to abandon stealth for firepower! Destroy as much of their weapons and armour as you can before we're caught! Don't worry, I'll get us out of here before we're overrun.''We're running out of time. There's just too much here to destroy by ourselves! And, we've run into a few Orcs, but where are the rest? A fort of this size must have more soldiers, even if they were preparing to move... wait, do you hear that?''Did you hear that? That must have been the quartermaster. It sounds like all the missing Orcs are upstairs, and drunk! Change of plans, ${PLAYER}.

'I say we sneak upstairs and off the one in charge before the rest of the Orcs sober up and realize we're here destroying their supplies. Without the quartermaster, these Orcs won't be organized enough to continue their plans to move everything into Gundabad, and I can send other scouts in to continue the work. Let's move!'You have been tasked with defeating the hill-beasts who have descended upon the path to Glimmerdeep.Defeat the hill-beasts on the path to Glimmerdeep.Defeat the hill-beasts on the path to Glimmerdeep (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})'Great work, ${PLAYER}! With all the hill-beasts defeated, let us return and report your success!'Your mission is to sabotage siege engines that have been discovered in a nearby Ekhamâti camp and eliminate any soldiers that try and stop you.Your mission is to sabotage siege engines that have been discovered in a nearby Ekhamâti camp and eliminate any soldiers that try and stop you.

