ed it is time to return to Lhan Garan and report your success to the mission giver there.'Mossward, my friend, is in dire need of assistance. The ruins, not far from here, have always been a place of danger from wolves. Now, however, there is a greater concern as Men are seen trafficking in the ruins tempting wolves from within with gifts of meat. Once captured, we fear that the wolves are being trained to assault the village.

'Are you willing to help us investigate and stop the brigands before something truly terrible occurs?''Wolves this close to Mossward are already problem enough. Add Men into the mix and those wolves will be trained to attack alongside them. We must put an end to this before it begins.''It is good to deprive these men of even more tools to set against us. Thank you for your efforts, ${PLAYER}.'Brigands intent on training wolves near Mossward must be stopped before they can use the wolves against the people in the town. Stop this practice before it begins.Defeat wolf-keepers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Find the Scout'With the wolf-keepers defeated we have lessened the enemies who stand against us. Good work. Let us return.'Uruk embattlements set into the side of the hills threaten the land below. But it is the leaders in these forces that wield the true power. You are tasked with finding and eliminating the leaders of the Uruks at this encampment.Defeat the White Hand war-leaderDefeat melee Uruk-hai of the White Hand (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat ranged Uruk-hai of the White Hand (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Find the Scout'That was an impressive display of power. Let us return to our base to discuss your victory.'White Hand Uruks encamped within Elven ruins threaten the populace with great weapons of war. Scouts present an option to strike down the leader and throw the forces gathered into disarray.Speak with the mission giver and travel to the location of the Uruk encampment and defeat the war-leader there.Complete the Mission: Bite the HandReturn to the mission giver and let them know of your victory over the White Hand.'Our scouts learned that there is a potent Uruk War-leader in the ruins. We believe that if we can remove it quickly, we have a chance to undermine the efforts of these invaders from the south. If you are willing, we ask you to make your way into the camp, find the leader, and remove it. Mayhap, in their absence, we can strike a harder blow and drive the remaining Uruks from the land.''Strike quickly and remove their leader. We shall yet drive this foe from our lands. I will await your triumphant return.''Your effort to defeat the White Hand will not go unrewarded. This foe is great and you have proven yourself a worthy defender of the Free Folk. Please, accept this small token of our thanks.'Your mission is to travel north to Thalat Tîr to thin the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as bring back samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars.Your mission is to travel north to Thalat Tîr to thin the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as bring back samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars.

