r their lesser cousins. There must be a truly vile force leading them for their resolve to remain so steadfast in the face of our continued assault. If you are willing, we are asking anyone with the gumption to assist to track down the leader at the very crest of the ancient ruin and bring the enemy low -- at last.''We do not know what to expect. Our scouts have not been able to find any details on the true identity of the leader at Caranost. We leave it now to your capable hands.''It is of grave concern that such a foe is here. In earnest, I have not seen such a foe, but I have heard tell that they are thrice the size of a man. You are a true warrior, ${PLAYER}. We honour you as such.'You have been tasked with carefully mining crystals within Mesem-gairu.Continue to mine crystals and destroy crystal spider nestsMine crystals (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Destroy crystal spider nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should return to the entrance of the cave.Return to the entrance of the cave'Great work, ${PLAYER}! Let's get all those crystals back to the base!'You have been tasked to seek out and destroy the corrupted crystals and defeat the corrupted pack leader Ramshar.You should seek out and destroy the corrupted crystals, and defeat the corrupted pack leader Ramshar.Defeat Ramshar, the corrupted wargDestroy corrupted crystals (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should regroup near the entrance to the cave.Regroup near the entrance to the cave'Great work, ${PLAYER}! Let us return and report your success to Scout-master Ausma!'An enterprising hobbit is looking to make a meal delivery service. She asked to have someone help get things rolling and you accepted the task.Deliver 60 pies to Glyn Helyg villagers (${NUMBER}/60)Defeat the attacking brigands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Find and speak with a Scout'How did the deliveries go? Why do you look so tired? Oh. Oh my, where did they come from? We should go back.'Glyn Helyg is a wondrous village carved into a cliff in view of a 