efeat the goblin leader.Defeat the goblin leaderDance with the goblin leader.<rgb=#FF0000>Dance</rgb> with the goblin leaderPerform another <rgb=#FF0000>dance</rgb> with the goblin leaderPerform second type of <rgb=#FF0000>dance</rgb> with the goblin leaderPerform third type of <rgb=#FF0000>dance</rgb> with the goblin leader'Great work, ${PLAYER}! You defeated the goblins, and without drawing your weapon?! I am impressed! Let us return and report your success.''Yar, what do you want, eh?! Well, what ever it is, I'm not gonna give it to you! Did you even tell me? No matter! You'll have to best my dancing to get what ever you be wanting! Can you squirm, worm?! Har, har!'You have been tasked with collecting treasures from a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad.Enter the vault.Enter the vaultCollect the treasure and exit the vault before it closes shut!Collect treasure (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect valuable treasure (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect priceless treasure (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Exit the vault after collecting the treasure!<rgb=#FF0000>Collect the treasure and exit the vault before it closes shut!</rgb>'${PLAYER}! You made it out of the vault just in time! Let us return with all the valuables you were able to collect. I am sure Hórin will be pleased with your efforts!'Golwen sets out to deliver a long-awaited farewell.You have returned to the beach in Dor-en-Ernil with Golwen.

