You should observe what happens.Observe what happensYou should listen to the conversation as you fish.Listen to the conversation as you fishYou should talk to Golwen.Talk to GolwenIt's only when the night closes in that you finally bid the others farewell.'We have some time yet before my crew-mates arrive. I only hope they can forgive the thick-headed behaviour I displayed for the last year.

