You should try his dish.Try Haldo's dishYou should wait for Haldo's verdict.Wait for Haldo's verdictYou should talk to Haldo.Talk to HaldoYou should listen to the conversation.Listen to the conversation'I won't ever forget this night.''I've been away for so long, it hardly feels right to call this home now. Especially now that my family is displeased with me. But if this is all it takes to make them avoid me, then maybe they aren't worth calling my family. It's no wonder why grandmother left the Shire so frequently.'

Haldo carefully deposits the stingóst into the mortar before he grins sheepishly at you.

'Will you do the honours, ${PLAYER}?''Have you gotten better at this? You appear less fatigued!'

Haldo tastes a pinch of the crushed stingóst. His eyebrows shoot up.

'That does taste familiar... I'm a wee bit nervous to try it with the other seasonings, however. Maybe I'll wait until after the pork is done.''Years ago, Mullen and I were hiking somewhere further out. A blizzard caught us by surprise. All we could see was white, white, white. We could hardly see our own hands before us. And as we blindly trudged our way towards what appeared to be a cave, Mullen tripped over a body!

''Twas a Man -- lost and freezing, but still alive. With our remaining strength, we dragged him into the cave, and Mullen immediately set to work. As I tended to him, she cooked a meal with our meagre supplies. That food brought him back from death, I'd wager.

'Once the blizzard died down, we brought him to a nearby town. He didn't escape that blizzard unscathed, but at least he had his life.'Before you sits a dish of pork and radishes, topped off with well-travelled seasoning. With one bite, you taste a harmonic mixture of succulent flavours.'We... we did it. It's not exactly as I remember it, but it's very, very, very close. If I hadn't just cooked this myself, I would have sworn grandmother did.' 

Haldo squints at a forkful of pork, curiosity colouring his features rather than disappointment. 

'Maybe my memory of this dish is no longer reliable, or something else is missing.

