'We ought to have ample time before my family returns. They would disapprove greatly if they knew what I was up to, and they'd most likely muck up my efforts! The rumours would damage our reputation, you see, and th -- er, we care very much about it.

'Though, it's more than just that...'Haldo pulls a few items out of dusty containers.

'Pardon the dust; I keep it as a deterrent. Nobody has bothered to go rifling through my things, but you can never be too careful. I'd be quite upset if they managed to get their hands on my grandmother's belongings now!

