revelations of the plight of the people Mizâdi's forces wishes to free filter from those you rescued. In the shadow of a shattered bridge, the oppressed toil to gather wood for the Ordâkhai war and warriors.Pleas of assistance to rescue more families forced into service by the Ordâkhai reach you. Beneath the shattered bridge to the south-east, more await release from their shackles.Free the captive harvesters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})The harvesters are free. Return to the road and speak with the scout to return to Mizâdi's encampment.Find Mizâdi's scout'More lives saved from certain suffering and eventual death. We are liberators, my friend. Let us return.'In the ruins of Dol Ernil, the dead walk again. A sickly glow from within the ruins beckons you to face the foes and drive them out of the ruins.Defeat the gaunt-men in the Ruins of Dol Ernil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Find the Scout'We should be cautious about the truths discovered here. Most folks cannot understand the terrors that you seem to face with ease. I am in awe of your ability. Come, let us return.'Within the ruins of a once great hall, the Dead now make their home. You are asked to venture into the ruins and purge the Dead within.Within the walls of Dol Ernil, the gaunt-men take residence where they should not be. It falls to you to enter the ruins and destroy the foe there.Complete the Mission: Haunting at Dol ErnilYou have eliminated the enemy within the ruin. Now you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your victory.'Hello again, ${PLAYER}, interested in another adventure? I have something for which you seem well-suited.

