You should talk to Elladan.Talk to ElladanYou should continue following Elladan and help him find Elrohir.Follow ElladanYou have found Elrohir!

You should let the twins talk.Listen to the twins' conversation'I'll be relieved to see the sun shining once again.''Neither Elrohir nor I enjoy the idea of taking the pass, but I confess that Orcs are not the sole reason. Many years ago, our mother travelled through here to visit our grandparents in Lórien. She never made it to her destination -- Orcs captured her. When we realized she had disappeared, my brother and I set out to find her. After weeks of searching, we found her alive, but...'

Elladan's voice trails off as he turns away.

'...We'll keep each other safe. We must.''Elrohir!' Elladan's frantic voice does not carry past the thick curtain of whirling snow.

'He -- he must've thought we'd be following close behind. We must find him. Quickly!''No, no. That can't be Elrohir's blood. I don't believe it.

'He must be close. Let's hurry.'According to the Galadhrim, Lothlórien has been peaceful. Regardless, Gwaihir's news of the wolf presence along the Anduin occupies your minds.You should talk to Elrohir.Talk to ElrohirElrohir has noticed growling coming from somewhere down the road.

