killed a number of the inhabitants. Scouts believe that there may be some townsfolk still alive in the hillock dens where the wargs make their homes.Scouts believe that there may be survivors in the warg pits in the hills nearby. You are asked to go into those hills and rescue those you can, and burn the dead to stop the spread of disease.Complete the Mission: The Jaws of DeathThe warg-matrons were present in the pit and they were fearsome. You were victorious. Return to the mission giver in Mossward and tell them of the success.'Reports come in from the hills that wargs are making the hillocks outside of town into dens. Aside from the clear threat that this poses, there is news that the wargs have taken a number of townsfolk. Some may yet live, it is unclear. Our scouts were not able to get close enough to confirm if there are any villagers in the bone pits.

'Will you go, find any survivors you can? Be wary, the wargs are cunning and cruel.''If there are any still alive from those taken, we must make efforts to recover them. Please make haste, ${PLAYER}. Any who are slain, should be burned to ensure that no diseases spread. A terrible end.''It is a shame that so many were slain, and a joy that those few could be saved. We are indebted to you, ${PLAYER}.'After escaping the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu, some of the surviving Ghâshfra found their way to Mount Gundabad where their mastery of flame has established them as powerful allies of Gorgar the Ruthless.Your mission is to defeat Draupush, one of the Ghâshfra in service to Gorgar the Ruthless.Defeat Draupush in Ashmâr-zarakh'Well done, ${PLAYER}! I fear that is not the last of these... Ghâshfra, but there will be time enough to track the rest of them down in days to come. Let us return and report your success to Hórin!'You have been tasked with finding a way into a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad.Find a way into the dwarf-vault.Find a way into the dwarf-vaultEnter the vault.Enter the vault'Well done, ${PLAYER}! You figured out how to open the vault! Let us return to Hórin and report your success!'The gates of Gundabad are heavily fortified. Only by approaching with stealth will you remain unseen….You have arrived close to the main gates of Gundabad.

