'If we stage this as a conflict between those two Orcs, no one will ever know we were here. But, we'll need some props. See if you can find any of that foul grog they drink. We can make this look like a tragic "drinking accident" hah!''Did you find some of that swill? Ugh, I can smell it from here. Hand it over.'

