'Don't let your guard down on our way to Caras Galadhon. I fear more trouble may be lurking just around the corner.''Keep your wits about you.''It is just as we feared: scouts have reported many sightings of Wargs close to the northern border.'There is no shortage of adventure out there for a curious and wandering hobbit. What has Bilbo Baggins gotten up to now?Your mission is to find Bilbo Baggins. Speak to Celeblír to continue the search!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 5'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to Celeblír'It is clear from the words of Glóin that Bilbo's trail must lead into the Misty Mountains. But where is he going, and why?

'Are you still resolved to follow him? Tell me that you are, ${PLAYER}!''This is terrible! Bilbo has been captured by goblins? Again?''Follow Bilbo's trail into the Misty Mountains, my persistent friend. And stay alert as you go, for those paths are dangerous, especially in winter. It may be that Kúblugat is not the only spirit of the storm haunting those slopes!

'Good fortune go with you, and bring Bilbo unharmed back to us!'Armed with the knowledge that Wargs now endanger Lórien, your party sets out to put an end to their machinations.Galadhrim scouts have sighted Wargs around the northern borders of Lórien.

You should talk to Elladan outside of Caras Galadhon in Lothlórien to begin heading north.Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Elladan & Elrohir, Chapter 5'With the help of the Galadhrim and fresh supplies, your return to Rivendell has gone smoothly.

Lord Elrond wishes to have a word with you.Talk to Elrond'We're right at the doorstep of Caras Galadhon, but how can we stand idly by while Wargs sow chaos in the Golden Wood?

'${PLAYER}, you have been a stalwart companion. Not once have you faltered in aiding us, and for that we are grateful. Though you have honoured your promise to us and our father, we have one last thing to ask of you.

'Come with us to the north. Whatever the Wargs have planned, we'll put an end to it. Together.''Quickly -- we must strike out for Talan Revail.''I've been told your journey to Lórien was rather eventful, ${PLAYER}. Still, you persisted and completed your task admirably.

'Though travel and adventure have separated my sons from me before, every time they venture forth, my heart grows uneasy. For what parent can stand not knowing where their children are?

'But this time, I was comforted knowing you were by their side. Thank you. They have found a true friend in you.'Bilbo Baggins has run afoul of the goblins of the Misty Mountains... again!Your mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 6'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to Celeblír'Oh, he has told me the story of his first encounter with the goblins of the Misty Mountains, or as much of it as he seemed comfortable sharing. It must have been good fortune indeed that helped our hobbit and the dwarves escape after their encounter with the Great Goblin!

'But Bilbo will need as much luck as that, or more, to escape this time! Are you ready to free him from their camp?''Did I think our hobbit was in danger before, when I believed he was imprisoned within Pinnath Fenui? How young and short-sighted were my worries then, before I knew he had been taken into Goblin-town!''The goblins must have brought him to the encampment of Pinnath Fenui, from which they have harried travellers in the mountains for some time. Find Bilbo and free him from their clutches, ${PLAYER}!'Bilbo Baggins has run afoul of the goblins of the Misty Mountains... again!Your mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 7'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to Celeblír'I have heard that there are numerous back entrances to Goblin-town, but they are unreliable and difficult to find. By the time we found one, if we could even get it open, it might be too late for poor Bilbo! We need to think of some other way to get inside. Do you have any ideas, ${PLAYER}?''The depths of Goblin-town are sure to be dangerous, but you will need to search them if you are to rescue Bilbo!''Yes, I agree. The main gate will be the most reliable way inside Goblin-town, but we will need a distraction.

'I think it is now my turn to accompany you on this mission, my friend. I will make certain you are able to get inside the main gate, if you promise to find our missing Baggins!'Bilbo Baggins has run afoul of the goblins of the Misty Mountains... again!Your mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 8'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to Celeblír'The inside of Goblin-town will be crawling with goblins, ${PLAYER}. It is not called "Goblin-town" without reason, as I trust you know. You have heard Bilbo's stories of it, as have I! Are you certain you are ready to rescue our hobbit?''I hope Bilbo is all right in the depths of Goblin-town. You have bested so many of its defenders... how many could possibly remain?'

Celeblír purses his lips.

'Now that I have said it, I regret giving voice to it. Let us move on with hopeful hearts, and pretend I never said it.''I know you are ready, my friend, but I thought I should ask. Good fortune go with you into the caves, and fight past the goblin defenders in search of Bilbo!'Bilbo Baggins has run afoul of the goblins of the Misty Mountains... again!Your mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 9'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to Celeblír'You have to hurry and rescue Bilbo from Goblin-town! Are you ready to find the dungeons and free our hobbit?''This endeavour is almost finished, ${PLAYER}, but not yet. It is one thing to get into Goblin-town... but getting out is another matter!''Bilbo Baggins awaits! Go with haste and free him from the dungeons! At last this adventure will soon be ended, but only once he is returned unharmed to the surface!'Bilbo Baggins has run afoul of the goblins of the Misty Mountains... again!Your mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!Complete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 10'Celeblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.Talk to CeleblírBilbo Baggins is back in the Hall of Fire, in the Last Homely House.Talk to Bilbo in the Hall of Fire'This is it, my friend. Tell me you will bring Bilbo Baggins back to the surface from within the depths of Goblin-town.''Thank you so much for finding Bilbo and bringing him back to safety! Now I can finally ask Bilbo the important question for which I sought him in the first place, and which his absence made impossible to answer. What was it? Oh, I will ask him myself, after he has rested from his ordeal. It involved the rhyme scheme for a song I am composing, an ode to the sound made by the wind through the leaves of the valley. He has quite a talent for such things, you know, and I needed his opinion on a few other particulars. But I will present those to him later.

'But now you should check in with our hobbit in the Hall of Fire, and make sure he has recovered from his ordeal.''Not many hobbits escape from Goblin-town even once, but with your help Bilbo might be able to boast that he has done it twice!''Well, ${PLAYER}, I hope you will accept my apology for causing you any trouble! Elrond has already spoken to me about his fear that I intended to follow young Frodo and the others, and I tell you, as I told him, that such a thing was not on my mind. No, I simply wanted to take a walk in the crisp, clear air of the mountains.

'It was quite a nice stroll, and it was good to visit with my old friend Glóin. We talked about our days of adventure, and about old friends, and I intended to turn around and come back to Rivendell after that. But I kept walking, and every new stone seemed interesting and unique, and around every bend I wondered what I might see. It was my old wanderlust again, I suppose, and it put me in mind of my adventuring days: around every turn a new marvel! And then there were goblins. Isn't that always the way of it?'

Bilbo pauses thoughtfully.

'How do you think Frodo is doing? Adventures are quite different when you're in them, aren't they? I look back on my own and don't remember the damp, or the fear; I remember how it turned out, and not the uncertainty as it was turning! I hope Frodo and the others with him are as fortunate as I was, and can look back fondly on the quest when it is finished!'

You assure the old hobbit that Frodo has many strong companions who will watch over him.

'Yes, I know, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for that, and for the assistance in Goblin-town! I cannot promise not to take further strolls in the mountains, but I will try not to run afoul of goblins again! Farewell and thanks once more!'You have completed your collection of 2013 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2013 festival steeds.Mount the Lissuin HorseMount the Teal Fireworks Laden HorseMount the Horse of the MidsummerMount the Horse of PlentyMount the Spooky Horse of the BatMount the Wintertide SteedYou have completed your collection of 2013 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2013 festival steeds.Mount the Lissuin PonyMount the Teal Fireworks Laden PonyMount the Pony of the MidsummerMount the Pony of PlentyMount the Spooky Pony of the BatMount the Wintertide SteedYou have completed your collection of 2014 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2014 festival steeds.Mount the Steed of Spring GardensMount the Steed of OdogilMount the Steed of Wedmath CelebrationMount the Horse of BountyMount the Horse of the Autumn SunMount the Steed of Winter WindsYou have completed your collection of 2014 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2014 festival steeds.Mount the Steed of Spring GardensMount the Steed of OdogilMount the Steed of Wedmath CelebrationMount the Pony of BountyMount the Pony of the Autumn SunMount the Steed of Winter WindsYou have completed your collection of 2015 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2015 festival steeds.Mount the Steed of New BloomMount the Steed of the Woodland RealmMount the Steed of NáriëMount the Steed of the YieldMount the Steed of the Anórien AutumnMount the Steed of the Ithilien WinterYou have completed your collection of 2015 festival steeds.You have completed your collection of 2015 festival steeds.Mount the Steed of New BloomMount the Steed of the Woodland RealmMount the Steed of NáriëMount the Steed of the Yi