You should bring the Old Winyards, cleverly disguised as Brandy Wine, to Saerthuithel as soon as possible.'I've received a different sort of orders from Jónar, the head of this here society. He hates the Inn League so much that he has assigned me a rather different task than my Inn League neighbour there. Shh, he mustn't hear us!

