Nathalan told you of his belief that for one to truly appreciate the character of a drink, it must be drank in surroundings that match its character. As a suitable drink for Angmar, he has asked you to collect the worst drink in all of Eriador: "Swill." This drink can only be found at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands.'I have here a list of requests to assist Inn League members in need, stranded away from home without the support of their beer-loving brethren. It seems they miss their favourite drinks, or in some cases they've never even tasted them!

