'Yet there are drinks of the worst quality and these must be consumed in the worst of surroundings. I have come here looking for an ale to match these lands, yet can find none. However, all is not lost, as I have heard of something called "Swill" which can only be found at The Forsaken Inn. Would you bring me this drink? I fear I have too much to accomplish here to make the journey myself.''You'll want to head to the Lone-lands to pick up that Swill before you start your journey to Aughaire, my friend.''Have you brought back the Swill yet? It can only be found at The Forsaken Inn. I have heard that it is the worst ale in all of Eriador, and for me to truly appreciate its character, I must drink it in the worst lands in all of Eriador.''Ah, excellent! You have the Swill. By the look of it, I can tell it truly is the worst ale in all of Eriador. Well, now I shall see how horrible it really is, shall I not?

