'While I'm sure of the address on the Scholar's Stair, please find out which of the houses on the road belong to my sweet lady by asking Barliman Butterbur, the proprietor of The Prancing Pony.  He is knowledgeable in the goings-on within Bree and he surely would know where she lives.  Please check with him before delivering the bouquet.''What are you doing back? You are supposed to be delivering those flowers. Go check with Barliman Butterbur over at The Prancing Pony. Oh, I cannot wait till she receives my gift.''So, my friend, I hear you are assisting Master Crabapple with a few things. He has sent ahead a description of the lovely lady, and I approve. I know what lady he's showing a fancy for. The poor fellow is simply too shy. 

