Stars of Old Cider should be bought from Butterbur at the Prancing Pony.Collect Stars of Old Cider from the Prancing PonyFoxglove Grubb is in Brockenborings in the Shire, west of Bree.

Foxglove Grubb has asked you to collect a bit of "Stars of Old" cider for her from the Prancing Pony. Once you have the cider, you should bring it back to Foxglove.'I have here a list of requests to assist Inn League members in need, stranded away from home without the support of their beer-loving brethren. It seems they miss their favourite drinks, or in some cases they've never even tasted them!

'Now Foxglove Grubb is a fine example. She needs Stars of Old Cider in order to complete the Inn League Challenge; I believe it is the only drink she has left to sample.

'If you wish to bring her some, it can be purchased in The Prancing Pony in Bree. Barliman Butterbur makes an excellent cider.''Why hello there! Are you a member of the League as well? Have you perhaps heard of the League's Challenge? You have? Good! I am in need of a bit of help with it, if you have the time to spare.

'You see, I thought I sampled all of the beers, wines, and ales there were to be found in Eriador. And I was right! But I forgot about the ciders! It was such a foolish mistake! And what's worse, I haven't the money to pay for the trip to get the "Stars of Old" cider I need.

'You look like an experienced traveller. Perhaps if you happen to pass by the Prancing Pony in the town of Bree and have the silvers to spare, you could buy a bit of the "Stars of Old" cider? I would be most grateful if you would!''Head to Bree if you wish to pick up that Stars of Old Cider.''Oh hello! Travelling by again, are you? Well don't forget, if you happen to be in Bree and near The Prancing Pony, please pick me up a bit of the "Stars of Old" cider.''Oh wonderful! Wonderful! You have the cider! I am so very grateful for your help in this! I will tell all the other members of the League of your selflessness!'You have been tasked with delivering unpleasant things to Inn League Members in need of assistance, something only a terrible ${CLASS} would do.

<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>Anlaf the Forlorn is in The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands.

You should collect fake Stars of Old Cider, actually Forsaken Cider, from Anlaf the Forlorn.Collect fake Stars of Old Cider from The Forsaken InnFoxglove Grubb is in Brockenborings in the Shire, waiting for you to deliver the Stars of Old Cider.

You should bring the fake Stars of Old Cider, actually Forsaken Cider, to Foxglove Grubb before the time runs out.'I've received a different sort of orders from Jónar, the head of this here society. He hates the Inn League so much that he has assigned me a rather different task than my Inn League neighbour there. Shh, he mustn't hear us!

'Foxglove Grubb has tasted all the beers and wines for the Inn League, but she has apparently forgotten ciders. She wishes very much to taste the Stars of Old Cider from The Prancing Pony, but I believe we will surprise her with something very different.

'Go to The Forsaken Inn and ask Anlaf the Forlorn for some of his own despicable Forsaken Cider. It is the foulest stuff in all the world, except for Swill, or perhaps Forsaken Ale. Foxglove Grubb will be so disappointed!''What a shock Foxglove Grubb will receive when she tries that disgusting concoction!''You...actually want to try the Forsaken Cider? Are you certain? A seasoned traveller like yourself cannot be accustomed to such drinks, is all. I would be surprised indeed if you warmed up to it.''Is...is that the cider? It smells rather strange, even from here. But I will try it! I am the Inn League's most dedicated member.'

Foxglove Grubb takes a sip of the Forsaken Cider, and immediately makes a face.

