<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>Clay can be found on the banks of the pond north west of Bree. Willow sprays can be collected near a pond south of Bree. Cut pine wood can be found outside of Bree. Fine lace can be procured from the tailor Maud Tatter in Bree.

Rona Turner has asked you to collect clay, willow sprays, firewood, and fine lace.Talk to Maud TatterCollect fine clay (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect cut pine logs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect willow boughs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Rona Turner is located in Bree.

Bring the materials to Rona Turner.'Ah, do you like pottery? I'm afraid I haven't much for sale at the moment. I had to fire my assistant after he knocked over a huge rack of nearly cooled pots, cups, bowls... oh, I don't even know the extent of which was lost.

'Forgive me for going on. Midsummer is such a busy time of year for orders and without my assistant.... say, if you happen to be free, I could make it worth your time!

'I just need a few simple things. With your help, I could get so much more done. Now let me think... my assistant chopped wood for me, but I sent him away before he collected it. You'll find that he has felled pine trees about the area. Pine burns nice and hot! Oh! I had a special order for a set of dishes with willow leaves imprints. There's a lovely weeping willow south of the city, near the lake. Now, while you are out and about, I also have an order of lace that needs to be picked up from Maud Tatter.

'Let me think, is that everything? Oh my, I very nearly forgot the most important thing! The clay! I harvest a lovely, rich clay from the pond north west of the city. If you could just run along and help me with those few things, I -- we can save so many happy couples' special day!''Good day to you! Ah, you have come for Rona's lace? I have it right here! Please do thank her for her business, would you?''Marvellous! You haven't any idea how much this means to me! I will probably need more help until I find a new apprentice. Please do come see me again.'Your Blade Wall has the power to fell many a foe in a single swing.Use Blade-wallThere are those individuals with mysterious qualities that others find quite alluring.Others often seem to have trouble tearing their attention away from you.Those in the conquest of Gorgoroth expect that you will find your way to the forefront of battle to assist them.You must earn Ally standing with the Conquest of GorgorothIn Angmar, the last hope of Free Peoples looks to you to stand beside them among the members of the Council of the North.You must earn Ally standing with the Council of the NorthYou have become an ally to the Eglain -- people who have shunned accepted society, choosing the meagre life that the Lone-lands will support.You must attain Ally standing with the EglainThe Mathom Society regards you as more than just a friendly contributor -- in fact, you have become something of a reliable ally.You must earn Ally standing with the Mathom SocietyYou are considered a reliable and staunch ally to the dwarves of Thorin's Hall.You must earn Ally standing with Thorin's Hall.When West Gondor is in need of aid, its inhabitants expect that you will find your way to the forefront of battle to assist them.You must earn Ally standing with Dol AmrothWhen Old Anórien is in need of aid, its inhabitants expect that you will find your way to the forefront of battle to assist them.You must earn Ally 