'Fill these lanterns for me with the little darlings, would you? And do come right back, they needn't be kept trapped for longer than is necessary.''Ah! Like twilight trapped in glass. How wonderful, are they not? We shall be splitting these up. Half will go to the House of Healing, and half to an adorable little alcove on the same level.

