<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>On the Third Circle, Ciriel works at the ovens, and the potter next to the House of Craft. Lebadar may be on the Second Circle, at the base of the entryway to the Third Circle.

