You have gathered his ingredients and should let him create his paints.'The festivities have been rather exciting, haven't they? It's been months since I've been able to produce a single painting, but this visit to Minas Tirith has finally given me inspiration!

'Unfortunately, I can't put a brush to canvas until I obtain paint ingredients. The city is like a maze -- I've already lost my way six times. If I go wandering off again, I may not find my way back!

'Perhaps you will have better luck. I've asked for directions... well, six times before. Seek out the chef Ciriel for charcoal, a potter from the House of Craft for clay, and the gardener Lebadar for flowers. The first two are on the Third Circle, and Lebadar is on the Second.''Charcoal from my burnt wood? Whatever for? Oh, no matter. Here, take it; I don't need it anyway.''Clay, ya say? Well sure, I can get ya some. We've got plenty.''Flowers? Oh, this is for that young painter, isn't it? I met him some days ago while he was exploring the city, but he hasn't returned since. Here you go. Please tell him I said hello!''Oh, ${PLAYER}, this is perfect! I can finally get to work. Painting scenes of Minas Tirith with ingredients gathered from the city itself.... I must say, I enjoy the idea.

