Create a guild-pattern chainmail hauberk.Execute the recipe for a guild-pattern chainmail hauberk'Good news: We have a lot of new apprentices in the guild. Bad news: They are progressing slower than I'd like. Make them some examples of real armour. Give them something to aspire to. Let's start with chainmail. Everyone thinks it's easy to make, but you and I know that the difference between good mail and bad mail is the difference between life and death.''Good news: We have a lot of new apprentices in the guild. Bad news: They are progressing slower than I'd like. Make them some examples of real armour. Give them something to aspire to. Let's start with chainmail. Everyone thinks it's easy to make, but you and I know that the difference between good mail and bad mail is the difference between life and death.''Wonderful! Let me put this on and have an apprentice take a swing at me. I'll stand by your craftsmanship any day.''Wonderful! Let me put this on and have an apprentice take a swing at me. I'll stand by your craftsmanship any day.'The leader of the Metalsmith's Guild has asked you to forge a helm the apprentices can use as a model for learning.The crafting recipes you must create can be bartered for from the Improved Recipes vendor.

