You should collect wares and provisions for the feast.Collect meats for the feast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect vegetables for the feast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect plates for the feast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect utensils for the feast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince IngórVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince Ingór'${PLAYER}, there you are! The reclamation of Gundabad is going well, thanks in part to your efforts assisting the Zhélruka. Let us rest and celebrate our successes!

'I ask but one more task of you. Would you gather food and wares for the feast? I will have the best Zhélruka cooks prepare a feast most filling!''Ah, very good!

'Did I mention our special guests? No? Well, we do have some special guests joining us for the feast. They have only just arrived at Gundabad, but you will see them soon enough.'

'Now, let us begin the feast!''When you were first made known to me, I did not expect such devotion to the Zhélruka cause, ${PLAYER}. Not long ago, there was much strife between all those in the Grey Mountains, but you have worked to dispel some of it. You have exceeded my expectations in every respect, and are a true friend to the Zhélruka Clan.

'But more than that, you are a trusted advisor to me! As my people and I journeyed, some wondered if we would ever find a home, and if Gundabad would ever again open its doors to us. My certainty never wavered. There will come a day when all the halls of Gundabad ring with the sound of dwarves at work, and my part in it will be my greatest accomplishment.

'You are always welcome in these halls, ${PLAYER}! Go forth and seek glory and treasure worthy of your name, your tale, and your allies: the Zhélruka Clan!'You have pledged to lend your aid and your adventuring skills to the Zhélruka and to fight on their behalf in Gundabad.Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

Prince Ingór wishes for you to explore Vérnozal.Explore the waterwayExplore the living quartersExplore the balconyExplore the throneTalk to ZóvaTalk to the Zhélruka Clan QuartermasterTalk to the Gundabad Missions QuartermasterTalk to HórinVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince IngórVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince Ingór'I am pleased that you have pledged to aid the Zhélruka as we work to reclaim Gundabad, ${PLAYER}!

'Under my command, the Zhélruka will no longer be a wandering people. As Durin II promised, so long ago, Gundabad shall be the welcoming home of all Zhélruka!

'Now, there is much work to be done. After a brave expedition through Máttugard, we have secured this hall: Vérnozal. It is a place for the Zhélruka to gather as we work to reclaim the Three Peaks of Gundabad. This hall was once the nobles' court and a seat of power in Gundabad. Soon it will be a place of trade and commerce, as well as a refuge of safety, for many frightful beasts and foes still lurk beneath the Three Peaks.

'Your first task for the Zhélruka? Familiarize yourself with the hall of Vérnozal. Explore the hall and speak with those you see, ${PLAYER}.''Your first task for the Zhélruka? Familiarize yourself with the hall of Vérnozal. Explore the hall and talk with those you see, ${PLAYER}.''I knew you would assist our cause!

'Advising Prince Ingór can be difficult at times, but it is always worth the effort. He has a good heart, and wishes only the best for his people. I am certain we will work closely together, for you have his ear as much as I do!''Welcome, ${CLASS}. I am glad that you are assisting the Zhélruka in Gundabad. Come see me here in Vérnozal when Prince Ingór decides that you deserve to be rewarded for your efforts.''I am here to assist Hórin and Scout-master Ausma on important missions for the Zhélruka. If you assist us on these missions, I will certainly share the rewards with you, ${CLASS}.''Ah, my friend, ${PLAYER}. We have undertaken many missions together, have we not? Aye, that we have! If we are to reclaim Gundabad for the Zhélruka, I say we will adventure together a great deal more. There is much history to learn of the Mountain-home and old halls to explore beneath the Three Peaks. Speak with Ausma or myself if you wish to carry out a mission.''You see the potential offered to us by the hall of Vérnozal? Yes, I have seen it too.

'Potential is not enough for the Zhélruka, however! This hall must be a place of beauty, restored to the shining beacon it once was. Right now the hall is covered in dust and crawling with small night-time beasts! Perhaps tonight you could take care of these unwelcome visitors for me.''Good work on dealing with those night-time visitors. There is more work to be done here in Gundabad, and it is a long road that lies ahead of us. At least the travel on this road involves making a home, rather than searching for one.'You have pledged to lend your aid and your adventuring skills to the Zhélruka and to fight on their behalf in Gundabad.Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

