Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince Ingór'${PLAYER}, a group of Dourhands has come to Vérnozal. We could not send them elsewhere, as it is now the way of the Zhélruka to be kind to all dwarves in Gundabad. I ask you to cater to them, as much as is advisable, but also to keep an eye upon them. I do not entirely trust these newcomers.''Remember to be friendly with those Dourhands. I do not want any unpleasant incidents in this hall, ${PLAYER}. Be careful.''Good riddance to those Dourhands. They certainly overstayed their welcome! I believe everyone was glad to see them off. The Hall of Vérnozal is not a filthy inn, suitable only for drunken revelry, but a great beacon of Gundabad reclaimed!'You have pledged to lend your aid and your adventuring skills to the Zhélruka and to fight on their behalf in Gundabad.Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset.

