Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.Talk to Prince Ingór'${PLAYER}, I have a mission for you. There is a fearsome cold-drake named Svalnath who nests in Gundabad. This spawn of Hrímil Frost-heart threatens all dwarves who walk upon the Three Peaks. We must find the drake and kill it if our people and their neighbours are to be safe here in Gundabad.''It is important to show everyone that they are safe in Gundabad, under the protection of the Zhélruka. That is why I am coming with you to slay this beast. Let us be off!''It is truly a prized decoration for this hall. All those who visit Vérnozal will know of our deeds and our great valour. You have done well and assisted the Zhélruka efforts in Gundabad a great deal. I thank you for your aid to our cause, ${PLAYER}.'Ermentrude Haybank, the Maze-master of Wistmead, has challenged you to get through the maze before the time runs out. You must not tarry long within the wheat-walls!

