You should return to Daley Utteridge with news of your success.Talk to Daley Utteridge'I cannot believe it, ${PLAYER}. Guard Kember and the watchmen have been making an effort to keep those less fortunate from the festivities, but I never thought that some of our own patrons would drive them out!

'Where will they go? I'm sure a few will sneak back in, but it has only gotten tougher for them as of late. The harsh chill of frost grims has taken hold of Frostbluff, and I fear for those that are forced outside the walls of Winter-home.

'Please, ${PLAYER}, can you help them? I can't stop working for fear of losing my wages, but maybe you can do something about those grims. I've seen them gathering at the frozen pond north-east of here, and it's only a matter of time before they move closer. Drive them off! My friends depend upon it!''I can still feel their unnatural chill from here. Please, ${PLAYER}, drive the grims off...I worry for my friends.''Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I will be able to rest easier knowing my friends are safe from the bite of winter, even just for tonight. If those grims return, I may ask for your help again.'While creating lanterns for his fellow Elves, Gairil the lantern-maker has run out of candle materials and needs help collecting more.

