Harbingers of the Dead have appeared in Skirmishes throughout Middle-earth. You should seek out Nedda Pinleaf to learn more about these mysterious foes.Talk to a Nedda Pinleaf in Bree, Ost Galadh, or the Twenty-first HallYou have encountered a creature of ill omen unlike any of the lieutenants of the Enemy you have previously faced. What does its presence portend for the peoples of Middle-earth?'Yes? What do you want?'

