Create a crate of jewellery for Umbar Baharbêl.Craft a crate of jewellery for the Umbar Jeweller's GuildProvide the crate of jewellery to the Umbar Jeweller's Guild Leader.'We jewellers look at the beauty and abundance of our land and find inspiration in the oddest of places. Who would think that the tooth of a feral crocodile could be turned into a fine work of art to adorn an ear or tie into a beard? A jeweller! That is who.

