Imi will be pleased to see that you have gathered several berries and some chipped ice for his dessert ingredients.'Good tidings to you, ${PLAYER}. The Yule season is my favourite time of the year, even though the frosty air can chill your bones to their very marrow.

'We dwarves enjoy a traditional dessert at this time of year. It may not make you feel any warmer, but it is a treat among my folk nonetheless. Alas, I have eaten so much that I have already used up my supply of ingredients to make more. I need more shaved ice and berries from a particular bush. If you could gather them for me, I would be in your debt, ${PLAYER}.

