'I'm so overworked that today I decided I'd just about had enough and went to try some of the events for a change, instead of running them. The problem is, I fell asleep afterwards...I was all tuckered out!

'Patrons are complaining that some of the kegs are empty. Can you bring this to refill them? I would do it, but I was promised a dance.''Hey! What are you still talking to me for? I'll get in trouble if this job doesn't get done, and fast. That mayor likes things just so, you know.''Ah, good work! You really saved my life there. You know, you're pretty good at this, ${PLAYER}. I can probably find more work for you, if you're interested. I'm so busy, after all.'By completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Grey Company.'Let me get to the matter at hand.

