or you...the Gauredain might eat you, and then your quest would be for naught!'When Smaug threw down the dwarves of Erebor, Thrór and his family and many of their subjects escaped south, eventually crossing through Dunland and north to the Blue Mountains.Discover the camp-sites of the exiles from the Lonely Mountain.Discover the dwarf-marker at Fordh MaruDiscover the dwarf-marker at Nár's PeakDiscover the dwarf-marker near the Pool of the KingDiscover the dwarf-marker near AraniantDiscover the dwarf-marker in FordirithDiscover the dwarf-marker in Thorin's HallExplore Cardolan.Explore Cardolan.Complete The Ravaging of CardolanComplete Inhabitants of the Vanished RealmComplete Perils of CardolanComplete Treasure of CardolanExplore Swanfleet.Explore Swanfleet.Complete Dwellers of Old SwanfleetComplete "The Many Folk of the Glanduin"Complete "Perils of Swanfleet"Complete "Treasure of Swanfleet"You have earned the Extra title.Obtain Title Writ - ExtraYou have earned the Extra title.Obtain Title Writ - ExtraDue to the difficulty of navigating the turbulent waters of the Shield Isles, it is common for flotsam from shipwrecks to wash up on Furtherholm's southern shores.Maghôrdo has asked you to clean up any flotsam you find on the island's southern beaches so that visitors will not be reminded of the peril of travelling here.Clean up the flotsam on the beach (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have cleaned up the flotsam from shipwrecks along the island's southern beaches. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.Talk to Maghôrdo'Navigating the waters of the Shield Isles can be quite challenging. Irregular winds, unusual currents, and reefs hidden just below the surface pose many dangers to ships if the crew is not up to the task. Because of this, it is not unusual for flotsam from shipwrecks to wash ashore on the southern beaches. Maybe it is not so good for visitors to see these things and be reminded that journeys here do not always end in the way they planned!

'You would be doing me a great service if you would remove any flotsam you find on Furtherholm's southern shores.'

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>'The flotsam has been cleared from the shore? Thank you for your help!

