'I'll admit, I've been having more trouble with this project than my last. I simply can't keep this field filled and the mayor is getting frustrated. Whether it's the winter conditions or some of those blasted snow-beasts, my snowmen keep getting destroyed.

'It's hard to stay passionate when your work is wrecked every single day. Maybe you can help though. See if you can craft more of my snowmen and make this field an amazing sight to behold!''Well, which one do you want to build?''I like the way you work. Your work is almost as good as mine...maybe you can help me out some more tomorrow. I'm sure if you keep trying, you can do even better!

