'I only ask that you return to me once you have experienced the marvelous beauty of fireworks throughout Middle-earth. I would hear the tale of your experience.''I shall remain here during the duration of the festival, and will look forward to your return.''Splendid! It is wonderful to meet someone with such a strong passion for the beauty of fireworks.

