herholm and then share your opinions with her.Perhaps you could fish near the bridge in the harbour.Find a place to fish in the harbourThe pier near the bridge in the harbour looks good. You should fish here.Fish from the pier in the harbourMaybe you should try fishing from the pier on the west side of the harbour.Find a place to fish at the west side of the harbourThe pier on the west side of the harbour looks great for fishing. Time to cast a line!Fish off the pier in the west side of the harbourA waterfall flows from above into the harbour. Could there be fish up there?Find a place to fish near the waterfall above the harbourIt looks like there are indeed fish near the waterfall above the harbour. You should catch one.Catch a fish near the waterfall above the harbourThe sandbar on the north side of the island has great potential for a fishing spot. You should scout the location.Find a place to fish from the sandbar in the northThe sandbar on the north side of the island looks like a great fishing spot. You should catch fish there.Catch a fish from the sandbar in the northThere are many great fishing spots all over the island. You should bring your catch to Merkhâma and tell her.'Tell me, do you ever go fishing?

'Maybe there is something you can help me with. Visitors often come to me and ask where on the island are the best places to go fishing, and I have no answer for them. I have spent my life at sea, but never once have I gone fishing. I have never needed to. Other people do that!

'If you go fishing in different parts of the island and tell me what you think, I will gladly reward you.'

