Ambi wants you to find his missing items for him.Having found all of Ambi's items, return to him at the tavern in Thorin's Halls.'Hey! You there, you ${RACE}, you! I need to speak with you! This is important.

'My father tasked me with delivering a package of goods, I think. I need that package and all its things badly, or I will be in serious trouble, and that is no good for anyone.

'Can you help me, please? I would be very thankful! Here is a list of the items to help you. Unfortunately, after all my celebrating, I can't remember where I left them.''Have you found any of my missing goods yet? I must really lay off the spirits at these events....''Brilliant! You did it, ${RACE}! Thank you so much!

'Now I won't be in trouble with my father. One more drink, and I will be on my way.

