Head to The Ivy Bush Inn in Hobbiton and talk to the Inn League member there.Talk to the Inn League Member in The Ivy Bush InnDrink six beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink five more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink four more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink three more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink two more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink one more beer within the allotted amount of time.Full and queasy with drink, you should now speak with the Inn League member in front of you.You have begun stage six of the Inn League's initiation.'Hurry to The Ivy Bush in Hobbiton and speak with the Inn League member there. Hurry! Time is a-wasting.''Well, well, well...lookie who's come to play the game...whoop-de-doo...drink the six, quick, quick, quick...don't make me tell you what you know...drink....''Drunk already? Ha!''Drink, drink, drink...for the...festival!''Oh are you having problems, silly one? Can't handle your..beer?''Is it too much for you?''So close, yet...so far....''Someone should give you a...good cheer. You are...amazing!'

'Hurry and go finish. The Bird and...Baby is in Michel Delving. Don't drink and...ride....'You have expressed an interest in becoming a member of the Inn League. In order to do so, you must pass their initiation. This is a long race and only the stout of stomach and strong of will can complete it.

<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>Drink six beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink five more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink four more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink three more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink two more beers within the allotted amount of time.Drink one more beer within the allotted amount of time.Full and queasy with drink, you should now speak to the Inn League member in front of you.'So you want to join the Inn League, do you? Well, then perhaps you are worthy, perhaps you are not. The rules are simple.

'The goal is to drink six of the beers there on the table. Strong ones or weak ones, it makes no difference to me! But be sure you let me know you are finished before the time expires.

'Are you ready to start?'

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will fail when logging out of the game.</rgb>'Go on and drink! You're lagging behind! You'll never make the Inn League, talking to me!''Drunk already? You've barely begun!''Good, good...almost half-way done!''Oh dear, you look a bit flushed. Are you feeling ill?''This is quite disturbing to watch, let me assure you!''You're almost done! Don't bother breathing, just finish it!''Well done, friend! You sure put away those beers, and just in the nick of time!

