<rgb=#00FF00>(Move forward by pressing W, and right-click on Bevan to talk to him)</rgb>Talk to Bevan at the gate of Mossward

<rgb=#00FF00>(Move forward by pressing W, and right-click on Bevan to talk to him)</rgb>Bevan at the gate recommended that you introduce yourself to Geralt, one of the residents of Mossward.

