<rgb=#FF00FF00>To open your crafting panel, you can use the 'T' key or click on the crafting button (it looks like a hammer and anvil) in the lower left part of your UI.

Select the cooking tab in the craft UI and find the proper recipe.

Remember: in order to execute a recipe, you must be near the proper facility. Cooking typically requires an oven or camp-fire.</rgb>'Let me see what you were able to do....'

She inspects the hard biscuit with a discerning eye.

'Good golden colour on the top, and it looks sufficiently hardened. The smell is making my mouth water and my belly rumble.

'I think that you have done very, very well, ${PLAYER}. I approve and declare you a novice cook.''Let us see what you have gone and made.'

He inhales deeply.

'Smells good. Looks golden and delicious, and I wager if I bounced it off the floor, it would resound with a thud.

'You pass, ${PLAYER}. You are on your way towards becoming a master cook!''I smell a treat upon you, and that can only mean that you have finished what I asked of you. Please, allow me to see the biscuit.'

She takes a moment to admire your handiwork.

'This appears cooked to perfection. You are well on your way towards becoming a cook. Well done, ${PLAYER}.''Cooks create food that can heal and buff those who consume it. This introductory quest will walk you through a basic recipe.'

