<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You should speak with the Novice Farmhand.''Hullo! So you'd like to learn to become a farmer? That's wonderful! Few things in life are as satisfying as nurturing a little seed into a fully grown vegetable, and then eating said vegetable! I've been working the land here in Swanfleet since my tween years, so you're in good hands.

