<rgb=#FF00FF00>Ingredients for foresters are found among fallen branches or from the many beasts lurking in the wild, and some are purchased from suppliers. You can also find ingredients on the Auction Hall.</rgb>The Supplier provided you with the ingredients necessary to create a piece of <rgb=#FF00FF00>brushed light leather</rgb> and a <rgb=#FF00FF00>thin rowan board</rgb>.Using the ingredients you received, craft a piece of <rgb=#FF00FF00>brushed light leather</rgb>Using the ingredients you received, craft a <rgb=#FF00FF00>thin rowan board</rgb>The recipes are complete. <rgb=#FF00FF00>Do not sell the brushed light leather or thin rowan board!</rgb> It is time to show your handiwork to your mentor, the Supplier.'It looks as though you have strayed a little ways from home, ${RACE}, and you want to learn about forestry?

