Remember: in order to execute a recipe, you must be near the proper facility. Jewelcrafting requires a workbench.</rgb>'Let me see what you have done.'

He examines the ring closely.

'I see no flaws, and the metal feels smooth and appears well polished.

'I think that this is a very good effort and proves that you are prepared to continue your work towards becoming a master jeweller.'Metalsmiths provide armour and tools to the peoples of Middle-earth. Becoming a metalsmith can be difficult, but the wares that they provide are a necessity throughout the world.

