<rgb=#FF00FF00>Ingredients for Metalsmiths are normally purchased from vendors or traded from players with the prospector profession. You can also find ingredients on the Auction Hall.</rgb>Create the <rgb=#FF00FF00>bronze helm</rgb>, as instructed by the Novice Metalsmith.Using the ingredients you have, forge a <rgb=#FF00FF00>bronze helm</rgb>The recipe is complete. <rgb=#FF00FF00>Do not sell the bronze helm!</rgb> It is time to show your handiwork to your mentor, the Novice Metalsmith.'It looks as though you have strayed a little ways from home, ${RACE}, and you want to learn the art of working metal?

'It seems, then, that you have come to the right place.

'You want to speak with Gestur by the forge. He will be able to set you upon the path of metalsmithing.'

<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You are far from home, ${RACE}. We will honour your request and help you as you learn the art of metalsmithy.

'Anorthint, near the forge, is an apprentice in the art of metalsmithing. If you are looking for guidance, I am certain that he will be willing to assist you with the fundamentals of the craft.'

<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You will find Cotman Brown near the forge here in the Crafting Area. 

'He is knowledgeable in the art of metalsmithy and is awaiting the arrival of new would-be metalsmiths. 

'Speak with him if you are interested in learning and practicing the metalsmithy profession.'

<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'Well, look at you. I do not often see your folk here, and when I do, I always find it a bit queer. Well, hobbits less so because of the hill.

'Oh, I am sorry, you wish to know more of metalsmithy? It just so happens that there is a fine metalsmith in this very hall, still learning, but taking to the art very quickly. His name is Bill Digweed, and you will find him by the forge in the larger room.

'Good day, ${RACE}.'

<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You should speak at once with the metalsmith trainer.''You should speak at once with the metalsmith trainer.''You should speak at once with the metalsmith trainer.''You should speak at once with the metalsmith trainer.''Well, look here... another would-be metalsmith. I am pleased to meet you and looking forward to helping you get started.

'If I go too fast or you need help at any point, you can ask me questions about metalsmithy, and I will do my best to provide you with clear direction. The first and most important step is having the proper ingredients.

'I set aside a few for new metalsmiths like yourself. Take this <rgb=#FF00FF00>crate</rgb> and let us begin.'

<rgb=#FF00FF00>Metalsmith vendors sell ingredients and recipes that are a vital part of any Metalsmith's training and continued work.</rgb>'If you are looking for guidance in metalsmithy, then I am prepared to offer you direction.

