<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You should speak at once with the tailor trainer.''She said I'd be happy to take on a new tailoring apprentice? I think that's overselling it. I'll teach you the basics, but I have a whole town's worth of clothing to either fix, alter, or make from whole cloth, so I'm a little too busy to dedicate lots of time to you. I'll show you how to make a basic cloak, though.

