'It seems, then, that you have come to the right place.

'You want to speak with Hannis by the forge. He will be able to set you upon the path of weaponsmithy.'

<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: You must make sure to have room in your inventory for this quest.</rgb>'You are far from home, ${RACE}. We will honour your request and help you as you learn the art of weaponsmithing.

