You should collect swamp-gas, raw egg, and slug-slime for Jónar's special brew.Collect swamp-gas from Rushock Bog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect a raw rotten egg from Sandson's FarmCollect slime from slimy slugs near Celondim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Jónar is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall.

You should bring Jónar all of the disgusting ingredients you collected during your adventure.'I am a master brewer. Did you know that? I rarely have time these days, with all the Ale Association management I must do. Recruitment is of course the top priority and undermining the Inn League... not brewing or tasting ales.

'But I have a mind to brew something today. I wish to make a drink -- a special brew. I would like it delivered to my good friends in the Shire. I would like it to spoil their festival. I would like to ruin their day. I would like it to make them ill.

'My special brew is a secret, and I will let you in on its recipe by having you collect the ingredients for me. Be a good recruit, ${PLAYER}, and help me with my plan.''I don't see those ingredients I asked for. Do you think I have them? If I had them, would I ask you for them? Tell me. No, do tell me. No? Exactly. Now kindly go do as I asked.''Bawk!'

Billina does not like your sinister look. In her alarm, she lays a disgusting rotten egg. That was easy!'Give me those.'Jónar wishes for you to deliver his horrific concoction to a populated area in the Shire, where it will ruin the day for anyone standing nearby.

<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>The Party Tree is in the Shire, in the town of Hobbiton.

You should deliver Jónar's special brew to the Party Tree, where it will surely ruin the day of many hobbits who have gathered there.Deliver Jónar's special brew to the Party TreeThe Party Tree is in Hobbiton, in the Shire.

You should set off Jónar's horrible brew around the gathering of Shire Festival Patrons to ruin their day.Use Jónar's Special Brew on the Shire festival patronsJónar is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall.

You should return to Jónar and tell him of all that transpired.Return to Jónar in Thorin's Hall'You now know my secret recipe: one rotten egg, five phials of swamp-gas, and seven phials of slimy slug-slime. I have turned it into something magnificent: my special brew.

'You only have one thing to do, and then I shall be satisfied. You must bring this to a populated area in the Shire and be sure to spread the vile fumes it exudes. The effects will be disastrous!

'Take this, my minion, and deliver it to a place where hobbits -- especially Inn League hobbits -- are known to gather. You must bring it directly to the Party Tree, where it is sure to ruin the festival for all!''My brew already smells very bad. Please go away at once; you ought to bring it to the hobbits. There is only so much time before that thing explodes into wretched, disgusting vapours.''Ha... ha ha! You smell terrible! I can tell from standing near you that my brew was a success. Ho ho ha ha ha!

'...Go stand a bit further off, please.'The ability to amuse your friends is a skill worth cultivating.People often find you funny.You looked across the ruins of the Hadhodiant and thought to yourself, 'I can make that jump!'Attempted to cross the HadhodiantYou have a vested interest in Kolmar's success as he runs the Summer Festival Keg-hopping Race.The Keg-hopping Race begins soon on this very track.

