'I believe Kolmar is a sure thing this year. A friend of mine saw him down a whole keg, then keep right on dancing! Would you like to support Kolmar? I would, if I were you.''Watch the race, ${PLAYER}! How do you think Kolmar will make out?''I see you had some luck at the keg-races! Allow me to be the first to bid you congratulations on your excellent luck, ${PLAYER}. Here is your reward.'You have a vested interest in Lar's success as he runs the Summer Festival Keg-hopping Race.The Keg-Hopping Race begins soon on this very track.

