'This contest shall pit four drunken sots...that is to say, fine and upstanding dwarves in a fight to the finish!

'The finish line, that is! We don't let those fellows anywhere near axes or other sharp implements until they've had a chance to sleep it off. Let me know if you are interested in tickets.''Here you are, my good ${RACE} -- two tickets to the main event!

