You should return to Merilien in Minas Tirith.Talk to Merilien'Proper illumination is one of the most important elements for the perfect evening wedding. The soft flickering of the firefly is the perfect blend of soft radiance and playful wonder.

'Now, they can't be your run-of-the mill insects. I require colour-themed lanterns, so you'll have to do a bit of travelling for the perfect glow. There are a few bodies of water around which these special creatures live, emerging only as the sun dips down below the horizon.

'Fill these lanterns and return them to me straight away. And do try not to track bog water back here.''Hmm, you did better than I expected. These lanterns give off just the glow I was looking for!

