'Please, take up your carving tools and help us supply all that is demanded.''Most excellent. These bows will be put to good use by guards all around Umbar.'The woodworker's guild in Umbar Baharbêl supplies many beautiful items to the citizens of the city. You are helping to see their craft services grow.The recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. <rgb=#00f000>Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader.</rgb>

