Your mission is to survey the ruins of Stormwall.'Well done! With your survey efforts, we should be able to assess Stormwall for repairs. This may need to wait until after Gundabad has been claimed, as Stormwall will need many hands to bring splendour back to its halls.'Within the barracks in Emax Dûl, the enemy has amassed equipment it can use for its army. We must seek out the equipment while it's vulnerable and destroy it. Mádathal the Deathward, the powerful Elder Orc, is said to protect this place, so best be on your guard.Your mission is to enter the area, seek out the equipment while it's vulnerable and destroy it.Complete Mission: Arms SaboteurYou have sabotaged the weapons within the barracks and defeated the mighty Mádathal the Deathward.Speak with Shâpar in Ahaba'Ah, ${PLAYER}. Something troubles me.

'Within the barracks in Emax Dûl, the enemy has amassed equipment it can use for its army. We must seek out the equipment while it's vulnerable and destroy it. Mádathal the Deathward, the powerful Elder Orc, is said to protect this place, so best be on guard.

'Enter the area, seek out any equipment that can help their army, and destroy it.''Your mission is to enter the area, seek out the equipment while it's vulnerable and destroy it.''Thank you for destroying the supplies found within, and ridding this place of Mádathal the Deathward.'Far above the battlefield, the ballistae of Ashmâr-zarakh keep silent watch over all that would seek to breach the gates of Gundabad.Your mission is to destroy ballistae in Ashmâr-zarakh.

You should talk to Hórin and travel to Ashmâr-zarakh.Complete 'Mission: Assault on Ashmâr-zarakh'You have completed your mission.

