Your mission is to destroy ballistae in Ashmâr-zarakh.'You have done well, ${PLAYER}!

'Without those ballistae to defend the outer walls of Gundabad, we have bought ourselves time to press the attack.'You have been tasked with defeating Angmarim at Dûn Traikh and recovering stolen supplies.Your mission is to defeat Angmarim at Dûn Traikh and recover stolen supplies.

