Speak to Ausma for your reward!Talk to Ausma'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'My scouts have come back from Dûn Traikh where they tracked down some stolen supplies. Angmarim still hold onto their fortress by the Gates of Gundabad! Were my scouts more numerous, they would have disrupted the Angmarim there. Instead, they were outnumbered at the gates. Perhaps a surprise assault from the rear of the fortress is in order.

'However deadly Dûn Traikh is, we must recover those supplies before the Angmarim use them to strengthen their defences!''Far from Angmar, upon the Gates of Gundabad, the Iron Crown keep watch over Elderslade as they seek to hold on to power in Gundabad….

'Your mission is to defeat Angmarim at Dûn Traikh and recover stolen supplies.''Well done! With the supplies recovered and the Angmarim numbers decimated, Dûn Traikh will soon be a threat no more!'Girhâzi has decided it is time to go on the offensive and has ordered an assault on the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok.Your mission is to help the Dumûri by assaulting the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok.

Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to enter the fray.Complete Mission: Assault on KhetsokYou have helped the Dumûri assault the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok. Return with the Dumûri scout to report your success.Talk to Khâdamul in Iridír'${PLAYER}, the time has come for us to go on the offensive. Khetsok is the Ordâkhai camp from which they stage their attempts to take control of the Wrackwade. Thus far we have remained on the defensive while we gather strength, but that time is now at an end. We have received reports that many of their company have returned to Eshadûr, leaving Khetsok vulnerable. Girhâzi has ordered an assault on Khetsok while they are weak. Are you with us?''Your mission is to help the Dumûri assault the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok.''It is good to have you with us, ${PLAYER}. Any day we weaken the hold of Ordâkh on Ambarûl is a good day.'You have been tasked with defending Trestlebridge from an assault by the enemies of the Free Peoples.Your mission is to defend Trestlebridge from an assault by the enemies of the Free Peoples.

Speak to Radhril.Complete Mission: Assault on TrestlebridgeThe mission is complete!

Speak to Radhril for your reward!Talk to Radhril'I have an urgent request, ${CLASS}.

'A large band of foes of the Free Peoples has been spotted heading towards the town of Trestlebridge. Their numbers are numerous and they have been seen slowly surrounding the town from all sides.

'If Trestlebridge is to stand, we must do all that we can to protect the town from this attack.'A band of foes approaches the town of Trestlebridge! The town must not fall to the invaders!

Your mission is to defend Trestlebridge from an assault by the enemies of the Free Peoples.'We have done well, ${CLASS}. With the raiding party defeated, Trestlebridge is once again safe. The Free Peoples of Trestlebridge will certainly thank us for our efforts.'You have been tasked with thwarting the efforts of foes dwelling in the village of Cotfast.Your mission is to thwart the efforts of foes dwelling in the village of Cotfast.

