'The Free Peoples in the Wildwood have reported nothing but troubles from the village of Cotfast that lies within. There are reports of provisions being stolen and forest creatures being captured.

'If the Wildwood is to ever be peaceful, the problems in the village of Cotfast will need to be resolved.'Within the Wildwood sits the village of Cotfast, a home to rogues and villains.

Your mission is to thwart the efforts of foes dwelling in the village of Cotfast.'We have done well, ${CLASS}. While the village of Cotfast still stands, perhaps they now understand that their evil ways bear consequence in the Wildwood.'The main stockpile of Orkish weapons and armour has been found, but you must act swiftly before it can be moved.You have been assigned another important mission!

Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to learn the details.Talk to AusmaYour mission is to infiltrate Dâr Brulku with Ausma and destroy the weapons and armour within.

Talk to Ausma to travel to Dâr Brulku.Complete Mission: Attack on the ArmouryThe mission is complete!

You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.Talk to AusmaThe mission is complete!

You should report your success to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.Talk to Glóin'${PLAYER}, for your continued effort, I grant you the rank of Izkhas of the Gabil'akkâ! It is well earned, my friend!

'There is little time to celebrate, however. I have another important mission for you. Our scouts have discovered the location of the Orcs' main armoury outside of Gundabad. It seems to be their main base for waging more extensive war in the region, but we fear they may soon move their weapon and armour stockpiles into Gundabad itself, preparing for a siege. We have an opportunity to prevent that from happening! Report to Ausma as soon as you can.''Ready for work, ${PLAYER}? We've had a lucky find!'

She points to an exterior fort near the main gate of Gundabad.

'This is Dâr Brulku. This fort holds the Orcs' main stockpile of weapons and armour. From it they arm their raiding parties and the guards that defend the gates. They know a battle is coming, however, and have begun to move the stockpile into Gundabad itself. If the two of us sneak past enemy lines and infiltrate that fort before they can move the stockpile, we can destroy it before they even realize what happened!

'We shouldn't wait too long, or we will miss this chance. We will need the cover of darkness to make it that far. Meet me here tonight.'Dâr Brulku, a fort near Gundabad, holds the Orcs' main stockpile of weapons and armour....

Your mission is to infiltrate Dâr Brulku with Ausma and destroy the weapons and armour within.'We made it back before we were overrun! Great work as always, ${PLAYER}. Go report our success to Commander Glóin!'You tell Glóin of your successful attack on the armoury.

'That sounds rather harrowing, ${PLAYER}! I am impressed! Ausma has proven quite capable as well, but I am beginning to grow concerned that her plans are too reckless. It would not do to lose either of you, so take some care and temper Ausma's brashness with some caution! For now, go and get some rest. I will call upon you again soon.'You have been tasked with defeating the hill-beasts who have descended upon the path to Glimmerdeep.Your mission is to defeat the hill-beasts who have descended upon the path to Glimmerdeep.

Speak to Ausma to travel to Glimmerdeep.Complete Mission: Beasts From the HillsThe mission is complete!

Speak to Ausma for your reward!Talk to Ausma'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'My scouts have come back from Glimmerdeep. There is no way into the mine! It is blocked by a roaming pack of hill-beasts who have descended into the valley from the mountains. This can not stand! We must return to Glimmerdeep and expel these beasts!'A vicious group of wild hill-beasts have descended upon the path to the mine of Glimmerdeep, in Ered Mithrin….

Your mission is to defeat the hill-beasts who have descended upon the path to Glimmerdeep.'Well done! With the hill-beasts defeated, we can now reenter the mine! Glimmerdeep is an old mine but still a valuable resource to our war efforts!'You have been tasked with defeating the troll blockade in front of the Glimmerdeep mine.Your mission is to defeat the troll blockade in front of the Glimmerdeep mine.

