Your mission is to defeat the hobgoblins inside Vorkodar.The civilians inside Emax Dûl's Servant’s Quarters are under the control of the Thardúth. Sorkamâl the Forbearing has discovered a way to free their minds and get them out. Use her scroll to free their minds and collect needed supplies for Mizâdi's war effort.Your mission is to enter the area, free the minds of servants within, retrieve any goods, and escape.Complete Mission: Disrupting ControlYou have freed the servants, gathered the supplies, and escaped.Speak with Shâpar in Ahaba'Ah, ${PLAYER}. Something troubles me.

