'Queen Mizâdi has asked for you personally, to take the fight to these Orcs. They have only just established themselves on this side of the span of Nâmbadir. Now is the time to strike. Go to their camp, and sabotage their weapons. This will greatly weaken their fighting ability, and then our warriors will come in and do the rest. With bent and broken blades, even the fiercest enemy is no threat to the Hamâti. Please, go there, destroy their weapons, and defeat any Orcs who get in your way.''Your mission is simple. Go to Tharháth, destroy the Orkish weapons and defeat any Orcs who get in your way.''Your combat prowess is to be commended. But that large creature - that is worrying. I will tell the Queen of it at once. I hope there are no more where that one came from.'You have been tasked with dispatching Gorgar's emissary at the Goblin-gate.Your mission is to defeat Blúghosh, Emissary of Gorgar, at the Goblin-gate.

