'The trolls of Gundabad are mighty, indeed. I say the fewer of them we face on the battlefield the better!'Your mission is to go to the Hall of Lajór and rescue kidnapped Zajâni nobles, before they suffer a worse fate.Your mission is travel to the Hall of Lajór in Zajâna and free the nobles taken prisoner by the Jewelled Council.

