'A number of Zajâni nobles are missing, and one of our spies just sent word that the Jewelled Council has kidnapped them. They are being kept in the Hall of Lajór.

'This is a delicate matter, but from what I've seen you are someone who is no stranger to combat and can get things done quickly. Will you help us return these nobles to safety, and away from the Jewelled Council?''Please ensure that no harm comes to them. These nobles are innocent, and their blood spilled would doubly be a dereliction of our duty as Bandázan. I trust you will see them through to safety.''Oh this is wondrous news indeed! I had feared for the worst, but this sets my mind at ease. We will celebrate your deeds today, my friend!'Your mission is to defeat the goblins of Glúkroz and destroy their weapons of war, by using their own explosives against them.Your mission is journey to Glúkroz and defeat the goblins encamped there and set fire to their weapons of war.

