<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>'Are you prepared to face the Dead of Nan Dhelu and their master? Be cautious, ${PLAYER}, some ancient evil dwells within. Be vigilant and destroy the wights there.''This cannot have been an easy task. The Dead are creatures that inspire fear within the most courageous of hearts. I offer you this meagre gift for your efforts.'Rising into the Grey Mountains above the Greylin, the oft-contested Grálinvarth overlooks the Greylin and serves as a valuable foothold in Elderslade.Your mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.

