Your mission is to defeat this foul creature.'Well done! With the Stûg-and-Zar defeated, the foundation has been laid for our work in Gundabad!'You have been tasked with defeating snow-beasts that have been driven into the cavern and destroying their food source.Your mission is to drive off the snow-beasts and destroy their food sources through the cavern.

