Speak to Hórin for your reward!Talk to Hórin'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'My scouts have come back from one of the caverns that weaves throughout Gundabad. A vicious storm has driven snow-beasts into a large cavern. These caverns serve as a vital passthrough to other needed resources.

'Enter the cavern, drive off the snow-beasts and destroy slop barrels in the cavern!'Severe storms have driven a wide array of creatures to seek shelter amongst the caverns that dot the outside of Gundabad.   Snow-beasts have taken refuge in a large cavern that serves as a vital passthrough to rich ore deposits throughout the cavern system.

Your mission is to drive off the snow-beasts and destroy their food sources within the cavern.'Well done! With the cavern cleared of snow-beasts, our forces can secure much needed resources in the fight for Gundabad!'You have been tasked with defeating the Hill Giant, Svalfang, in the Wildwood.Your mission is to defeat the hill giant, Svalfang, in the Wildwood.

Speak to Radhril.Complete Mission: Svalfang's StandThe mission is complete!

Speak to Radhril for your reward!Talk to Radhril'Would you accompany me on a mission, ${CLASS}?

'The Free Peoples in the Wildwood have reported the giant, Svalfang, wandering through the Wildwood. There are reports of trees and boulders ripped from the ground. I believe this Svalfang is not in a pleasant mood.

'If the Wildwood is ever to be peaceful, Svalfang will need to be driven away.'Svalfang the Hill Giant ventures into the Wildwood, seeking payment for those he has killed.

Your mission is to defeat the hill giant, Svalfang, in the Wildwood.'We have done well, ${CLASS}. With Svalfang defeated, perhaps the giant now understands that the Wildwood is no place for ruthless giants.'The Commander of the Orkish forces of Tharbad watches over the city from within the old tower upon the river. Ascend the tower and defeat him.Speak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the tower.Complete the Mission: Tharbad Tower AscentWith the defeat of the Orc commander of Tharbad, you should return to the mission giver.Return to Hithriel and tell them of the commander's defeat'The Orkish commander of Tharbad still resides within that tower. With the courtyard clear, you should now be able to make your assault upon the tower itself.''Well ${PLAYER}, are you prepared to begin your ascent of the Tower?''Well fought ${PLAYER}. With the defeat of the Orkish commander, the forces scattered throughout the ruins will be leaderless and in chaos.

'Dealing with them will be much simpler now. I thank you.'A particularly brutal Orc captain has made the old tower of Tharbad his base of operations. You have been asked to clear the courtyard approaching the tower of defenders to open the way for an attack on the tower itself.Speak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the tower.Complete the Mission: Tharbad Tower CourtyardThe tower courtyard has been cleared of foes. Speak with the mission giver in order to continue your assault.Return to Hithriel and inform him of your success'A particularly cruel and brutal Orkish captain has claimed the upper floors of the ruined tower of Tharbad as his stronghold. If we are to drive the Orcs from Tharbad, we will need to defeat him.

'First you will need to cross the river to the island on which the tower stands. Once there, clear the courtyard below the tower of defenders.''Take care ${PLAYER}. The Orcs in that tower will offer you no quarter.''Quick work, ${PLAYER}. With the courtyard clear, you should be able to assault the tower itself, and find the Orc commander above.'An accursed flame burns in the ruins at the edge of the Greyflood. It must be doused if the spirits it has drawn to these waters are to be banished.Speak with the mission giver and let them know you are ready to complete your mission in the Greyflood.Complete the Mission: The Accursed FlameWith the flame extinguished, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your findings.Tell Hithriel that the flame has been extinguished'That flame you found must be the source of the power that has called these drowned spirits forth from the waters of the Greyflood. If you wish to banish them, the flame itself must be extinguished.''You are ready to set out? Stay on your guard. It is likely that the most dreadful of wraiths will be drawn to the flame itself.''It is a relief to know that this kindling of evil has been extinguished by your hand. I thank you for your brave efforts.'Gorgar the Ruthless has been tracked to Goblin-town. Will you find and defeat him in time?Gorgar has been spotted at the Goblin-gate!

Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu at once!Talk to AusmaYour mission is to find and defeat Gorgar the Ruthless in Goblin-town.

Speak to Ausma to travel to Goblin-town.Complete Mission: The Assassination of GorgarThe mission is complete, though not quite a success.

You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.Talk to AusmaThe mission is complete, though not quite a success.

You should talk to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.Talk to Glóin'Fabarâl ${PLAYER}! I have urgent news!

'Ausma just reported that Gorgar arrived at the Goblin-gate a few hours ago! If her plan is to go ahead, the time is now! Report to her as soon as you can, and good luck! The Gabil'akkâ is counting on you!''Are you ready, ${CLASS}? We know where Gorgar is. Let us strike before he slips through our fingers! Oh, and Hórin here has requested to join us; he said something about wanting to do more than just stand around in an old fort!'

She shrugs and looks to Hórin, grinning. Hórin gets flustered, mutters about saying no such thing, and turns away, blushing.

'I will get us unseen through as much of Goblin-town as I can, but... we may have to wade through some goblins. Let me know when you are prepared!'Gorgar the Ruthless has been tracked to Goblin-town. Will you find and defeat him in time?

Your mission is to find and defeat Gorgar the Ruthless in Goblin-town.'I already told Glóin that we failed in our mission, but he wishes to speak with you himself.'

Ausma is clearly still angry about Gorgar's escape. You try to lift her spirits by telling her that although the particulars of the mission were failed, the defeat of the Great Goblin and the severing of the alliance between Goblin-town and Gundabad must count as successes. She sighs loudly and allows you to see the slightest hint of a smile.

'You are right of course, ${PLAYER}, but my quarry has evaded me, and I will not be satisfied until he lies dead. Go on, go talk to Glóin. Don't keep him waiting!''Welcome back, ${PLAYER}. I know Ausma and Hórin are disappointed that Gorgar escaped, but your contribution to the war effort must not be discounted! Gorgar was forced to retreat, his tail between his legs, and furthermore his alliance with Goblin-town was shattered! Not only that, but much of his army is now in tatters! You will be commended for your hard work.'Your mission is to find the legendary Beast of Belfalas and subdue or defeat it.Your mission is to find the legendary Beast of Belfalas and subdue or defeat it.

Speak to Malthak to travel.Complete Mission: The Beast of BelfalasYou have successfully defeated the great beast Tarasâd! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.'Good to see you, ${PLAYER}. We have gotten reports of a great legendary beast, Tarasâd, the Beast of Belfalas. It was seen rampaging through north Zamarzîr. Growing up in Umbar, we all heard the stories of the great Beast of Belfalas, but most knew never to pay them much mind. Well, several captains have reported losing men to a great beast, as long as four men and as wide as three, in the last week.

'Please, investigate northern Zamarzîr and if you find the great beast, defeat it quickly, before it overcomes you.''Your objective is clear, ${PLAYER}. Find the great beast Tarasâd in Zamarzîr, and subdue or defeat it.''Wow, I never thought I'd see the day. Look at the size of that claw. You truly are a mighty warrior, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for doing this.'You have been tasked with dispatching a powerful beast in Misthallow.Your mission is to find and defeat the great hunting cat which terrorizes Misthallow.

Speak to Hórin to travel to Misthallow.Complete Mission: The Beast of MisthallowThe mission is complete!

Speak to Hórin for your reward!Talk to Hórin'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'My scouts have returned from Misthallow. They come with a story of a terrible beast, the sharpest fangs, and deadly claws of the greatest length! They call her Bergelmir. They managed to avoid the beast, barely, but a caravan of provisions would not be so lucky as a group of nimble scouts!

'We can not let this deadly beast roam freely on the pass to Misthallow!'A beast in Misthallow has been terrorizing those on the southern path from the Grey Mountains….

Your mission is to find and defeat the great hunting cat which terrorizes Misthallow.'Well done! To think there was not one, but two terrible beasts in the Misthallow! Hopefully there were only two and no more.'You have been tasked with destroying the Angmarim ritual at Shakal-atrâd.Your mission is to destroy the Angmarim ritual at Shakal-atrâd.

