'My scouts have returned from Shakal-atrâd. The Angmarim have performed some ritual at the old dwarf watch-post. This can not stand! We must return to Shakal-atrâd and put a stop to their fell practices!'Upon the ruins of Shakal-atrâd, in Elderslade, an Angmarim ritual has taken place, defiling the old watch-tower….

Your mission is to destroy the Angmarim ritual at Shakal-atrâd.'Well done! With the Angmarim ritual disrupted, the tower may once again be a watch-post for the dwarves! If we are to keep the road to Gundabad clear, Shakal-atrâd must remain under our protection.'You have been tasked with thwarting the ghastly presence at Shakal-atrâd.Your mission is to thwart the ghastly presence at Shakal-atrâd.

Speak to Hórin to travel to Shakal-atrâd.Complete Mission: The Bloody RuinsThe mission is complete!

