'My scouts have returned from Shakal-atrâd. Angmarim have taken refuge at the old dwarf watch-post. This can not stand! We must return to Shakal-atrâd and put an end to what ever presence remains there!'Within the ruins of Shakal-atrâd, in Elderslade, an Angmarim ritual had taken place, defiling the depths of the old watch-tower….

Your mission is to thwart the ghastly presence at Shakal-atrâd.'Well done! With the ruins clear, the tower may once again be a watch-post for the dwarves! If we are to keep the road to Gundabad clear, Shakal-atrâd must remain under our protection.'You have been tasked with destroying the source of the Taurogrim corruption that has spread over Óinsbridge.Your mission is to defeat the source of the Taurogrim corruption.

Speak to Ausma to travel to Óinsbridge.Complete Mission: The Branches of CorruptionThe mission is complete!

Speak to Ausma for your reward!Talk to Ausma'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'My scouts have come back from Óinsbridge. They have found the bridge to be overrun by the Taurogrim. The Taurogrim continue to be pushed from the Mirkwood and have begun taking lands such as the Thornholt!

'We cannot let the Taurogrim corruption to spread over Óinsbridge. We must find the source of their corruption and defeat it so that we can regain control of the bridge!'The Taurogrim have taken over Óinsbridge as their corruption threatens all in the Grey Mountains….

Your mission is to defeat the source of the Taurogrim corruption.'Well done! With the source of the Taurogrim corruption destroyed, we should be able to retake Óinsbridge! I just hope the Taurogrim do not try regroup and double their efforts!'There are reports of ships disappearing in several of the northern Shield Isles of Jeb Khâtel. Investigate the islands and figure out what is happening to these ships and their crews.Your mission is to investigate the northern Shield Isles of Jeb Khâtel and figure out what is happening to disappearing ships and their crews.

Speak to Malthak to travel.Complete Mission: The Call of the SeaYou have successfully defeated the sirens and escaped with your life! Return to the mission giver with this report.'Well met, ${PLAYER}. We have been receiving disturbing reports from Jeb Khâtel in the Shield Isles. To the north, there is a series of small islands. Several ships have gone missing in this area, not to be seen again. Please, investigate these mysterious isles and figure out what happened to these ships and their crews.''Your mission is clear, ${PLAYER}, to investigate the northern Shield Isles of Jeb Khâtel and figure out what is happening to these disappearing ships and their crews.''That is disturbing news indeed. It's a tragedy what happened to those sailors, but due to your brave deeds, future ships venturing through those isles won't suffer the same fate.'You have been tasked with dispatching the wargs inside Shathur-munzu.Your mission is to defeat the wargs inside Shathur-munzu.

