'Investigate the grounds of Adakûr near the crypts of Esh-kimâkhi for signs of the travellers. I pray these travellers are merely waylaid, and may still return safely to their families. Please, our need is urgent, go now in search of them.''Your mission, ${PLAYER}, is to search the grounds of Adakûr near the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi for any sign of this band of missing travellers.''That is grim news indeed. I am glad you were not dragged into a shallow tomb with those travellers. We will warn future travellers to stay well clear of the crypts of Esh-kimâkhi. Thank you for returning the Dead to rest. I'm sorry for the danger you encountered, though you seem to have handled yourself quite capably.'You have been tasked with dispatching the worms in the Clutch-hollow.Enter the Clutch-hollow and defeat the worms within.

