'We have found a den of worms within the mountains. They must be what's left of Scatha's own horde. I cannot abide these foul things to live! Go, and slay them all! For the Zhélruka!''Good work, ${PLAYER}. We cannot allow those foul beasts to remain alive. I will let you know when we find more.'Deep in the Wyrmsgráf, what remains of Scatha's brood makes their den....

