Speak to Hórin for your reward!Talk to Hórin'I have a new mission for you, ${PLAYER}.

'Our workers have returned from old dwarf-made waterways of Shalakâm. Even with their efforts, the waters still do not flow in the directions needed to bring additional fresh water to Máttugard.

'You are to travel to Shalakâm, and work to assist in redirecting the flow of the water there. While you are patrolling the waterways, would you collect any misplaced parts that the workers may have left behind?''Within Shalakâm, the ancient waterways of Gundabad, many old gates direct the flow of water….

'Your mission is to collect gears and redirect the flow water within the dwarf-made waterways of Shalakâm.''Excellent work, ${PLAYER}!

'I am sure that everyone in Máttugard will thank you for your efforts. I also thank you for returning with all these gears. I am sure we will be able to put them to good use in our continued restoration efforts of Gundabad.'You have been tasked with removing the bats who have descended upon the dwarf-ruins of Zarkul-sulûn.Your mission is to remove the bats who have descended upon Zarkul-sulûn.

