'My scouts have come back from Zarkul-sulûn. There are bats everywhere! This can not stand! We must return to the Zarkul-sulûn and expel these winged beasts!'Upon the dwarf-ruins of Zarkul-sulûn, bats have descended onto the Torrent-spires in the darkness of the night….

Your mission is to remove the bats who have descended upon Zarkul-sulûn.'Well done! With the bats driven away by your quick thinking, Zarkul-sulûn may soon be ours! We can't have vicious bats swarming us in the heat of battle!'You have been tasked with exploring a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad.Your mission is to explore a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad.

