'We have recently unlocked the hidden vault of Agbash-khalt. With the treasure vault open, it now must be explored!

'You are to travel to the vault of Agbash-khalt at once and find out what lies within. Careful though, as we do not know how safe the inner sanctum of the vault is!''Behold! The vault of Agbash-khalt, sealed and hidden to all those who have occupied Gundabad, has now finally revealed itself to the Zhélruka Dwarves….

'Your mission is to explore a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad.''I have received word of your efforts at Agbash-khalt, ${PLAYER}.

'There was a trap in the vault that locked you inside! I am glad that you kept your wits about you and figured out how to escape! If you had panicked, I dare say the outcome might have been quite grim. Well done!'Mincham believes that Olnathron can be found in some ancient ruins in the western Fields of Fornost.You have been asked to travel to the North Downs and enter the ruins of Tham Lorn in the Fields of Fornost. There you will face Olnathron, a fell-spirit that is a source of the evil stirrings that spread through these remnants of the once-glorious Kingdom of Arnor.Complete Mission: The Fortress of OlnathronOlnathron has been sent back to the abyss. You should talk to Mincham and then give your report to the Hooded Stranger.Talk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony'A fell-spirit by the name of Olnathron has been menacing innocents who enter the Fields of Fornost. Mincham, a Ranger of the North, believes that this evil resides in the ruins of Tham Lorn in the western fields, but he is bound by duty to watch over the road south of Fornost. He could use the help of a seasoned warrior with the strength of heart to face this evil.'

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>'Do you think yourself ready to enter the fortress of Olnathron? You must be careful. You are a seasoned warrior, but this place is truly evil.''You have done well, my brave friend. Not only has Olnathron been defeated, but the fumes from those burning idols may have been responsible for the increase in the corruption of Fornost of late. You have my thanks.'You have been tasked with dispatching the Orc captain defending Shathur-munzu.Your mission is to find and defeat Rauzhúl, the Orc captain defending Shathur-munzu.

