'Caivád Sâr is a deadly fortress and is not a place to tread lightly!'Far from Angmar, the last stronghold of the Iron Crown keeps watch over Elderslade for the forces of Gundabad….

Your mission is to defeat the wardens of Caivád Sâr.'Well done! With the three wardens finally defeated, we should be able to launch an assault against Caivád Sâr soon enough!'Led by a terrible hobgoblin, the forces of Gundabad have invaded the Keep of Tharrazhâr. You have been charged with repelling their attack and securing Skarháld.Your mission is to break through the defences of an Orkish invasion in the Keep of Tharrazhâr and defeat the hobgoblin known as Graznúl.

