Your mission is to break through the defences of an Orkish invasion in the Keep of Tharrazhâr and defeat the hobgoblin known as Graznúl.'Well done, ${PLAYER}!

'I shall see to it that Skarháld's defences are bolstered at once. Let us hope it is enough!'Gond Orchal has been corrupted by a gaunt-lord who is raising Wights from the various tombs. This evil must be defeated.Speak with the mission giver to travel to the tomb. Defeat Wights and the Gond Orchal war-monger.Complete the Mission: The Tombs of Gond OrchalWith your mission in Gond Orchal successful, you should return to the mission giver.Return to Baglan and tell him you have defeated the evil'A Gond Orchal war-monger is corrupting the tombs in this area. Defeat the risen Wights and the gaunt-lord at the top of the hill.''Be careful amongst the tombs at Gond Orchal, ${PLAYER}. There are Wights about and a gaunt-lord oversees the area from the top of the hill.''You have done well ${PLAYER}. As agreed, you are deserving of payment. Take this and know that we are grateful for all you have done.'You have been tasked with investigating a fire in the Wildwood, then quickly returning to town.Your mission is to investigate a fire in the Wildwood, then quickly return to town.

