Your mission is to investigate a fire in the Wildwood, then quickly return to town.'We have done well, ${CLASS}. With the ambush defeated, Trestlebridge is once again safe. All those in Trestlebridge are thankful that we returned to town when we did. The fire was certainly a distraction to lead us away from town.'You have been tasked with rescuing those caught in an ambush at the watch post of Bizar-atrâd.Your mission is to rescue dwarves at Bizar-atrâd.

