Your mission is to assist Rangvald with training dwarves for war at Skarháld.'Well done! With these soldiers properly trained, we are certain to win this war!'The robbers in Kidu-bâla have stolen many valuables from the Beltáni and other travellers. The valuables should be reclaimed and returned to their rightful owners.Your mission is to infiltrate and retrieve the items stolen from the Beltáni.

