'We cannot let Orc take over the Steel Keep! I need you to destroy their stockpile of weapons so that we may more easily dispatch the enemy!'Within the halls of Thikil-gundu, Orcs from Gundabad have taken hold of the old armoury….

Your mission is to destroy weapon stockpiles guarded by Gundabad Orcs in the Steel Keep.'Well done! With their weapons destroyed, we can easily attack the armoury and take care of those Orcs! The last thing we need is another Gundabad stronghold in these mountains!'You have been tasked with guarding Trader's Wharf from potential threats.Your mission is to guard Trader's Wharf from potential threats.

