'You are to travel to Scatha's larder in Wyrmsgráf and defeat these dragon-kind before they can grow to rival their forebears! For the Gabil'akkâ!'Deep within Wyrmsgráf, there lies a great larder which once belonged to Scatha the Worm. In recent years, it has come to be a feeding ground for the young dragon-kind of Ered Mithrin.

