You should rake up leaves.Rake up leaves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})'It is important to keep our forest and pathways clean and safe. Might you pitch in and rake up any fallen leaves you might find in our village? We can use the dry leaves as kindling in the hearths.'You have achieved a goal open to only a few. You will have the glory of representing the Free People as a ranger from Esteldín against a troll out of Angmar.Speak again to the ranger within this room and choose to enter battle as a noble ranger out of Esteldín.Speak with the ranger to enter mortal battle as a rangerSpeak with the ranger to complete the quest.Speak with the ranger to complete the quest.'Welcome warrior. This is your opportunity to prove your prowess on the field of battle. If you choose to, you may speak with me again to enter mortal battle with an opponent of great power and strength.

