You should bring all the food that you have collected and baked to Mabel Mitford so that the festival feast will remain plentiful for the hungry patrons.'Are you here to help me? I'm so busy, I don't know what to do with myself. There are so many hungry patrons to serve.

'Would you be so good as to prepare some ingredients so that the feasting folk don't go without a fair portion?

