You should speak to Odilia Rumble to receive your reward for completing a scavenger hunt card!Talk to Odilia Rumble'Why, I ask you, am I even responsible for this mystery? True, I am nearer the Party Tree oftener than nearly any other Hobbit in the Shire. But I am no constable, I can assure you of that, and no great riddle-solver, either.''And there we are. Another list examined. Of course, they left another reward as well. Did you expect it? I must confess that I was not surprised. Enjoy it, my friend.'Every year in the spring, the Anniversary Scavenger Hunt takes place to celebrate a very special occasion.

