'Yes, yes, there is indeed another reward. Somehow I've been coaxed against my will to participate in this madness! The Party Planning Committee will hear about this!'The Farmers Faire is in Bywater for a limited time!Travel to the Festival Announcer, Caltha Tunnelly, in Bywater to learn more about the annual Farmers Faire! The Hobbits of Bywater are celebrating the summer's bounty with food and drink, fishing, and hunting for eggs and mushrooms in the nearby farm-yards.Travel to BywaterEach year the Hobbits of Bywater celebrate the last of the summer sun and the bounty of the year's harvest by throwing a spectacular Farmers Faire in the middle of town. Visit and join in on the fun!Travel to Bywater in the Shire to participate in the Farmers Faire celebrationTravel to Caltha Tunnelly, the Festival Announcer in Bywater, to learn more about the annual Farmers Faire! The Hobbits of the Shire are celebrating the summer's bounty with food and drink, fishing, and hunting for eggs and mushrooms in the nearby farm-yards.

