'If you wish to stand a chance at all, you should wield a mighty dwarf-club and keep the others away. Make sure you are ready to fight before you enter the hall! If you leave the bounds of that lower level yonder, you will be immediately disqualified. Good luck to you, ${PLAYER}!'

