You should bring news of your success to Logethuil.'Do you know what I advise? I advise that you ignore my friends and embark upon the greatest challenge of all. That is the only way you shall earn my respect as an elite gardener.

'When you begin the game, you are responsible for planting and gardening tasks, as well as driving away the dear shrews. If you can manage all of this in the allotted time, you will have truly done as much as you can for our poor little garden.

'Do your best, ${PLAYER}! The stakes are very high indeed.'

