<rgb=#FF0000>After accepting this quest, you will get a map. Use the map to travel to the Party Tree and join in the Festival.</rgb>Argirion, boatswain of the Gilminuial, told you how his ship was damaged in a storm and lost all of its cargo. He has asked for your help in locating his captain and reclaiming the lost cargo.

<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>The Captain of the Gilminuial may be found northward along the Baranduin. The cargo is strewn along the Brandywine River.

Argirion asked you to seek out the Captain of the Gilminuial and recover as much of the ship's cargo as you can.Argirion is southward along the Brandywine River.

The Captain of the Gilminuial bid you return to Argirion and let him know that the rest of the crew survived. He also asked that you fulfil Argirion's request and collect the cargo.'Hoi there! I am Argirion, boatswain aboard the Gilminuial -- or at least I was until we were beset by a great storm! The Gilminuial is a ship belonging to we Rangers that sails up and down the Baranduin providing much-needed supplies to the Wardens of Annúminas in the North.

'That work, though, was brought to an end with the storm. Our ship was grounded, the quartermaster and I were washed overboard, and our cargo lost. I know not if anyone else survived the disaster and would be pleased if you could search northward for the Captain.

'It is also vital that the cargo be recovered, for it was intended to supply the Wardens as they fight the evil that has come to Annúminas. I am sure it is strewn all along the Brandywine.''I fear the rest of the Gilminuial's crew perished, but I must know for certain. Seek out the Captain, if you can, and recover as much of the cargo as possible.''Ah! You have come from Argirion? He and Mindambeth are well? That is good.

'You may return to Argirion and let him know that all survived the wreck and are now repairing the damage. Do as Argirion requested and gather the cargo before you return, however... it is vital for the defence of Annúminas.''It is good to know that my kinsmen did not perish in the storm.

'Thank you as well for recovering this cargo. Bring it to Mindambeth, as well as any more you may find as you journey along the Baranduin.

'As thanks for your efforts, you may choose something from the ship's stores that have survived. Mindambeth will see to your reward.'The Taste of Hobbiton is in full swing! Bondo Brandybuck is accepting wagers on which hobbit is most likely to win.Speak to Bando Brandybuck and choose your favourite contestant for the next upcoming race.Speak to Bando Brandybuck to choose a race contestantObserve the race and cheer for your chosen participant.'Good day to you, ${PLAYER}! Here for the festival, are you? Well, as you may know, our main event is the Taste of Hobbiton! It's a combination race and eating contest.

'In the end, only one hobbit will have the endurance and pluck needed to roll across the finish line first! Pick a likely looking contestant and let's see if you've got an eye to spot the winner!'You have a vested interest in Burdy's success as he runs the Summer Festival tasting race.The Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival.

You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Burdy Gamwich wins the race as you supposed.Observe the race to see if Burdy is victoriousBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton.

You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.Talk to Bando Brandybuck'Good day to you, my good ${RACE}! Are you here to watch the Taste of Hobbiton? It is a tremendously exciting event that we hold here every summer. Food is brought from all over the Shire, and our four speedy contestants must compete to see how quickly they can sample each bit of vittles!

'Here is a bit of inside information, if you'll be wanting it: Burdy Gamwich is a sure thing this year. I happen to know that he eats eleven full meals per day! And he is only just out of his tweens and is active as a young hobbit-lad can be.

'I'd say the race can end with none other than young Burdy coming out on top. Would you like to place your confidence in his winning the event? I am sure there will be a great prize in it for you if you guess rightly.''My goodness! Watch the race, ${PLAYER}; it is far more interesting than me. Burdy will do splendidly, I am sure!''Well done, ${PLAYER}! I hear you had some excellent luck with your guess at the outcome of the Taste of Hobbiton. Allow me to offer my congratulations and this respectable reward!'You have a vested interest in Daffodilly's success as she runs the Summer Festival tasting race.The Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival.

You should watch the Taste of Hobbiton and see if Daffodilly Hayward wins the race as you supposed.Observe the race to see if Daffodilly is victoriousBando Brandybuck can be found at the Taste of Hobbiton.

You should speak with Bando Brandybuck to collect your prize.Talk to Bando Brandybuck'Good day to you, my good ${RACE}! Are you here to watch the Taste of Hobbiton? It is a tremendously exciting event that we hold here every summer. Food is brought from all over the Shire, and our four speedy contestants must compete to see how quickly they can sample each bit of vittles!

'Here is a bit of inside information, if you'll be wanting it: Daffodilly Hayward is a favourite this year. She has been the undefeated pie-eating champion in Overhill for three years running. And I heard she walked all the way from Overhill to Hobbiton Centre last spring!

'I'd say she is a sure thing. Would you like to place your confidence in her winning the event? I am sure there will be a great prize in it for you if you guess rightly.''My goodness! Watch the race, ${PLAYER}; it is far more interesting than me. Daffodilly will do splendidly, I am sure!''Well done, ${PLAYER}! I hear you had some excellent luck with your guess at the outcome of the Taste of Hobbiton. Allow me to offer my congratulations and this respectable reward!'You have a vested interest in Gladdy's success as she runs the Summer Festival tasting race.The Taste of Hobbiton can be observed during the Summer Festival.

