You should talk to Theodore Gorse.Talk to Theodore Gorse in Bree, Rivendell, or Twenty-first HallTheodore Gorse, a treasure seeker with experience, is searching for his many stolen treasures from his many adventures.'You have done it! All of my lost excursions into danger have been restored! It is safe to say that I am a Master Treasure-seeker now! Yes, I did say that I would share in the bounty and Theodore Gorse is a man of his word! Here, take this small token. It is the least that I can do, my friend!'Darôma wants seashells from the nearby beaches to decorate the inn.Darôma has offered to pay you for bringing seashells to her. She suggested looking on the island's northern shores, particularly in and around the channel.Collect seashells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have collected many splendid-looking seashells from the beaches of Furtherholm. You should bring them to Darôma inside The Cracked Flagon to receive your reward.Bring the seashells to Darôma'There is a thing I have been wanting to do but never seem to have the time. It is not unusual for beautiful seashells to be found on the island's northern shores. I wanted to take a break and collect some of them to decorate the cabins, but my duties have kept me from enjoying the beaches.

'If you bring me some beautiful seashells from Furtherholm's beaches, I would happily pay you for them. The best place to find seashells is on the island's north side, specifically in and around the channel there.'

