'The worst of it has to be the garbage left by some of the sloppier festival patrons. Stinking, slimy garbage and refuse all around the Eating Contest, and the Mayor's wife demands that the patrons don't see any of it! But it keeps piling up.

'I can't bear to touch the stuff, myself. I don't even want to look at it. Mabel keeps saying she's too busy. Say...you don't look too busy!''That garbage is still piling up, you know. Disgusting stuff. Please go take care of it before the Mayor's wife sees it, or else she'll think I'm not pulling my weight. This is all that Mabel's fault....''I don't see any more garbage or spills! Thank goodness -- the very sight of them was most nauseating. I can't imagine how disgusting it must be to actually have to touch such things. 

