'Would you be interested in playing?''Try looking for Elves around Duillond. I'm sure they will try to catch your eye if they wish to engage in the game.''What do you see out yonder? I stand here often, and watch.''How I love to gather for festivities! Music can be so inspiring, ${PLAYER}; do you not agree? We are missing something, though, if this is to be a true party....''Goodness me, you startled me! I was simply, ah, standing guard over this delightful display. I only sampled it to ensure that it was sufficiently delicious, which it is. It was just a taste! You will not tell anyone, will you?''Mae govannen! You look to be an accomplished ${CLASS}. I can tell by your eyes that you have seen many a battle, like myself. I greet you, and give salute to your great valour. We warriors are as kin!''Your talents in Mír a Rinc have become legendary, ${PLAYER}. You have done well!'Troves and Trickery is a festival tradition among many cultures, where participants try to please a number of celebrants with their tricks in order to receive a prize.

