You have found all of Holfast's missing valuables, and now you should return them to their master.'What a terror! I ventured into the Haunted Burrow, for I was sure there would be treasure tucked away in every corner. I swore I wouldn't leave until I came away with a few riches.

'Instead of jools at the bottoms of various jars and whatnot, I found the most horrible things instead! Sticky, cold, wet, terrifying things. Unnatural things!

'When I came back outside for a bit of fresh air, I found that I'd lost several valuables in the meantime. Surely they are at the bottoms of the jars now, for other greedy folks to find. Now I am poorer than when I started! I dare not go back; will you help me?'

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only one Haunted Burrow quest may be underway at a time.</rgb>'I've lost so many things! My monocle, my button...let's see. What else? Oh! My ring and my pocket-watch as well. There was something else too....

'I was rummaging in many places, but if you can find everything I lost throughout the Haunted Burrow, I'll be tremendously grateful to you.'These delicate bones have an ashy feel to them, like they will crumble in a moment if you trouble them. You imagine the dust of death filling your nose and eyes and squeeze your eyes shut unwillingly in anticipation.

