Anglalaith has asked you to gather some branches from several bushes so that he may finish making his Yule wreaths.Gather branches from the bushes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Anglalaith is at Duillond.

Anglalaith will be pleased to receive the branches you gathered and begin work on more wreaths.'I wish you a Yule to remember, ${PLAYER}. The festivals to honour the seasons are always my favourite times of the year. Nature goes through such wonderful changes; indeed, the beauty can be quite overwhelming.

'I have a tradition at Yule where I make wreaths from the boughs of the evergreen bushes and present them to the others as a way to honour the winter season. I am nearly halfway done with this year's wreaths, but unfortunately I have run out of branches.

'If you could, head into the hills to the west and retrieve some for me so I can finish making the wreaths. I would be greatly indebted to you.''Have you gathered branches for my wreaths, yet? It is not a festival without wreaths.''These branches will do perfectly, ${PLAYER}. I will sing the songs of Yule while I craft the remainder of the wreaths, and I will add your name in thanks.'Every year in the spring, the Anniversary Scavenger Hunt takes place to celebrate a very special occasion.

