Twelve silver pennies was at least three times his worth, perhaps, but he would earn far more in service before the journey was through.'Now these Elves aren't wanderers. They seem to belong here, more even than Hobbits in the Shire, and if there's any magic about, it's right down deep, where I can't lay my hands on it, in a manner of speaking.'You completed a scavenger hunt card!Every year in the spring, the Anniversary Scavenger Hunt takes place to celebrate a very special occasion.

