<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>Hobbiton lies far to the east of Michel Delving.

Will Whitfoot has given you an official petition and has sent you to Hobbiton to find ten inhabitants to sign your petition.Lobelia Sackville-Baggins is at Bag End on the Hill in Hobbition.

Having obtained ten signatures, you should bring the signed petition to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins.'Ah, here it is! The Book of Festival-law clearly states that a festival-planner can be changed with a petition signed by no fewer than ten persons who reside in the town of the feast in question.

'Here, take this official petition. If you can find ten residents of Hobbiton to sign it, then the post of Hobbiton Yule-planner can be changed!''A petition for a new Yule-planner? Of course, I'll sign it!''You were able to find a way to get Lobelia out of her office? Give that paper here!''I'll sign your petition, you can be sure!''What's that now? Why of course I'll sign your petition!''A petition for a new Yule-planner? Of course, I'll sign it!''You were able to find a way to get Lobelia out of her post? Give that paper here!''I'll sign your petition!''What's that now? Why of course I'll sign!''A petition for a new Yule-planner? Of course I'll sign it!

'That Lobelia has been nothing but trouble since she moved to Bag End. What I wouldn't give for young Mr. Frodo to return.''A petition? Why would I sign a silly thing like that?''What do you want? Can't you see that I am busy preparing for this year's Yule-feast?'Complete a Yule Festival activity in Frostbluff!Every day there is something to do in Frostbluff.  Every day there is Yule!  Come and join everyone in Frostbluff and complete a Yule Festival activity.  We have a Sack of Presents waiting for you!Participate in a Yule Festival activity in FrostbluffEvery day there is something to do in Frostbluff.  Every day there is Yule!  Come and join everyone in Frostbluff and complete a Yule Festival activity  We have a Sack of Presents waiting for you.Participate in a Yule Festival activity in FrostbluffMara Sandydowns would like to thank you for your participation in the Yule Festival today.Speak to Mara SandydownsCongratulations!  You have made it to Frostbluff.  Participate in any Yule Festival activity today and earn a Sack of Presents!'Well done, friend!  Come and sit by the fire a moment.  You have earned this Sack of Presents for all your hard work today!

