HINT:

Minstrels use <rgb=#ffff00>Ballads</rgb> to attack their enemies and empower themselves. These skills operate on a rotating system that allows the minstrel to have three special buffs on themselves at any time. After the third buff is applied the next <rgb=#ffff00>Ballad</rgb> played will overwrite the first, then the second and so on.Use the skill Ballad of Swiftness on the training-dummyThe Minstrel Trainer is in Frerin's Court.

