Runekeepers require <rgb=#ff0000>Battle Attunement</rgb> to use offensive skills, and <rgb=#00ff00>Healing Attunement</rgb> to cast healing spells.  <rgb=#ffff00>Attunement</rgb> is <rgb=#ff0000>raised</rgb> or <rgb=#00ff00>lowered</rgb> through the use of similar skills.  Offensive Skills typically have <rgb=#ff0000>Red</rgb> backgrounds, and Healing skills typically have <rgb=#00ff00>Green</rgb> backgrounds.  Use your offensive skills to raise your <rgb=#ff0000>Battle Attunement</rgb> to three and then use your <rgb=#FF0000>Shocking Words</rgb> skill.'I am pleased to know that you have completed your meditation and training. The road ahead is filled with many challenges, and we must all prepare ourselves for what is to come. I think that this lesson will be one that remains with you.''Yes, I sensed that you were well-prepared, ${PLAYER}. Remember, we must work to reclaim this land, and while we have a tentative peace with the dwarves in the valley below, we cannot overlook the lesson of that past and the betrayal that came at their hands.

'Speak with Dorongúr and tell him that I believe you are ready.''Strike the training-dummy with your new skill and return to me. We must make certain that you are prepared to stand against the dangers of Middle-earth.'

