'You must learn skills from others, like myself. We can guide you through your training and help you become stronger.

'Learn the skill <rgb=#00ff00>Savage Strikes</rgb> from me and show me that my teaching has given you mastery by striking the training-dummy nearby.'

HINT:

Champions rely on <rgb=#ffff00>Fervour</rgb> to activate some of their skills such as <rgb=#00ff00>Savage Strikes</rgb>.  Use your <rgb=#00ff00>Swift Strike</rgb> and <rgb=#00ff00>Wild Attack</rgb> skills to build <rgb=#ffff00>2 Fervour</rgb> and then strike the <rgb=#ff0000>Targeting Dummy</rgb> with your <rgb=#ffff00>Savage Strikes</rgb> skill.'I am pleased to know that you have completed your meditation and training. The road ahead is filled with many challenges, and we must all prepare ourselves for what is to come. I think that this lesson will be one that stays with you.''Yes, I sensed that you were well-prepared, ${PLAYER}. Remember, we must work to reclaim this land, and while we have a tentative peace with the dwarves in the valley below, we cannot overlook the lessons of the past and the betrayal that came at their hands.

