Dorongúr Whitethorn has sent you to speak with Elladan son of Elrond.Talk to Elladan in Edhelion'Beyond the door to the east, you will find Elladan and Dorallas. Elladan is here at the behest of his father, investigating a dark omen that plagues Master Elrond's dreams. Speak with him.

'Master Elrond has told me that it is foolish to rebuild this place, but I do not share his concern. Seek me out should you find the need to return here in the future.

'For now, go to Elladan and help us quiet the darkness in this land.''Find Elladan beyond the open doorway to the east. I have taught you all I can. Be well, ${PLAYER}.''Master Dorongúr is a good teacher, but his heart is too close to this land. I respect his efforts to reclaim Edhelion and know that he means well, but there are other problems within Ered Luin than this fallen refuge.

'I pray he taught you well, for the road ahead is dark....'The trees of Edhelion, long dormant since the departure of the Elves, shed their seeds long ago. The Elves at the refuge believe that life still exists within the preserved seeds found in the large piles of leaves beneath the barren boughs.The copse of trees Gailthin speaks of lay a short distance from her.

Gailthin asked you to search the patches of leaves for any sign of preserved seed that might be used to restore the grove to its former beauty.Return the preserved seeds to Gailthin'Greetings, ${CLASS}. I wish to speak to you of a matter of importance to me. Long ago, when this ruin was a thing of beauty, I tended the groves and kept the lore of Edhelion. I have returned now to see that this place is restored to the beauty and reverence for which it once stood. My efforts to collect and catalogue the lore go poorly. Even worse, the blight affecting the trees has left me with little hope....

'Hope, however, is never truly lost, and so I ask you to assist me. These trees have resilient seeds, and if any have survived the years, they will be found in the embrace of the leaves scattered about their trunks.

'I know that you must test your mettle against the creatures now plaguing the trees, so I hope that this small task will not hinder your goals. Will you assist me?''The gift of life, that is what these seeds represent. I am pleased that your efforts proved to be fruitful. To know that we shall recover the beauty and knowledge of Edhelion stirs such joy within me that I shall remember your efforts always. Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'Allows players to skip through to the public area of the game.If you would like to skip the remainder of the tutorial experience and be transported to Thorin's Gate at the outset of the game's story, speak with Glóin again.Talk to Glóin to skip the TutorialIf you would like to skip the remainder of the tutorial experience and be transported to Thorin's Gate at the outset of the game's story, speak with Glóin again.If you choose to skip the tutorial experience, you will be transported to Thorin's Gate at the height of the Dourhand's control over Thorin's Hall and will be unable to travel to Thorin's Gate prior to those events.

