'That girl Violet probably went that way and found trouble, so I think you should deal with those ruffians. Maybe they'll take the hint and move back to wherever it is they came from.

'The ruffians -- brigands like as not -- are camped not far west of here. Their camp is on the heights of Narrowcleeve, south past a waterfall. It looks dangerous but you can ford the stream just before the cascade goes over the cliff.''I wish the Bounders had more hobbits. This sort of thing wouldn't happen if the Shire was guarded better in the first place.

'Well, no matter, here, please take these coins for your trouble.''Please try to drive off those ruffians for us. I hope it don't come to violence, but if it does, so be it. Their camp is at Narrowcleeve, west of this farm and on the far side of the waterfall. There should be a place where you can ford the stream not far from here.'You rely on your rune-stone in battle, and together, you cannot fail.Use any rune-stoneIncrease the resiliency of your Rune of Restoration.Use Rune of RestorationSearch out the strongholds of the Dourhand brigands.Search out the strongholds of the Dourhand brigands.Discover RingdaleDiscover the GrimwaterDiscover the Spire of KheledûlDiscover the Kheledûl DocksImpress the people of Furtherholm by winning the Shield Isles Midsummer Run many times.Complete the Shield Isles Midsummer Run during the Midsummer Festival.Complete the Shield Isles Midsummer RunMurig could use your help with securing water for the warrior-scouts.Murig needs samples of water from different points along the river.

