'I am the King of Frostbluff, and no one tells me what to do!''My keep is the grand <rgb=#FF00FF>Frostlake Fortress</rgb>! If only we could reclaim this great fortress and restore balance to the kingdom!'

'I am the King of Frostbluff. I have spoken!'A daily snowball battle - winter is simply grand!Complete The Battle at Frostbluff.Complete The Battle at Frostbluff'If you secure all our fortresses, I will give you an extra reward. What do you say?'To celebrate the downfall of Sauron, the sons of Elrond have challenged the heroes of Middle-earth to a contest of strength, cunning, and wit. These heroes will pledge their abilities to either Elladan or Elrohir's banner, engaging in honourable battle with those who pledge to their rival, all while striving to complete as many deeds as possible throughout Eriador.
 
