'Return that bag of turtles to Sig Mandrake at his shop in Bree and see if he has heard any more news of my nephew.''Bring that bag of turtles to Sig Mandrake at his shop in the south-western section of Bree, ${PLAYER}. I'm terrified that they might escape again!

'And be sure to ask him if he's seen my nephew Benegar anywhere about.''Ah, you have brought another bag of turtles. Good, good. This is the one Benegar Longbottom set aside for me, is it? I would say I almost have enough tiny turtles to begin making the turtle soup. Not just yet, but very soon, I would say.

'I did see the boy not long ago. He said he found a place where he's sure to catch twice the turtles anyone else has caught and ran off to prove it. I told him there were no turtles to find at the place he described, as I have only ever seen frogs there, but he insisted.

'If you are looking for him, you can see for yourself, I suppose. He was going to an island in the middle of one of the Everclear Lakes, north-west of Bree.''The boy said he was going to look for turtles on an island in the middle of the Everclear Lakes, north-west of Bree. I told him you only ever see frogs on that island, but he didn't believe me and said he would bring back twice the turtles of any single person. I don't believe him, but he certainly seemed confident.''Oh dear... it seems that I was mistaken. There are no turtles here. There is something worse!'

