'The two chieftains will be fairly close together, somewhere in the Goblinhole Ruins, so that each of them can keep an eye on the other. Be careful... those chieftains will be the strongest of the lot!''We might be close to dealing the goblins a decisive blow, ${PLAYER}. The only thing keeping them from fighting amongst themselves are their loyalty to the two chieftains that are rumoured to lead them: Gurzstâz and Gurzrum.

