Atherol is waiting to speak with you about your expedition to Farmer Maggot's farm.'Hello, friend ${PLAYER}. You have become a burglar of no small skill, but you and I both know that is not enough. An adequate burglar is simply not good enough if the task calls for an accomplished burglar, after all!

'It might not be too late. I have heard of just such an accomplished burglar, and it could be that he can give you the advice you need to become more than just adequate!

'Then again, he might not. But there's no harm in trying! Look for Atherol Took at Adso's Camp on the Great East Road, between Bree and Buckland. If you have it in you to become a truly accomplished burglar, Atherol Took might be able to tease it out of you!''Hello, friend ${PLAYER}. You have become a burglar of no small skill, but you and I both know that is not enough. An adequate burglar is simply not good enough if the task calls for an accomplished burglar, after all!

