Hazel Kenton will want to know that you have successfully restored Hilton Harper's will to defend the Bree-fields from those who threaten the peace.'You have grown both in strength and confidence, ${PLAYER}, but you have not yet reached your potential. You must learn to inspire your friends even when all hope seems lost, for you are a beacon against the darkness.

