'She often stands watch at the West-gate of Bree-town, even when her own duty has ended. Seek her out and learn from her, ${PLAYER} -- we of Bree-land need more captains like Captain Kenton.''You have grown both in strength and confidence, ${PLAYER}, but you have not yet reached your potential. You must learn to inspire your friends even when all hope seems lost, for you are a beacon against the darkness.

