'I recommend that you explore the hamlet of Tighfield, checking out our most notable sites: the village centre, Tighfield Farm, and the Elbow's Bend, the finest tavern in all of Yondershire!

'When you're done, you should journey to the village of Gamwich. Gytha Beatbrush is a game hunter there and a fearsome Bounder as well. You should meet her!''You are looking for Gytha? Why, that's me! I am a member of the Yonder-watch, but game hunting is my first love, and it is something at which I excel!

