'You have no time to lose! Cross to the other side of the ship and leave through that cave there!'Patrons of The Forsaken Inn have been complaining about terrible wailing noises coming from the floors and walls of the cellar. The proprietor of the inn has requested that you wait around until midnight when the complaints of the noises usually begin.You will need to be full of ale if you are to pass the time.Talk to Anlaf about the free ale'Ah, good... you look to be the adventurous sort! I have a problem that I was hoping you might assist me with. It seems that some of the patrons have been complaining of terrible wailing noises coming from the walls and floor in the cellar. I'm sure it's nothing, but business hasn't been great lately what with the rumours that the inn is haunted!

