led barrows have been found to be inhabited by hateful Barrow-spirits. Those who fight to defeat these spirits and return them to the final rest they have somehow escaped will be recognized by the grateful folk of Bree-land.Defeat Barrow-spirits in the barrowsTake respite, however brief, and you can fight on.Strike with Safe-guardTake respite, however brief, and you can fight on.Strike with Safe-guardRhiangar Nevit seeks to get back into the good graces of her father, the Mayor of Herne. To do so, she needs some help gathering ingredients for his favourite meal.Rhiangar Nevit has asked you gather supplies for her family's favourite stew. Ruddy-coat goats can be found west of Herne, and the rest of the ingredients can be collected from the local townsfolk, many of whom can be found at Crossway House, Herne's inn.

You should gather ingredients for Rhiangar.Collect stewing herbs from TangwenCollect potatoesCollect a loaf of breadCollect a bottle of Crossway House's finestCollect ruddy-coat goat meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Rhiangar is in the Mayor's house, in Herne.

You should being the ingredients for dinner to Rhiangar.'You rescued my fool of a father, and for that, I cannot thank you enough. Much as we may bicker, he is still family and I love him.

'Pay no heed to his harshness – he has always been like that. The accident only made it worse. When I left, he could still walk, however. I came back as soon as I received word that his condition had worsened.

'Sadly, he won’t speak to me right now, but I know how to warm his heart. I am going to make his favourite stew. With your help, that is. I am loath to leave his side now that I am home, but you could get the things I need! There would be some coin in it for you, if you help.

'We will need bread from the baker Wynfor, potatoes from Powel Bruthlys, stewing herbs from Tangwen, and a bottle of Crossway House's finest red. We're making goat stew the way mother used to do - a Nevit family favourite and secret recipe. Which means we'll need goat meat as well - only the meat from father's favourite goats will do! You will know them by their ruddy-coloured coat. There's a herd of them west of town that you can cull from.''Oh yes, Rhiangar paid me for this loaf already. You can go ahead and take one from the stack here.''A bottle for our Mayor and his daughter? Very well. You'll find it in the back, help yourself to one, but no more than that!''I came up from Swanfleet to sell my potatoes and have been stuck here now for days! I hope someone does something about how dangerous things have gotten of late.''Hello there! You are here for the herbs Rhiangar ordered? I have them right here. I hope our dear mayor is not giving her too much trouble.''You have done it! Now to fill this cottage with his favourite smells. Will you join us for dinner? It’s the least I can do to repay you.'Determined to restore proper service to Yondershire, Postman Grubb enlists your aid in sending a message to Postmaster Proudfoot of the Quick Post.Postmaster Proudfoot can be found outside the Quick Post in Michel Delving.

