Intent on recalling mail bound for Yondershire and conducting a test on the route to Nobottle, Postmaster Proudfoot has asked you to travel to Waymeet and talk to Postman Twofoot.Travel to WaymeetPostman Twofoot can be found at Waymeet in the Shire.

