You should return to Agatha Greendale with news of your success.Talk to Agatha Greendale in Bree'In the dark recesses of Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham, and Haudh Nogbenn, there are many fell creatures that haunt the barrow, but three in particular which you should be wary of. The three creatures are Brishzel the barghest, the fell spirit Faegfaer, and Fergandir the gaunt-man.

'If you were to travel with a group of friends to Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham, and Haudh Nogbenn and dispatch any of these creatures, the hunters of Bree would be in your debt.

'You can find the entrances to Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham, and Haudh Nogbenn in the southern Barrow-downs.''Thank you for doing the people of Bree this service.

