'I want you to investigate the ruins for any scrap of writing related to cookery. Check their supplies. Maybe they already gathered what we're looking for without knowing it.

'I will wait here where there are no ruffians.''New research material! You are a fine assistant indeed. Give me a moment to look through what you've brought me.'Orders liberated from the bodies of riders out of Nímbarth can turn the tide of the threat against Cardolan.Saeloril has asked you sneak the forged orders into places where they will be found in Nímbarth.

