Maddoc is inside the Inn at Herne.Return to Maddoc'Life in Herne was never easy, but lately some darkness has passed through the land, stirring up all manner of foul things! There is a wolf pack north of Herne which does not usually trouble the town or those on the road. However, they have of late become vicious, attacking passersby and raiding the town come nightfall.

'If you could thin out the pack, that would help immensely.''Thank you, traveller! I hope this quells their brazenness. Herne needs no further tribulations.'It's up to you to protect the Old Forest, lest it become overrun with wood-trolls and fell spirits.Tom has told you that the sword can be found near Old Man Willow.

