You should tell him what has transpired since you last saw him.Talk to Hob Hayward'Seek you to break the sword? Old Tom won't stop you. But don't you go alone with that old Willow-man still a-singing. His song today is darker now than once it was, dangerous, and mean.

'Hop along, my little friends, let our hobbit show the way. And steer you clear of dangers fell, but if you can't: stay strong, stay safe!''Wood-trolls? Well, that's a first for me; not many hobbits have faced trolls in the first place!

'I should have guessed Tom wouldn't be interested in coming with us, but no matter. We can find Old Man Willow on our own. If you have friends you want to call upon instead, I'll stay behind to watch your backs.

'Once you've figured out what you want to do, we'll be on our way.''It's been a while, hasn't it! Did you discover what was happening in the Old Forest?'

You relay the tale to the Shirriff, who listens attentively with wide eyes.

'Well, I must say, this is beyond me. Evil swords and wood-trolls make for an exciting tale, but I'm glad the forest is calming down. Still, all those foul things came so close to Buckland. We'll keep a sharper eye out from now on.

'The Bounders are in your debt -- and Marigold's!'Gondamon is one of the strongest fortresses of the Longbeards in the Blue Mountains. The Dourhands and their goblin-allies seek to overthrow the stronghold and claim it for themselves.Mathi has been leading the defence of Gondamon for the duration of the siege. It is crucial for you to report in to him and find out where you can help.Report to Mathi, commander of GondamonThe first assault of the final attack has begun. The Enemy must not breach the walls.Push back the first assaultThe second assault of the final attack has begun. The Enemy is attempting to force their way in through a different gate.Push back the second assaultThe third assault of the final attack has begun. They are attempting to come through the last gate.Push back the third assaultThe final assault has begun. Their numbers are waning, but their ferocity increasing. Withstand this storm, defeat their leader, and Gondamon will continue to stand free.Fend off the final assault'This is all I get for reinforcements? I suppose you will have to do. We've defended this keep for as long as we could, but I fear the next push might be our last.

'Head to the walls and let them come to you. Perhaps there is hope yet that Gondamon will still stand free at the end of this day.''Gondamon stands a free city, a damaged and beaten city, but a free one. We held out for as long as we had strength, I fear if you hadn't come when you did, the city would have fallen. The Longbeards owe you a great debt.'Lotho's plans to change the Bounds in Yondershire must be stopped.Fredegar Bolger has been making and storing stink-bombs around Nobottle, should the need arise.

