The Orc who stole Hal's bow is at Tharbad, in Cardolan.Retrieve Hal's stolen bowYou should bring the stolen bow back to Hal Wolfscomb.

Hal is at camp in northern Tharbad in Cardolan.'Hello there. My name is Hal Wolfscomb, and I travelled down from Bree with this company as their hunter. It’s my job to keep us supplied with fresh meat, but when the Orcs attacked they stole my bow. I could make a new one, but this land was stripped of its trees long ago, and besides it would take far too long. I heard you are going into the ruins. When you do, will you look for my bow?''My bow! You found it! Now I can get back to my job of feeding these fine folk.'Defeat many wretched falconers in Skirmishes.

