'Thank you.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth desires tough sword sheaths from the intelligent creatures making the Lone-lands their home.You accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire tough sword sheaths from the intelligent creatures in the Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.Wanted: Tough sword sheaths from the intelligent creatures of the Lone-lands. Bring the sheaths to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth.Wanted: Tough sword sheaths from the intelligent creatures of the Lone-lands.'These will be used to show that there is hope, even in these dark times.

'Thank you.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Thaliollang in the Elf-ruin of Meluinen at Lin Giliath requires the return of broken wood spears.You are on a task to collect broken wood spears from Orcs plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.Needed: Broken wood spears from the Orcs plaguing Meluinen. Deliver the items to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath.Needed: Broken wood spears from the Orcs plaguing Meluinen.'It is good to see that you are willing to stand against the Orcs. We are grateful for your assistance.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Thaliollang in the Elf-ruin of Meluinen at Lin Giliath requires the return of large filth.You are on a task to collect large filth from the insects and spiders plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.Needed: Large filth from the insects and spiders plaguing Meluinen. Deliver the items to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath.Needed: Large filth from the insects and spiders plaguing Meluinen.'I will begin studying this immediately. Thank you for your efforts.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Thaliollang in the Elf-ruin of Meluinen at Lin Giliath requires the return of sharp claws.You are on a task to collect sharp claws from the massive toads plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.Needed: Sharp claws from the massive toads plaguing Meluinen. Deliver the items to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath.Needed: Sharp claws from the massive toads plaguing Meluinen.'The toads are not normal and needed to be purged. Thank you for your efforts.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Naerandir has told you he knows the story of Othrongroth, the Great Barrow, but that the reality of the place as it exists now must be masked beneath the splendour of legend, lest cautious fear grows into terror.Sambrog is at the furthest end of the Great Barrow, in the deepest halls.

