Calargyl is near Amon Firn, in eastern Cardolan.Return to Calargyl'The activity I have seen at Amon Firn troubles me. The dead have been roused and wander the Deadmount, and strange Men are skulking around the area as well. The two can often be seen fighting each other, and I fear their quarrel will spill over and trouble the rest of the land.

'It seems that Maeriel trusts you. Well then - put the spirits back to rest, ${PLAYER}, and do what you can to remove the... Men from that place as well.''Well done. May the dead rest more easily at that sorrowful place.'Somewhere within Nan Wathren lies an enemy potion-brewer, deadly in his craft.The Tarkrîp defiler is in Nan Wathren in the southern North Downs.

