You have safely brought the Hare back to Radagast. You should speak to Radagast to see what else he might ask of you.'Ah! Fortuitous timing, for you are just the Lore-master I need, ${PLAYER}. Apparently more of my little friends are in danger.

'You have an affinity for animals yourself, do you not? If you do them a good turn, they will feel incredible loyalty to you, and you will be able to call on animal-friends much as I do, to come and sit with you when you are feeling lonely.

'There is a hare in great danger, hiding in his burrow south-west of here. Please hurry and bring him back to me! Fellowship with the gentler creatures is an important step on your journey to becoming a master of lore.''Well done, young friend! You are well on your way, but we have more friends in need of rescuing.'Radagast has asked for your help in saving one last creature from the swamps of Harloeg: a sparrow whose nest is surrounded by Bog-wardens.The sparrow's nest can be found amongst the ruins in the south-west of Harloeg, far to the south of Agamaur.

