'A party of Elves travelled into the caves of some Stone-trolls not far from here and discovered a party of Hillmen of the Trév Duvárdain seeking to cause trouble. A great battle was joined while the Stone-trolls were elsewhere, but the Elves of my company are exhausted and in no shape to continue the fight.

'If you are as skilled a Warden as rumour would have it, I ask that you travel with me to these caves and defend my Elves until they are ready to continue the fight.''The rumours were true, ${PLAYER}: you are certainly a highly-skilled Warden and deserve every measure of the reputation you are earning!

'I would place the safety and well-being of my friends in your care at a moment's notice, if there was such a need.

'I thank you again, ${PLAYER}.''Are you prepared, Warden ${PLAYER}? This task may not be an easy one, for the caves are dangerous, and the Stone-trolls may return at any moment.'

