You have been told that Isferon has a puzzle that he cannot solve. As Isferon is a most learned Lore-master, this puzzle must be difficult indeed.Isferon gave you the first of Berenin's riddles.

Isferon hopes that you can discover the solution of Berenin's riddle and collect the first of three keys from the location that is described.Solve Berenin's first riddle and collect a key from the correct locationIsferon is at the refuge of Duillond in Ered Luin.

Now that you have solved the first of three riddles given him by his friend Berenin, you should return the key you found to Isferon at Duillond.Isferon gave you the second of Berenin's riddles.

Isferon hopes that you can discover the solution of Berenin's riddle and collect the second of three keys from the location that is described.Solve Berenin's second riddle and collect a key from the correct locationIsferon is at the refuge of Duillond in Ered Luin.

Now that you have solved the second of three riddles given him by his friend Berenin, you should return the key you found to Isferon at Duillond.Isferon gave you the third of Berenin's riddles.

Isferon hopes that you can discover the solution of Berenin's riddle and collect the last of the three keys from the location that is described.Solve Berenin's third riddle and collect a key from the correct locationIsferon is at the refuge of Duillond in Ered Luin.

Now that you have solved the last of three riddles given him by his friend Berenin, you should return the key you found to Isferon at Duillond.Isferon is at the refuge of Duillond in Ered Luin.

You have become a part of Isferon's quest to discover his friend Berenin's legacy by solving the riddles he left, and now Isferon waits to travel with you to the cave where he stored Berenin's locked boxes.Talk to Isferon and travel with him to the caveIsferon is at Duillond, the refuge in Ered Luin.

You discovered Berenin's legacy -- a desire that he not be forgotten by his friend and to engage in one last game of riddles -- and helped Isferon not lose sight of his friend's memory. Isferon is waiting to speak with you again.'Isferon at the refuge of Duillond in Ered Luin has come into possession of a puzzle that he hopes a true Lore-master will be able to solve. He has kept the details to himself, but if you were to seek him out, I am sure the puzzle would be of interest to you.

