ck of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The townsfolk in Oatbarton await the delivery of jellied goo to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town.You have been tasked with collecting and delivering jellied goo from the insects and spiders north of Oatbarton. You are to deliver the items to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town of Oatbarton.Wanted: Jellied goo from the insects and spiders north of Oatbarton. You can make the delivery to Ponto Oats at Oatbarton centre.Wanted: Jellied goo from the insects and spiders north of Oatbarton.'I am certain that we will be able to find a use for these.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The townsfolk in Oatbarton await the delivery of jellied goo to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town.You have been tasked with collecting and delivering jellied goo from the insects and spiders surrounding Oatbarton. You are to deliver the items to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town of Oatbarton.Wanted: Jellied goo from the insects and spiders surrounding Oatbarton. You can make the delivery to Ponto Oats at Oatbarton centre.Wanted: Jellied goo from the insects and spiders surrounding Oatbarton.'We will find a way to use these. Thank you.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The townsfolk in Oatbarton await the delivery of leathery fur to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town.You have been tasked with collecting and delivering leathery fur from beasts surrounding Oatbarton. You are to deliver the items to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town of Oatbarton.Wanted: Leathery fur from beasts surrounding Oatbarton. You can make the delivery to Ponto Oats at Oatbarton centre.Wanted: Leathery fur from beasts surrounding Oatbarton.'Oh I am certain that we will find a use for these. Thank you.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such