'Our brethren, long sleeping in the earth, are now taken from their slumber by fell spirits out of the past, spirits called by their master to march by his side in the fortress of Garth Agarwen.

'Now they stir where once they slumbered. West, once our home, now in ruins, the Dead walk anew. Our time is short to strike back against the past, but perhaps thou art willing to aid us?''The Dead walk again in the ruins to the west. Seek them there and end them.''We draw closer now to release. We will know that it is by the hands of others that our opportunity for freedom was given.

