'If you were to defeat a number of them, it would take time before any would notice and be able to come and support. This would give us the opening we need to strike.''If we strike quickly, the island will be mostly undefended for a short window of time.''Once all the pieces are in place, we will be able to signal the Rangers to strike. This was an important accomplishment.'Stone-trolls have moved down from the Misty Mountains into the Bruinen Gorges of the Trollshaws.There are Stone-trolls settled at the ruins of Ost Thondol in the Bruinen Gorges of the Trollshaws.

