The dwarves of the Misty Mountains have requested a collection of broken halberds.Wanted: Broken halberds from the Men and goblins throughout the Bruinen Source.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The dwarves of the Misty Mountains have requested a collection of sleek skin.Collection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains.

