Hunt the great bears of the Misty Mountains and collect their hides.Glóin is rumoured to be in need of bear hides to deliver to Elrond in Rivendell as a token of his appreciation.

Collect bear hides in the Misty Mountains and bring them to Glóin in his camp.'Word travels quickly. These are fine hides, fine hides indeed. You have proven a worthy hunter of beasts, ${PLAYER}. I hope this gift will please the Elves.'With each blow you improve and become more dangerous to your foes.Use Critical Hit Chain opening skillsPractice opening your opponent's guard and learn how to gain further advantage from it.Strike with Force OpeningI grieve to see Ost Elendil in the hands of the Enemy, ${PLAYER}. The great palace of the kings should lie untainted by the forces of evil, not brought low by the machinations of Angmar and its regent!

