'Listen well, for I will tell you where now it lies!''You have done well to defeat Nornagol, ${PLAYER}! I have taken the Silithar and will deliver it to Calenglad. Return now to him with the tale of your adventure!

'I will show you the way by hidden paths back to the surface.''Let us leave this place, ${PLAYER}. The Silithar must come safely to the surface, and I would speak with Calenglad before I return to my home.'Legolas has led the way deep into the Gladdalf, a remote corner of the Trollshaws, on the trail of the Wood-trolls.Legolas is following a mysterious trail into the Gladdalf.

