You have defeated a man who was masquerading as a ghost, and found a bag with a tin of white paint. Continue searching the rocky outcrop for clues as to why he was trying to scare people away from this area.Search the rocky outcropThe outcrop is in the south-western Angle.

You have defeated a Man who was masquerading as a ghost. Search the area of the rocky outcrop he was lurking around for clues as to why he was trying to scare people away from this area.Continue searching for cluesThe path is in the south-western Angle.

