You should talk to Aran Greenwith.Talk to Aran Greenwith at Trestlebridge'${PLAYER}, there seems to be something wrong at the Trestlebridge gate leading towards the Wildwood. The guards are at a loss for words. Come, let us approach the Trestlebridge gate ourselves and find out what situation transpires.''I am surprised that Gothtal was so easily bested. Now we know he was only an intermediary for this Sharkey character, who seems to have interests in much of Bree-land and the surrounding regions. Sharkey can not be merely an Orc, with all the mischief attached to that name. No matter, these are not troubles for the Woodcutter's Brotherhood to dwell upon. We should continue to focus on Trestlebridge.

'Another building has been restored in town, ${PLAYER}. Would you like to inspect the craftmanship?''In the time since you have joined the Woodcutter's Brotherhood, we have accomplished much together. Trestlebridge is greatly restored, the Wildwood is safer, and the spirits of the townsfolk have been lifted. The Brotherhood has you to thank as a valued member both among our rank and of our community. I thank you, we all thank you, for your efforts here. You have made Trestlebridge the beacon it was meant to be.''This Gothtal has gone too far. He taunts us while we do nothing and he plots attacks. No more! I had given a task to woodcutters in the town's service to report any sightings of Gothtal directly to the Woodcutter's Brotherhood. I have received a very recent report that the Orc has returned to Cotfast. I say we march to Cotfast and confront Gothtal. His days of taunting Trestlebridge are over!''There are a number of foes who reside in Cotfast. We should make quick work of them and destroy anything we find that connects Gothtal to this village. The Orc is no doubt influencing those in the Wildwood with gold and other riches.

'Once the town is clear, then we shall defeat Gothtal. For Trestlebridge!''It is done. Gothtal's threat to the Wildwood and Trestlebridge is no more. Come, let us return to town.'Someone has posted a task to collect copper ore in the Wildwood.Copper ore can be found in the Wildwood.

