You should enter Writhenset, defeat the mining leaders, and repair support beams.Defeat the Writhenset foremanDefeat the Writhenset overseerRepair support beams in Writhenset (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})The cave-in seems to have come near the West-delf entrance in Writhenset.

You should find the source of the cave-in.Find the source of the cave-inThe cave-in seems to have come near the West-delf entrance in Writhenset.

You should find the source of the cave-in.Find the source of the cave-inRubble can be found in Writhenset.

