'I need you to head into the area of Tâl Bruinen and scout out the positions that might be used by the Enemy or their allies.''So, the Gauredain have appeared in Tâl Bruinen, as well? The Elves will not be pleased when they learn of this, if they have not already.

'They would never have moved so far afield save at the prodding of the Enemy -- but what their part is in the greater scheme, I cannot yet say.'An effort to harvest lumber from the Wildwood is on hold until the League's axes are properly sharp.Whetstones can be found in the Wildwood.

