'The Wildwood has grown far too wild. Plants and trees who should not be in this area are making the growing hard for those who should, hoom. Clear away bittercreep, stenchwort, and wilderyew saplings, and I shall think about letting the townsfolk through.''Hoom, hum. You managed to remove only the plants and trees I indicated? You seem to have a good eye, Little One. I will teach your people what they may remove without depleting the forest.'After escaping from the wicked waggon snatcher, Stomper the Pony has fled, but he may be charging into even greater danger!Stomper the pony has fled into the western Wildwood.

