You should talk to Minda Heathertoes.Talk to Minda Heathertoes'Oh happy day! You found my supplies. Oh dear, but where is poor Stomper? Do you see any sign of him? Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear!''Poor Stomper! He must be so scared! Please, find him!''Those hoof-prints are from Stomper’s big feet to be sure! But huge paw-prints? Oh dear, oh dear! I fear that poor Stomper is about to be Warg food! Please, ${PLAYER}, we must find him!''Stomper! You did it, ${PLAYER}!

'Oh, but my waggon! My beautiful waggon! Completely ruined! Well, I suppose I must be grateful for what I yet have. Thank you, ${PLAYER}! Come, let us leave this place, lest more brigands or Wargs come seeking their friends. I heard there is a pond nearby, and Stomper looks like he could use a drink. I shall meet you there!''Thank you for meeting me here, friend. I know I have asked much of you, but you were the only one who would help me! I am so very grateful.

'I imagine you are probably wondering what a hobbit such as myself is doing so far from home. I have the honour of being apprenticed to the master chef, Lyn Woodsorrel. She sent me forth into the Wildwood to collect ingredients for the first ever Feast of the Wildwood.

'But, alas! You know how that went. I am so grateful for all the help you've given me, and am loath to ask for more... but ask I shall! I desperately need your help gathering ingredients, or the feast will be ruined! I will be ruined!'The Woodcutter's Brotherhood has learned of a fiendish plot involving the Trestlespan.Supervisor Beecher can be found at the Trestlespan.

You should talk Supervisor Beecher.Talk to Supervisor BeecherBlack powder bombs can be found on the Trestlespan.

You should remove the unlit black powder bombs as soon as you are able.Find black powder bombs on the Trestlespan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Norwarden can be found in the Wildwood.

You should plant some of the black powder bombs that you collected at Norwarden.Norwarden can be found in the Wildwood.

You should grab a torch and light the black powder bombs that you planted.Pick up a nearby torch to light black powder bombsMarl's Crossing can be found in the Wildwood.

