You should defeat any hardened tomb-robbers that you find in the Wildwood.Defeat hardened tomb-robbers in the Wildwood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})The tomb-robbers' camp-site can be found in the Wildwood.

You should find the tomb-robbers' camp-site.Find the tomb-robbers' camp-site in the WildwoodThe tomb-robbers' camp-site can be found in the Wildwood.

