Dawn Stockard is waiting for you to return with the last set of components she needs.'I can fashion you a piece of equipment that will do justice to the great deeds you have performed, ${PLAYER}, but I must warn you that it will not be easily finished.

'I must ask you to put yourself in great peril to obtain the materials I need. First you should bring me the tough carapaces of the Nerbyg which skitter among the pools of Malenhad in Angmar. I will also require the spiked helmet of the Dourhand captain Hogni Cleave-shank, who at last report was commanding the Dourhands at the fortress of Gabilazan in the Misty Mountains.

'Bring these items to me, and I will begin my work.''You can find Nerbyg in the Eastern Malenhad in Angmar, and Hogni Cleave-shank at Gabilazan in the Misty Mountains.''I am glad to see you return safely out of the wild, ${PLAYER}, and will make use of these components as I fashion your equipment.

'The next items I will need are corroded Neekerbreeker-horns from the Nerbyg of the Eastern Malenhad in Angmar and grisly bat-talons which can be found on the bats of Angmar and other terrible places.''You may harvest the horns from the Nerbyg of Malenhad in Angmar. The bat-talons I need can be obtained from bats in Angmar and other dangerous places.''I thank you for these components, ${PLAYER}, for they will be of much help to me in fashioning your equipment.

'Two components remain, and I must tell you truthfully: this will be your greatest challenge. You must collect the putrid slime of Helchgam, the terror that dwells beneath Carn Dûm in Angmar. I also need a Badge of Command from the uruk Lagmâs in Urugarth.

'When you have acquired these items, bring them here to me.''Helchgam dwells in the foetid sewers beneath Carn Dûm, and Lagmâs champions the uruks of Urugarth, both in Angmar.''I greet you in victory, ${PLAYER}, and thank you for these final components!

'See the equipment I can fashion for you from these things you have brought? Wear it when we drive back the shadow and bring peace to the Free Peoples!'Sterling Proudfoot has agreed to help you fashion a piece of equipment that properly reflects your skill as a burglar.Snow-beasts can be found in the north-western corner of the Misty Mountains near the Bruinen Source. Driftclaw can be found in the Misty Mountains, in the land of the giants, in the south-eastern corner.

