Sterling Proudfoot asked you to bring him a goblin-badge of Rank and an Insignia of Battle.Collect goblin-badge of rankCollect Insignia of BattleSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of Bree and east of the Brandywine River.

You should bring the last set of components to Sterling Proudfoot.'${PLAYER}, you're in need of some equipment that says "Look at me! I'm a burglar!" Come to think of it, that might be a little counter-productive in our line of work. No matter! You deserve some nice equipment, and I'm going to make you some! You'll have to fetch the components I'll need, but that should be no problem for a skilled burglar such as yourself, right?

'The lineage of an item holds great power, so keep that in mind as I set before you a series of difficult tasks. In the Misty Mountains, snarling snow-beasts roam. Gather some of their fur... I've heard they can be found near the source of the river Loudwater, but I don't know if that's true. Also, there is a great white bear which dwells in the land of the giants of the Misty Mountains... bring me his fur as well.

'When you have gathered these things, return to me for more instruction.''Both the snow-beasts and Driftclaw dwell in the Misty Mountains; the snow-beasts near the Bruinen Source and Driftclaw in the land of the giants.''Excellent! These will do nicely!

'Meanwhile, I need another set of materials! Drakes in Angmar and other dangerous places have extraordinarily hard scales which would do nicely for the task at hand. Also, certain cave-claws have glossy hides which would be desirable. Only drakes and cave-claws in particularly dangerous places, like Angmar and Moria, will have the necessary components.

'When you have gathered these things, return to me.''The drakes and cave-claws you need to hunt can only be found in Angmar and other dangerous places.''Very well-done, ${PLAYER}! These will be just the thing to give the equipment I'm making for you that extra something that it needs if it will be truly special!

'I only need a few more things. I'm sorry to say that you'll probably find them somewhere within Urugarth, and that sounds like a dreadful place. Nothing to worry about for such a skilled burglar, though, am I right?

'I need a goblin-badge of rank from the goblin Akrúr who guards the path to the great drake Lhugrien. I also need an Insignia of Battle from the uruk-champions Sorkrank and Burzfîl.''You should find Akrúr, Sorkrank, and Burzfîl all near or within Urugarth.''A truly commendable job, ${PLAYER}! Was Urugarth as terrible a place as I have heard? No, do not tell me! I'd like to still be able to sleep at night!

'Let me just make use of these last few components, and... that should do it.

'Take this equipment, ${PLAYER}, and I hope that it will serve you well! We burglars need to stick together!'Fenton Marshley has agreed to help you fashion a piece of equipment worthy of your great skill as a hunter.Zorrgolug prowls in Fasach-falroid in Angmar. Tarkrîp goblins dwell among the Orc-camps of Malenhad in Angmar.

Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him the matted hide of the Warg Zorrgolug and brimstone-tinged Tarkrîp helmets.Collect Zorrgolug's matted hideCollect brimstone-tinged Tarkrîp-helmets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Fenton Marshley is at the Hunting Lodge east of Archet and north of Bree, in Bree-land.

