You have collected the second set of components Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him.Mormoz and Azgoth may be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Sorkrank and Burzfîl serve at Urugarth.

Fenton asked you to bring him a Rune of Winged Dominance and an Insignia of Battle.Collect Rune of Winged DominanceCollect Insignia of BattleFenton Marshley is at the Hunting Lodge east of Archet and north of Bree, in Bree-land.

You have collected the final set of components Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him.'I can make you a piece of equipment worthy of your skill as a hunter, ${PLAYER}, but with this offer I give to you a warning: the tale of this piece will be hard-fought and purchased with great toil.

'I will need time between each stage of the process, so do not bring me everything at once. I will first need the matted hide of Zorrgolug, a great Warg of Fasach-falroid, and five brimstone-tinged Tarkrîp helmets affected by the great swamp of Malenhad. Begin your hunt with confidence and finish it with triumph!''You may find the Warg Zorrgolug prowling in Fasach-falroid in Angmar. The Tarkrîp goblins may also be found in Angmar, but dwelling among the Orc-camps of Malenhad.''You return in victory, ${PLAYER}! I am pleased to see that you bring with you the hide of Zorrgolug and helmets of the Tarkrîp tinged with brimstone. The tale of your deeds grows ever longer!

'There are more components to seek, ${PLAYER}. Next I will need the glossy hides of cave-claws and the horns of the Neekerbreekers that dwell in Angmar and other such evil places.''As I have told you, you may find both cave-claws and nerbeglir in Angmar and other evil places.''I welcome you once again, ${PLAYER}, for I see that you have returned with the glossy skins and corroded horns I tasked you with obtaining.

'The last set of components remains, and obtaining these will not be easy. Do not despair! I am confident that you can retrieve them, even from the blackest depths of the shadow itself!

'I need now a Rune of Winged Dominance, borne by the merrevail Mormoz and Azgoth at Carn Dûm, and an Insignia of Battle, carried by Sorkrank and Burzfîl at Urugarth.''You may find Mormoz and Azgoth at Carn Dûm, while Sorkrank and Burzfîl serve at Urugarth.''You emerge triumphant from the darkness, ${PLAYER}, and I rejoice to see it!

'I marvel at your hunting prowess, my friend. Wear this small token with pride, for you have earned it with your hard work and your dedication!'Hunward at Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood has agreed to fashion you some jewellery to enhance your brawling potential.Hunward has asked you to bring him Wildwood brigand boots and Frostulf's tankard.

