Hunward asked you to bring him an ashen Gorthorog-horn and a goblin-badge of rank.Collect ashen Gorthorog-hornCollect goblin badge of rankHunward is at Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood.'A true Brawler knows the importance of a strong defence! Value might and vitality, but value too your appearance while you fight, for anything can be turned to your advantage mid-brawl: even the flashing glint of jewellery might distract your foe at an inopportune moment!

'I can fashion you suitable jewellery for this purpose, but I will need a number of materials from you: not only for the crafting, but also to prove that you are deserving of it! It is a tradition among Brawlers, my friend, and I would not wish to break it! It is our foes who will break, after all!

'A Dourhand brigand named Frostulf Splitknuckle fancies himself a Brawler, and he has issued an open challenge to folk in the Wildwood: he claims he will defeat any opponent in single combat, and without spilling a drop of his beer! Find him outside the western gate of Cotfast and answer his challenge. Bring me his tankard and prove you are a worthy Brawler, ${PLAYER}.

'So too will I require the boots of brigands here in the Wildwood. Only the leather of such boots will serve, so bring them to me without complaint.''A Dourhand brigand named Frostulf Splitknuckle fancies himself a Brawler, and he has issued an open challenge to folk in the Wildwood: he claims he will defeat any opponent in single combat, and without spilling a drop of his beer! Find him outside the western gate of Cotfast and answer his challenge. Bring me his tankard and prove you are a worthy Brawler, ${PLAYER}.

'So too will I require the boots of brigands here in the Wildwood.''Nice work, ${PLAYER}! You showed Frostulf a thing or two, I expect! But these next materials will be more difficult to obtain, for you will need to go further afield for them.

'I will need mandibles from spiders such as those found in Angmar and other dangerous places. I will also need bubbling droplets from the brimstone-leeches which creep through the swamp of Malenhad in Angmar.''I will need mandibles from spiders such as those found in Angmar and other dangerous places. I will also need bubbling droplets from the brimstone-leeches which creep through the swamp of Malenhad in Angmar.''You did it! These materials are disgusting, but they are necessary. The droplets will season the leather of the boots you brought me, and the toughened strips will provide excellent defence. But you are not finished yet, and this next task will prove you are a Brawler most worthy!

'I require a horn from the Gorthorog Tarlûg, who resides in Carn Dûm. I also need a badge of rank from the goblins of Urugarth. Prove that you can stand against opponents both large and small, and fear neither!''I now require a horn from the Gorthorog Tarlûg, who resides in Carn Dûm. I also need a badge of rank from the goblins of Urugarth. Prove that you can stand against opponents both large and small, and fear neither!''Most impressive, my brawling friend! You are truly deserving of the fine piece of jewellery I have crafted for you. May it protect you no matter the number or ferocity of the opponents you face!

'Why did I need you to gather such assorted materials? Ah, I am making myself a new pair of boots. Never underestimate a good pair of boots!

