Wáli is waiting for you to return with the last set of components for which he asked.'I can make you a piece of equipment befitting your stature as a guardian, ${PLAYER}, but heed my warning: I will require several components for its making that will take you to dangerous lands and into great danger.

'But you are a guardian! Surely you will not shy away from such a challenge!

'The first items I need you to gather are the ashen hide of the great boar Grimgore in Fasach-larran in Angmar and the snow-encrusted boots of the Dourhands at Gabilazan in the Misty Mountains.''You may find the boar Grimgore in Fasach-larran, and the Dourhands have encamped at Gabilazan in the Misty Mountains.''Drakes and cave-claws of the varieties you seek may be found in Angmar and other such evil places.''Lhugrien and Athpukh may both be found at Urugarth, ${PLAYER}.''These boots fill me with anger, ${PLAYER}, anger that the Dourhands would be so bold as to seize Gabilazan from my kinsmen!

'You have done well to bring these and to bring the ashen hide of Grimgore. No longer will he stride the cliffs of Fasach-larran!

'If you can collect the next set of components as quickly, I will finish my work in no time at all! Next I shall need unyielding drake-scales such as can be found on the drakes of Angmar and other treacherous places. I will also need the gem-crusted nails of the cave-claws found in Angmar and such places.''These scales look to be just the thing, ${PLAYER}, and these nails have just the right sort of gems! The equipment I make for you is sure to be something special, when it has such components on which to draw.

'Two components remain: a flawless scale of Lhugrien and a Warg-keeper's token. If you can retrieve these items, you will truly be counted among the mightiest of guardians. Both can be found in Urugarth; the first from the drake Lhugrien and the second from the goblin Warg-keeper Athpukh.''I marvel at your courage, ${PLAYER}, for none know better than I the ferocity of Lhugrien! I know too the reluctance with which Athpukh would part with his token.

'You are a mighty guardian, ${PLAYER}, and it is an honour to know you. Take this equipment with my regards, from one guardian to another!'Baillindiel has agreed to help you fashion a piece of equipment that will be of use to a renowned minstrel such as you.Snowbeasts can be found in the Misty Mountains. Goblins are encamped with the Tarkrîp Orcs in Malenhad in Angmar.

