Baillindiel is waiting for you to return with the first set of components.Worms can be found in Angmar. Wights can be found in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar.

Baillindiel asked you to bring her clouded worm-eyes and revered wight-remains.Collect clouded worm-eyes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect revered wight-remains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Baillindiel is at the Elf-harbour of Celondim, in Ered Luin.

