Isdi is waiting for you to return with the last set of components.'I can fashion you a piece of equipment that will reflect the depth of your knowledge, ${PLAYER}, and aid you in your further pursuit of wisdom.

'However, I will need you to obtain the components I will need if I am to make this equipment for you. Do not quail from the danger, for you are a learned lore-master and have come through all hazards to reach this point. You are wise enough to survive your coming trials.

'The first items I will need are the matted fur of the great boar Grimgore, who roams Fasach-larran in Angmar, and the emblem of the Corcur tribe of Hillmen encamped near Helegrod in the Misty Mountains.''You may find Grimgore wandering Fasach-larran in Angmar, ${PLAYER}, and the Corcur encamped near Helegrod in the Misty Mountains.''You may find wights in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar, ${PLAYER}, and the brimstone-leeches in Malenhad, also in Angmar.''Helchgam dwells in the pools beneath Carn Dûm, while goblins guard the tower of Urugarth, both in Angmar.''I am glad to see you return, ${PLAYER}, and with the components I sought. These will be of much use to me as I fashion your equipment.

'Now I need some of the remains of the wights who roam Imlad Balchorth in Angmar and some bubblings droplets of slime from the brimstone-leeches of Malenhad, also in Angmar.''I thank you for these items, ${PLAYER}. Are you ready to collect the last set of things I will need?

'I hope that you are, for these will be most difficult to acquire. I believe you to be up to the challenge, but know that it will take you into the very heart of the land of Angmar. You are wise, ${PLAYER}. Now you must be strong as well.

'What I need is the putrid slime of Helchgam, the horror which dwells below Carn Dûm, and the emblems of the goblins which guard the tower of Urugarth.''I marvel at your success, ${PLAYER}, though I should not do so -- I have seen your great deeds and heard of your wisdom, but still I doubted. I am not as wise as I supposed.

'Allow me now to present you with this equipment I have fashioned. May it serve you long and well!'Sterkist has agreed to help you fashion a piece of equipment of which Grimbeorn would approve.Norboglir can be found in the Eastern Malenhad in Angmar. Hogni Cleave-shank can be found at Gabilazan in the Misty Mountains.

