Wáli is waiting for you to return with the final set of components he needs.'I can make you a weapon that befits your tremendous might as a guardian, ${PLAYER}, and I am happy to do so! As with all things, however, I must tell you that something of such worth will require a great deal of toil and hardship. It -- and you -- will be stronger for it!

'I will first need the cruel bludgeon of the snow-troll Shataz and brimstone-tinged spears of the Tarkrîp goblins. Shataz dwells now on the outskirts of the land of the giants in the Misty Mountains. The Tarkrîp you seek are encamped among the Orc-camps of Malenhad in Angmar.''You may find the Snow-troll Shataz near the giant-lands in the Misty Mountains. The Tarkrîp goblins serve at the Orc-camps in Malenhad.''${PLAYER}, you may find spiders, Wargs, and bats in Angmar and other such terrible places.''If you can defeat Barashal and retrieve from him his crimson horn, you and I will both benefit, ${PLAYER}. And I would appreciate it if you were to say this to Barashal when he falls: "Thus are the kinsmen of Wáli avenged!"

'Somewhere within Urugarth, uruk commander Gruglok holds vigil over his arena. If you can take from him a Sigil of War, the weapon I fashion for you will be made the stronger.''You have done well to defeat Shataz, ${PLAYER}, and I am pleased that his tale is at last ended, for he brought much grief to my kin in his day.

'I thank you for these spears, as well. Note the poor craftsmanship...it is a wonder to me that weapons of goblin-make don't just fall apart when wielded! I will destroy these weapons and sprinkle the powder over the weapon I make for you to remind it of the fragility of its foes.

'I am ready for the next set of components. Now set forth and bring me grisly bat-talons, hooked Warg-claws, and spider-mandibles from such creatures as dwell in Angmar and other similarly terrible places.''Very well-done, ${PLAYER}, and with such speed, as well! Your weapon will become a great deal stronger when the memory of these foes become a part of it.

'I need only one more set of components, and these will be most difficult to obtain. Barashal the Gorthorog and Gruglok of Urugarth are fearsome opponents. From Barashal, collect a crimson Gorthorog-horn. You may find him at Carn Dûm. You may gain from Gruglok at Urugarth a Sigil of War.''I greet you in victory, ${PLAYER}, and my heart is more glad than it has ever been of late, to know that Barashal is dead! Sleep well, my kinsmen -- you are avenged.

'It is an honour and a privilege to know you, ${PLAYER}, for you are truly mighty among guardians.

'I give to you this weapon with the hope that you will use it well and for the betterment of all the Free Peoples of Middle-earth.'Gwesgylliel has agreed to help you fashion a weapon worthy of your reputation as a champion of the Free Peoples.Ongbúrz Orcs may be found in Fasach-falroid in Angmar. Tramug stalks the swamps of Malenhad in Angmar.

