Gwesgylliel is waiting for you to return with the last set of components she needs.'I can make you a weapon that you will bear with pride, ${PLAYER}, for those that behold it will know you to be a mighty champion. Mightier still are deeds done with honour, and you have performed many!

'But proceed with caution, ${PLAYER}. The components I will need for this weapon will not be easy to come by.

'First, I need you to gather swords from the Ongbúrz Orcs of Fasach-falroid in Angmar, then travel east to Malenhad and obtain the hand-axe of the goblin Tramug.''You may find the Ongbúrz encamped in Fasach-Falroid in Angmar. In the eastern reaches of Angmar, in Malenhad, you may find Tramug.''You may find Wargs in places like Angmar, Eregion, and the Misty Mountains. The barghests I seek may be found in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar.''The fortress-city of Urugarth is a place of evil, ${PLAYER}, but it also holds the remaining components I need for your weapon.''I am pleased to see you have returned, ${PLAYER}, and that you bring with you some of the swords of the Ongbúrz. They will no longer add notches to these for each of our friends they slay.

'I rejoice too that you have deprived Tramug of his hand-axe! His tale ends with you, it seems!

'Go now and bring me claws from the Wargs who stalk through eastern Angmar and other dangerous places, like Eregion and the Misty Mountains. I also need the barbed barghest-tails from those creatures which haunt Imlad Balchorth.''I am glad to see you again, ${PLAYER}. These components will greatly improve the weapon I am making for you.

'Seek out the vile drake Lhugrien and obtain from her a flawless scale. Also acquire for me a Sigil of War from the evil Gruglok. Both may be found at Urugarth.''You return victorious, ${PLAYER}! I bow to your skill, for I know Lhugrien and Gruglok to be fearsome opponents!

