Sterling Proudfoot is waiting for you to return with the last set of components.'If you're at all like me, ${PLAYER}, you'll be wanting a weapon that's just right for those who've chosen to follow that noblest of professions by becoming burglars. And not just any burglar, but a skilled one! Not just any weapon will do, and I can make just such a one for you!

'It won't be easy, though. I'll be needing a number of things from hard-to-reach places. What am I saying? You're a fine burglar! I'm sure you'll manage!

'The first things I'll need are fangs from the brimstone-leeches of eastern Angmar and the claw of the Warg Narglup, who can also be found in Angmar, though to the west near Tór Gailvin.''Brimstone-leeches and the Warg Narglup can be found in Angmar; the leeches to the east and Narglup to the west.''Perfect, perfect! These will do nicely!

'I will get to work making use of these in the construction of your weapon, but you'll need to get back out there and look for the second set of things I need!

'I need you to collect eyes from the hateful worms of places like Forochel, the Misty Mountains, and Eregion. I also need beaks from the dread turtles of Malenhad in eastern Angmar.''The worms you need to hunt can be found in places like Forochel, the Misty Mountains, and Eregion.''Splendid job, ${PLAYER}! I knew you were a top-notch burglar!

'There's one last set of things I'll need. Be warned that you'll need to search some pretty unpleasant places, but that's the job, I guess, isn't it?

'I need a Warg-keeper's token from the goblin Athpukh who guards the Warg-pens of Urugarth in Angmar. I also need the cruel talon of the morroval-queen Azgoth who dwells in the evil city of Carn Dûm in Angmar.''Athpukh can be found in Urugarth, and Azgoth can be found at Carn Dûm, both in Angmar.''Another job well-done, ${PLAYER}! Let me incorporate these items, and...ouch! This talon is sharp -- I hope I never stumble across a morroval, if this talon is any indication!

'I give you this weapon, Burglar ${PLAYER}. Use it well!

'That wasn't so very difficult, was it?'Dawn Stockard has agreed to help you fashion a weapon worthy of your status as a great captain.Snowreap goblins can be found in the Misty Mountains. Fakhthal leads the Orcs of Fasach-falroid in Angmar.

