.</rgb>Complete the Great Barrow - Thadúr instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Great Barrow - Thadúr instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Great Barrow - The Maze instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Great Barrow - The Maze instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Halls of Night instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Halls of Night instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Helegrod - Dragon Wing instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Helegrod - Dragon Wing instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Helegrod - Drake Wing instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Helegrod - Drake Wing instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Helegrod - Giant Wing instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Helegrod - Giant Wing instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Helegrod - Spider Wing instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Helegrod - Spider Wing instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete the Inn of the Forsaken instance.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete the Inn of the Forsaken instance</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Complete Legendary Angmar: The Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu quest multiple times for an additional reward.<rgb=#00e4ff>Complete Legendary Angmar: The Rift</rgb> (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})This quest is for Legendary Servers.<rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Defeat Thaurlach.<rgb=#00e4ff>Defeat Thaurlach</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This quest is for Legendary Servers.</rgb>Defeat Lagmâs.<rgb=#00e4ff>Defeat Lagmâs</rgb>An award for achieving level 50 has been mailed to you by an unknown benefactor.Achieve level 50Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book I of the Mines of Moria Epic quest series.'Would you look at this. I'm helping you complete Mines of Moria content now too! I'm a multi- purpose cat, I am. Oh, and look at this, I have a bunch of Item Advancement stuff to give you. That's so cool.

'Alrighty, let's do this, eh?''Book I of the Mines of Moria coming right up! Enjoy!'Carn Dûm is the evil heart of Angmar, a terrible city protected by gates and hordes of Orc-warriors.Carn Dûm lies to the west of Tármunn Súrsa.

Éa's husband Erscin and his fellow warriors were captured by Orcs and taken to Carn Dûm. She has asked you to enter Carn Dûm and rescue Erscin.Free slaves in Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Éa is at Tármunn Súrsa, east of Carn Dûm.

The slaves of Carn Dûm were set free and may now return to their homes, but you were unable to find Éa's husband, Erscin. You should return to Éa with the news.'${CLASS}, you must help me. My people are gone, spirited away by the Orc-slavers of Carn Dûm.

'These slavers raid our villages and take our best warriors away to toil in their work-camps. Chained and shackled, they are forced to labour for the False King. Those that become injured or fall ill are left to die.

'My husband, Erscin, is among the captured slaves -- if he even lives and breathes. Please hurry! The slaves must be freed. You will find them in Carn Dûm, far to the west.''You must free my people from Carn Dûm.''Thank you for doing this. My people will never forget your bravery. But please, tell me... did you find Erscin? Be he living or dead, I must know what happened to him.'You fought the trolls of Urugarth with great success, but the leader of the Gertheryg remains a threat.Barashal is at Carn Dûm, to the west of Tármunn Súrsa.

Táni was impressed by your efforts to purge the trolls from Urugarth and has sent you on another mission: to defeat Barashal, the leader of the Gertheryg.Táni is at Tármunn Súrsa, to the east of Carn Dûm.

You defeated Barashal, the Lord of the Gertheryg, in battle and should return to Táni with the tidings of your success.'I can see why you were sent all the way up here to help us. You did a commendable job back there against the trolls, but there is more work to do.

'The Gertheryg of Carn Dûm are commanded by a vile fiend called Barashal. You must go there and slay him.

'Barashal won't go down without a fight, so be sure to rest well before you head out west into Carn Dûm.''A great hero is what you are! A few more like you, and we can surely turn the tide against the Enemy!''Go into Carn Dûm and defeat Barashal, the leader of the Gertheryg.'Find lore of the Enemy scattered throughout Barad GúlaranFind lore of the Enemy scattered throughout Barad Gúlaran.Find lore of the Enemy scattered throughout Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.A text found within the halls of Barad Gúlaran.The mysteries of the past lie open to you, but still you seek to uncover more, never resting in your pursuit of knowledge.Isdi is at the ruins of Edhelion, on the slopes above Thorin's Hall, in Ered Luin.

