With the trolls and their leader defeated, it is time to return to Táni.'No doubt you are here at the behest of my cousin. Your help may or may not be needed, but as you seem to have experience in these matters, let me explain the situation.

'Long have my brethren and I suffered the trolls of Angmar, the gertheryg. We must strike a blow against Angmar by defeating these creatures and their master.

'The fortress-city of Urugarth is their stronghold. Cross the narrow bridge, and eventually the path turns south to Urugarth -- or so it is said.''Go into Urugarth and defeat the gertheryg and their leader. Cross the bridge and follow the paths south-west until they turn at last south to Urugarth.''You have done well, but there is more still to do. The leader of the gertheryg must be slain.'Lore found in the library of Rivendell tell that a particularly deadly variety of mushroom grows within the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. This mushroom might be used by the Enemy to create a terrible weapon.Curtamusgan may be found within the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu.

Galasebdir has asked you to bring him a Curtamusgan, so that the scholars at Rivendell might study it and prepare a defence against its poison should Angmar use it as a weapon.Galasebdir is at Iorelen's camp.

You have found a Curtamusgan and should bring it to Galasebdir at once.'Hail and well met, ${PLAYER}. Were you sent here to aid us? Let me tell you of my mission, then perhaps you will know whether you may aid me or not.

'I was sent both to protect Jónsi, who is here to investigate rumours of ancient mines within the Rift, and to seek out a rare and particularly deadly variety of mushroom -- Curtamusgan -- which grows within. The spores of this mushroom might be used by the Enemy to create a terrible weapon.

'If you would enter the Rift and find one of these mushrooms for me, I can have it delivered to Rivendell, so that they may prepare a defence against the poison. Beware, though, the mushrooms may use its spores as a defence against threats to it.''Curtamusgan are very valuable mushrooms, highly desired in Rivendell.''This indeed a Curtamusgan, ${PLAYER}. I will have it delivered to Rivendell by the swiftest means possible.

