'Go and quell some of the tempests and defeat the beasts that stalk the mountain-side. I fear the storms are unnatural, for they seem guided by intent.

'The worst of the storms have been seen to the north-east in the Redhorn Gate.''The worst of the storms have been seen north-east of Echad Dúnann in the Redhorn Gate.''You have returned! I feared that the ferocity of Caradhras might have gotten the best of you, but I can see you are a ${CLASS} of great skill.'Brave adventurers have been summoned to complete missions across Middle-earth.Missions can be completed across Middle-earth.

