You have delivered a crate of supplies to Legrindavor at the court of Tirband and should now return to Quartermaster Badhordam.'There is hope of victory, ${PLAYER}: the Dúnedain have taken the court of Tirband, a square on the highest level of the city, from which the great watch-tower looks out over Lake Nenuial. This is a grave blow to the Angmarim, and we must not lose it!

'But we must keep them supplied, or lose it we shall. I would have you carry a crate of supplies to Legrindavor, the Ranger in charge of maintaining our control of Tirband. Pick up a crate from this stack and carry it to Legrindavor.

'You should bring allies with you, for you will be unable to defend yourself from Angmarim attack while you are carrying the crate of supplies. Return to me once you have delivered the crate to Legrindavor.''Bring a few strong allies with you, ${PLAYER}, because you will not be able to defend yourself from attack while you are carrying the crate. You will find Legrindavor in the court of Tirband on the highest level of the city, from which the great watch-tower looks out over Lake Nenuial.

'Return to me once you have delivered the crate of supplies to Legrindavor.''Thank you for your aid, ${PLAYER}. It is to be hoped that the supplies you delivered to Legrindavor will be used to maintain Dúnedain-control of Tirband for a while yet.'Taking the Morvith BridgeTaking the Morvith BridgeTaking the Morvith BridgeTaking the Morvith BridgeDefeat Angmarim in Carn Dûm.Defeat Angmarim in Carn DûmDefeat Angmarim in Carn Dûm.Defeat Angmarim in Carn DûmMordirith's wrath against the Trév Gállorg has not been deterred. Reinforcements from Carn Dûm and Urugarth are trying to march across Rammas Deluon towards the village of Aughaire.Faelbenn is near Gath Forthnír.

