'Gather your allies... the fighting will be fierce!''Is your fellowship assembled? Are you ready to defend Aughaire?''Thank you for your aid, ${PLAYER}. We have won a victory at Aughaire, but we cannot relax our defence until Angmar is defeated.'Mordirith is still determined to raze Aughaire to the ground and gathers his forces in Rhunendin to put forth a major offensive against the Trév Gállorg.Tordoron is near Gath Forthnír.

