Having found several unbroken mirrors, you should return to Darri and report your success.Return to Darri at the Twenty-first Hall'Greetings, friend ${CLASS}. I am Darri, and I hail from the Lonely Mountain. It is hard to believe we are truly treading the ancient paths of Khazad-dûm, is it not? It is enough to kindle a flame in the heart of even the stoniest dwarf.

'There is one thing in which I have a particular interest: the mirrors you may have seen about the Twenty-first Hall. I believe there are four of them, and I have a theory about what they are for.

'Could you go and record some information about the mirrors, such as rotation, location, and so forth? I would like to study what you find.''Good work, ${PLAYER}! Now, let me take a look at the recordings you made.''Have you found the mirrors I sent you to seek?'The Durub, a tribe of Mordor Orcs who claim to be the chosen of Sauron, have established their camp just south of the Twenty-first Hall.Durub Orcs can be found at Gazatu-ru, south of the Twenty-first Hall.

