Ingifast will be interested in seeing the copy of the "other orders" you managed to obtain.'${PLAYER}, I recently overheard something that has me a little concerned...and curious. I was out tracking the movements of the White Hand, and a pair of archers wandered by. They didn't see me, and before I dispatched them, I was able to eavesdrop on their conversation.

'One of them mentioned the "other orders" their band received. Any new information is valuable to our efforts...find out what these other orders were, and we will have an advantage! I suggest you begin with the guards of the White Hand, as they are much more likely to bear important documents.

'Look for them to the south-east among the buildings of the Redhorn Lodes, particularly the Ore-house, Menem-mezel, and Malmezel. One of them should be carrying a copy of these mysterious "other orders."''The White Hand camps are around the Redhorn Lodes. Look for the guards there.''Excellent, my good ${RACE}, most excellent! Let us now see what we have here....

