'I will meet you south of here, ${PLAYER}. To be honest, I look forward to exploring. I saw on a map that we might encounter the Hall of Durin!

'Here is a signal you may use if you wish to call me to your side.''Ah! Look at this, ${PLAYER}! It is stunning.

