You should return to Dale Sageford with the furled Orc-banners.'A moment of your time, if you can spare it. There is a crumbling ruin of a fort to the north of this location, slightly east as well. This fort is overrun by Orcs and half-orcs.

'This alone is cause for concern, but they fly banners of the White Hand. In our travels through the valley here, we have seen these Orcs and half-orcs growing more and more brazen. We need to collect proof that they are organized and get that information into the hands of the authorities in Bree.

'Go to the ruins, get the flags, and return them to me furled so as to not cause concern when we bring them to Bree.''So, did you find the banners?''I am certain that these will prove useful. These Orcs and half-orcs continue to force their way further and further towards Bree-land's borders. We must alert the Constables and see if there is a way to slow them down.

