Ingifast wishes you to thin the numbers of the White Hand Orcs. He fears they will soon become a greater threat.Defeat White Hand Orcs in the Redhorn Lodes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Ingifast is at the Orc-watch, north-west of the Redhorn Lodes.

