'We surrendered Khazad-dûm long ago under the terror of Durin's Bane, and the Orcs laid claim to it in our absence. We cannot let another usurper take what is rightfully ours! Eventually we will reclaim every last inch of the Mines the Orcs have despoiled...and that begins now! 

'Cull their numbers. Make them start at every flicker of shadow at the edge of their vision, make them worry it may be a champion of the Free Peoples come to exact a bloody price for their affrontery! Look for them to the south-east, among the ancient structures of the Redhorn Lodes.''Ha! Wonderful, ${PLAYER}. A grisly task well-deserved. We will have the realm back in hand soon enough!''There are White Hand Orcs -- and far too many of them -- throughout the Redhorn Lodes. You should probably start there.'You have discovered Gazatu-ru, a camp of strangely organized Durub Orcs. They must have strong leaders to have such powerful delusions about their own grandeur.The Durub captains are at Gazatu-ru at the Great Hall of Durin, south of the Twenty-first Hall.

