'The statue-base is there in the centre of the court. Will you do the honours of reassembling it?''Quickly, put it back together before the mortar dries!''Bellows and anvil, ${PLAYER}; what a long, strange trip you've been on. Those goblins and their Orkish allies nearly got away with their plan to erase the name of the legendary Helgi Goblinbane from not only their memory, but perhaps, in time, also from ours!

'I... this is such a beautiful act, from one who is not even planning to settle permanently within Khazad-dûm's magnificent halls. I am so proud of you! I just... I... excuse me. I seem to have a fleck of stone-dust in my eye....'The mirror in the Flaming Deeps is constantly being disturbed by Deep-worms, fiery dragonets, and the Ghâsh-hai. Keeping it correctly aligned is a nigh-impossible task.Thórgnyr is in Anazârmekhem, north of The Cross-roads of Ash.

