'Hadâd-mezer can be found to the north-west. Just... follow the sounds of battle.''We recently sent three groups of dwarves into the Flaming Deeps in an attempt to drive away the invading Orcs, but I believe something has gone badly for our folk. Sounds of battle are coming from Hadad-mezer and I fear for the group that ventured there.

