'You have my thanks, and the thanks of the others here at Ost Guruth, ${PLAYER}.

'There is one last task I will ask of you before you return to Sadreda.'You have discovered a highly unusual ore in the cracks of Khurjezer, churned up by whatever force shattered the bridge and the floors around the chasm.Narfulz ore can be found at the Crack's Edge in the centre Nud-melek.

