It is completely overrun with vermin, but perhaps there are artifacts to be uncovered that lie nearby.You have cleared Balin's Camp of the worst of its infestation, and can now investigate for any relics or items of interest.Winiel has come to the Water-works, seeking the lost knowledge of the dwarves.Lore-fragments can be found throughout the Water-works.

