'We cannot rest until we are prepared for the worst. We must be ready to meet this onslaught, and if we are lucky we will not be doomed as Balin was, whose road was yet unknown to him.

'My dwarves Slóthi, Sigdan, and Thálfi here in the Chamber of the Cross-roads must be told of the situation. You should do anything they ask to help them prepare for the coming storm. The Great Delving, at least, will be ready.''Speak to Slóthi, Sigdan, and Thálfi here in the Chamber of the Cross-roads and aid them in preparing for the onslaught I fear is coming.''You have indeed done as I asked; now I can but hope that it will be enough!

'The Great Delving, at least, is sufficiently at the ready. We were fortunate that Mazog had not yet made his move.'You have been instructed to find Celofa in the Foundations of Stone in Moria in order to further your prowess as a Burglar.Celofa is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria.

In order to further your training as a Burglar, you have been sent to find Celofa, a fellow Burglar of great renown.Talk to CelofaCelofa is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria.

In order to further your training as a Burglar, you have been sent to find Celofa, a fellow Burglar of great renown.Talk to CelofaYou should find Celofa in the Foundations of Stone in Moria in order to further your prowess as a Burglar.'Well hello there, friend. How in the world did you find me here? I intended to sneak in undetected, but it seems that rumour has preceded me, and here I find a companion!

'I do so love riddles, don't you? I can tell that you do, for you have the look of a fellow Burglar. Stand up straight and let me see you clearly! Ah yes, you look agile and have a clever face...I think you know what I mean.

'Come, let us speak some more about riddles, and maybe we can learn something from one another.'The Orcs at the Crack's Edge are uneasy, but stay to gather their strength for a push to the Dimrill Dale.Orcs can be found at the Crack's Edge along the great rift in the centre of Nud-melek.

You should defeat Orcs at the Crack's Edge outpost.Defeat Orcs at the Crack's Edge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Svanr is at the west side of the chasm upon the Bridge of Khazad-dûm in Nud-melek.

You should tell Svanr that have defeated a number of Orcs at the Crack's Edge.Return to Svanr'These Orcs are only here temporarily, it would seem, but they gather their strength to push a small army towards the Dimrill Dale. As to why they would face fire, fear, and sun to move eastward, I know not, but I do not like them.

'Let us trim their ranks, eh, ${PLAYER}?''Well done, ${PLAYER}! Make them think twice about whatever mischief they are getting themselves into.''The Orcs of the Crack's Edge must be made to regret their boldness for facing whatever has made them so uneasy. Let them add your name to the list of terrors into which they fly!'Captain Garnyd has summoned you into her presence.Garnyd is at Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps of Moria.

