You have been instructed to seek out Captain Garnyd.Talk to Garnyd at Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps of MoriaCaptain Garnyd has summoned you into her presence to further your training as a Captain.Garnyd salutes you.

'Well met, Captain. I see my summons for you was well-placed, as is the prevailing opinion of your value to our cause against the Enemy.

'I would have your aid here in our fight to reclaim Moria. Please stay a while and let us speak of how you can aid the cause.'Dithrik has given you the final task in your quest for advancement as a Guardian.Defeat the World Eater in the Dark DelvingsDefeat NightshineReturn to Dithrik in the Foundations of Stone'Well, we have come to it. There is no time like the present for these horrible deeds. You must gather your friends and your strength, ${PLAYER}, for you will need both before the end. Head into the place known as the Dark Delvings, and bring this bait we have concocted.  

'Once inside, look for the place where the World Eater was fought in the days of old, and leave the bait there. There should be no mistaking the place.

'I do not know what you must do to proceed from there. I am sorry I cannot be more helpful, but if you cannot find a way, then you will have little use for what I wish to teach you upon your return. I wish you the best of luck, Guardian.'Dithrik's chest swells as you approach, and he seems to be sizing you up as if seeing you for the first time.

'You have done well this day, ${PLAYER}. Few others in the history of the ages could have accomplished what you did this day. Few indeed, for I tried also, and barely escaped with my life.

'From this day forth, you are my shield-brother. You have earned the title in my eyes, and indeed in those of all dwarves. Let any who question your valour come see me, and I'll set them aright with a dwarf-fist to the eye.'Valthor has summoned you into his presence.Valthor is encamped at the Foundations of Stone in Moria.

