With your task complete, you should return to Waden with news of your success.Talk to Waden outside Fil-gashan'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. There are many captains who seek the Path of the Healing Hands, but not all can accomplish their task alone. You should seek to aid your fellow captains along their path.

'The greatest danger your fellow will face is at the Fil-gashan.

'Go now and prove your honour.'

<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can only be completed by helping a captain on their Class quest, "In Harm's Way."</rgb>'You have done well, ${PLAYER}. You are truly a worthy captain.'Many champions seek the Path of the Martial Champion, but not all can accomplish their goals alone.Longpincer can be found in Skûmfil, east of the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone.

