'Do you remember where to find everything? Curve around to the east of the low cliff of white, chalk-bearing rock; from there, you can go due north-east and up the slope to find birch-wood in and around the grove. To find the stone outcroppings, head due east into Gelirdor, then head south-east when you reach the first clearing.''Could you bring me the stone and wood that I requested?''Welcome back! Thank you kindly, friend ${CLASS}; any time you wish to help me again, it would be most welcome.

