'If you are truly all that they say you are, you will go to Skûmfil and face Grimreaver, patron of evil. I want you to bring me his fang as proof that he is dead. This will not be an easy task, but it is not impossible. There is no shame in bringing friends with you on this venture.''I am tremendously impressed! You have done credit to your fame, great credit indeed. Something troubles me still, though. By your description of this foe, it sounds to me like evil will not be held at bay for long in horrid Skûmfil.

