'Do not be fooled, though. Beyond this border, the Enemy is gathering to destroy us. They await the day when their Dark Lord emerges from Barad-dûr to lead them into Caras Galadhon, to the doom of us all.'Find remnants of fallen heroes within SkûmfilFind remnants of fallen heroes within Skûmfil.Find remnants of fallen heroes within Skûmfil.Find the filth-covered BladeFind the ichor-covered HelmFind the pitted longswordFind the eroded dwarf-shieldThe Wargs and the riders of Athmadhul have been defeated. Now it is time to destroy the training camp itself.The track is at Athmadhul, south-east of Mekhem-bizru.

Ótam wants you to return to Athmadhul, but this time wishes you to dismantle the track fences the Warg-riders use to train.Destroy gates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Ótam is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Athmadhul.

Ótam will be pleased to hear that the training track has been destroyed.Talk to Ótam at Mekhem-bizru'The Wargs have been defeated, depriving the goblins of new mounts. The goblins have been defeated, depriving the Wargs of new riders. Now, the time has come to destroy the very training track itself and deprive them of future Warg-riders altogether.

'Return to Athmadhul, to the south-east and destroy the fences that frame the track. Without those, future Warg-riders will not have the finesse to manage successful close quarters combat.

'It is a small step, to be sure, but not an insignificant one.''All our work will be for naught if we do not destroy that track.''With the track destroyed, we will have little to fear from the Warg-riders. My axe will cut down any but the best... and thanks to you, we no longer have to fear that.'Hadhelen has written a letter to Andiriniel, whom he was supposed to meet at the Lady's Rest.Andiriniel is at the Lady's Rest, south-west of the gates of Caras Galadhon.

Hadhelen asked you to deliver his letter to Andiriniel.'Perchance could you do me a discreet favour, ${PLAYER}. There is a woman I was supposed to meet by the Lady's Rest, just a short ways south-west of the gates of Caras Galadhon, but I do not think I will be able to make it. I was hoping you could take this letter to her for me.

'Please forgive me for pressing this upon you... I would never do so were the situation not so urgent!

'I... I have work to do now....''Have you delivered my letter to Andiriniel yet? Please do hurry.''What is this? A letter for me? I was not expecting anything of the sort.

'Very well, let me see what this mysterious message is about....'Nembes watches over the fountain of the Lady Galadriel.Pitchers can be found on the terrace near Nembes, and there are three locations to which she would have you bring pitchers of water: parched Elves beneath Telain Neduil, at the base of the ladder that climbs up to the House of Celeborn, and at a gathering of musicians north of Celúrlin.

