You should return to Handelen with the report of your patrol.Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad'Are you willing to patrol southern Gathbúrz, ${PLAYER}? I know it looks pretty barren out here, but that is the main approach to the gate of Dol Guldur, and if a significant enemy force should slip by us, there we may pay dearly for it.

'We must remain alert for any movement by the enemy. Return to me with your report when you have completed your patrol.''Our survival here depends upon performing routine patrols to sight the approach of the Enemy.''There is still not much out there, I trust? So long as that road remains under our watch, the forces of Dol Guldur cannot mount an assault against us at Emyn Lûm, where the centre of our strength resides.'The lone survivor of a vicious attack has made a small camp on the northern face of the hill beneath Harndirion.Gronu's camp is just south of the river, in a small grove of trees, north of Harndirion.

