You should speak with Harchador and let him know that you were victorious.Talk to Harchador at Mithechad'Word has spread that the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl are preparing for a counter-attack against the Malledhrim. We must strike against them first, before they can muster their full strength.

'I will leave that to you, ${PLAYER}. Bring death to the enemies of the Malledhrim at Ânghum-maudhûl, then return to me with your report.

'Ânghum-maudhûl lies south-east of here, along the road.''Your quick action has granted the Malledhrim a reprieve. With the forces of Ânghum-maudhûl diminished, we do not expect a counter-attack until reinforcements arrive.''Seek out and defeat the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl. Go now!'Taking the baileys of Dol Guldur will leave the interior defences weak and vulnerable.The Outer Bailey holds the entrance to the Dungeons of Dol Guldur, but more importantly, the gates to the Inner Bailey and the heart of the fortress. All who stand guard must be cleared to claim this location.Claim the Outer BaileyThe forces of Dol Guldur will not give up their fortress so easily. Stand strong and defend what you have claimed from their wrath.Hold the Outer Bailey against the assaultThe Outer Bailey now belongs firmly to the Golden Host. It is time to push deeper and defeat those guarding the Inner Bailey.Claim the Inner BaileyYou have staked a claim for the Inner Bailey, but the masters of Dol Guldur will not give it up lightly. Defend it so that you may assault the Tower.Hold the Inner Bailey against the assaultThe warden of the Inner Bailey has come down from the tower. Defeat him and claim the baileys and outside of Dol Guldur for the Golden Host.Claim the Ringwraiths' Lair'Goldagnir is eager to strike the final blow. You should meet with him at once.'The Ringwraiths' Lair provides the final defences for the inner fortifications.The baileys of the Ringwraiths' Lair are the final line of defence before the interior of the fortress.Defeat FaelathronDefeat MazaukgratDefeat KúfitDefeat DurnákhDefeat GúlherynDefeat AfgluDefeat ZánurzDefeat NorchadorDefeat MornákhYou have done everything there is to do on top of Sâri-surma. You are now king of the icy world.Complete the King of the Mountain DeedComplete the Frost Fight DeedThe Black Badges of Dol Guldur are awarded to soldiers who have slain valiant defenders of the West.The black badges of Dol Guldur may be found upon enemy soldiers in Gathbúrz.

