'We must destroy the carts that are being used to transport the ore, but they appear to be of dwarf-make, which may make them difficult to disable.

'Hurry to Garmadh-maudhûl and destroy the carts.  The encampment can be found to the north-east by following the trail that traverses up the mountain.''We here at Mithechad thank you for your services. Your contribution has weakened the supply-chain for Dol Guldur at a critical point of the assault.

'We are indebted to you.''Have you destroyed the ore-carts of Garmadh-maudhûl? The supply of ore to Dol Guldur must be hindered!'The forest in the Ashenslades appears to have been corrupted by a strange malady that has spread across the area.Sâd Doldúr lies to the south of Barad Angol, down the mountainside.

Himeinior has asked you to collect some water samples and pieces of fallen blighted wood from the area around Sâd Doldúr.Gather pieces of wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gather water samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Heiminior is at the camp near Barad Angol, up the mountain pass north of Sâd Doldúr.

You should return the branches and samples of water to Himeinior.'There is a strange malady affecting the trees in the Ashenslades. They have become a mere shadow of what they once were, due to this strange blight. While I have my suspicions of the cause of the blight, I need to be certain before moving forward.

'Could you travel to the ruins of Sâd Doldúr and the surrounding area and gather some samples of water from the Bleakmere and some pieces of fallen blighted wood from the ruins?

'Sâd Doldúr is located down the mountain. You can reach it by following the path directly to the east of us. The branches can be found near the trees.''Bring me the water samples and pieces of wood I requested, ${PLAYER}. They can be found around Sâd Doldúr.''After looking at these samples, it appears our fears are well-founded.  The blight is spreading westward and may begin to creep into Taur Morvith. 

