You should return to Frithgeir and let him know that you have been able to defeat a number of gwiber in Thrór's Coomb.Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund'Surrounding several rocky crags, a horde of gwiber has begun to populate the eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb. These creatures are growing in power and represent a danger to all of the people of Enedwaith.

'We will pay well for any assistance that you might render in stemming the growth of the gwiber population.

'Travel south across the river to the tundra below and seek out the gwiber along the eastern ridgeline of Thrór's Coomb.''Your efforts have been valiant, but I fear these creatures will not be so easily driven forth.''Gwiber are a breed of drake found specifically in this region. They used to dwell deeper in the mountains, but now they have descended into the vale.'Laegalar has asked you to collect Blades of Necromancy from the Black Númenóreans that inhabit Sammath Gûl.Sammath Gûl is in Dol Guldur.

