'For this task, I think that perhaps smaller numbers might prevail where a large assault might be turned aside.

'Darúk can be found in the heart of Ânghum-maudhûl, standing guard before the forges, east of Mithechad.''With Darúk's defeat and the destruction of his banner, Ânghum-maudhûl has been thrown into disarray. This has secured the southern flank of our forces and bought us time. 

