'I do not know if he can be stopped, but we must do what we can to slow him. I ask that you venture to Ost Dunhoth and slay as many of its denizens as you may. Gortheron is a threat we cannot ignore.''It may only be a small victory, and short-lived, as no doubt those forces will be replaced, but we can rest easy today knowing it was a victory.''If we are to survive these dark times, we must strike where we can.'Ost Dunhoth is an ancient Gondorian fortress in Enedwaith. The Gaunt-lord Gortheron has claimed it as the base of his power.Locate the entrance to Ost Dunhoth.Locate the entrance to Ost DunhothGrants completion of deed: Discoverer of Ost Dunhoth.By completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discoverer of Ost Dunhoth.'Now, my little fellows, where be you a-going to, puffing like a bellows? What's the matter here then? Tell me what's your trouble!

