'Travel at once to Sâd Doldúr, ${PLAYER}, and disrupt Lidognir's foul sorcery before it is too late. Lidognir can be found at the pinnacle of Sâd Doldúr, south and down the mountain from Barad Angol.''With the defeat of Lidognir, the Golden Host has stopped a grave threat to our home. If this sorcerer had not been stopped, the trees throughout Mirkwood and Lothlórien would have suffered as the trees do within the Ashenslades. 

