'Therefore, I ask that you hunt the Wargs of the Ashenslades and collect their teeth as a warning to their brethren.

'Wargs can be found throughout the Ashenslades, but they have also established a den to the south of here, near the ruins of Naur-hoit.''Seek out and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades and collect their teeth as a warning to their brethren.''I once again thank you for your service, ${PLAYER}. These beasts have long been the bane of any excursion into the Ashenslades.'<rgb=#00e4ff>This deed is for Legendary Servers.</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This deed is for Legendary Servers</rgb>Complete Volume III, Book 3: Echoes of the DeadA number of enemy scouts have been sighted along the outskirts of Garmadh-maudhûl, watching for signs of approaching danger.Garmadh-maudhûl can be found to the north-east of Mithechad by following a trail that traverses up the mountain.

