You should return to Eirien and inform her of your deed.Talk to Eirien in Mithechad'In the northern reaches of the Ashenslades, the forces of Dol Guldur have established a camp among a series of ruins they call Garmadh-maudhûl. This camp has begun to deploy scouts to warn of incursions from forces assaulting Southern Mirkwood. 

