'When the forward scouts have been defeated, return to me with your report.''I commend you on the successful execution of your duty. Your victory will make our next task easier to accomplish.''Defeat the enemy scouts that have been sighted along the outskirts of Garmadh-maudhûl. They present a significant threat to our forces.'The tale of Moria and Lothlórien is nearing a close. What does the future hold for the Iron Garrison and the Golden Host?The Volume 2 Epilogue does not begin until you have completed Book 9: Fortress of the Nazgûl.The Golden Host and the Iron Garrison have completed their mission to Mirkwood, but there is still a story to be told.Complete 'Epilogue: Zigilburk Returned'Complete 'Epilogue: Sigileth's Knives'Complete 'Epilogue: Ningloril'Complete 'Epilogue: Laeglang'Complete 'Epilogue: Alfirimbes'Complete 'Epilogue: Greyhammers'Complete 'Epilogue: Cúcheron's Bow'Complete 'Epilogue: Achardor's Fate'Complete 'Epilogue: Barvessain'Complete 'Epilogue: Braiglinn'Complete 'Epilogue: Issuriel's Flower'Complete 'Epilogue: Gorothúl of Dol Guldur'Many foes have settled throughout Mirkwood, striving ever to make it the fell and hopeless stronghold of evil that it has since become.Many foes have settled throughout Mirkwood, striving ever to make it the fell and hopeless stronghold of evil that it has since become.Discover Garmadh-maudhûlDiscover Sâd DoldúrDiscover Ânghum-maudhûlDiscover BúrzkalaDiscover Amon AngenedDiscover Durbúrz-stazgThe ruins of Minas Elendúr in Eregion and their under-cellars of Delotham have gone unexplored for long years since they were abandoned.Complete Chapter 6: Fúni Gem-cutterFind the statue in the courtyard of Minas ElendúrFind the south-west corner of Minas ElendúrFind the enclosed porch in Minas ElendúrFind the circular courtyard in Minas ElendúrFind the south-east corner in Minas ElendúrFind the south-east aisle in Minas ElendúrFind the isolated chamber in Minas ElendúrFind the dimly-lit, 