he Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue FaelwenFaenthír is gone. His sister, Puigfinnel, is searching for someone to rescue him. Faenthír is being questioned by the Orcs of Dol Guldur because he was caught sneaking behind their lines.Faenthír is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue FaenthírAgorgened has lost his sweetheart to an ambush by the Orcs of Dol Guldur at the top of a large waterfall.Glamrennel is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue GlamrennelLaegalar has lost his brother, Hethulír, in the woods of Mirkwood.  They were out searching for rare herbs when they were ambushed by sorcerers.  He has come to the Mourning Well in hopes that someone hears his cries for his lost brother.Hethulír is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue HethulírMaediel has gone missing. Her daughter, Dolhendeth, is worried because lately she has decided to go for long walks in dangerous areas. She is worried that Maediel has been captured and has asked you to bring her back to her.Maediel is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue MaedielUiloriel sits in the Haunted Inn trying impossibly to drown her sorrows. Her bethrothed has gone missing. Thimuil went to fetch her more lembas from Lothlórien and never returned.Thimuil is in the Dungeons of Dol Guldur.Find and rescue ThimuilAmong the ruins on the eastern border of the Ashenslades, fell spirits from beyond the Void have risen and wander the area.Sâd Doldúr lies to the south of Barad Angol.

