You should return to Maerwen for your reward.Talk to Maerwen at Helethir'It seems the Wargs in Draugdegil have acquired the taste for raw flesh... the beasts become ravenous and fey.

'Enter into Draugdegil and defeat the goblin-leader Athgrat and the Warg-matron Kranklob, but make sure to deal with all the Wargs after exhausting their stores of meat!

'Travel north-east to Draugdegil and make sure you have slain the Wargs after goading them into consuming their specially-prepared meat, and you will be greatly rewarded, ${CLASS}.''The Wargs must meet their end, ${PLAYER}. Go now to Draugdegil, to the north-east and remove their threat.''News of your success travels before you! I have not seen such valour in many years, ${PLAYER}... well done!'You have entered Lhaid Ogo, a series of tunnels beneath the Lich Bluffs. The passages are clogged with mud and feel quite unstable.Lhaid Ogo is a mysterious place. Who knows what you might find down here?Delve into Lhaid Ogo and unravel its mysteriesThe winding passages of Lhaid Ogo are clogged with mud, and its layout seems to shift as if on a whim.Find the ancient, unlucky explorerFind the gap in the bridgeFind the discarded pouchFind the unfinished dinnerFind Mud-eater's lairFind the disturbed earthen slopeThis cloth pouch is not as ancient as the rest of Lhaid Ogo; someone must have brought it here, and recently, but then discarded it for some reason.

