ev to earn favour with the Men of Dunland.Wanted: Spotted ears from the beasts in western Dunland.'The local beasts often stalk our herds. You have kept them at bay, and we will see what we can do in return.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The Dunlending taskmaster wants stretched skins. She can be found at Galtrev in Pren Gwydh.You have accepted a task to acquire stretched skins. You are to deliver them to the Dunlending taskmaster in Galtrev.Wanted: Stretched skins from the beasts in western Dunland. Collect them and deliver them to the taskmaster in Galtrev to earn favour with the Men of Dunland.Wanted: Stretched skins from the beasts in western Dunland.'The local beasts often stalk our herds. You have kept them at bay, and we will see what we can do in return.'You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.By completing this quest, you will gain rank amongst the Creatures of Angmar.'So maggot, you want to be ranked up a bit? Well I'll allow it, but just this one time. Don't get used to it!''Alright, here you go. Now leave me in peace!'By completing this quest, you will gain rank amongst the Free Peoples.'So maggot, you want to be ranked up a bit? Well I'll allow it, but just this one time. Don't get used to it!''Alright, here you go. Now leave me in peace!'South of Harndirion, there is a small series of ponds which are the prime watering holes of the deer which inhabit Thrór's Coomb.Deer can be found among a series of ponds, south of Harndirion and Gronu's camp.

