Perindúr has asked you to continue the battle against the Orcs of the western Ashenslades.Defeat Orcs at Ânug-stazg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect ashen spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Perindúr is at Mithechad, west of Ânug-stazg.

You should return to Perindúr and inform him that you have defeated the reinforcements that arrived at Ânug-stazg.'With the defeat of Fotak, the forces of Ânug-stazg have been scattered, and the threat to Mithechad has been diminished. However, the scattered forces do still serve a threat to the area.

'Will you go again to Ânug-stazg and defeat more of the Orcs? Many carry ashen spears made from the blighted wood of the Ashenslades...bring me several of these as well as a token of your success.

'Ânug-stazg lies to the east of Mithechad, beneath a canopy of twisted trees.''Seek out and defeat Orcs near Ânug-stazg and retrieve any ashen spears that you might find.''Once again, your assistance was invaluable, ${PLAYER}.

'With the defeat of these reinforcements, our ability to explore the cause of the strange malady affecting the trees has been increased tenfold.  

'Thank you again.'The ruins among which the giants have made their encampments also house lost relics of the exiles from Erebor, who dwelt here once long ago.The giant encampments may be found far to the south of Zudrugund.

Frithgeir has asked you to recover a relic from the giants in Thrór's Coomb.Defeat giants to recover a relicThe giant encampments may be found far to the south of Zudrugund.

