'I shall await your return here, should you survive.''You have faced my challenge and prevailed, ${PLAYER}. Go forth and complete the Wild Hunt and earn the Huntsman's favour, if you would win passage for your allies.''Go forth and challenge the falcon-spirit.'As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.

