'Travel south-east to the hill and follow the path along the ridge, defeat any Dievlig that you encounter, then return to me.''The defeat of the Dievlig on the hill will show their brethren that we will not go quietly from this place. We will defend our right to trade with whom we wish.''Defeat the Dievlig who have brought grief upon my party.'This note tells of several other survivors of the attack on Bledhun's band. These people have fled northwards, as grim portents have spoken of dark times ahead.Bledhun's encampment is in the east of the Bonevales.

