'This does not bode well, but perhaps we can stop them. First, we will harry them, then we will strike when they are weak!''Have you found any sign of the Dragon-clan's rallying point? According to the map, it is somewhere near here, but perhaps the enemy who drew this map was in error.'You have passed into Dunland and now find yourself welcomed into the homes of the simple folk of Lhan Tarren, a small village inhabited by the Caru-lûth, the Stag-clan.The items for the ritual feast can be found somewhere in Lhan Tarren.

You should help Elder Riagán find the items that he has lost, for they will be needed tonight at the feast, and it seems as though his old mind has forgotten their whereabouts.Find the first piece of the ritual setFind the second piece of the ritual setFind the third piece of the ritual setElder Riagán can be found in Lhan Tarren, musing over the whereabouts of the items you found.

You should bring the pieces of the ritual set to Elder Riagán for tonight's feast.'Tonight is the Feast of the Running Stag, our clan's annual festival. It is an important ritual, and you must join us and share our fare. Tonight, you are of the Caru-lûth, the Stag-clan!

'Now, be off with you! I must prepare, and I cannot remember where I left the three ritual pieces... curse this old head of mine!

'The crown, the spear, the hair... where did I leave them...?''It was not always so difficult for me to remember where I left things. My poor, old head!''Oh! You are a kind one, ${PLAYER}. I am ready to replace the rest of the Stag-clan with just you, if truth be told. Ha!

'Do not pay me any mind. They are a useless, little clan, but they are no less dear to me for that.

'Thank you for helping an old man gather his wits. Now I may begin to prepare for tonight.'Lhan Tarren burns! The servants of the White Hand did not take kindly to the Elder's refusal, and their vengeance has been frightfully swift and cruel.As Lhan Tarren burns, the river still flows with quelling water astride the village. The flames are beginning to spread....

You should search the banks of the river for a way to carry water to the fires, starting with the nearest fire at the tree by the bridge.Use the bucket to throw water on the flaming treeAnother fire burns at the Elder's hut. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.

You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut where the Elder once stood.Use the bucket to douse the fire at the Elder's hutAnother fire burns in the middle of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.

You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut in the middle of the village.Throw water on the fire at the hut in the middle of townAnother fire burns at the north-east corner of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.

You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut at the north-east edge of the village.Throw water on the fire at the north-east edge of townGuto can be found in Lhan Tarren, mourning the loss of his grandfather the Elder.

