You should quickly heal the wounded villagers, before another life is lost to the horrible attack that took place in Trum Dreng.Elain is in Lhan Tarren.

You should return to Elain to see what else can be done to help right this terrible wrong.Tell Elain that you have helped to heal the wounded townsfolk'It is terrible! I cannot believe those fiends crept in here in that short time when I was chasing Guto. I was worried you were taken too.

