'We must stop the bloodshed in Lhan Tarren before we can hope to avenge the dead.''Thank the Gwirod for your skill, ${PLAYER}. I believe you have saved many lives today. 

'Alas for Lhan Tarren... my poor Elder! What are we to do? Please -- stay with us a little longer while we get back on our feet, my dear friend.'Plas Maru is a great cairn which was reserved for the ancient brenins and their brehur.Plas-maru lies to the east of Ilar's camp.

