You should bring word to Ilar of your victory against the wights.Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales'These are sad days for our people, Duvodiad. Those who went before us and guided us for generations are being defiled by those who have betrayed us. I fear that Plas-maru, the cairn of our greatest leaders, has fallen as well, but it may be that you will learn more of the evil there.

'The entrance to Plas-maru lies to the east of here. Travel there and defeat the wights which stand guard outside its entrance.''I hope that with the defeat of these abominations, our ancestors will be left to rest.

'Thank you for your aid in this task.''Have you dealt with the wights yet?'The Bonevales are in the northern reaches of Dunland.The Bonevales are in the north of Dunland, south of the Lichbluffs in Enedwaith.

