'You can reach the Bonevales by travelling south on the main road through Enedwaith, through the Lichbluffs. At least, that is what the Elder told me.''A duvodiad in these lands? Who goes there? Why are you in this forsaken place?''If you take the main through-way south from Enedwaith, I am sure you will find the Bonevales without a problem.'The herd-lands, recently captured by the Dragon-clan, had many food-stores that were meant to feed the peaceful inhabitants of Trum Dreng. The Dragon-clan invaders have stolen a great deal of it.Stolen food and supplies can surely be found on the Dragon-clan scouts who invaded the farm.

