'Something must be done.'Luned worries about a friend who ventured out into Pren Gwydh to gather supplies for Galtrev. Like many other stout folk during these trying times, he has not yet returned.Leolin, a friend of Luned, is late to return from his early morning venture onto Pren Gwydh's road.

