'This... this is terrible. My poor, poor friend. He was a great use to Galtrev, venturing out each morning and returning with goods for the people of this village. But no more....'Gethin is an old man, and no longer has the strength to lift the boxes he has been charged with delivering.The first Overseer is at the worksite near the western gate of Galtrev.

