You should carry the first shipment to the second Overseer.Deliver the second box of supplies to the second worksite's OverseerThe third Overseer is at the worksite just uphill and to the south from the second worksite.

You should carry the first shipment to the third Overseer.Deliver the third box of supplies to the third worksite's OverseerRuthless Tom guards the west gate.

