'But all the working men have gone, or perhaps they were taken. The old and the women are left to bear heavy burdens. For myself, I cannot even lift the boxes I am supposed to carry. I am much too slow for this, and I am always falling behind....''If I lift another box, I fear my back will give out completely....''If I lift another box, I fear my back will give out completely....''If I lift another box, I fear my back will give out completely....''If I lift another box, I fear my back will give out completely....''Ah, thank you, ${PLAYER}! What a kind soul you must be, to help the foolish people here in Galtrev.

'Once, I might have been able to show you proper hospitality. Now, alas, all I can offer you is friendship, little though it is worth.'The more vicious wolves of Pren Gwydh can be found in their lair, and the bravest warriors of Galtrev once attempted to fight these beasts in their own territory... that is, before they were taken for the war.Elder wolves can be found in the Fanged Lair, north of Galtrev.

You should defeat many elder wolves in Pren Gwydh.Defeat elder wolves in the Fanged Lair (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Hopcun can be found in Galtrev, awaiting your safe return.

