'I hope you have brought your friends. This battle will not be easy.''Well done again; however, this was only your second trial.'The Pit in the Starkmoor serves as a proving ground for conscripts. Those strong enough to withstand it join the army in Wulf's Cleft; those too weak are sent to dig in the mines.The banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor.

