'I am sure there are folk in need of aid there, as well. Perhaps they too feel the oppression of Isengard. Saruman has stretched his White Hand perilously far into our lands.

'A fellow named Andras just led his caravan in that direction...perhaps you can overtake him on the road, and he can show you around.''A thief on the road! Help! Help! Oh, why will no one help me?

