You should report what you have found to Gwilum.This stack of crates contains war-supplies and provisions for the guards. Alarmingly, they bear not only the mark of the Ox-clan, but of the White Hand as well. Perhaps you should search the rest of the crates around the tower.'Alas, that my people, the Uch-lûth of Carreglyn, have allied themselves with the Wizard Saruman is not new tidings to me. Indeed, I -- and many others like me -- seek to convince my people that this path is wrong, but we have met with little success.

'Nevertheless, your actions may help to disrupt the White Hand's influence in Barnavon.'Stanric seems to be a good man and has asked you to help the toiling Men of Stangard with their chores.Byrnstan guards the Mead Hall door of Stangard. Gadda stands not far from the Mead Hall. Sabert guards the north gate down below.

