You should take knowledge of what you have seen back to Brifard.Talk to Brifard'Well, ${PLAYER}, this is a bad sign. The wolves should not be acting this way towards our men.

'I have noticed that there have been far fewer creatures on the Field as of late. I do not know why these beasts have suddenly deserted their homes, but surely something is wrong.

'Humour me...search outside the wolf-den to see if you can find any beasts or any evidence of what is going on.''So then, it is as I thought. These wolves are without any nourishment from the Field and have become more dangerous in desperation.

