'I fear that others will suffer the same fate if the goblins are permitted to retain their hiding hole. If you would, go to their cave and collapse the entrance, then return to Ardwyn at Forthbrond and let him know that one threat has been removed.''Thank you for lending Cadthorn your aid. With the entrance to the goblin-cave collapsed, it should be some time before they are able to attack any more of our patrols or messengers.'Idmar has considered Doron's plea and has chosen to take action against the brigands of Parth Celebrant.The brigands are located in the large camp to the south. It is likely that the thieves who carry these relics will be hard to detect, even among their fellows.

