You should return to Ardwyn and let him know that you have dealt with the sentries.Talk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond.'The Dunlendings at Brôntrig are assuredly to blame for the attacks on my patrols, but the village is protected by many sentries who are in a position to warn their kinsmen should we approach.

