'I must try to remember the time I spent here. Perhaps something has fallen from my memory.'You have done all you can in the western part of the Isendale, and now it is time to move on.Innoth can be found by travelling south until you reach the Isen, then east along the shore until you reach the rocky outcropping where Innoth is encamped.

