'I am certain that Innoth will have as much need of your aid as I.''${PLAYER}, your name is spoken of well among the Rohirrim on these shores. This area had been quiet until recently, but in the past few days, there have been shadows emerging from every direction.''I believe Innoth will need your aid.'Idmar is unsettled by the arrival of fallen warriors of Gondor at the Field of Celebrant.The Oathbreakers of Parth Celebrant can be found to the north, east, and west of Idmar's camp.

