'Would you gather some of these hides for me, so that I might examine them more closely?''These are indeed wondrously strange hides! I could trade for many marvelous things for my people...I thank you for bringing these to me.'Frogildi recognizes the danger posed by the great turtles of the Rushgore and has a plan to control them.Turtles can be found throughout the Rushgore.

