You should return to Gisalic with news of your success.Talk to Gisalic at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore'The insects you discovered at the burrows are of great concern to me. Such sizeable and venomous creatures are a source of fear and terror to my heart.

'Perhaps you might use your talents to rid us of this threat? Perhaps if the insects perceive a threat greater than themselves, they might not fancy a change in their natural fodder.

'Will you do this for me?''Wonder of wonders! Many thanks, my friend. I have a terror of things that creep, and I thought I might awaken one morning to find myself within their terrible nests.'More slaves have disappeared of late. It seems that some mysterious Man has come through the deeper tunnels, and each time takes a few of the hardier slaves away with him. To what fate, no one can tell, but given the laughter of the Orcs and their deference to this figure, it must be an evil one, indeed.The missing prisoners and the Man who took them might be found somewhere in the Orc-mines.

