You should relay the tidings regarding the Dunlendings at Wulf's Cleft to the captain of the Rohirrim outpost.Talk to the Rohirrim-captain in the Heathfells'The force gathering in Wulf's Cleft is no feint. The clans are gathering in force and mean more than to push us from Dunland... they intend to march upon Rohan and likely Edoras itself!

