'I will tell you now, we have not the men or horses here to hold the Ford against half that many. Grimbold must be told, and soon, or we shall find ourselves swept back across the Isen.'You found a heavy, studded collar upon a slain Dunlending war-hound. If the beasts still wear collars as they roam these hills, then their master must be somewhere nearby.The Dunlending Hound-master has set camp somewhere in the Heathfells.

