mplete Slayer of Dunland deedThere is much to do while travelling through the lands of the Great River.Complete Explorer of the Great River deedComplete Quests of the Great River deedComplete Slayer of the Great River deedYou have discovered the entrance to the Instances of IsengardTo earn this deed, you must discover the entrance to the Instances of Isengard.Discover the Ox-clan merchant-camp in Nan Curunír.Grants completion of deed: Discovery: Instances of IsengardBy completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discovery: Instances of Isengard'Now, my little fellows, where be you a-going to, puffing like a bellows? What's the matter here then? Tell me what's your trouble!

