'A spice? What madman created this? It would fell an ox if you could get one to taste it.'A party of Rohirrim have ridden south from the Wold to investigate the massing of the Orcs along the East Wall of Rohan.A band of Rohirrim from the Wold have made camp in the East Wall south-west of the Argonath and the entrance to the Wold, in the stretch of land that leads to the Norcrofts.

