'Be safe, ${PLAYER}!''${PLAYER}, we must run! The Thane is dead, and Langold burns as we speak. Run, run!''We made it out....'After helping out the people in and around Harwick, word has gotten back to Harding of your goodness, and he has called a council to hear of your deeds.Harding holds his council in the upper level of the Mead Hall in Harwick.Speak with HardingHarding holds his council in the upper level of the Mead Hall in Harwick.

