You should speak with a guard outside of the Mead Hall to gain an audience with Harding, Aldor of the Eastemnet.Talk to a guard outside the Mead HallHarwick's Mead Hall can be found atop the tallest hill in town.

The Mead Hall of Harwick is the main gathering area for both the townsfolk and the soldiers. The Hall is off-limits to the townsfolk at the moment while the head soldiers gather for an important discussion.Receive an introduction to Harwick's ThaneCaptain Agelmund, overseer of defences outside of Harwick, is stationed at Feldburg, the largest military fort in the Wold.

You should speak with Captain Agelmund.Talk to Captain Agelmund'Well, it just came to my mind that I cannot keep you here all day, running errands for my horses. You must be welcomed by Harding! He is the Thane of Harwick, Aldor of the Eastemnet, and is a very important man.

'You should seek an audience with Aldor Harding if you wish to stay long in Harwick, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for your help, by the way!''The Thane does not like to be interrupted, but you seem anxious to gain an audience with him. You are the traveller who survived the siege of Langhold, are you not?

