'South of Feldburg is a den of Wargs that have lived there for some time. They have mostly stayed away from the road and travellers, so we left them alone. Lately, though, they have grown far more aggressive.

'As a first trial, you must find and defeat a pack of these hunters.''The hunting packs of Wargs are dangerous on foot or while mounted. Your deed proves that you are rather hardy, if you truly managed to kill one. You are certainly no stranger to combat! I am pleasantly surprised.'Olghakhósh's Easterling snipers are expert marksmen, lethal with a bow and arrow. Their weapons always hit the mark, and many lives were taken by these dangerous foes in the attack on Wakenflood.Easterling snipers can be found in Olghakhósh, the enemy encampment near Wakenflood on the banks of the Anduin.

