You should defeat draugar and collect the relics they carry.Collect relics from Draugar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Céolstan stands in the stables of Harwick.

You should bring the relics to Céolstan.The draugar of Dwolung Hole bear relics upon them that may be of interest to the people of Harwick.'Hm, I do not recognize the symbols on the relics you collected from the draugar. They almost look to be of a Dunlending quality, but I cannot tell for sure. Perhaps that tomb was from before the time of the Rohirrim.

'I will see that these get put in better hands than mine, for I am useless in such matters, but thank you for bringing them to me.'Cíllan is now desperate to come up with a great sum of gold, and thinks of the riches left behing in Langhold which may still be salvaged.The refugees' savings should be somewhere in the ruins of Langhold, as long as they haven't been taken by the enemy.

