'I am glad you came back safe, and more glad you came back victorious! You are quite brave, good ${RACE}.'After the recent attack on Wakenflood, tensions are high at this outpost. The commander wishes to deflect future attacks from Easterlings by ousting the scouts who prowl the bounds.Sergeant Hubyrt can be found at Wakenflood.

