'Yes, we found that boat. Someone went to some trouble to hide it. Isteron said he has never seen a boat like that, but he thinks it must have come from the land of the Elves, up-river. I have no reason to doubt it: it seems like the sort of boat Elves would make.

'Another curiosity: these Elves went to the trouble of hiding their boat, and then must have set off on foot. But they left many of their supplies behind: food, tools, garments, medicines. Why did they leave these items behind? What could compel them to leave such useful items behind? And where did they go?'Draugar have begun to spill from the mouth of a cave near the spot where the salamanders show signs of corruption. The dead should be slain anew, for it is a bad sign when those who have passed walk the earth once more.Draugar have begun to spill from the mouth of a cave near the spot where the salamanders show signs of corruption.Discover the source of corruptionDwolung Hole can be found in the bog west of Harwick where the salamanders grow corrupted.

