'Now with these Easterlings threatening our borders once more, my companions and I seek to warn the Reeves of the Eastemnet of the impending invasion and encourage them to muster for war. Our final destination is, of course, Edoras, but for now we have a task to complete. Perhaps you would be of a mind to lend us your aid?''There is much to tell....''Do you understand now somewhat of the Rohirrim and our mission? We are a close people and do not oft trust outsiders, but you seem a good sort.'Utred has long kept watch against the passage of foes across the ford, and he has asked you to perform a regular patrol of the River Watch forts.The second southernmost watch-tower can be found on the edge of the Great River in the northern Wold, south-east of Langhold.

