'I have not heard from the men there in many days, and I worry that things go badly for them.''I am glad you arrived when you did! I have only enough warriors to keep this post secure, and scout the road area to report back to Captain Agelmund, but we lack the ability to keep the road safe.

'You look hardier than most warriors I see these days. Perhaps you can help keep the road safe by tackling the source of the problems, eh? We have trouble brewing just north of here.'Wódscrafen is full of dead who woke to walk the cold passages of the cave, stirred by some great evil there.Draug can be found in Wódscrafen in the southern Wold, north of Twickenburg.

