feat CinderThe warband leader Cinder and its minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Cinder is defeatedThe warband leader Cinder and its minions have been terrorizing the people of the  Wold, and must be dealt with.Cinder has terrorized the swamps of the Wold for too long, and you brought it to an end. The people of Rohan appreciate your efforts.The warband leader Hanrun and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold and must be dealt with.The warband leader Hanrun and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Find HanrunThe warband leader Hanrun and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Defeat HanrunThe warband leader Hanrun and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Hanrun is defeatedThe warband leader Hanrun and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the  Wold, and must be dealt with.The horrifying tales of the Warg known as Hanrun now have an ending. The people of Rohan appreciate your efforts.The warband leader Urush and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold and must be dealt with.The warband leader Urush and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Find UrushThe warband leader Urush and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Defeat UrushThe warband leader Urush and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the Wold, and must be dealt with.Urush is defeatedThe warband leader Urush and his minions have been terrorizing the people of the  Wold, and must be dealt with.The Wold is safer for travellers now that Urush has been taken care of, thanks to you. The people of Rohan appreciate your efforts.Wódscrafen is full of draug woken from death to walk again and trouble the living. Their tombs should be burned so that they can never wake again after you lay them 