Enswith has described the Orc brute, Gat, and has encouraged you to defeat the Orc, in order to avenge her belated husband.Defeat Gat, the Orc bruteEnswith awaits at her farmstead, north-east of the meadhall of Faldham.Return to Enswith with news of Gat's defeat'Adléod, oh, dear Adléod. He was my husband... killed by Orcs during our walk along the western hillside. He stood alone against them so that I might escape, but now, everything in Faldham reminds me of his tragic death. I cannot bear to stay here much longer.

