ross his path face immense danger.Defeat the láthbear, SwertríperSwertríper, has left the confines of his den in order to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts.Defeat the láthbear, SwertríperThe hulking láthbear, Swertríper, has been put to rest. His deadly claws and menacing teeth will cease to threaten the farmers of the Norcrofts.CompletedThe fearsome láthbear, Swertríper, has left the confines of his den to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts. All who cross his path face immense danger.The hulking láthbear, Swertríper, has been put to rest. His deadly claws and menacing teeth will cease to threaten the farmers of the Norcrofts.Burnoth is discomfited by Reeve Athelward's overly gracious demeanor and apparent disregard for the severity of Rohan's situation.Burnoth is encamped outside the Mead Hall of Cliving.

