'When you have crafted the battle-horns, deliver them to the guards throughout the city, then return to me.''Indeed, I can provide the fastenings you need. If these horns will aid in our defence, I do so gladly!''Ah, thank you, ${PLAYER}. This will see much use during the siege, I am certain.''Thank you, friend... I did not relish standing guard out here with no way of sounding the alarm!''Guarding the outskirts of the city like this with no battle-horn was a frightening thought... my thanks!''This horn is a great boon, ${PLAYER}. Thank you!''I thought it unwise for Lady Tóla's guard to be without a means for calling for aid. Thank you!''Your assistance has been most welcome, ${PLAYER}! Thank you.'The preparations for the defence of Eaworth have been completed, but all is not well....

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance can only be completed Solo.</rgb>Ingbert stands near Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.

