'Knowing that this danger has subsided, I must now concentrate entirely on the coming siege of Faldham. Praises upon you, ${PLAYER}. You are a worthy ally.'Pleased with your hunting prowess and offering of aurochs-meat, hides, and ivory, Offram has recruited you to perform more tasks.Sacks of flour and vegetables can be found within the Eaworth Vendor Hall.

