Goldwine has asked you to collect ore and wood to craft arms and armour with.Collect Vale-ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect Vale-branches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Goldwine is standing guard near the forge in Eaworth, south of the cliffs and marsh, in the Entwash Vale.

