'Enter Thrug-unur and deal with the captain of the goblins, Zân... cut the head from the serpent, and the body will die. Return to me when the deed is done.''Ah, you have proven every bit as valuable as I believed you would. Well done, ${PLAYER}. I have one more task for you, and it is one that will win you great favour with the Rohirrim....'The Ent Baillas was concerned for the injured man who passed him by, but has not the energy to wake from his treeish slumber.Baillas is near the centre of Fangorn's eaves.

