You smell smoke here and see the orange glow of fire. It is not hard to guess why this Ent may be angry.The Huorn makes no move to attack you, but regards you with interest. It is likely that you and it have the same goals, for now.Tracks led from Éomer's Vengeance into the Forest of Fangorn, and you should do what you can to follow them.There is a camp of Orcs beneath the Eaves of Fangorn, north of Éomer's Vengeance.

