You feel concerned for him as well, for you know these folk to be generally good sorts. Surely he will need assistance if he is to survive in this particularly wild forest.Baillas's memory has ended; you must clear your head and return to reality.Gandalf wishes to speak with you atop Treebeard's Hill.Gandalf wishes to speak with you.Talk to GandalfThe hobbits are upon Treebeard's Hill.Observe the fate of the two hobbitsGandalf is on Treebeard's Hill.Talk to GandalfGandalf is on Treebeard's Hill.Listen to GandalfGandalf is at Treebeard's Hill in Fangorn.Talk to Gandalf'I think I have told you enough, without telling you too much. Let us return to the present.''Let me share some of my knowledge with you, ${PLAYER}, for I believe that you came to this place tracking two old friends. They are friends to me also, and I know what became of them.

