Indeed, it still looks restless, despite being free of its bonds. You fear that it feels the same sense of dread that you feel while standing on the foot of this foreboding stair....Gandalf the White wishes to speak with you about the current state of Fangorn, and the role that you might have in stirring the air at last.Gandalf is on Treebeard's Hill in Fangorn.

