You should investigate what lies atop the stairs, for you suspect a significant spider problem in this area. It appears that these foes are spilling out of their nest.You have squashed many of the swarming spiderlings in the Silkenhold of Fangorn. The trees in this choked part of the forest may rest assured that the promise of future evil has been somewhat lessened.Spiders of Fangorn are clearly no better than spiders anywhere in Middle-earth. They are evil, and must be slain at any cost.Fangorn Spinners can be found in the Silkenhold of Fangorn, far in the north of the forest's eaves.

