You gaze bemused at this quiet creature's eyes, and soon strange thoughts begin to seep into your mind.You have the sensation of recalling a memory that is not your own....You believe you understand what just happened: you were given a memory from deep within the eyes of the Ent, something he saw that he wants to know about.

This Ent has grown too sleepy, too tree-ish to solve the riddle of this memory. Will you help him?The Rohirrim limped off towards the north-west. Surely with his injuries so severe, he left a visible tread upon the spongy earth.The Rohirrim limped off to the north-west, moving deeper into the Eaves of Fangorn.

