You should speak with Béortnoth regarding the last attack on Thornhope.Talk to Thane Béortnoth outside Thornhope'Ah, ${PLAYER}. Sanity returns to me -- or so it seems to me, at least -- but I cannot rest until the filthy Orcs are driven from my home. You have been of great aid thus far...will you join us once again?

