Agelric can be found in central Garsfeld.Talk to Agelric'Ho, traveller. I am Agelric and until recently, I was a respectable crofter....

'Have you heard that flapping -- that infernal cawing on our fields? I thought the half-orcs were bad, but even they do not peck at our wounds! Those dark birds have come to strip away all that is left of our crops! Even the scarecrows have been torn asunder.

'I have an idea, though. Those birds aren't too bright... will you go out to the crofts and fool them? Hold as still as a scarecrow, and when they come to peck at you, you can solve our problem in your own way....

'Yes, let me know if this works!''Ho-ho! It worked? Those wretched birds got what they had coming, I say!

Thank you for your aid... maybe now some of my crops will actually make it to the next harvest!'Gísil does not want to risk causing panic should his plan be revealed before the proper time, and thus has asked you to be discreet.Gísil and Gísling can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld. Langar can be found in west Garsfeld.

