'I will be waiting... and please, this would mean so much to me. You will be rewarded in kind.''Oh, thank you, thank you! I cannot tell you how much this means to me. The guards look at me as though I am crazy, but you... you trusted in the importance of my request! I fear what would have happened had you not aided me.

