You should return to Gísil with news of your success.Talk to Gísil at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld'${PLAYER}, the time has come to bring the fight to these half-orcs. We cannot allow them and the Orcs to unite against us in any coordinated fashion. We have struggled hard to hold against the half-orcs alone and would surely fall if they banded together.

'Travel to their camp and destroy their banners -- show them that such evil will never control even the smallest part of Rohan!''Good! Those half-orcs will pay for giving us so much trouble. The loss of their banners will symbolize what little stake they will continue to have in our lands.

