'Go to them and learn their opinions, then we shall speak again.''Gísil wishes to know my thoughts? Then he shall have them!

'Garsfeld will fall... our foes are too numerous, and no aid comes for us from the Reeve. We should flee to Snowbourn while we still can!''I will tell you what action should be taken: we should slaughter our foes, every last one.

