Gísil is inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.Talk to Gísil'It is no secret that Garsfeld has fallen on the very worst of times, ${PLAYER}. For my own part, I have struggled to keep the crofters from the enemies at our doorstep, and more importantly, from the panic that they are surely feeling.

'My son, Gísling, has taken a more active role in moving against our foes, but we fight a losing battle.

