You want nothing more than to help this lonely Ent be free from the pain of watching his trees turn so evil.Fastred wants you to arm the crofters of Snowbourn in preparation for what he believes will be a substantial assault on the settlement.Extra arms and armour can be found scattered throughout Snowbourn and inside the Snowbourn barracks.Gather extra blades of the Rohirrim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gather helms of the Rohirrim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Having collected arms and armour, you should now distribute it to the crofters of Snowbourn. The crofters can be found throughout the settlement.Fastred can be found in the mead-hall of Snowbourn.'Sigeric... even the name disgusts me.

