'In the meantime, I want the people of Snowbourn prepared for battle. We know not the force we face, and must make ready for anything.

'Gather arms and armour from the blacksmith and about Snowbourn. Outfit the people, and then return to me. We must have everyone involved - we cannot risk defeat, not here at the edge of the Westemnet...''They are outfitted, then?

