on'Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Radanir and the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Radanir and the Grey Company in Dunland.As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company in the time since you left them.Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halros and the Grey Company.Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Halros's Watch'Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Halros and the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Halros and the Grey Company in Dunland.As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen Halros in the weeks since he elected to remain behind, in the Shire.Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halros and the Shire.Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Halros's Watch'Your eye is drawn west and north across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the pastoral quiet of the Shire. You wonder what has become of Halros since he elected to remain behind and watch the borders of that land.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Halros and the Shire.As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Calenglad and the Grey Company.Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Calenglad's Appeal'Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Calenglad and the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Calenglad and the Grey Company.As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Golodir and the Grey Company.Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Pit of the Falcon'Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the rocky hills of Dunland. You wonder what has become of Golodir and the Grey Company since you left them.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Golodir and the Grey Company.As you study the contours of Gléowine's map, your mind is drawn to wonder what has befallen Lothrandir in the prisons of Orthanc.Your mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Lothrandir, still a captive of Saruman.Study Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Strength of Will'Your eye is drawn west across the map, beyond the borders of Rohan, and comes to rest upon the cruel circle of Isengard. You wonder what has become of Lothrandir within the prisons of Saruman.Your mind wanders as you contemplate the fate of Lothrandir in his captivity.With the attack on Scylfig over and many, many great losses counted, the survivors must begin to break the ice and recover from their grief.Cyneberg, stricken by grief from the loss of her father and Thrymm, has asked you to leave her alone.

