'Dunfast has no Thane, no lords, no nobles, no great warriors to draw the enemy, yet something happened here. Our search for the people has been in vain thus far, but perhaps we can learn more of what happened to them.''Núrzum takes delight in chaos and despair. He came here not to hunt these people, but to terrify them.

