ir, queen of the Great Spiders of Mirkwood, has established a nest in the heart of the Scuttledells, where she is breeding an army to answer the call of Sauron.You must burn all the cocoons and webs within Dígelir's nest before defeating Dígelir herself.Complete the quest Webs of the Scuttledells -- ChallengeThe stone-giant Helf has stolen the egg of a Great Eagle. He has retreated back to the safety of his mountain home upon Iorbar's Peak, where he plans to make the egg into his next meal.Complete the deed The Stone-giant's DemiseComplete the deed Helf's DownfallComplete the deed Saviour of the Eagle EggSlaughter Champions in the War.Slaughter Champions in the WarSlaughter Champions in the War.Complete the previous deed tier.Slaughter Champions in the WarSlaughter Champions in the War.Complete the previous deed tier.Slaughter Champions in the WarSlaughter Champions in the War.Complete the previous deed tier.Slaughter Champions in the WarSlaughter Champions in the War.Complete the previous deed tier.Slaughter Champions in the WarA fierce barghest named Clampjaw is near....Clampjaw stalks the frozen ponds in the northern Writhendowns.

