Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that the Dwergfant is fully functional again.Talk to Aldbéort'I have reports that the Limlight is beginning to have a distinctive odour. We have seen this before. The mechanisms within the Dwergfant have become damaged or impeded. They must be cleared before the river is truly fouled.

'Head to the Dwergfant, discover what is broken with the mechanisms, and get them up and running again.''Shall we set off to the Dwergfant?'

<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'The water is already clearing up along the river. No doubt we shall have to return, but for today, the work is done.'Avanc and toads are polluting the Dwergfant.Avanc and toads can be found at Dwergfant.

