Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the avanc and toad population in the Dwergfant has been thinned.Talk to Aldbéort'The waters of the Dwergfant flow into the Limlight, then down through Stangard and into the Great River. Scouts have reported seeing creatures living within the ancient dwarf-structure: avanc and toads.

