Wulfin has asked you to venture within Gerngath and return with several books documenting the history of the Rohirrim.Collect Rohirric books in Gerngarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Wulfin is at Harwick.

Wulfin will be pleased to see you recovered several Rohirric books from Gerngath.Talk to Wulfin'Knowing where you came from, what your family did, how your ancestors honoured their name, and who laid their lives down for King and country is as important as knowing what tomorrow brings. It tells us who we are and who we should strive to be. It tells us how to approach tomorrow.

'Our tales are written in volumes kept within an old ruin called Gerngath. The place is now being searched and looted by Easterlings. I ask you to please venture within and bring back the tales of our fathers.''When you are ready to make the journey I can show you where Gerngath lies.'

<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'There are many more remaining, but even these few preserve a great deal of our history.'Easterlings are searching through Gerngarth for ancient Rohirric texts.Easterlings and trolls can be found in Gerngarth.

Wulfin asked you to venture to Gerngarth and defeat the Easterlings pillaging the ancient library.Defeat trolls and Easterlings in Gerngarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Wulfin can be found in Harwick.

Wulfin will want to hear the library of Gerngarth is secure.Talk to Wulfin'The Easterlings are a formidable foe that has long troubled us. No matter how many defeats we deliver upon them they keep returning to the field of battle. Now, they search Gerngarth for an edge in that battle. They reason that if they learn our past, they will be able to predict our responses.

'We cannot give them this opportunity. Go to Gerngarth and drive the Easterlings from the ancient library. Be wary, though, they may have trolls with them.''Are you ready to visit the ancient library of Gerngarth?'

<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'More will come, but for now our ways and history are safe.'The iron being mined at Ghâmpronk can be used to make needed weapons and armour.Iron can be mined at Ghâmpronk.

