Waldeg will be pleased to begin making weapons and armour with the iron from Ghâmpronk.Talk to Waldeg'Every day, new warriors take up the fight to defend our lands. In order to fight, they each need their own weapons and armour; otherwise, the battle is short and unsatisfying in its results.

'The goblins have primed a mine for us across the river, at Ghâmpronk. Bring this pick, head to the mine, and gather what iron you can scavenge.''Let me know when you are ready to get your hands dirty at Ghâmpronk.'

<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'This iron will allow us to outfit many new warriors.'The goblins have flattened a hill in their search for iron.Goblins and trolls can be found at Ghâmpronk.

