'Head across the river and defeat the goblins and trolls mining within Ghâmpronk.''Are you ready to venture across the river to Ghâmpronk?'

<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'The goblins will come back, but even a few days without mining means a lot more weapons the Enemy will not have.'Only by completing the tasks assigned to you by Soldier Falturx and Nartul, can you earn the favour of War-tyrant Akúlhun.Complete missions for Uglash.Report to Dâr-gazag, maggotInto the GrimwoodGet to Grothum, maggotReport to LugazagTo Tírith RhawTo Tol AscarnenSpeak with War-tyrant Akúlhun at Gramsfoot.

