In the wake of seeing so many steeds slain, Winsig hopes to protect any that remain alive.Follow Winsig to the second stableThe second stable lies to the south of the Mead Hall of Walstow.

Winsig requires your aid in defending the stable from the vicious assault of the Orcs.Defend the second stable of WalstowThe bridge of Walstow passes through the middle of the town.

While you defeated the Orcs at the second stable, the rest of the town has burst into flame. Winsig desires to reunite with her men and put out the fires.Cross the bridge with WinsigGadhumúrz stands just beyond the bridge of Walstow.

