Most of the residents cannot remember the snow in Forlaw ever being quite this bad.Remove snow piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Cuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.Speak to CuthmarFence posts can be found scattered around the western side of Forlaw.Pick up fence posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Cuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.'After the funeral today, most of Gárwig's family will have a hard time getting back to the way things were, though for some that may take a long time. Please check on the orphans; Ansith and Cuthmar. They are cared for by Ebba and can usually be found in Gárferth's house.''Ah, did Ansith send you to help? Thank you for helping us remove these snow piles! They build up fast these days. It seems like the wind blows them right back as I turn around to remove the next. 

