'The champions of Dol Guldur must be defeated at once...if we can make a good show of our strength, it may be that the hearts of their warriors will falter, and many will turn aside from the battle.

'Enter Sâd-en-Dagor in Dol Guldur, north-east from Helethir, and challenge the champions Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr. Make haste!''Defeating all three champions at once is not a task for just any ${CLASS}. But I feel you are ready for the test, ${PLAYER}.''${PLAYER} has returned!

