o earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Ornate Sword Sheaths from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect ripped cloaks. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire ripped cloaks.Wanted: Ripped Cloaks from the Wildermore region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Ripped Cloaks from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect slimy filth. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire slimy filth.Wanted: Slimy Filth from the Wildermore region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Slimy Filth from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect tattered skins. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire tattered skins.Wanted: Tattered Skins from the Wildermore region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Tattered Skins from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect unkempt furs. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire unkempt furs.Wanted: Unkempt Furs from the Wildermore region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Unkempt Furs from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect weathered beaks. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire weathered beaks.Wanted: Weathered Beaks from the Wildermore region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Wildermore.Wanted: Weathered Beaks from the Wildermore region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Gárnoth's Farm was one of the more productive farms in the Fallows, but was recently abandoned. Cyneberg scouted the farm and saw many Orcs carrying arrows, and with Forlaw's defenders running low on supplies, this would be a good opportunity to help secure the area and resupply the guards.Gárnoth's Farm is to the south of Forlaw. A little down the road past the south gate of Forlaw is a path to the right that leads to this farm.Collect arrows from White Hand Orcs (0/8)Orcs seem to have recently captured Gárnoth's Farm. Most of the Orcs appear to carry arrows on them, and collecting arrows for Forlaw's defences should be a priority.Collect arrows from White Hand Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Cyneberg is keeping Gárwig company in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw.There are many White Hand troops occupying this farm. These troops are in a prime location to assault Forlaw and are a threat to anyone on the plains of the Fallows. 

