<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'Very good. We are not making many boats these days, but the Orcs do not like when our arrows burn.'Drakelings and bats have settled in the remains of Sâd Torech.Drakelings and bats can be found at Sâd Torech.

