You have gathered the whips and should now anchor them to the bases of nearby White Hand banners.Tie whips to White Hand banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have successfully tripped numerous Warg-riders of the White Hand.CompletedCruel whips wielded by the White Hand could better serve the people of Wildermore by sweeping Warg-riders off their mounts. If you were to gather their whips, and tie them along the bases of nearby banners, it is possible the vile riders would not notice until far too late and be heaved onto the hard ice below.You have cleverly employed the enemy's cruel implements against their riders. The White Hand will be slowed in their advance into Wildermore, lest more of them meet their end on the forest's icy floor.You are adding tents for the Men of the SutcroftsComplete Sutcrofts Tents: RebuildComplete Sutcrofts Tents: Enhancements IComplete Sutcrofts Tents: Enhancements IIComplete Sutcrofts Tents: InhabitantsThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'While a tent is not a house, there are still some things that can be done to add some comfort and turn it into a home. Beds, tables, camp-fires, and stools are among the things that we can add to help return a semblance of normalcy to people's lives.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'While a tent is not a house, there are still some things that can be done to add some comfort and turn it into a home. Beds, tables, camp-fires, and stools are among the things that we can add to help return a semblance of normalcy to people's lives.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'The tents have been fully prepared and made ready for the people of the Sutcrofts to come and join your town as inhabitants and not just visitors. They will add a breath of fresh air and new life to Hytbold. Those coming are a varied sort: women, children, warriors, and craftsmen. All have been displaced by the Enemy, and all will now call this place home.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'There are many across the Sutcrofts who have been left homeless by the constant raids and assaults. These people have valuable skills and would be a good addition to our developing town. Not to mention, they need a new place to call home, and we do not leave our countrymen behind. We should begin to set up and prepare some tents to provide these people a place to live.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'A skilled tailor such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by stitching warm blankets for them.Hildelith has given you a recipe for fur blankets.

