'The goats and blood-fish can be found among the willows along a section of the Entwash south-west of Walstow. Make sure that the waters you jump into are shallow and stagnant... the river's current will carry the scent away too quickly, otherwise.'

<rgb=#FF0000>The Fishing Hobby is required to complete this quest</rgb>'This is a very large one! Well done, ${PLAYER}. I can make stew for a week with just this one fish.'Upon your return to Snowbourn, you learned that Fastred discovered that his son has been taken by an unknown force. Meanwhile, you now know that Walstow faces a full-scale assault.Fastred is inside his home in Snowbourn.

Despite Cynelac's warnings, you should warn Fastred of the impending attack on Walstow.Find Fastred in his homeFastred can be found inside his home in Snowbourn.

