'In order to call him forth, you'll need to open my casket, which is deep within the crypt.''Thank you for freeing me. I am no longer bound to this place, therefore I will not be a nuisance to anyone. Best of luck along your journey.'Thrymm is concerned about the looming Orc-attack aimed at Scylfig, and plans to ready the town for a violent assault.Thane Cynegar resides in the town of Scylfig in the northern Writhendowns.

