'Scylfig is the nearest town, and we should hurry there to brace for an Orc attack. Once that danger passes, let us ride in haste for Forlaw to warn the Reeve.'You are upgrading the East Gate of the townComplete The East Gate: RebuildComplete The East Gate: Enhancements IComplete The East Gate: Enhancements IIComplete The East Gate: DefendersThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'The East Gate is fully rebuilt and ready to be manned. It is a dangerous post, looking out into the hills of the East Wall, and one we will want well-guarded, for it is surely where the Enemy will march from. Brave warriors will be needed to stand guard.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'The East Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'The East Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'Hytbold only has two gates: one in the east and one in the west. Both of the gates still stand, but the timbers are burnt out and would not hold against any concerted assault. The East Gate must be replaced and rebuilt if we are to have any security.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'The traps that the Orcs have laid throughout Fangorn are catching small squirrels and foxes.Traps can be found within the Entwalk.

