rn Ice-spiresDiscover the Ice-spires at DunfastDiscover Núrzum's WrathThe Rohirrim have a race course that loops out from Cliving, up into the southern Wold, then down again and follows a road back into the city.You have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Enter the first gateYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the second gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have been challenged to race a course on your steed.Ride through the next gateDo not allow time to expireYou have