rk to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.'A true smith will tell you that the forge is nearly as important as the smith working it. If we are to make the highest and best quality weapons and armour, we need a superior forge for the crafstmen to work with.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'The snows have begun again in Byre Tor...a fierce storm, which likely means one thing. Núrzum is near.Strange weather has cropped up in Byre Tor.

