<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>'Thank you for your efforts at cleaning up after the Uruks, ${PLAYER}.'Uruk-hai riders have been seen at Thrymm's Farm in the Fallows, leaderless without Núrzum, but nonetheless bent on wreaking destruction upon the lands of Wildermore.Thrymm's Farm can be reached by speaking with Dudoc to travel there.

