The forces of Isengard -- Núrzum especially -- must pay for what they have done.'Don't ye come any closer! Stay back!' The woman relaxes when she realizes that you are not an enemy.

'Yes, we escaped Byre Tor. We make north to cross the river into Eorlsmead.

