You should return to Burnoth and let him know that you have done as he has asked.Talk to Burnoth'Ah, ${PLAYER}, I see that you arrived before us. We were delayed as we rode from Entwash Vale; however, that may prove a boon. Had we delivered our warning regarding the Easterlings in the north, Théoden King may have been distracted from the greater threat: Saruman.

'We understand that he has ridden forth to the Fords of Isen...we make ready to follow behind. Would you aid us in our preparations? There is little time, and much to do. We need provisions and medicine for the journey...would you seek these things throughout the city and bring them here to me? We need dried meat, vegetables, water, medicine, and bandages.''Aye, this will do, my friend. There is still much to be done, however. You should speak with Hutha, Ulf, and Léofdag and see what tasks they might have for you.''Our preparations are complete, thanks to you. Will you come with us to the Fords?

'Ah, but nay...you have your own tasks to be about...perhaps we will meet again, provided we survive the confrontation with Saruman.

