n. Not to mention, they need a new place to call home, and we do not leave our countrymen behind. We should begin to set up and prepare some tents to provide these people a place to live.''Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'Defeat wolves in Western Rohan.Defeat wolves in the WestemnetDefeat wolves in Western Rohan.Defeat wolves in the WestemnetDefeat many wood-trolls in Wildermore.Defeat many wood-trolls in Wildermore.Defeat Wood-trolls in WildermoreDefeat many wood-trolls in Wildermore.Defeat many wood-trolls in Wildermore.Defeat Wood-trolls in WildermoreA skilled woodworker such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by crafting a long-burning torch for them.Hildelith has given you a recipe for a long-burning torch.

