'We met with no resistance on our journey, and I believe I have you to thank for that.

'I would like to speak with you in private. The people will manage on their own for now, I am certain.''Are you ready to venture into the Dimholt, ${PLAYER}?''The Orcs are vanquished, and my people are safe. Those Orcs knew not the warriors they faced! 

'Dunharrow shall once again be a haven for the people of Rohan, and my people will remain free of the Enemy's grip.

'Let us not tarry long here, ${PLAYER}, for this place fills me with dread.'After sending his people to safety, Thane Mágla remains behind to defend Middlemead from the White Hand.Thane Mágla is sitting at his table.

