'The road to the south will lead my people to Aldburg, but our foes lurk too near. The Uruks that stalk the fields of Kingstead have done much to harry my people and have been so bold as to attack Entwade itself several times in the past weeks. Now, I have heard talk that they ride along the road to the south and slay passers-by before claiming their goods.

'My people and my wife cannot meet such a fate, ${PLAYER}. Ride against them and clear the road so that my people may pass unfettered when the time comes.''You bear the telling marks of a skirmish, ${PLAYER}. I trust it is done then.

'The Uruks have been fighting with great tenacity as of late, so I am glad that their riders along the road have been quelled.'Agelman hopes to return Léoflad to Edric's side and persuade the Thane not to abandon his charge in the wake of such a tragedy.The horses can be found near the farmhouse at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead.

