'Poor Léoflad, I have known her since she was but a girl.... She was trained well in the art of sword-play, and I grieve that she did not remain at the Wade to aid us. And now... I fear for Edric, truly I do. Such a loss would break the strongest man. Were there only more time to mourn....

'I will prepare dear Léoflad for travel, and I shall bear her to the Wade with haste. Prepare a steed, ${PLAYER}, and leave the rest to me.''Well done, ${PLAYER}. Now then, allow me to ready Léoflad for her final journey.

'Such a brave Woman....'Éowyn seeks to ready her people to travel south to Dunharrow, but the path through the Harrowdale must be prepared before their travels can begin.Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in the Harrowdale.

