'You have a steed, aye? Well then, ride after them!'

Smála looks around, trying to catch the eye of the other farmhands.

'Brothers, we have not the time for this!''Ah, I mean not to be curt, but many things must be set in order before my fellows and I ride to Edoras at Éowyn's request.

