<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Edoras quests must be completed before the Evacuation of Edoras takes place.</rgb>'Oh! Is this for us? Thank you so much, kind stranger. I did not know what we would be eating on our journey, and it is a long walk....''Bread? And still hot from the oven, too. It is a great gift that will feed my children when they are hungry. Thank you, stranger!''Is this truly for me? Thank you! I do not remember the last time a stranger has been so kind to me.''What a kind ${RACE} you are! I have no way to repay you for this, but you have a friend in me, always.''What is this? Wayfarer's bread, fresh from the oven? You have eased many cares by putting this gift in my hands, stranger. I cannot thank you enough!'Thanks to you, the hungry townspeople of Edoras now have fresh Wayfarer's Bread to sate their hunger on their journey to Dunharrow.Heartbroken to learn the last of his council was slain, Thane Mágla wishes to sit amongst his men once more before the war's end.Thane Mágla's home can be found directly to the south-east of the Mead Hall in Middlemead.

