'${PLAYER}, what I ask of you will put you in great peril, but I am confident that you are up to the task. Scout the camps that the Orcs have established near Aldburg and learn their number.

'There are camps north-west of the city, and rumours of another camp to the south have recently been brought to my attention. Be careful.''It appears that the White Hand number far fewer than the unknown Orcs.

'Let us first focus upon ridding the Eastfold of one threat, then we can deal with the other.

