You have discovered a cave filled with vicious Orcs poised to strike against the Rohirrim. You should defeat many of their number.Defeat Rashat-hai Warriors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat Rashat-hai Black-arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat Rashat-hai Defilers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have defeated a great many Rashat-hai Orcs in Gurz-shâpol.CompletedYou have discovered an expansive cave teeming with Orcs under the White Mountains.  Their numbers are great, and should they remain unchecked, the Orcs could easily overwhelm the defenceless at Underharrow. For the safety of the Harrowdale and Edoras itself, the Orcs must be defeated.The Orcs of the White Mountains have long harried the Rohirrim, and through your efforts, you have protected Underharrow and Edoras from their impending assault.While investigating the rumour of a monstrous boar, you are certain to encounter many boars of a usual size. They are no more than a nuisance and should be easily defeated.The Eastfold is teeming with dangerous boars. By hunting them, you will be providing a service to its inhabitants.Defeat boarsThe Eastfold is teeming with dangerous boars. By defeating them, you will be providing a service to its inhabitants.Defeat boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You hunted many boars while following the trail of one monstrous boar, and the Eastfold is better for it.CompletedWhile following the rumour of a monstrous boar, you are certain to encounter many boars of a usual size. They are no more than a nuisance and should be easily defeated.You hunted many boars while following the trail of one monstrous boar, and the Eastfold is better for it.While in the Boar-tribe Orc-camp, defeat as many of them as possible.The Boar-tribe Orcs are unpredictable and dangerous. Defeat as many of them as possible.Defeat Boar-tribe OrcsThe Boar-tribe Orcs are unpredictable and dangerous. Defeat as many of them as possible.Defeat Boar-tribe Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Several Boar-tribe Orcs were defeated, making travel through their camp a little less dangerous.CompletedThe Boar-tribe Orcs are unpredictable and dangerous. Defeat as many of them as possible.Several Boar-tribe Orcs were defeated, making travel through their camp a little less dangerous.Upon arriving in Aldburg and speaking with Thane Arcil, he recommends exploring Aldburg to learn more about the former capital of Rohan and to speak with some of its inhabitants in the process.Arcil suggested that you explore the former capital city of Rohan, Aldburg and learn something of its history.

You should seek out Éothain and speak with him first.Talk to ÉothainThe training hall is in the eastern part of Aldburg.

