You should return to Arcil and let him know what you found in the woods.Talk to Arcil'I would normally not concern myself with rumours, but this one weighs heavily upon my mind. There is tell of a monstrous boar wandering the woods. I cannot help but think of the Boar of Everholt, which defeated Folca King all those years ago.

'I do not have the time to chase rumours, but I would appreciate if you could look into this for me. Such a beast would be a dangerous thing. Let us hope that these are simply rumours....''I must admit that I am relieved it was not a great boar. I was raised learning the bravery of Folca King, and I confess that if the Boar of Everholt was able to best one of Rohan's greatest warriors, I feared for myself and others.

'However, the fact that this totem was meant to frighten us is a little concerning. With the crude construction, it is possible some children made it as a jest. Let us hope that is the truth of it.'Éowyn, Mágla, and Ellen Fremedon have made their preparations, and now, they stand ready to guard the people of Kingstead as they travel to Dunharrow.Éowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras.

