'Did you hear that? Just over....

'I heard it with my own two ears, but...I would indeed feel better if someone else would speak with it, as well. Would you speak with the mouse? Or was it an Orc? Oh, yes, the crow.''Get away from us! We only talk to one man and you are not him!

'Go away!''How did you know it was me? I have been fooling that mad old man for weeks now!

'Please do not tell anyone. I will be in terrible trouble. I will stop pestering Bertred...I promise.''It was a boy? I was talking with a boy and not a crow? I do not believe you! I will have to talk this over with my friend, the Orc-mouse, to see what he thinks.

'Or was it a crow?

