old.A descendant of the Boar of Everholt and its minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.A descendant of the Boar of Everholt and its minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Defeat the scion of the Great BoarA descendant of the Boar of Everholt and its minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Defeat the scion of the Great BoarA descendant of the Boar of Everholt and its minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.CompletedA descendant of the Boar of Everholt and its minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.The scion of the Great Boar has been defeated, ending the violent bloodline that once claimed Folca King's life.Snapfang and his minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Snapfang and his minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Defeat SnapfangSnapfang and his minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Defeat SnapfangSnapfang and his minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.CompletedSnapfang and his minions have been terrorizing the inhabitants of the Eastfold and must be dealt with.Snapfang and his minions have been defeated.Éomer has been released from the prison at Edoras, where he had been unjustly sent by Gríma Wormtongue.Aldburg is south-east of Edoras, nestled near the White Mountains.

