Thane Cútha told you to return to Aldburg and speak with Thane Arcil.Talk to Arcil'I know that you have already been to Aldburg and assisted them there, but I think you should return to Arcil and let him know of your victory here today.

'I am certain that he would be pleased to learn that the Boar-tribe Orcs no longer pose a threat.''${PLAYER}, it is good to see you again! The Boar-tribe Orcs have been defeated you say?

'You are modest, but I doubt not that you had a hand in their defeat. There may be some stragglers still about, but with their chieftain defeated, they will not prove much of a threat.

