During the battle, you suffered severe wounds and now fight to retain consciousness.Do not succumb to the wounds suffered during the battle'I think that I have spoken enough for one night, ${PLAYER}.'You have found Burg-shápol, a cave in the Everholt where the missing craftsmen may be found.Horn is inside Burg-shápol, the cave in the Everholt where the missing craftsmen might be found.Talk to Horn in Burg-shápolHorn is in the tunnels of Burg-shápol.Talk to Horn in Burg-shápolHorn has stayed behind to delay the approach of the following Orcs, while you search the tunnels of Burg-shápol for the missing craftsmen.You have found Nona and Corudan in the depths of Burg-shápol.Talk to Nona in Burg-shápolCorudan is in the depths of Burg-shápol.Talk to Corudan in Burg-shápolMany Orcs have returned to Burg-shápol, and you must defeat them!Survive the return of the Orcs to Burg-shápol'This was a pleasant surprise, ${PLAYER}! Now let us return to town and see what tale Nona and Corudan have to share!''I hear Orcs approaching, ${PLAYER}, not from ahead of us but from behind!

'I will stay here to delay their approach, but you should press on into the cave to see what has become of the missing craftsmen. Perhaps one of them has escaped and we have him to thank for the dead Orcs we have seen already, but even so they are all likely still in danger. Go, and quickly!''I will tell you the story of how Corudan and I came to be here, ${PLAYER}, but not just now. Let the tale wait until we are in the sunlight again. We have slain many Orcs to free these people, but the woods crawled with more of their kind and we should not tarry here.

'Is Horn here with you?''It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. We thought to find you in Edoras, but on the way we found an overturned waggon and sign of struggle, and thought to look for these folk. I am glad we did, for today we have saved some lives. These Orcs were ferocious. It is fortunate that most of the creatures were away when Nona and I entered the cave.'The lumber-yard has been saved, but the Orc-problem remains a growing concern.Thane Sparhafoc is at Fenmarch, east of the lumber-yard.

Guthláf stayed behind to assist in the cleaning efforts at the lumber yard, but asked to have a message relayed to his father, Thane Sparhafoc.Travel to FenmarchThane Sparhafoc is in the Mead Hall, in the eastern part of Fenmarch.

Guthláf asked you to inform his father, Thane Sparhafoc, about the troubles at the lumber-yard.Talk to Thane Sparhafoc'Allow me to worry about the lumber-yard, ${PLAYER}. I ask that you travel to Fenmarch and inform my father of what has happened here.

'If these Orcs were also seen near Aldburg, I fear that we may have a much larger problem than we originally thought.

'Take the road east to Fenmarch and seek out my father, Thane Sparhafoc.''It's so calm and beautiful here.''It's so calm and beautiful here.''You assisted my son in driving the Orcs from the lumber-yard? Thank you.

'It appears that we have a problem which needs solving. There are other pressing matters here in Fenmarch which I struggle with.

