'The best course of action might be to ask others if they might have seen any evidence of an Orc-camp.

'Talk to the people of Fenmarch to see if we can find any evidence towards locating these Orcs.''Orcs? Nay, I thankfully have not seen any near this place. 

'Although, I was recently picking flowers and saw a great frog! It leaped at me, and I thought that I was soon to perish!''I have seen no Orcs, but I did see Meregyth run past earlier. She looked quite upset...I hope that she is well, for she is a very lovely young lady.

'You might want to seek out Tova, though...I heard her talking about a giant boar. That may be of more concern than any Orc.''This is interesting. I do not know whether there is a connexion, but it is worth looking into.

'This totem could have been made as a jest, or there could be something more malevolent behind it.''We do not see much turmoil here, but I imagine that Orcs do not consider marsh-land to be of great advantage.

'I do not mean to be short with you, but I have much to do. These chickens keep me busy!''It was not a giant boar...at least not one that is still alive. I was out for a walk, clearing my head, and nearly stumbled over it!

