You were able to find Drytwald's ring near one of the haystacks and should return it to Drytwald.Talk to Drytwald'She is going to do away with me! I cannot find my ring anywhere. I have been delivering hay for many summers and have never lost it. I wager it is near one of the haystacks...but which one?

'I must begin preparing dinner. If I do not, I will be in even more trouble than I already am.

'It must be at one of the haystacks that I delivered today. It should not be too difficult to find. Could you please search for my ring?''You found it? I knew I could rely upon you. I hope it was not too difficult to find.

