You should bring the water to Thane Ordlac.'Take the children from here and summon someone to care for Fríthild's body.''Hail, ${PLAYER}! I am pleased that you were able to join us for this feast. While I remain uneasy about the outcome, I find that I am able to -- for the moment -- put aside my worries. You and Ordlac have my gratitude for this respite.

'Please, join the festivities!''Ah, ${PLAYER}...go fetch some water from the table over there.''Alas, my friend, it is too late. Fríthild has gone from us. Fríthbert is now Reeve of the Broadacres....'Reeve Fríthild has chosen to take to the field against the Warg-riders at Baldmund's recommendation.You should speak with Reeve Fríthild.Talk to Reeve FríthildDefeat the Warg-riders terrorizing the eastern fields of the Broadacres.Defeat the Warg-ridersYou should speak with Reeve Fríthild.Talk to Reeve Fríthild'Come, ${PLAYER}. Let us depart from this bloody field.''Let us to arms, friends! These goblin-vermin shall feel the wrath of the Riders!''The foe is fallen, but at what cost? Alas for poor Baldmund!'You have come to Reeve Fríthild's house to honour her before her children.Thane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies.

