'A bed has been made for him in the Mead Hall, in the centre of town.''Ah, a ${CLASS} has come to our aid....'

Thane Léoferth abruptly starts a terrible coughing fit. He clears his throat to try again.

'It is good to see more aid for this fair town. I want so much to see the sun again and feel a sword in my hand, but fate has me trapped in this broken body....'

He gets caught in another coughing fit but recovers quickly.

'I hope you can help us. The White Hand is relentless, but our stand here will not break.''He is weak, and talking tends to send him into fits of coughing. Do not fret, he will fight through this fit like the others. Meeting you seemed to raise his spirits, which has been hard to do of late. I try to keep him comfortable, but there is not much I can do for him. 

'I need to get him ready to eat shortly. Would you mind taking these dishes to the cook to be washed?''There are more dishes? If there were men to spare, the first thing I would request is help with all these dishes! I should be focused on keeping bellies full.'The White Hand army within Madh-fushaum is comprised of mostly Orcs, Uruk-hai, and Dunlendings. Each force is led by a captain of their own kind.There are captains among the White Hand army inside Madh-fushaum.

