'It is up to us to act. The time has come to gather Nothmar and Gifemund's men. We must confront our foe.''Aye, we are ready. We have rested from our journey from Gapholt, and are ready for a fierce battle that is surely ahead of us.''It is good to see you have returned, ${PLAYER}. My men have gathered, and we are prepared.'You have a strong sense that whoever rode down these innocent people is still nearby. This massacre is fresh, and the murderers cannot be far.The attackers of the refugees can be summoned by examining the remains of the poor beast that led the cart.

