'South and east, across the Hoardale River, you will find a swath of land called Hithlad. A forest ripe for harvesting covers the land there. It is called the Grimwood. We found rat-folk working there and drove them out, only to have the enemy come to their defence.

'You must scout through the wood and find the camp so you know where the battles will be fought in that wood. Return to me only when you discover this location!''My ire rises each time I see your face, worm. Let us be certain of one thing: you do as I say, and you live. Press me, and I will slaughter you. Find the Grimwood and return to me only after you know the location of the camp.''Favour earned! Not for you, of course... you've simply been prepared for your future sacrifice for the glory of Angmar, Mordirith, and Lugbúrz!'You have been summoned by the lady Éowyn, for West Gondor is likely in need of your aid.Éowyn can be found in Dunharrow.

