'I wonder where he could be!''Please help my brother!''Fuirion, please tell us what happened to you? Oh, why will you not say? Why will you not look at me?'You hurriedly tell the healer that Fuirion has been grievously wounded, and bleeds alarmingly onto his brother's floor.

