You have rallied an archer to the defence of each of Blackroot Vale's villages and should now report back to Malthellam.Talk to Malthellam'Time grows short, ${PLAYER}... Malthellam must be told at once of the Dead and their new ally.

'The longer we delay, the greater the peril for everyone who dwells in the vale. I know not how many of the Dead have thrown their lot in with this man, and I do not know how best to act against them. I pray that Malthellam can offer some guidance in defending our lands, or I fear all will be lost....

'Go now! Seek out Malthellam in Morlad, and tell him of what we have learned.''I wish your return to Morlad could have been a merry one, ${PLAYER}... but our future only seems to grow darker with each passing day.

'If this man is the invader from Tarlang's Crown as you believe, I fear he plans to gather the Dead as part of his great army in the south. We cannot allow him to maintain a foothold in the vale, and I will not risk the safety of my people to push him from these lands.

'Gather my archers, and send them to defend Alagrant, Sardol, and Lancrath. Go with haste, ${PLAYER}, for I shall look to you when the time comes!''Very well, the villages shall be protected, but the matter of this man from Tarlang's Crown still looms over us all.

