The inhabitants of Dínadab are suddenly bustling with activity, frightened by the sudden sighting of Corsairs. You should speak with townspeople and see if there is any fact behind this wild claim.'Help, help! Should we evacuate? Where can we go that is safe? The Corsairs will take everything!''I was looking over the ridge to the east, and I saw tents... strange tents! Is it brigands? Someone said it was Corsairs... but that is impossible.''Corsairs! Did you hear? Corsairs have come from Umbar! Does this mean Dol Amroth is fallen? What are we to do? I must hide and lock away all of my things, and I must run! But where shall we go?''I just came here this morning from the town south of here, and I swear to you, I saw them. Corsairs! Hordes of them. Everyone was running, and I hastened here. What are we to do? What if they come here?''I heard rumours, ${PLAYER}. What if there is truth to them? You are a famous adventurer... have you ever encountered Corsairs in your travels? Are you going to protect us?''Why would he leave in his state?''Why, why is he doing this? Fuirion has run off. He is wounded -- he could die!''Yes, I've had many reports of Corsairs. The soldiers have all followed Prince Imrahil, and only farmers are left. I am sorry, but I have no one to send to rescue Fuirion.

