Speak with Bruidis to discuss a plan.Speak with Bruidis to discuss a plan'Hebil mentioned other captains of his rank and for once I believe his words. ${PLAYER}, you should be on your way to Belfalas. I know of a strong Corsair presence there but know not the precise location.

