Gilanor has asked you to seek out Corsair spies and recover any order they may be carrying.Collect orders from Corsair spies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.

You have recovered a collection of orders detailing the leadership and intent of the Corsairs in Edhellond. You should report back to Gilanor.'As it stands, we are ill-prepared to wage any sort of counter-attack against the Corsairs. Our Prince and many men have travelled to the east, leaving us little to work with.

'However, I have heard talk of Corsair spies acting as messengers to their forces near Tadrent and even as far east as Lamedon. If you were to catch one of them by surprise, it is likely that the information they bear could be used to our advantage.

'They are not known to travel by road, so you may have to seek them out. Bring any orders you find to me, and we shall see if hope yet remains!''Ah-ha! These are just what we needed, ${PLAYER}...

