You have encountered angered marsh turtles in the marshlands near Tadrent and should cull their numbers for the good of the people.Defeat marsh turtles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have defeated many marsh turtles near Makham Mijann.CompletedTurtles in the marshlands near Tadrent have grown aggressive in the wake of the Corsair invasion. Their sharpened beaks are known to penetrate even armour of fine make, so efforts to rout the Corsairs by force might be hindered by the marsh turtles. The people of Tadrent would be well-served by a cull of the turtles, whose numbers would certainly recover in time.While their sharp beaks could have also posed a threat to the nearby Corsairs, you have done the people of Tadrent a great service by culling the turtles in the marshlands. Future efforts to rout the Corsairs will no longer be threatened by the marsh's wildlife.In addition to threatening the lives of countless Gondorians, the Corsairs of Umbar seek to steal anything of value in Edhellond, including relics of the Elves who once dwelt there.Corsairs of Umbar can be found throughout Edhellond in north-western Belfalas.

