You should return the sheet music to Torthol.Return the sheet music to Torthol'Help, help! My music, my composition -- the pages have gone everywhere!

'I was practicing for a concert, and the wind took my sheets. Curse these stiff legs! I cannot catch them, for the wind whips them about too quick.

'Without my music, there can be no concert... I will be ruined!''Thank you, thank you! Now I can practice once more. The concert must go on!'From the beacon of Amon Lontir, the threats to Gondor have become well-known, but it is less known how the people of Ost Lontir will address them.Dol Amroth can be viewed to the west of Amon Lontir.

