You have found a small child in the haystack, much to Mildir's obvious dismay. You should talk to Mildir.Talk to Mildir'I do not think we are safe here, ${PLAYER}. Corsairs have been spreading through our lands like a great blight.

'Maybe the guards think it is amusing to have a drunk Corsair right outside our walls, but I do not! They are planning something for Ost Lontir, I just know it.

'If you could search the overlooks to the east and west of town for any sign of the Corsairs, I would be grateful... and maybe I could actually sleep tonight.''It is comforting to know that they are not on our doorstep today, but I still fear for what the future holds.

'You have done me a great service, ${PLAYER}, as simple as it may have been.

'Wait... what is that?''Confound that child! If he were a Corsair I would have... Bah!

