If you could claim the weapons borne by the corsairs, their forces would slowly be weakened to allow for a more successful attack by the Men of Gondor.'Ah, you have done well to bring these to me, ${PLAYER}.

'Every weapon we take from our enemies stretches their resources in Tarlang's Crown thinner and thinner. We shall force them out of their defences in time... I am sure of it!'Bereneth's father is a soldier who was wounded in the recent sortie. Help her visit him in the Houses of Healing.The Houses of Healing are in the Sixth Circle, on the northern side.

