'${PLAYER}, we should gather information as to Dolgimil's whereabouts. Our best bet might be Gaerlond, a fishing village, now in ruins, just south of here.

'Perhaps some of the more indolent Corsairs around there might be convinced to part with a bit of information. I shall meet you there soon my friend.'You ask the resting Corsair where Dolgimil can be found.

'Might be the one who toppled that lighthouse. You don't scare me, ${CLASS}!'You ask the besotted Corsair where Dolgimil can be found.

'I have not seen him. Though I wouldn't go looking for him you know. He's got a, *hiccup* stronghold.'You ask the lazy Corsair where Dolgimil can be found.

'You want an audience with Dolgimil? You're a fool, ${RACE}. I guess it's your life. I think he's on the coast.''It would seem that Dolgimil destroyed Barad Rill and has a stronghold somewhere on the Dor-en-Ernil coast. I know these lands well and the Dor-en-Ernil coast is mostly dunes and rock. The only structure was Barad Rill...

