Help Bergil find the foodmonger Himnir and ask for a treat for all the children. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.Ask Himnir for treatsThe Wrights' Market lies in the southern stretch of the First Circle.

Bring the broken whisk to the tinker Amonel in the Wrights' Market, as Himnir asked. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.

