* Defeat Thisarti
* Defeat Thisarti quicklyDefeat the archer Thisarti swiftly, for his arrows and his aim are deadly.Defeat the archer Thisarti quickly<rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Thisarti before he falls back into the Corsair ranks</rgb><rgb=#FF0000>Defeat Thisarti before he falls back into the Corsair ranks</rgb>Thisarti, a Haradrim master-archer, has snuck up from behind and fires on us with deadly aim. Deal with him quickly so he cannot fire on Aragorn and his troops.

