'Defeating these vile, brutish creatures may help us secure victory!'

<rgb=#FF0000>This bounty can only be completed a maximum of three times.</rgb>'You have fought these beasts up close? I hear their sword can cleave men in two! You are indeed a skilled warrior.

'I thank you for defeating many half-trolls in Dor-en-Ernil. For Gondor, my friend!'Glanion hopes to stem the tide of Haradrim troops by decimating their ranks.Haradrim can be found throughout Dor-en-Ernil.

