<rgb=#FF0000>This bounty can only be completed a maximum of three times.</rgb>'The Haradrim forces are surely hurt from your deeds. I thank you for that. Still, there is much left to be done.'A bounty notice asks you to seek out Derufin who has information about Langarch, a maddened wild beast in Southern Ithilien.Derufin can be found in Bâr Húrin.

