'The bounty! I am quite glad you are here! The Rangers asked if Duilin and I could rid them of this nuisance. Apparently this boar's been getting in the way of the Rangers slinking about. Obviously I said yes to appease these hospitable men. The thing is, we're quite busy with hunting bigger game and can't be bothered with this animal. If you take care of this task for me, Duilin and I would be most grateful.''Well done. Well done indeed! No need to tell the Rangers. I shall inform Anborn myself. You've done much. It is the least I can do! Take care, friend.'A bounty notice asks you to seek out Duilin who has information about Maeganc, a ravenous wild beast in Southern Ithilien.Duilin can be found in Bâr Húrin.

