<rgb=#FF0000>This bounty can only be completed a maximum of three times.</rgb>'I thank you for rescuing Gondorians in Dor-en-Ernil. Though these are dark times, they shall live another day, and it gives me hope.'A bounty notice asks you to seek out Thurindol who has information about Ronkúrz, an Orc captain from the Morgul-vale.Thurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin.

