'Get out there and take those posts.'''Bout time you pitched in around here.'Capturing the outposts provides us with strategic locations throughout the Ettenmoors to launch our further campaigns against the enemy. Make your way to one of the outposts and capture the location.Make your way into the Ettenmoors and seek one of the outposts there. These can be found in the far south-west, overlooking the river near Hoarhallow, the near south north-west just beyond the river and north near the western entrance of the Isendeep Mine.

