You should share some of the berries you collected with Cranniel.Talk to Cranniel'Good day to you! I am just a simple merchant. I pass through here from time to time, bearing goods between Linhir and Dol Amroth, and do not stay very long, but decided that perhaps I needed a break from the day to day work, and to relax for a while.

'I have heard the wild berries that grow along the cliffs here are delicious. Would you care to search for some? I would not mind to trying some myself, that is if you don't mind sharing with this stranger!''Delicious! If that is not the best berry I have ever tasted, then I do not know what is!'Now that the enemy forces in Ringló Vale have lost their leader and had their ranks decimated, your focus has been directed to Dor-en-Ernil where corsairs have already come ashore.Laerind can be found in the village of Ethring.

