You should seek out Garvir in Linhir.Seek out Garvir in Linhir'I thank you again for all that you have done for the people in Ringló Vale. There is great conflict to the south in Dor-en-Ernil. Corsairs have come ashore and push ever further inland.

'Farewell my friend and may Gondor benefit from your aid.''You are a brave warrior and kind hearted for helping the Vale. Arvaethor suggests you head south to Dor-en-Ernil? I believe you will be of great aid to these people of eastern Belfalas. You should speak with Borhador as he is more familiar with which Gondorian captains reside in Dor-en-Ernil.''You head to Dor-en-Ernil to take on the corsair forces? The sons of Comeldir have been stationed in Linhir I believe. Erchar, Herion, and Garvir are their names. I can not remember which one is leading the forces there. It might be Garvir? Oh, my mind has difficulty with names and faces at my age.

'No matter, travel south-east to Linhir. It is a large city that spans across the river Gilrain which runs the border between Dor-en-Ernil and Lebennin. Safe travels.''You are not a soldier under my command, but I welcome any warriors. You have come at a time when I need good men the most. Will you join my ranks and defend Linhir?'Shíktarb commands you to kill enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge for the glory of conquering their land.Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River.

