You should return to Dagor and tell him how you destroyed the enemy's boats and supplies.Talk to Dagor'The first rule of warfare, ${CLASS}, is to give the enemy no quarter. If they cannot pull back and regroup, they must either bend - or break.

'Now it so happens my men have espied some of the boats that brought the Haradrim into Lossarnach. They are here and there along the banks by the mouth of the River Erui. They have also noted piles of supplies, not far from the boats.

