Through a hard fought battle, you defeated great number of the enemy within the Isendeep mine.'This mine is mostly stone now, ${CLASS}, but mostly is not all. There is enough ore here to harvest and turn into viable weapons and armour, and so we must keep her from the hands of our enemy.

