'Take this reward and know that your efforts are very much appreciated by myself and all the Free Peoples who stand against the army assembled against us.'Once a harvesting location for the Hobbits of Hoarhallow, the Grimwood Lumber-camp now offers equipment for refining and preparing the wood needed to build palisades throughout the Ettenmoors. Lieutenant Swithulf knows that retribution will come in the form of an assault from Gramsfoot.Stay within the area of the Grimwood Lumber-camp and defeat the enemy out of Angmar.

