The battle at Tol Ascarnen earned you victory over your foes.'I've spent long years fighting, ${PLAYER}. I never shy from battle, and I never show my enemy fear. Courage is one thing as is common sense, and common sense tells me now that we must prepare ourselves for a coming battle.

