r in Western Gondor.Wanted: Shattered Hatchets from the Western Gondor region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect torn skins. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire torn skins.Wanted: Torn Skins from the Western Gondor region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Western Gondor.Wanted: Torn Skins from the Western Gondor region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect toxic filth. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire toxic filth.Wanted: Toxic Filth from the Western Gondor region. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for a collector in Western Gondor.Wanted: Toxic Filth from the Western Gondor region.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The captains of the corsair ships must be defeated to prevent a retreat.While the captains live, the corsairs can retreat or reinforce.Defeat corsair captains on their ships (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Faltharan, lord regent of Pelargir, seeks to uncover the fate of his father before all hope is lost.Faltharan can be found overlooking the eastern gate of Pelargir.

