'These are indeed ours. We stored supplies down in the vaults of one of the last standing buildings in Harlanc. I did not think the Haradrim would bother exploring the ruins' interiors, let alone find our cache. You have done a great service to return the supplies. Though consisting mainly of rope and arrow heads, these are invaluable items to a Ranger. Thank you.'The corsairs at Hashadîr have increased in number as of late. Burning some tents will stretch their resources and make them uncomfortable.The tents are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth.

