'Come, let us brave the darkness together.''Drugât had strayed far from redemption. I doubt we shall see him wander among the living again.'Balakhôr has summoned Lothíriel to treat with him on his flagship, the Night-jewel.Lothíriel is in the Great Hall of Dol Amroth.

