'I only wish that some day the fighting will end, and we can return to rebuild this place.''I wonder what will come of this.... Will people return to the city some day, or will they try to make new lives elsewhere? Many of us are too old to begin anew....

'The guards seem to have everything in order. I think we can depart from here, ${PLAYER}.'After weakening the forces in Tarlang's Crown, the time has come to confront Azruthor and put an end to the Scourge's plans for the Anfalas.Azruthor can be found in the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown.

