'It is true that many of the people in Lebennin come from families that once supported Castamir, but his legacy was a tainted one, and he fell from favour with all but his most devoted. It is no folly that he came to be known only as the Usurper!

'Malthellim must be locked away, lest he allow more of the Enemy inside these walls.'You are determined to learn if Artamir still lives, and have followed the markings of an Orkish map to see if it will guide you to the missing man of Gondor.You have nearly arrived at the location marked on the Orkish map.Find the location marked on the Orkish mapYou are making your way through the Dead Marshes to the location marked on the Orkish map.Continue south-east past the Orc patrols to the location marked on the mapYou have not yet found Artamir, but you do not wish to give up the search. Perhaps he is just ahead.Continue your search for Artamir. Did he come to this place?You have found Artamir, but he stares into the water as if entranced, and does not notice you.Break Artamir from his reverie'Let us return to my camp, ${PLAYER}. I am going to abandon this foolhardy errand before it kills me!''Oh... what... what is it...?'

