You should meet Lothíriel in the Great Hall of the Prince in Dol Amroth.'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for coming to my aid once more.

'I grow concerned for the lands to the east... the lands of the Ringló Vale, Dor-en-Ernil, and Lebennin. Word has spread of war come to the shores in the east, and what folk remained behind are now beset by foes on all sides.

'I would ask that you travel through Lamedon to the Ringló Vale. There you will find the settlement of Ethring, and I am certain the people there would benefit much from your presence, as we already have.''You look as if you have travelled long this day, ${CLASS}. I hope your wits are still about you.

'I have heard of your valour in the west, but dark times have come to our lands. We awoke to a dawn-less day, and found ourselves overrun by foes.

'If you seek to aid us at the Lady's command, you both have chosen a fortuitous time.'You have been summoned by Aragorn to his camp near Pelargir where he hopes to set you and Lord Angbor upon new tasks.Aragorn can be found at his camp to the north-west of Pelargir.

