'There is a Sûhalar encampment against the northern Rammas, not too far from here.''Most interesting! I shall send these to Minas Tirith so that they may be studied more but honestly I have never seen such metals before. It looks as if they were unearthed from deep within the ground. Perhaps somewhere near Rhûn?'The Sûhalar Easterlings have constructed an encampment at the base of the northern Rammas. Ingold believes that the presence of Gondor along the wall may drive the enemy away.Jal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor.

