You should defeat Sûhalar guards and their captain.Defeat Sûhalar tower guards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat ShurlâjIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas.

You should speak with Ingold.Speak with Ingold'I am worried about the Sûhalar encampment against the northern Rammas. Its numbers continue to grow. I fear they may try to take the Rammas and the North-gate if left unchecked.

'I'm counting on you to defeat the forces gathered there. Be careful, as the axe-men are strong and skilled warriors.''You have accomplished much. You say you have defeated their captain as well? Then the North-gate remains ours, ${PLAYER}!'The Sûhalar Easterlings have constructed an encampment at the base of the northern Rammas. Ingold proposes an effort to cripple the forces gathered there.Jal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor.

You should free their horses.Jal Vârsha can be found along the the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor.

Now that their horses are gone, you should burn their tents.Destroy tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Ingold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas.

You should speak with Ingold.Speak with Ingold'The Sûhalar encampment against the northern Rammas must be stopped. Free their horses to stop further patrols from searching for the Rohirrim, then burn their tents to plunge the encampment into chaos. I'm counting on you.''Your efforts preceded you. I can see the smoke from here! Yet again, you are a most impressive warrior.'The fell Haradrim Sorcerer Kang-kethek has come into the area. Defeat him before he turns the tide of the combat.

