'Return the barrels to me, and I will fill the iron pot.''You did well, little soldier. A lickspittle of a different sort you are. I am pleased with what you've done, and so I say that you are a good soldier. Now be off with you, else my pleasant nature may turn foul.'A Minstrel has climbed up to your vantage point, shouting insults and egging on our foes. Dispatch him before he whips your enemies into a frenzy.

