Polla is displeased, but willing to try a different theatre at Gord's request. You should meet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of Air.Meet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of AirPolla Stoutley can be found in the Hall of Air in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith.

You have arrived at the Hall of Air and should now talk to Polla.Talk to Polla Stoutley in the Hall of AirHollur can be found in the Hall of Air.

