You should bring the Slug goo to Dulglok.Bring the Slug goo to Dulglok at Shrak Mauruk'I want a tasty meal! Get me some slug goo and maybe I'll share a little with you!

'Just thinking about slugs makes me hungry. Hurry up!''Yum! I changed my mind. This goo is just for me and the other war-leaders!'Read the plaques of taverns and wine-shops within Minas Tirith.Read the plaques of taverns and wine-shops within Minas Tirith.Find The Wheel and Cask plaqueFind The Laughing Halfling plaqueFind The Splintered Shield plaqueFind The Mûmak and Keep plaqueFind The Wainrider's Head plaqueFind The Hammer and Tongs plaqueFind The Haven plaqueFind The Merry Swan plaqueFind The Brick and Mortar plaqueFind The Cresting Wave plaqueFind The Lone Beacon plaqueFind The Thirsty Seer plaqueFind The Eagle and Sickle plaqueRead the plaques of buildings used for the advancement of knowledge within the city of Minas Tirith.Read the plaques of buildings used for the advancement of knowledge within the city of Minas Tirith.Find the House of the Heavens plaqueFind The Old Archives plaqueFind The Archives of Vorondil plaqueFind The Black House plaqueFind the Houses of Lore plaqueMany soldiers have been injured attempting to defend Dol Amroth.The injured must be tended to before their wounds become too great.Heal injured soldiers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Tolwin is having difficulty leading the people of Crithost. Many matters need his council and many wounded and frightened folk are in dire need of assistance.Ailing farmers can be found in the hall at Crithost.

You should tend to the wounded.Distressed refugees can be found in Crithost.

You should calm the refugees.Tolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost.

You should speak with Tolwin.Speak with Tolwin'I am not sure where best to put my time in all these matters. You must be experienced in dealing with all kinds of people across these lands. Perhaps you would be a better guide to these people than I would.

'I cannot think straight while my mother might still be alive out there. She is all the family I may have left...

'Will you help look after the people of Crithost? The wounded rest in this hall while some farmers outside could use some guidance. They need someone strong to look up to.''The spirits of those in the village are already lifted thanks to you. You have certainly lifted my spirits in the short time you've been in Crithost.

'Were you as much a leader when you were of my age?'Small fish will group and cluster together for short periods of time as a defensive measure.Calembel is to the north-east of Dol Amroth.

Torchuil asked you to go to Calembel and wait for a fish ball. Once you found it, you were to fish as quickly as possible.Search the shores for a Fish BallThe fish have balled up. Catch as many as you can.Catch fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Before the fish fleeTorchuil is in Dol Amroth.

Torchuil will be pleased to see the fish you were able to catch.'Small fish will often bundle together in tightly swimming balls as a defensive measure when predators arrive. This increases the odds that as many of the fish will survive as possible.

'When we find one of these balls, we must strike as quickly as possible. It will not last long. You must fish up as many as you can in the short amount of time provided.

'The fish often ball up around Calembel. When you get there search around, soon enough you will find a ball and then you must strike.''This is a great many bait fish. We will be able to use them to start catching some of the larger ocean fish soon.'It is time for the Finder's Gathering to begin.Bergil can be found in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates.

