'You are a hardy ${CLASS} and might be able to bear the dread that surrounds the Dome. Will you search for him there? I will not abandon him until I am assured of his fate, but death has not been a stranger to our men in these dark days.''I thought as much, ${PLAYER}. You need not say more...'

Golthor shakes his head.

