You have not found any survivors, but you have discovered a note on a fallen man. You should examine it before returning to Ost Anglebed.Collect the note from the fallen man of LornostNimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.

You have searched Lornost thoroughly and discovered the cause for its fall. You should return to Nimithil and tell her what you have learned.'The fate that befell Lornost is deeply troubling, ${PLAYER}.

'They were attacked in the night by the Haradrim, but none of us knew how brutal the assault had been until the morning. I wish to learn more of what occurred in Lornost, but the Steward has sent no men into the field. He claims that the Haradrim are too numerous, but they shall only gain might the longer we delay. And what of the folk that were slain... shall they lie where they fell?

'Travel to the east, and see if you can discover more about what drove the Haradrim to Lornost.''The Heirs are unafraid to deliver on their threats - that much is clear.

