'Also, I see in Tolwin's eyes that he looks up to you. Should you accept this final attack, you will give Tolwin the strength he needs to face the man who killed his father and kin.''I will not mourn the loss of my husband Gilgír and my sons until The First Blade falls.''We have made it back safely to Crithost. Tolwin and I shall spend our time vigilantly protecting this village. I am certain that some of the enemy in Cair Andros will retaliate.

'Crithost will stand. You have my word that we will rebuild Talath Anor in time.'Search for tribute baskets to the five River-maidens of Lebennin.Search for tribute baskets to the five River-maidens of Lebennin.Search for tribute baskets to the five River-maidens of Lebennin.Find a tribute basket to Roamingstar of the River GilrainFind a tribute basket to Grey-eye of the River SerniFind a tribute basket to Silverfroth of the River CelosFind a tribute basket to Truetongue of the River SirithFind a tribute basket to The Lone Lady of the River EruiYou find a hand written note that reads:

Roamingstar of sweet song,
