They say when the cock does not crow and a fell wind from the East blows you will awake to save us! I wish this to be true more than ever! I am afraid for what will happen to our fair Minas Tirith if you do not spare it from growing darkness. I know you brood there silently, hidden and waiting to act. I urge you to act now. We're in dire need, oh Lone Lady of the Erui. Help us, most powerful of the five sisters. May you accept this most humble offering.The corsairs have smashed several statues at the docks.The statues are a symbol of Dol Amroth's ambitions for sea-faring.Restore statues (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})After learning that the ruthless Dead have infiltrated Dor-en-Ernil and plan to sweep eastward to Mordor, Garvir hopes to find some means of slowing their advance.Glanion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Durnir can be found overlooking the Gilrain in Linhir.

