'I would like to start overseeing repairs as soon as it is safe again to leave the city. If you are venturing out in Pelennor would you be interested in surveying the damages of the Rammas Echor?

'While you're out there, know that men still protect the Out-wall at the South-gate and North-gate. You may be able to lend a hand to Turgon and Ingold. I am sure they could use it!''You are not here to convince me to leave my post, I hope. If so, it is a fool's errand for I plan to defend this gate until the Rohirrim arrive.''I would be thankful if you were to lend a hand here at the South-gate. My men and I have been busy protecting the Rammas from the Orcs gathered in the Harlond. Alas, we have not yet been able to turn our attention upon the newly gathered forces in Pelennor Fields.'After threatening to imprison you, it is clear that Lady Terenis desires to learn of the truth of Pelargir at any cost.Lord Angbor can be found just outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin.

