'If you ask me, something must be done about these pests. You can disperse them by getting rid of their nests. Oh, and watch out for Old Stone-tail. She's been living in the cisterns since I was a child. Most cistern workers don't mess with her but you're an ample warrior. Perhaps you'll be the one to finally drive Old Stone-tail away for good?''Well, I cannot believe it. Old Stone-tail finally took off with her tail between her legs. I never thought I would see the day. Perhaps now we can get the cave-lizard population in the cisterns under control.'The people of Lornost were ill-prepared for war against the Heirs of Castamir and granted no honour in death at their hands.You have come upon a massacre in Lornost, and should now bury the dead.Bury slain Gondorians in LornostSlain Gondorians can be found throughout Lornost in eastern Lebennin.

