'Did Tolwin not tell you of my training in both stealth and blade? I suppose he was too young to remember my training.

'No matter, we are safe to rest here for a short time... Where are my manners?! My name is Dúneth. I am sure Tolwin has been worried sick about me.''I had forgotten the words my father once said to me. He told me that we come from a long line of skilled warriors and everyone in this family is a warrior.

