You hope you can follow that!Find the entrance to Drû Bhûta, the village of the Wild MenKhôr-buri-Ghân is waiting to welcome you to the village of Drû Bhûta.Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân at the entrance to Drû BhûtaKhôr-buri-Ghân's fellow Wild Men can be found throughout their village of Drû Bhûta.Talk to Âm-buri-Sôl in Drû BhûtaTalk to Wêg-pulo-Ghûr in Drû BhûtaTalk to Mân-weni-Mhên in Drû BhûtaKhôr-buri-Ghân is at the entrance to Drû Bhûta.Talk to Khôr-buri-Ghân at the entrance to Drû BhûtaGhân-buri-Ghân, the leader of the Wild Men, can be found in the village of Drû Bhûta.Talk to Ghân-buri-Ghân'Wild Men live here long time before others. Our land our own. I am called Khôr-buri-Ghân, son of headman Ghân-buri-Ghân.

