'I speak to father Ghân-buri-Ghân. Explore village. Meet Wild Men and learn our customs. I will see you here when done. Then bring to headman.''I speak to father Ghân-buri-Ghân. Explore village. Meet Wild Men and learn our customs. I will see you here when done. Then bring to headman.''Stonehouse-folk built walls high, built walls strong. Now gorgûn surround walls. No more leaving for Stonehouse-folk.

