<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete Book 6, Chapter 2 of Volume IV to advance this objective.</rgb>Battle your way to the centre of the Pelennor FieldsKings' End can be found near the centre of the Pelennor Fields at the site where Théoden King fell.

