'If you are willing, I once again have need of your aid. I would ask that you travel through the Noman-lands and gather any Hauntreek you may find. My fellow Rangers and I have great need of them at Haerondir, especially with our foes so close by.

'Deliver the Hauntreek to the Rangers at Haerondir, where it will surely be put to good use.''Thank you, my friend. Our company shall put the rest of this Hauntreek you bring us to good use when any additional braziers begin to burn low.'There is much to be done in the maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk.The maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills.

