'A palpable hit, and another! I find no joy in battle, my friend, but I find that I am uncommonly good at it, truly! I will use that skill to defend the men at my side, until my last breath is stolen away by some lucky stroke!

'Fight onward, ${PLAYER}! Make our foes pay for the evils they have done, and hope still to do!''Stand fast, men! They seek to cow us with their numbers, but each of us is worth a dozen of their mindless thralls!

'My limbs are heavy and my breath is short, ${PLAYER}, but I will do what I can to support Aragorn and my kinsmen.

'Fight on! Fight on!''I see that you have already slain your share of Orcs, ${PLAYER}! Legolas has also cut an impressive swath, but he tells me his supply of arrows will not last long. Perhaps you can help him with this?

