Fallen swords can be found around the base of the western slag hill near the bodies of their former wielders.Find a fallen sword for ThalanirYou found a sword for Thalanir and should bring it to him on the southern slope of the western slag hill.You found a sword for Thalanir and should bring it to him on the southern slope of the western slag hill.Éomer is on top of the western slag hill.Talk to Éomer atop the western slag hillÉomer has asked you to fight your way back to the eastern slag hill in search of Legolas and Gimli.Defeat enemies at the Battle of the Morannon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Legolas is on the south-western slope of the eastern slag hill.Talk to Legolas on the south-western slope of the eastern slag hillLegolas has asked you to defeat any enemies you can find as the press of battle surges against the eastern slag hill.Defeat enemies at the Battle of the Morannon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Calenglad is atop the eastern slag hill.Talk to Calenglad atop the eastern slag hillAragorn is atop the eastern slag hill.Talk to Aragorn atop the eastern slag hill'Do not worry about me, ${PLAYER}! We are hard-pressed by our foes, but even so they are unable to match us! I have the high ground, for now, and that gives me the advantage!

'The flow of the battle pushed Éomer of Rohan further down the slope, and I fear he will be cut off from the rest of his forces. Find him to the east, and ensure he is safe!''I welcome the concern of the Prince of Dol Amroth, but it is unnecessary! My own battle is well in hand.

'But I have another worry: the terrible flying creatures that carry the robed Nazgûl on their backs. They fall upon my soldiers and bear them aloft with their clutching claws... and then they drop them to the battlefield below. There is no protection from this!

'The safety of my men is my prime concern, for many soldiers of Rohan are unhorsed and such is not their preferred means of doing battle. Over the din of battle I thought I heard Rohirric voices crying out in alarm, to the south-west. That is where you are needed, not here with me!''Help! Will no one help me? Alas for my injuries!''I am glad to see you are still kicking, ${PLAYER}! I am afraid I can't do very much among all these warriors, but I aim to do the best I can for Frodo and poor Sam.

