Anborn is telling you a tale of strange travellers in Ithilien. You should listen closely.Listen closely to Anborn's tale'That is all I have to tell for now, my friend.'In a desperate bid to free the Wastes of two threats to the Host of the West, Faramir, son of Ondoher has set a plan in motion to stop Burudagath the Bloodletter by setting the Wainriders against him.Faramir is just outside Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.

