You should defeat Orc overseers.Defeat Orc overseers in Skoironk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.Return to Candúr'Thurindol has spoken to me about enemies hiding beneath the Slag-hills. Some of these foes are extremely dangerous and should not be dealt with alone. Make haste to the caverns of Skoironk with your allies and defeat those who oversee the Orcs that dwell below the hills.''The overseers are defeated? Their forces slowly crumble! Excellent work, my friend.'Angbor has been tasked with preparing for the march eastward and must gather supplies for the journey.You should gather the supplies scattered around Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.Gather supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})The supply cart can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion.

