You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.Talk to Thurindol'Small brush fires dot the hill-sides of North Ithilien. We have led several small charges against these flames, yet reports of more come to us at Henneth Annûn each morning.

'This time of the season, a brush fire should be a rare occurrence, and not one we should be dealing with every day. I fear the Orcs lurking in Ithilien are to blame. No doubt they wish to slow us down or strike fear into us by attempting to burn the entire hill-side bare.

'If you encounter any brush-fires, douse them immediately. I know that I can count on you, my friend.''${PLAYER}, your efforts have saved North Ithilien's wilds.

'Any sign of new life is a threat to the Enemy. We must be the sentinels of hope and guard these verdant lands. You have my thanks.'The Rangers of Ithilien lost many of their number in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields. Even as the War rages on, those that survived and returned to North Ithilien are in dire need of healing.Kingsfoil can be found in North Ithilien to the west of Henneth Annûn.

Anborn has asked you to gather kingsfoil in the hope that it might be used to heal his fellow Rangers.Collect kingsfoil in North Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Wounded Rangers can be found within Henneth Annûn.

You have gathered the kingsfoil and should now use it to heal the Rangers as best you can.Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn.

You have healed the wounded Rangers as much as you were able, and should now report back to Anborn.'I have a favour to ask of you, my friend.

'Swift was our return to Henneth Annûn at the battle's ending, and we had little time to tend the wounded. We are a hardy folk, but an injury is an injury no matter the Man. A few of our number suffer wounds still, and I hope to heal them before the battle is rejoined.

'The lands of Ithilien are home to many useful herbs and flowers, and among them, kingsfoil. A mere weed in the eyes of many, I know of its restorative properties in the hands of a King... as well as those of an able healer. I have studied the kingsfoil potions and salves you bear, and I believe that you might have the skill to heal my men.

'Search the foot-hills to the west, for kingsfoil has often grown on the slopes beneath Henneth Annûn. When you have gathered as much as you can bear, bring it to my men and heal them as best you can.

'Be swift, ${PLAYER}.''You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.

'The wounds of war are not easily healed, and I fear more difficult times still lie ahead... even after our victory at the White City.

'Now more than ever, our resolve must not falter in the face of the Enemy.'Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you encounter.Find three survey locations around the Noman-lands.

