'Take Faroth with you and sniff them out.''Good work, ${PLAYER}. I knew Faroth would prove invaluable. And I shall sleep easier without fear of Orcs skulking right into our camp.'Mordor Firestarters have begun to set North Ithilien's revitalized flora aflame. Slay them before they burn the entirety of North Ithilien!Mordor Firestarters can be found in the wilds of Ithilien, south of Cair Andros. 

