'I have been keeping watch upon the foes in Dagorlad while Thurindol keeps watch upon the Slag-hills. Go speak with him, and in haste, for the situation in the Slag-hills is dire indeed!'Aragorn and his army have landed in the Harlond, unbeknownst to the enemy and many of the men who fight for Gondor.Complete the deeds in The Quays of the Harlond.Complete the deeds in The Quays of the Harlond.Complete the deed The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 1Complete the deed The Quays of the Harlond -- Tier 2Complete the deed Challenge: Kálmok's SquadronDefeat many Variags in Far Anórien.Defeat many Variags in Far Anórien.Defeat many Variags in Far AnórienDefeat many Variags in Far Anórien.Defeat many Variags in Far Anórien.Defeat many Variags in Far AnórienIn a desperate bid to free the Wastes of two threats to the Host of the West, Faramir, son of Ondoher has set a plan in motion to stop Burudagath the Bloodletter by setting the Wainriders against him.Faramir can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn in north-eastern Dagorlad.

Faramir has asked you to confront Burudagath the Bloodletter at Ondoher's Folly. You should speak to him when you are ready to depart.Talk to Faramir at Dol AcharnAnborn can be found at Haerondir in the Wastes.

