You should inspect the various debris in the chamber.Examine the rubbleExamine the tattered clothExamine the food scrapsExamined the chamber.Completed'If you seek allies of Dulgabêth, look first to an enemy of Sauron. Many years ago, a beast by the name of Narchraw crossed Sauron. He was locked away in the dungeons of Barad-dûr for his crimes. The dungeons can still be found within the ruins of the citadel.

'There are troubling rumours that Dulgabêth has spoken with Narchraw. Find the beast and kill it at once. If the tales are true, there are few as dangerous as Narchaw in the lands of Mordor.'While you do not notice anything out of the ordinary, the beast known as Narchraw must be very powerful.

