You have found the King of the Stout-axes at a curious moment. It appears he has overpowered his captors, and now means to escape. You should speak to him on behalf of Spakorth.Talk to King Váskmun GreytoothKing Váskmun Greytooth's armour can be found among the collected weapons at the armoury, rations of some kind can be found in the larder within the dungeons of Barad-dûr, and his mithril lockbox can be found in a small chamber near the main gate of Barad-dûr.

King Váskmun Greytooth has asked for you to aid in his escape by finding him some food, his old armour, and a mithril lockbox that was taken from him by Sauron.Find King Váskmun Greytooth's armour in the dungeon armoury of Barad-dûrFind King Váskmun Greytooth some food at the larder in Barad-dûrFind King Váskmun Greytooth's lockbox in Sauron's relic-chamberKing Váskmun Greytooth can be found in his cell in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.

