'Ruin their forges and break their weapons, and I dare say their search will be over before it begins! If the Firehorns discover you, do what you must. When the Dourhands treated my folk as the Firehorns treat the Stout-axes now, I did not shy from battle.

'While you deal with that, I'll escort Spakorth into the Spire. He has a mind to speak with King Greytooth, but I do not think it wise. Ah well, I have my axe if talking won't do!'You have destroyed many of the forges, tools, and weapons vital to King Greytooth and the Firehorns' quest to seek the dwarf-rings.

