You should establish contact with those in command of Fushaum Bal.Talk to ThângTalk to MâlatukTalk to KhirgiUpon entering the encampment, the mood strikes you as rather strange. Everyone looks tired and ready to leave the Plateau of Gorgoroth. There is still hostility here, but it is not directed towards you. It seems to be directed towards someone else. You decide that it is in your best interest to learn more about the situation.'You may walk here in Fushaum if you like, but do not dwell too long. Not all of the men here are as compassionate as myself.'

Thâng wipes his blade upon his clothes.

'All we ask is that you leave the treasures of Mordor to their rightful owners. If you wish to help us, we will certainly reward you before we depart for Harad.''Any are welcome if not plotting to oust us. Thâng and I are rulers of Fushaum. As least we were until that Khirgi moved in. All we want is to collect what is rightfully ours and return to the east. Sauron promised us much and gave very little. Now he is gone and can trick us no longer.''I could have killed you like that.'

Khirgi snaps his fingers to simulate your death.

