You should talk to Viznak.Talk to Viznak'First idea! Infected Orcs strap you to altars, bat-people come pick you up, take you inside! Happened to me almost! You try! Find an altar and lie on it. What could go wrong?''That didn't work. Guess you scared them off! We try new plan.'The Uruks have many barrels of brew in Kala-gijak,. This brew makes them more irritable and fight harder. Faeron thinks it is a good idea to destroy these barrels.Uruk brew barrels can be found in Kala-gijak.

