You should talk to Faeron.Talk to Faeron'I have heard that the Uruks drink a nasty brew that lessens their inhibitions, making them more ferocious fighters. Destroy any barrels that you come across before they can consume more.''Ugh, I can smell the brew's stench from here. Thank you for taking care of that. We do not want the Uruks to gain any advantages in combat.'Kâwon-weni-Khûrs is the village historian of the Red Sky Clan. Listen to his words to learn the history of his people.Kâwon-weni-Khûrs and his statues can be found in Bhol Rûdh.

