You should examine the Drúadan statues and listen to Kâwon-weni-Khûrs.Examine the fourth Drúadan statueKâwon-weni-Khûrs can be found in Bhol Rûdh.

You should talk to Kâwon-weni-Khûrs.Talk to Kâwon-weni-Khûrs'Outsider. I am Kâwon-weni-Khûrs. You come to learn the struggles of my people. You shall know. The statues tell our history.''It is a time of great change. The statue I now carve tells the next story, if we survive.'Viznak's first plan did not work out, but don't worry, he has more ideas.The Lair of the Gloom-lord can be found near Seregost, deep within Agarnaith.

