You should talk to Viznak.Talk to Viznak'Bats live in cave near Seregost. HUGE bats! Maybe if we can sneak up on them, we can ride 'em up over walls! I know there's even one big enough to carry you! Worth tryin', might be fun!''Ugh. Can't sneak up on bats, ears too good! Bats not very nice either. New plan!'The Drúedain of the Red Sky Clan are prepared for battle. Meet Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk outside Kala-gijak to begin the assault.Kala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith.

You should go to Kala-gijak.Go to Kala-gijakFaeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack.

