You should talk to Viznak.Talk to Viznak'You nice guys and save me from nasty infected Orcs. I help you out and fix green-cloak. His name Rhadrog? Yes, but we can do better. We form partnership. You hate Orcs, I hate Orcs, we good team. I the brains, you the muscle! It will be great! Talk it over with grumpy guy.''Glad you are back. Rhadrog's situation is dire. I have managed to get some information out of our new 'friend' here.  Seregost lies to the north-east, at the end of the swamp, and he made it sound massive. He also mentioned that the 'Blight Lady' rules Agarnaith. I know not what manner of creature he speaks of, but he seemed frightened at the mere mention of her.

