'Rhadrog better soon. Needs sleep now. Let's get to work!''He wants to be partners?! There must be some ulterior motive. I have never known a goblin to not be a scheming little ball of slime. Regardless of how much I want to strangle him, we must work with him for now, or we stand no chance of survival in this disgusting bog. Perhaps we can even learn enough about Seregost and its leader to report back some useful information before we are inevitably betrayed.''Good! We friends now. First thing, fix sickness! I discover making tasty drink from swamp stuff make it go away! Don't know how, don't care. You go get stuff, mix in bowl, and drink! All better. You and grumpy better drink it, too. You not sick now, but you will be! Here, I make you list.'

