You should talk to the captured raft-elf.Talk to the captured raft-elfMervárth is standing guard outside Esgaroth-of-old.

You should talk to Mervárth.Talk to Mervárth'They kidnapped the Elf in hope of some news about the stoppage of shipments flowing from out of Mirkwood. When trade halts, even thieves suffer. The problem is, the Elf is stone-faced and silent as all his stubborn kind. I fear they will lose patience and do him harm. You would do well to hurry.''Thank you, ${CLASS}. I think I can make it back to Loeglond on my own.''So you rescued the raft-elf, then? Good, good. You looked like you could handle it! I suppose my job here is done, thanks to you.'Queen Regent Erna holds her son Bryn to be answerable, in part, for Athálrik's misdeeds.A coin can be collected from the banker in the Dale Crafting Hall, the wood from a foreign trader in the lower markets near the eastern gate, and the puzzle-box from a dwarf craftsman in Dale's upper markets, in the centre of town.

