<rgb=#FF0000>The quantity of Mote-worthy crafts will be removed from your inventory.</rgb>Thorlind believes the poison you found poses a grave threat and has asked you to gather ingredients for an antidote. Find the Celeblam plants nearby.Celeblam flowers can be found nearby, in Eryn Lasgalen.

You should collect Celeblam.Collect Celeblam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Thorlind can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen.

You should talk to Thorlind.Talk to Thorlind'I recognize this poison, ${PLAYER}, and it frightens me. Glenneth and the Beornings may be in grave danger. But where there is a natural threat, there is a natural cure. The Celeblam flower can be found nearby. Quickly, gather some for me so we may craft an antidote.''This should do. Thank you, ${PLAYER}. Let us hope that Glenneth and the Beornings have no need of this antidote.'The Taurogrim bear a potent, but curable poison. Without a steady supply of Celeblam, their corruption will spread too quickly to contain.Celeblam flowers can be found in Eryn Lasgalen.

Thranduil has asked you to gather Celeblam for the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen so that Thorlind can craft more of his healing draught.Collect Celeblam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.

You should talk to Thranduil.Talk to Thranduil'With the Taurogrim encroaching on Eryn Lasgalen, it is unavoidable that more innocents will fall victim to their poisons. We shall have need of more of Thorlind's curative draught, and I would ask for your aid in this task.

'Gather more Celeblam in the forest and deliver it to me as swiftly as you are able!''I shall see that this Celeblam is delivered to Thorlind at once.

'Let us hope we have no further need of such a cure.'There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. Today, you should focus your efforts in Dor Amarth and Agarnaith.Today the Conquest of Gorgoroth would like you to work in Dor Amarth and Agarnaith.

You should complete any four Allegiance quests in Dor Amarth or Agarnaith.Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.

You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.Talk to an Expedition Organizer'Hello, friend! Prepared for an adventure?

'Today, we would like you to focus your efforts in Dor Amarth and Agarnaith. The bounty board has many things to do, and we would be grateful for whatever aid you can offer. Be careful out there!''Well met, adventurer.

'Today, Durin's Folk will reward you for work in Dor Amarth and Agarnaith. The bounty board over there has tasks for you. Best get to it! Gorgoroth isn't going to conquer itself!''Hail, friend of the Elves.

'We have identified that currently Dor Amarth and Agarnaith hold the greatest threats to our people. Your efforts are best spend there today. See the bounty board for specific information. Travel with care, and represent us well.''Greetings, adventurer.

'The Conquest of Gorgoroth has decreed that Dor Amarth and Agarnaith are the targets for today. Check the bounty board for specific tasks in those areas. Good luck.''The Conquest of Gorgoroth thanks you for you aid, adventurer. Take this as a token of our gratitude. See me again tomorrow for a new task.'There is much to do for the Conquest of Gorgoroth to succeed. Today, you should focus your efforts in Lhingris and Agarnaith.Today the Conquest of Gorgoroth would like you to work in Lhingris and Agarnaith.

