You should talk to Rékar.Talk to Rékar'Next, I suggest you track down the notorious chicken-thief, Snowfell the Lynx. She is quite the successful hunter, with many children. Unfortunately for her, Lynx furs are quite valuable, and the people of Dale would like to keep their chickens. She will be harder to find than Fenskin, but the pay is good.''It seems that crafty cat has finally met its match! Good work. Ready for your next challenge?'Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.Dale-lands Moose and Oakthorn can be found in the wilderness near Dale.

