You should talk to Rékar.Talk to Rékar'Many people underestimate the Moose. It is a large plant-eater lacking intelligence. Do not be fooled. An angry bull moose is a threat to any grown man or woman. One especially large moose, Oakthorn, has been known to even charge at caravans as they travel along the roads! See if you can hunt him down.''Excellent work! Glad to see you were not stomped to bits and gored by that monster's rack. I have one more challenge for you, if you are prepared.'A wealth of lore awaits those who brave the Bones of Barad-dûr.Candúr can be found in Udûn.

