<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>Defeat Azgazôr.Defeat AzgazôrYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.Talk to Candúr'I am concerned with the tower of Durthang. Since we last spoke, more foes have gathered there. Perhaps the Captain of the Pit is preparing his forces for an assault against us?

