'You have seen it in waking, but through my power, it has been shaped anew by your thoughts and desires.

'Look around you, and see now these visions of what is to come....''What I have shown you may not come to pass, but it will be the future that awaits you if you abandon this quest. There are things that remain beyond my sight in the frozen wastes of Morgoth, and so, you must remain vigilant.

'Remember well what you have seen, ${PLAYER}. It is time you awoke....'A new pit-fighting tournament has begun and you have been asked to participate.Enter the combat area.Enter the combat areaDefeat the first opponent.Defeat the first opponent<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>Defeat the second opponent.Defeat the second opponent<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>Defeat the third opponent.Defeat the third opponent<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the combat area!</rgb>'Good work, ${RACE}. Párgrub finally winning supplies! Soon this poor snaga will be the best merchant, yes.'Thranduil has a plan to besiege Iphantemel's den in Torech Emel.You should talk to Oroniel.Talk to OronielHelp construct a barricade.Help construct a barricadeDefend the workers from the spiders.Defend the workers from the spidersHelp construct another barricade.Help construct another barricadeDefend the workers from the spiders.Defend the workers from the spidersHelp construct the final barricades.Defend the workers from the attacking spiders.Defeat the attacking spidersTalk to Thranduil.Talk to Thranduil'The watch is built and safe. Come, let us return to Felegoth. I place the path to Torech Emel under the watch of my guards.''The spiders retreat! Has Iphantemel called them to her? I know not. The Old Mother does not wish to fight us any longer, at least for the present, it would seem.''Ah, ${PLAYER}, is it not? It is good you have come. Quickly now - we need assistance with these barricades. We must finish constructing them before Iphantemel learns of our plans.'The lore-master Fróthi wishes to examine what remains of the dragon-tooth necklace.Examine Scatha's tooth with Fróthi.Examine Scatha's toothExperience the vision.Experience the visionTalk to Fróthi.Talk to Fróthi'Now, let us return this tooth to Górsim. We dwarves do not take kindly to stolen or lost treasures! If Górsim lost this last tooth... well, let us not ponder on that!''A vision you say? Well, what did you see?'

You tell the dwarf what you saw, as best you can.

'Poisoned? Unending pain? One could almost pity the creature... almost. He must hate dragons with nearly as much passion as Durin's Folk!'After spending countless years within Thikil-gundu, Vethúg Wintermind comes to wreak vengeance upon Durin's Folk.King Thorin III Stonehelm can be found before the gates of Erebor.

Vethúg Wintermind makes for Erebor, and King Thorin III Stonehelm has readied an army of dwarves and Elves to oppose him. You should speak to King Thorin when you are prepared to defend Erebor.Talk to King Thorin III StonehelmYou should follow King Thorin III Stonehelm and remain alert at the gates of Erebor.Follow King Thorin III StonehelmKing Thorin III Stonehelm is making ready to defend Erebor.

