He cracks open one of the crates and grins.

'Oh yes, this is very illegal. Very illegal, indeed. Thanks to you, we might finally be able to jail these smugglers!'Someone has posted a task to collect Deadly Claws. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire Deadly ClawsWanted: Deadly Claws from the Strongholds of the North. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Deadly Claws from the Strongholds of the North.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect Spiny Carapaces. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire Spiny Carapaces.Wanted: Spiny Carapaces from the Strongholds of the North. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Spiny Carapaces from the Strongholds of the North.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.The roots of the forest are in need of care.You should collect phials of root-healing draught from within Felegoth.Collect phials (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should defeat corrupted roots and give water to trees in need throughout Eryn Lasgalen.Defeat corrupted roots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.Return to Radagast'Let us return to the task of mending these woods. The Elves of Felegoth have been preparing healing draughts - not for you or me, but for the roots of their beloved trees! Sad to say, some roots are beyond our help and must be pulled up. And yet that is the way of things. In a healthy forest, there is both growth and decay.

'Will you take some phials with you and help in the healing and uprooting? I do not think it will be hard to tell which are corrupted and which can be saved.''Ah, you have returned. I gather you were successful? That is good. Good indeed!'More weapons from the forges of Mornaur have been discovered in the Mornaur Look-out.Mornaur-forged weapons can be found in the Mornaur Look-out.

