You should visit Rikolf, Frekur, Orgrand, Ránnvig, and Olgat to collect their payments.Talk to FrekurTalk to OrgrandTalk to RikolfTalk to OlgatTalk to RánnvigDagrun can be found in the Master's manor in Lake-town.

You should talk to Dagrun.Talk to Dagrun'Now, I suppose we must conduct town business sooner or later. Part of the job of Master is managing the wealth of Lake-town. That includes collecting a fair share of taxes from each citizen. From what I can tell, a handful of citizens are quite overdue on their payments. I think our previous Master was not very aggressive in his collecting.'

She hands you a list of names.

'Please visit these people in Lake-town and kindly ask them to pay what they owe the town. And please, be polite, but firm.''Oh, you again. What do you want now?'

You explain that you are here to collect his late tax payments.

'The nerve of that woman! One day on the job and already making demands! Fine, take it and get out!''If it isn't ${PLAYER} again. What can I do for you?'

You explain that you are here to collect his late tax payments.

'Oh. Um... I'm afraid I don't have the money right now. I donated quite a lot to the orphanage and Sútvif's family....'

You shoot him a steely look. His facade falters.

'Ah, I may have just spent too much money on rounds of ale for my friends... look, this is all I have right now, just take it.''H-hello there, ${PLAYER}...'

You explain that you are here to collect his late tax payments. He becomes saddened.

'Oh... Háta handled the coin... let me get you what I owe. Please apologize to Dagrun for me.''Can I help you with something? I have a tavern to run here.'

You explain that you are here to collect his late tax payments.

