ron's soldiers in UdûnDefeat many of the forge-workers in UdûnDefeat many scavengers in UdûnThorlind has spotted a raft bearing a man who might be the leader of this strange plot, approaching Esgaroth.You should confront the leader of the excavation, who is located on a raft at the edge of Esgaroth-of-old.Confront BurudâurYou should investigate the strange pile on one of the rafts in Esgaroth-of-old.Investigate the strange pile on the raftSmaug's bones are in the water, in Esgaroth-of-old.

You should find a good vantage place to inspect Smaug's bones.You should talk to Thorlind, who can be found just outside of Esgaroth-of-old.Talk to ThorlindYou should travel to Lake-town, north of Esgaroth-of-old.Travel to Lake-townLake-town can be found in the Dale-lands.

