You should find out why someone in the unruly crowd spoke the name of Smaug.Talk to Skerri'Those were Men of Mordor, then? But look, a raft approaches from across the water. Can you see the occupant? He is dressed as those men were, and by his bearing, I guess he is their leader.

'I wonder what he might tell us of this dark plot we have found here, if we brave standing before him.'You tell Thorlind of Burudâur's words and all you saw. He ponders deeply.

'I see. It sounds as if there is some other scheme afoot, somewhere in Lake-town. There we have another piece of the puzzle, and yet I still cannot guess at the whole! Will you go to Lake-town and uncover what you may? I must report back to Felegoth without delay, and your swift action might prevent whatever harm is planned.''Yes, you heard me a-right. Leave Smaug's bones where they lie! Don't tell me you're in favour of this madcap plan?'The Lake-town Smugglers are notorious for their black market trading. Dagrun has asked you to destroy any ill-gotten goods you find while inside the smugglers' hideout.Smuggled goods can be found inside the smugglers' hideout in Lake-town.

You should destroy smuggled goods.Destroy smuggled goods (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Dagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters.

You should talk to Dagrun.Talk to Dagrun'While you're cleaning out the smugglers, would you mind cleaning out their ill-gotten goods as well? We've found enough evidence to lock Skótmun away for good, and I don't want any questionable items resurfacing because we failed to take care of it right away! Just go ahead and destroy any you find.''You destroyed how much?! Thank you for taking care of that, ${PLAYER}. Now none of it will make it out onto the streets.'Defeat many of Sauron's soldiers in Udûn.Defeat many of Sauron's soldiers in Udûn.Defeat many of Sauron's soldiers in UdûnDefeat many of Sauron's soldiers in Udûn.Defeat many of Sauron's soldiers in Udûn.Defeat many of Sauron's soldiers in UdûnAfter finding evidence that Glenneth was attacked, you and Thorlind separated. You must continue alone to find the lost Beornings before the same fate befalls them!The Beornings are lost somewhere in Eryn Lasgalen, north of the path.

You should find the Beornings.Find the BeorningsYou have found Langhár alone in a glade north of the path.

