'It does seem our dear old Master of Lake-town has died, but those guards are being awfully tight-lipped about the cause. He was the very picture of health just yesterday! And then there's a rumour going around that he was murdered....'There is a lively debate among its residents about transporting Smaug's bones to Lake-town.Stafhild can be found in the unruly group in Lake-town.

