You should talk to Mervárth.Talk to Mervárth'With Captain Álarr's blessing, we have access to the murder location! We should make our way there.''Well, that was certainly illuminating. It appears our Master was murdered by the Lake-town Smugglers!''${PLAYER}? Captain Álarr instructed us to let you investigate the area. You may look, but please do not touch anything. This is where we found the Master last night. We believe the murderer was hiding behind that crate, pushed the Master against the wall, and stabbed him with that knife. Let us know if you find anything worthwhile.''Rust? No, I don't know anything about the rust. But Mervárth thinks the red kerchief belongs to the Lake-town Smugglers? That is an important piece of information! I will let Captain Álarr know.'The evidence points to the Lake-town Smugglers being involved in the Master's murder. Storm their hideout, and bring in their leader for questioning!The smugglers' hideout can be found in the Lake-town underbelly.

