'You may tell the Elves of Mirkwood that their friend is free and the Lake is safe for trading once again. ''You have done it, ${PLAYER}! All my raft-elves are accounted for, and everything has been made safe. You should return to King Thranduil and tell him the good news. Thank you for everything you have done for us.'

He bows deeply.'You have done great deeds this day, ${PLAYER}, and not even for your own people. I am impressed by your generosity and valour. I shall keep my word and allow trade to resume with the Dale-folk. The Woodland Realm thanks you.

