'King Ilkún's company. Aye, we tell tales of those he sent to the Withered Heath to seek the Thafar-gathol and his forebear's remains. Many died there when the glacier known as the Anvil split open and dragons poured out! These are relics that should be remembered and praised. I will ensure they are studied and proudly displayed once Ered Mithrin is reclaimed. You have done a good service to the Zhélruka.'Orc-kind from have taken over the Glimmerdeep and work to mine its wealth.Collect tarnished gems.Collect tarnished gemsYou should collect tarnished gems from the Orc-kind in Glimmerdeep mine.Collect tarnished gems (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should bring the gems to Agátur in Skarháld.You have recovered a stolen gem from one of the Orkish miners in Glimmerdeep mine. Are there more such gems to be claimed?'I see these gems, while tarnished, could be quite valuable in the hands of a skilled gem-cutter.

