It seems Sharkey's Men have driven out or slain many of the White Hand forces that remained in the Vales of Anduin. You should search for their leader and attempt to disrupt whatever plans Sharkey has for the Gladden Fields.Find the leader of the forces at Sharkey's SloughThe slain Shakh-hai can be found in the dredging pit at the centre of Sharkey's Slough.

