You should talk to Radagast.Talk to RadagastRadagast has called upon you to visit his home of Rhosgobel. While it is not certain what matters currently trouble Radagast, it is not often that he directly seeks you out for assistance. What ever the matter may be, it is surely to be important! You should seek travel to Rhosgobel as soon as you are able.'Ah, ${PLAYER}, just the ${CLASS} that I was hoping to see. I have need of your assistance.'By order of King Thorin Stonehelm, you must venture deep into Moria and discover the true purpose of the Secret Stone.

