You should talk to Baradal.Talk to Baradal'Hail, traveller, might I ask.... Hold a moment. Are you ${PLAYER}? I am Baradal, house-carle to Lady Arwen. She has mentioned you many times, and it is good fortune to meet thus on the road. You are known to be a great friend to her family.

'I am here at the behest of Lord Elrond. The wedding party will pass this way soon, and I am to make the way clear for Lady Arwen. She wishes to visit a location nearby, where her mother was taken by Orcs before she sailed to the Undying Lands. It is a delicate subject, but I feel you have earned the trust of Arwen's family.

'Would you honour me by travelling by my side on this errand? I will explain more as we travel to the village south of here.''Come, let us travel together to the village of Arhaim, to the south. We have much to discuss along the way.''Come, let us travel together to the village of Arhaim, to the south. We have much to discuss along the way.''Do you hear that, ${PLAYER}? The heavy breathing and scuffling feet of Orcs. I believe they lie in wait on the road just ahead, prepared to waylay any passersby. Unfortunately for them, today we are the ones passing by, and they will learn it to their sorrow! Let us hit them from the side, where they will not expect it.'

She stretches and shakes her arms, warming them up for combat.

'Ready when you are, friend.''I can see why you are so renowned, ${PLAYER}. Those Orcs stood little chance against you. Let us tarry no longer; the village of Arhaim should be near.''This must be Arhaim. It is quite... primitive compared to the cities of the Eldar. The cities of Men are not all like this, correct? I am afraid I have little frame of reference. Most of my travelling has been between Imladris and Caras Galadhon with Lady Arwen, and not by this road.'

You realize from her words that Baradal might be quite young for an Elf. You describe some of the grander cities of Men, including Minas Tirith and Edoras, that you have visited in your travels.

'I see. I will travel to Minas Tirith myself in the coming days. I am looking forward to it. On to the task at hand. We need to speak to the Woodfolk here if we are to find where Lady Celebrían was taken. Let us hope they are open to speaking with outsiders.'A dwarf named Grímyr has asked to speak with you privately about some urgent matter.Grímyr would like to speak with you privately.

You should speak with him to attend the 'Secret Meeting'.Attend the 'Secret Meeting'You have been accused of murder!

You should talk to King Thorin.Talk to King Thorin'Well met, friend. Tell me, are you ${PLAYER}? I have heard much about you from King Thorin! I admit I had been hoping to meet you in person. There is something... secret... about which I must ask. Come, let us move somewhere a little more private.''${PLAYER}, you stand before me accused of the murder of Grímyr of Durin's Folk. My guard discovered you standing over his body, weapon in hand! You would already be clapped in irons if they had not also found this....'

He pulls a small object from a pouch and shows it to you: a small, perfectly round stone, darker than the deepest cave, blacker than night. As you look into it, something within the stone pulls at your mind, bidding you to look deeper. This stone is known to you. Thorin quickly puts it back into the pouch.

'Indeed. This is the Secret Stone. I had ordered it to be moved from its place and hidden once more, but Grímyr must have discovered its location and stolen it away. You are a hero of Durin's Folk, ${PLAYER}, and in my eyes you are innocent of any wrong-doing; do we not know how this stone can affect the mind? But it is clear to me now that the stone cannot be kept safely in Erebor.''Come, friend. Let us speak in private.'The Woodmen of Hultvís often gather fish from the waters of the Great River, Anduin.Nets can be found along the eastern shores of the Anduin in Woodsedge.

Germund has asked you to gather fish from nets along the Anduin.Collect fish from nets along the Anduin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Germund can be found in Hultvís.

You have gathered a number of fish and should now deliver them to Germund.'${PLAYER}! Where you travel, good fortune seems to follow. Will you hear my plight?

'Long have I cast my nets into Anduin, but never has its bounty been so meagre. It seems to me an omen... but of what?

'Will you go down to the banks of the Great River and gather fish from my nets? If Anduin is generous to you, perhaps my concerns were for naught.''Well? What did you find?'

You show Germund the fish you gathered from his nets.

'Hah, 'twas just a bad day of fishing, I think! I'm sorry to have tasked you with such a small matter, ${PLAYER}, but I deem it most worthwhile, for it eased my mind considerably! I'll see to it myself at dawn on the morrow.'<rgb=#00e4ff>This deed is for Legendary Servers.</rgb><rgb=#00e4ff>This deed is for Legendary Servers</rgb>Complete The Black Book of Mordor: Chapter 10The Woodmen of Blómgard have been unable to hunt in the woods due to a rise in the number of vicious beasts that lurk within.Boars can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin.

You should collect boar meat for the Woodfolk of Blómgard.Collect boar meat in Laerlad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Evorik can be found in Blómgard.

You should talk to Evorik.'Perhaps my wife Odahild has told you that the numbers of those who dwell in Blómgard dwindle year by year? Soon there will not be enough of us to defend the village, nor enough to hunt for food. In better times our hunters ranged the woods for boar meat, and it was enough. Can I ask you to brave the woods of Laerlad and return with boar meat for my village?''Your kindness fills my heart, but more than that: the food you have brought will fill my stomach and those of the village! It is not often we see such charity from strangers, and I am happy to know it has not vanished in the darkness of these days.'Radagast has an additional gift for your troubles in assisting his effort to restore the Vales of Anduin to the peaceful and beautiful place that it once was.Radagast has many tasks that need completing in the Vales of Anduin.

