You should crush the lavender that you have collected.Grimbeorn's bees can be found at the Beorninghús.

You should feed Grimbeorn's bees.Gírta can be found at the Beorninghús.

You should talk to Gírta.Talk to Gírta'Listen to the buzzing of the bees! Watch as they trundle about! Those big bees belong to Grimbeorn, but in name only, for they are the descendants of bees raised by his sire Beorn, and they are cared for by us all. In return they give us beeswax for candles, among other wares.

'Would you like to attend to the bees? They are partial to a strain of lavender that grows nearby.''Grimbeorn's bees are quite friendly, as you have learned. I believe they have made a new friend today, and I trust that you have learned to respect the bees, as well!'Radagast the Brown asks you help him rescue chickens and bring them back to the safety of Rhosgobel.Chickens can be found all over Middle-earth.

