You should speak with Radagast.Speak with Radagast'Use the special food I have given you to befriend some chickens. They'll be safe in Rhosgobel where I can tend to them. I'm counting on you, ${PLAYER}.'You give a tasty treat to the chicken!You give a tasty treat to the chicken!You give a tasty treat to the chicken!You give a tasty treat to the chicken!You give a tasty treat to the chicken!'Ah, thank you! I see you were able to bring back a couple of chickens with you. I am glad your travels were a success.

