You should talk to Rísti Graver.Talk to Rísti Graver'It is difficult to work and to stay on schedule here at the Dáinlik. Each day I hear reports from my workers that they feel as if they are being watched. Some even speak of shadowy thing in the hills. I myself, thought I saw something today, at the base of the axe. Perhaps that would be as good a place as any to start. You must get to the bottom of this!''So there was something there?! I knew that we were not going mad!

'You must tell Náin of what you saw! How are we to complete the Dáinlik with these beasts lurking in the rock?!'Ríkmar of the Woodmen has grown fearful that Hárskor and the provisions he bore have fallen into the hands of Orcs still lurking in Woodsedge.The crossway to the old forest road can be found by following the road to the north of Hultvís.

