Sharkey's orders told of a ruined excavation site in the northern reaches of Tûn Melen. You should find it and explore it.The warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.

You have searched the ruined excavation site at Tûn Melen, but you found no sign of Sharkey or his men. You should continue your search to the south and find the warrens of Tûn Melen.Find the warrens of Tûn MelenThe warrens of Tûn Melen can be found to the south of Tûn Melen in the south-western Gladden Fields.

You have found the warrens of Tûn Melen. You should investigate them, but proceed carefully, as Sharkey and his men are likely gathered inside.Investigate the warrens of Tûn MelenThe imprisoned Woodman can be found in a small alcove to the right of the entrance to the warrens of Tûn Melen.

After entering the warrens of Tûn Melen, you heard a faint cry from a Woodman in a cage. You should speak to the imprisoned Woodman and learn what has happened in the warrens of Tûn Melen.Talk to the imprisoned Woodman in the warrens of Tûn MelenAfter searching the belongings of Sharkey's lieutenant, you discover orders sealed by a small waxen 'S'. If these are orders from Sharkey, you should examine them at once.

