You explain that you were sent by Radagast on behalf of the chieftain of Hultvís. He sighs with relief.

'I don't care who sent you as long as it's not Sharkey. Please... you've got to help me!'Círdan has seen many injured over the years. Currently, many of those wounded remain untreated.Salves can be found in Díngarth.

