You should tend to the wounded soldiers.Círdan can be found in Díngarth.

You should talk to Círdan.Talk to Círdan'I have known war, but I am not a warrior. No, I have always been, and will always be, a builder and a sailor of ships. And yet the call to war must be heeded, so I brought to the Great Alliance my skills as a healer and a bringer of wisdom.

'I have seen more injured soldiers of late, a greater number than I am accustomed to treating at once. You have some skill tending to the wounded? That is good. I ask you to collect some salves and see to these injured soldiers. Your assistance will be greatly appreciated by both healers and healed alike.''Did your skill at healing prove up to the challenge, and the wounded begin to recover? Good. I am glad to hear their injuries fade and their spirits improve. Let not this gift of yours go to waste during the years of the siege!'Defeat many foes in the resource instance of Óinsbridge.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of Óinsbridge.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of ÓinsbridgeDefeat many foes in the resource instance of Óinsbridge.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of Óinsbridge.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of ÓinsbridgeDefeat many foes in the resource instance of Glimmerdeep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Glimmerdeep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The GlimmerdeepDefeat many foes in the resource instance of The Glimmerdeep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Glimmerdeep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The GlimmerdeepDefeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel Keep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel Keep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel KeepDefeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel Keep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel Keep.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Steel KeepConquer the many enemy encampments in the Vales of Anduin.Conquer the many enemy encampments in the Vales of Anduin.Explore YlgrafExplore the Goblin-gateExplore WaldfastExplore Fil SulmogExplore TríubadExplore Côs BraenExplore Sharkey's SloughExplore LúlstrokExplore the Warrens of Tûn MelenExplore Shathur-munzuExplore BrafulugDefeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered Heath.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered Heath.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered HeathDefeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered Heath.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered Heath.Defeat many foes in the resource instance of The Withered HeathDefeat many beasts in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many beasts in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many beasts in Ered MithrinDefeat many beasts in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many beasts in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many beasts in Ered MithrinDefeat many dragon-kind in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many dragon-kind in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many dragon-kind in Ered MithrinDefeat many dragon-kind in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many dragon-kind in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many dragon-kind in Ered MithrinDefeat Gundabad Orcs in Ered Mithrin.Defeat Gundabad Orcs in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many Orcs in Ered MithrinDefeat Gundabad Orcs in Ered Mithrin.Defeat Gundabad Orcs in Ered Mithrin.Defeated many Orcs in Ered MithrinDefeat many Ungoledain in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many Ungoledain in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many Ungoledain in Ered MithrinDefeat many Ungoledain in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many Ungoledain in Ered Mithrin.Defeat many Ungoledain in Ered MithrinThere is still much to do in Ered Mithrin.There is still much to do in Ered Mithrin.Complete: Gathering Resources in Ered Mithrin (Advanced)Complete: Leaders of Ered Mithrin (Advanced)Complete: Enemies of The Glimmerdeep (Advanced)Complete: Enemies of The Steel Keep (Advanced)Complete: Enemies of Óinsbridge (Advanced)Complete: Enemies of The Withered Heath (Advanced)For those visiting the Beorninghús, it is important to help in the daily work of Beornings.Eggs can be found at the Beorninghús.

