You should bring the eggs to Gírta.Gírta has asked you to gather some eggs from chicken nests around the Beorninghús. The chickens do not seem to mind!'This is truly a good collection of eggs from our wonderful chickens. I will put these eggs to good use, and I know they will be appreciated by all who sit at my table. I know more than one dozen ways of preparing eggs for supper, each of them different, and each of them delicious. I believe no one in all the vales knows more about the preparation and enjoyment of eggs than I do!'Someone has posted a task to collect dwarf-made sword sheaths. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire dwarf-made sword sheaths.Wanted: Dwarf-made Sword Sheaths from the Dwarf-holds. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Dwarf-made Sword Sheaths from the Dwarf-holds.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect rock tails. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire rock tails.Wanted: Rock Tails from the Dwarf-holds. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Rock Tails from the Dwarf-holds.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect stone-abraded skins. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire stone-abraded skins.Wanted: Stone-abraded Skins from the Dwarf-holds. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Stone-abraded Skins from the Dwarf-holds.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect withered claws. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire withered claws.Wanted: Withered Claws from the Dwarf-holds. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Withered Claws from the Dwarf-holds.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect withered ears. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire withered ears.Wanted: Withered Ears from the Dwarf-holds. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: Withered Ears from the Dwarf-holds.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Explore much of the Ironfold and Ered Mithrin.Explore much of the Ironfold and Ered Mithrin.Complete: Seeking Iron VeinsComplete: Treasure-seeker of the IronfoldComplete: Survey Markers of the Dwarf-holdsComplete: Ruins of Ered MithrinComplete: Treasure-seeker of Ered MithrinComplete: Delver of Thikil-gunduExplore much of the Vales of Anduin.Explore much of the Vales of Anduin.Complete: Enemies of the ValesComplete: Treasure-seeker of the ValesComplete: A Chronicle of the CompanyComplete: Protectors of the ValesComplete: Sites of the ValesA sudden, mysterious madness has overtaken some of the creatures that dwell in the Gladden Fields.Maddened marsh-lurkers can be found at Gilvamyr and Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. A few may also be found wandering the Gladden Fields.

