You should talk to Langhár.Talk to Langhár'Who are you? Are you here to help?'

You quickly explain the situation and ask Ainhard to tell you what happened here.

'I cannot say for sure, it happened in the dead of night! But I can tell you what I saw, and what I heard.

'I was asleep with my hounds, when I was awoken by the sound of many scuffling feet, a horrid chattering of some beastly horde! I quickly looked out the window and saw hundreds of glowing eyes and the glinting of weapons in the moonlight! I am unsure what they were — Orcs, goblins, Taurogrim, but there were so many! I could only hide in my home while they trampled through and destroyed everything in sight.

'What do I do now? Pick up the pieces and carry on? But I am afraid they will come back at any moment!''The poor man is terrified! We should investigate the area and see if it was goblins that came through, or something else. Perhaps we can pick up the trail of... whatever it might have been... as well.''Goblins indeed! What did that one drop? Some kind of drawing? Is that supposed to be the Great Goblin?

'I do not know what to make of that drawing, but we should hold on to it for now. Let us return to Ainhard and send him on to Vegbár. It is clearly not safe for him to be out in the wilds by himself.''You came back! Are the demons still out there?'

You explain that the attackers were indeed goblins, and that there are still some lurking nearby. You tell Ainhard that he should head to Vegbár where it is safe.

'Ah, yes, that sounds like a good idea. But... I cannot leave with my home in such disarray, and my hounds missing! Will you help me?''Ainhard is right. There will be more people in danger if the goblins are left unchecked. We have work to do.''Thank you for all your help. I will head to Vegbár with my companions when I am able. I should let you know that there are others living nearby that may also need your help. I am in no state to help anyone, but please, do what you can.'The birdhouses of Rhosgobel are in need of repair.Birdhouses can be found at Rhosgobel in Laerlad.

