You should search for the cart's owner.Find the cart's ownerBaradal can be called to your side with Baradal's summoning horn.

You should talk to Baradal.Talk to BaradalThe dead cart owner's horse may still be alive somewhere in the forest of Duskenvale.

You should find the missing horse.Find the missing horseThe horse was spooked by your approach and ran deeper into the forest.

