If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.Talk to Langhár'I smell more goblins here, ${PLAYER}. They must be waiting for the homes to be emptied, so they can break in and take anything that isn't nailed down! Find them, and we will show them how mighty we are! We will give them a big Beorning <rgb=#FF00FF>ROAR</rgb> and send them fleeing!''I smell more goblins here, ${PLAYER}. They must be waiting for the homes to be emptied, so they can break in and take anything that isn't nailed down! Find them, and we will show them how mighty we are! We will give them a big Beorning <rgb=#FF00FF>ROAR</rgb> and send them fleeing!''I smell more goblins here, ${PLAYER}. They must be waiting for the homes to be emptied, so they can break in and take anything that isn't nailed down! Find them, and we will show them how mighty we are! We will give them a big Beorning <rgb=#FF00FF>ROAR</rgb> and send them fleeing!''Excellent roaring, ${PLAYER}! If I did not know better, I would think you were secretly a Beorning yourself! But of course that cannot be.''Excellent roaring, ${PLAYER}! If I did not know better, I would think you were secretly a Beorning yourself! But of course that cannot be.''Excellent roaring, ${PLAYER}! If I did not know better, I would think you were secretly a Beorning yourself! But of course that cannot be.'Wandering lost-lights move along the river Gladden.Wandering lost-lights can be found along the river Gladden.

