You should inform Haldis that the decorations are complete.Talk to Haldis'While I was walking sweet Honey-bell I saw the pond lilies in full bloom, and their loveliness left me amazed! Had I not been so exhausted by the walk, I might have picked some lilies to brighten Grimbeorn's hall. If you venture once again among the Vales, could I ask you to pick some of the lilies for me? The hall could use some decoration and some brightening both!''I am sure the lilies will brighten the hall! Dare I think the flowers might bring a smile even to old Grimbeorn himself? I do dare!'The Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster has a small quantity of Motes available.Talk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster to trade Longbeard Marks for Motes.

