You should speak to Audvak, Hithril, and Ragnild about further protecting the Vales of Anduin.Talk to RagnildTalk to AudvakTalk to HithrilThe Wilderfolk of the Vales are composed of Beornings, Woodmen, and Elves, and all must work together if they are to make safe the lands they share. Representatives of these peoples have gathered in Hultvís, intending to work together to protect the Vales of Anduin. You should seek out Audvak, Hithril, and Ragnild, and offer them your assistance.'I am Ragnild, of the line of Grimbeorn. I greet you as an equal, ${CLASS}, for your deeds precede you and I would welcome your help. Wargs roam among the ruins of Shathur-munzu, and I need them cleared out.''You must be ${PLAYER}. I have heard tell of your deeds from Chieftain Ríkmar. I am Audvak, and I need the help of hardy adventurers willing to strike without fear against the darkness. Avabárg was once a place of peace and safety, but now a gloom has descended upon the isle and it has become a den of evil. Few only dare go there, but that is where my tasks will lead.''Are you one who seeks to make safe the lands in which you travel? Know that you speak with another such, for that is my goal too.

