<rgb=#00FF00>Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.</rgb>'The Anduin's waters were once pristine. Conflict has a way ruining that which is innocent. I know that I am partially to blame for some of the conflict that found its way to the Vales. I ask now that you assist me in purifying these waters. Bring me those rusty weapons of battle and the healing shall begin.'

<rgb=#00FF00>Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.</rgb>'It is a start. Still, there is much more to be done. The machines rise up from out the Gladden Fields.'War has taken a toll on the Anduin, leaving rusted debris along the tributaries of the great river.Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.

You should talk to Radagast.

<rgb=#00FF00>Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.</rgb>'The Anduin's tributaries were once pristine. Sometimes the paths of Men and the march of Orcs can disturb the peaceful waters. I ask now that you assist me in purifying these streams of the Great River. Bring me those objects of Men and Orcs that choke the waters.'

