You have set many traps in the woods outside Hultvís, and you should now return to Atta.'If you insist on standing about at my house, perhaps you could help me with something.

'I've built these traps to protect my people, but I cannot set them myself without leaving Hultvís... and I-I can't do that.

'Set these traps in the woods outside Hultvís and spread them about!''Hmmph.'Defeat many enemies of the Dwarves of Ered Mithrin and the Ironfold.Defeat many enemies of the Dwarves of Ered Mithrin and the Ironfold.Complete: Ered Mithrin Beast-slayer (Advanced)Complete: Ered Mithrin Dragon-kind Slayer (Advanced)Complete: Ered Mithrin Gundabad-slayer (Advanced)Complete: Ered Mithrin Ungoladan-slayer (Advanced)Complete: Ironfold Beast-slayer (Advanced)Complete: Ironfold Easterling-slayer (Advanced)Defeat many enemies of the Wilderfolk in the Vales of Anduin.Defeat many enemies of the Wilderfolk in the Vales of Anduin.Complete: Vales Beast and Insect Slayer (Advanced)Complete: Vales Goblin Slayer (Advanced)Complete: Vales Orc Slayer (Advanced)Complete: Vales Warg Slayer (Advanced)Noffer the pig is good at sniffing out truffles. Take him for a walk and see if he can find some for you!Ingelfled can be found in the village Arhaim in Duskenvale.

