'I have some supplies for the village, but the Beornings will not let me pass. They tell me that the Orc activity on the road has made it unsafe for regular folk like me. Perhaps they are right, as some of the carriers I sent with supplies never came back....

'If you're headed that way and they let you pass, would you take these supplies to Arhaim for me? They are very isolated down there, and will be eager to receive them.''Supplies from Lúfred? Thank you, ${PLAYER}. We have not received any supplies from the north in some time.

'Please, accept this payment.'The encampment of Echad-in-Edhil is in need of additional supplies.Supplies can be found in Díngarth.

