'This is all very clear to me, ${PLAYER}. A large warg has come down from the Floodfells. He broke free from his collar and now roams the Beorning-lands! You must find this beast quickly, and put an end to the menace of him!''You defeated the leader of the wargs? We are fortunate you stumbled upon that collar before he stumbled upon one of us, ${PLAYER}! I suppose that is the stock in trade of all adventurers, is it not? But I must say you have more fortune than most I have known!'Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.Karazgar has come to the Anvil of Winterstith to bolster his forces by laying claim to the Herald of Winter and her Frost-horde. If he succeeds, he will have the means to wipe out not only the expedition of dwarves in Ered Mithrin, but to lay siege to all of the Northern Kingdoms.Survive the Expedition into the AnvilHórin is standing by outside the Anvil.

