You should defeat wargs in Duskenvale and Shathur-munzu.Defeat wargs in Duskenvale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Completed.CompletedNow that you have seen what lies inside Shathur-munzu, you feel it is your responsibility to deal with the warg threat as much as you are able. You should defeat as many wargs as possible in the wilds of Duskenvale and Shathur-munzu.You have done much to cleanse Duskenvale of the warg menace. The people of the Vales are safer for your actions.In the depths of Kidzul-kâlah, something evil has taken root. Elrond has asked you to help him investigate the matter, and hopes to learn how the Maiden of the Gladden is involved.Gandalf has asked you to speak to Elrond. He can be found outside the Beorninghús.Talk to ElrondElrond and Glorfindel have travelled to Kidzul-kâlah to seek answers from the Maiden of the Gladden.

