You should show your perfect honey cake to Hállkell.Show Hállkell your perfect honey cake'We have both been through a lot lately, and I think a rest might be well-deserved. Do you know what I find most relaxing? The ancient Beorning art of baking, of course! Would you like to help me bake a honey cake? This will not be just any old cake, I assure you. This will be of the very type that Beorn of old used to bake himself! There are easier recipes to follow, but this is not a day for easy. I rest best when I am tested! Does that make any sense?

'Come see me if you have questions about the process.''The recipe? Yes, of course! You will need to gather wild wheat, seeds, and honey, all from the Beorning-lands. Then the wheat and seeds must be ground very well. Next you add the wild honey to the mixture. Honey from the farm will not do for this step! No, that honey is far too domesticated, and Beorn's original recipe calls for wild honey!

'Once the mixture is properly mixed, it is time to bake it, but don't let it cook for too long! The best honey cake is moist and not too dry!''The recipe? Yes, of course! You will need to gather wild wheat, seeds, and honey, all from the Beorning-lands. Then the wheat and seeds must be ground very well. Next you add the wild honey to the mixture. Honey from the farm will not do for this step! No, that honey is far too domesticated, and Beorn's original recipe calls for wild honey!

