'Once the mixture is properly mixed, it is time to bake it, but don't let it cook for too long! The best honey cake is moist and not too dry!''Now that honey cake looks simply perfect, and it smells even better! Well done, my friend! This is your very first honey cake? I would almost not believe it! You will find this honey cake recipe bakes differently for everyone who tries to make one. Truly a signature of the baker, if you will.

'Did you find the process as restful and relaxing as I did? I hope so!''The recipe? Yes, of course! You will need to gather wild wheat, seeds, and honey, all from the Beorning-lands. Then the wheat and seeds must be ground very well. Next you add the wild honey to the mixture. Honey from the farm will not do for this step! No, that honey is far too domesticated, and Beorn's original recipe calls for wild honey!

