You should talk to Odahild, the leader of Blómgard.Talk to Odahild'Blómgard was once a place of joy, but lately our spirits have fallen. We have toiled long, but ever our work is hard, and our lives become harder. We call it the Green Sadness, for are we not like the trees that reach for the sunlight but become crowded by the overhanging canopy of our hardships, and fall beneath the shroud of darkness?

'Seek out the folk of the village if you think it be not so.''I thank you for seeking to encourage my people, ${PLAYER}, even if the Green Sadness cannot be tamed with mere words. When the woods are made safe for even the children, perhaps then hope will return to our hearts.

'There is no easy solution, but we are a sturdy people and we will face our hardships as we have always done. With your help we may find the way forward.'Gwaihir the Wind-lord can see all that transpires in the Vales of Anduin.Landroval can be found at the Eyrie.

