You should talk to Náin.Talk to Náin'As I peer into the abyss my mind begins to cloud. There is both shadow and madness down there. I fear our only option is to enter the pit and hope to bide us some time until the seal can be repaired. If you are not able, I understand, and will send some of my best warriors instead. What choice do I have? If nothing is done, doom is certain.'

