Atta grasps loosely at his throat and appears to look through you for a moment.

'It is not Old Mad Ubb that the children of Hultvís should fear, but Úbil the Snatcher....''Are you prepared to hear my tale?''Many years later, I learned that Beorn had died. 

'It was said that the Snatcher was driven off by his kin, but the Snatcher lives longer than Men... longer even than those with the gift of Beorn.

'If ever I dared to leave Hultvís, how can I be certain that Úbil does not still lie in wait for me?'Regretting the allowance of skin-changing secrets falling into the wrong hands, Radagast seeks to end the Ungoledain presence in Laerlad for good.Côs Braen can be found in the southern edge of Laerlad.

