You should bring the mushrooms to Sterkist.'Gírta has tasked me with collecting wild mushrooms from the Beorning-lands. They grow in the small groves throughout the vale, but now that I give it a little more thought, I realize that these mushrooms can be found quite far from the Beorninghús! I would not want to encounter a warg, or worse! Perhaps you could help me collect some of the mushrooms that are further afield?''Great work! This should be enough mushrooms for the stew that Gírta is preparing. I shall bring the mushrooms to her. You have been most helpful!'Rock-worms of the Gladdenmere are covered in scales that are much prized by the Beornings of the Vales.Rock-worms can be found on the northern edge of the Gladdenmere.

