You should find them and send them to safety before the goblins come for them!Warn BeggaWarn EvrulWarn GuduleWarn HodverLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.

You should talk to Langhár.

If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.Talk to Langhár'There are other Woodmen living in this area that are now in danger, ${PLAYER}. They must be warned that the goblins have come down from the mountains and are moving south! I fear that the next time the goblins decide to strike, the Woodmen will not be as lucky as Ainhard.''There are other Woodmen living in this area that are now in danger, ${PLAYER}. They must be warned that the goblins have come down from the mountains and are moving south! I fear that the next time the goblins decide to strike, the Woodmen will not be as lucky as Ainhard.''There are other Woodmen living in this area that are now in danger, ${PLAYER}. They must be warned that the goblins have come down from the mountains and are moving south! I fear that the next time the goblins decide to strike, the Woodmen will not be as lucky as Ainhard.''That accounts for everyone. They will be safe in Vegbár under Skalla's protection. Now we can focus our attention on the goblin threat itself!''That accounts for everyone. They will be safe in Vegbár under Skalla's protection. Now we can focus our attention on the goblin threat itself!''That accounts for everyone. They will be safe in Vegbár under Skalla's protection. Now we can focus our attention on the goblin threat itself!'Several watch-towers guard the entrance to Goblin-town, preventing an easy infiltration. They will need to be brought down before you can enter safely.Goblin watch-towers have been erected between Vegbár and Goblin-town.

You should destroy goblin watch-towers so you can enter Goblin-town unnoticed.Destroy goblin watch-towers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You destroyed some of the hastily-erected watch-towers.Completed'If you are going to get inside Goblin-town unseen, you will have to deal with the watch-towers between here and the Gate. I have heard from the scouts that they seem to have been assembled in a hurry; they must be expecting an attack from the Great Goblin. Luckily for us, hasty construction oft means hasty destruction!'You have destroyed the watch-towers between Vegbár and Goblin-town, and can now pass through unseen.Someone has posted a task to collect calcified carapaces. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire calcified carapaces.Wanted: calcified carapaces from the Vales of Anduin. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: calcified carapaces from the Vales of Anduin.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect lost essences. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire lost essences.Wanted: lost essences from the Vales of Anduin. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: lost essences from the Vales of Anduin.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect pebbled filth. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire pebbled filth.Wanted: pebbled filth from the Vales of Anduin. Collect them to earn a reward suitable for collectors.Wanted: pebbled filth from the Vales of Anduin.You have turned in a stack of trophies for a modest reward suitable for a collector such as yourself.Someone has posted a task to collect stone-worn furs. These can be turned in for a reward.You have accepted a task to acquire stone-worn furs.Wanted: stone-worn furs from the Vales 