You should talk to Durin IV.Talk to Durin IV'What an insult! Can you believe this? The banners of the Dark Lord still stand upon the Corpse-fields! Rip them down before my dwarves see them!''Well done! I no longer see the vile banners of Sauron, and the spirits of my dwarves will not be lowered by seeing the ugly things. Khazâd ai-mênu!'You have been entrusted to train and mentor a new soldier.A new recruit has come to Díngarth.

