'The Orc encampment to the west poses a grave threat to us, and all attempts to push past it have been stymied by the sentries there. Make your way into the encampment and defeat any of these sentries that you encounter, and they will no longer hinder us.''${PLAYER}, you continue to be a solid ally in this city most grim. Here is a small reward for your assistance.'Gothmog's forces are scattered throughout the area. Dolenthol asked you to seek out and defeat both scouts and defenders.Gothmog's scouts and defenders are patrolling the area and must be defeated.

