You should bring the untouched remains to Damrod.Dâr Grazadh, once a great guild-hall of Minas Ithil, is now a hall of rot that houses the Dead in caskets that line the walls. These caskets may have been brought here from Gondor's old burial houses just outside the city. Perhaps some of the remains have yet to be desecrated. You should search the caskets for untouched remains.'I am surprised you were able to find even a few untouched remains, but it is a welcome discovery. I will have these safely sent away to Minas Tirith, where they may once again know peace. I thank you for your efforts.'Armoured sentries under the command of those who control the Dead patrol the Circle of Sorrow.Armoured sentries can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.

