Defeat Blood-singer Maurgol.Defeat Blood-singer MaurgolDolenthol is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.

You should talk to Dolenthol.Talk to Dolenthol'${PLAYER}, I must tell you of a powerful morroval the Rangers encountered. They tell me they heard beautiful singing while scouting, and when they went to investigate the source, the Blood-singer fell on them with thrashing claws and terrible magic. Not all of them made it back alive. We must defeat this monster before more lives are lost!''She is defeated? Thank you, ${PLAYER}. The Rangers will be pleased to hear their fallen comrades have been avenged.'The Rangers have identified the merrevail captain in the Circle of Madness, and have asked for your help defeating him.Captain Hethulos can be found somewhere in the Circle of Madness.

