You should talk to Dolenthol.Talk to Dolenthol'The Rangers have located the morvul they believe to be in charge of the merrevail forces here in the Circle of Madness. He would be a formidable opponent. Would you be willing to challenge him while you are exploring this tier of the city?''The deed is done? Thank you, ${PLAYER}. The Rangers are fortunate to have you as an ally.'Some of the Rangers are missing, and Rhadrog would like help searching for them.Ambushed Rangers can be found in the Circle of Madness.

