'For now, however -- the Orcs hide caches of bombs in the unclaimed territory to the west, between Ashmargathâl and Târ-kútoz. There are already scouts out looking for the caches. I tried to join them, but they told me to stay back here and rest....

'Could you go in my stead? I trust that you're keen of eye and steady of hand. Dismantle and destroy any caches you come across.''Look, Hermáth! Mekhnet has returned to us! She said she's ready to be back on the field, but I told her she needed some rest first. She had to make her way up to us, after all!

