'I have sent one of my scouts, Gárjan, to bolster the forces that reclaimed it and aid in scouting the approach to Mount Gundabad. Zudramdân may prove a valuable watch-post in Elderslade, but its defences are in dire need of improvement.

'You are to travel to Zudramdân and meet with Gárjan at once!''Ah! Did Commander Glóin send you?

'Very good. There is much to be done, but first you'll want to report to Náth over there.'Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to learn more of his people's history in Misthallow.Léothred can be found at Framsburg.

