You should destroy the Orkish barricades at Zaghúth and help to make clear the way for the Haban'akkâ.Although the Redhorn Pass remains blocked, your efforts to impair the defences of Zaghúth has loosened the Orcs' grip on Barazinbar.Eager to put an end to the War of Three Peaks, Durin has devised a plan to reclaim Mount Gundabad.Durin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu.

