'Yes? You seem to be developing an eye for skill! It is true, I am not as accomplished with axes as I am with swords. The sword is a Zhélruka weapon. We will swing axes, if that is what we have at hand, but we do not prefer them. Let the Longbeards prize their axes; we will use whatever is necessary to achieve victory, whether that be sword, axe, or knife.''You have a good eye, friend. With practice perhaps you will become even more skilled at the art of appraisal.''Well? Let us see if Yrsa has trained you well in the art of appraisal. What can you tell of me?'

<u>Runerik Knotbeard, Beorning Chief of Limlók</u>
<rgb=#FFFF00>Skin-changing:</rgb> 95
<rgb=#FFFF00>Herbalism:</rgb> 85
<rgb=#FFFF00>Hardiness:</rgb> 85
