'Barricades alone may not stop Gorgar and his Orcs, but they will do much to aid in the defence of Zarkul-sulûn!'The northern settlement of Limlók needs its defences fortified, supplies replenished, and surrounding lands made safe.Yrsa Spearwife, Thyra, Sighild, and Trygvar can all be found in Limlók.

