You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók'I hope you do not think you have completed all your work. Look around you, ${PLAYER}. Does Limlók look prepared for an assault? Yes, perhaps we could handle one attack. It would be foolish of Gundabad to strike just once, however. I know they will come again and again until we fall.

'Now then, speak to my kin. They have more work for you to do.''You have done as you were bid, and for that I commend you. You have stayed in my village and not once were you a burden. I can not say the same for those dwarves who linger here and eat my food. I only let them stay because they saved Vaskorn's life.'There seems to be an abundance of crates filled with sapper-bombs in Atrad-zarakh.Crates of sapper-bombs can be found all over Atrad-zarakh.

