lete: Settlements in the Wells of LangfloodComplete: Treasure-seeker of the Wells of LangfloodComplete: Dwarf-surveys in the Wells of LangfloodComplete: Ruins in the Wells of LangfloodComplete: Natural Formations in the Wells of LangfloodAs Gultháva's enchantment fades, Isildur comes to remember the events at the close of the Second Age, when Mordor was besieged.Explore locations of bravery and heroism to be found within Isildur's tale of Mordor Besieged.Learn of Ram RaedasLearn of DíngarthLearn of Echad-in-EdhilLearn of AdambelLearn of Amon FuinLearn of Dol NaegLearn of HalrothLearn of Barad-dûrLearn of Baur KasakLearn of Mokh ShapatLearn of Mokh DargaLearn of BarthostLearn of UrshúlagarLearn of Matum GrazLearn of AngathraiLéothred, the Rohirric scholar, and his new friend Fróthi have been thrust ever closer towards the dangers of war in their quest to learn the truth about Fram and Scatha.Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.

