You should greet Landroval.Greet Landroval with a <rgb=#FF0000>bow</rgb>Landroval can be found at the tribute spot.

You should talk to Landroval.Talk to LandrovalHúbald Túcca can be found in Lyndelby.

You should talk to Húbald Túcca.Talk to Húbald Túcca in Lyndelby'Hullo, stranger! I am Húbald Túcca, but you may call me Hubo. Oh, you tried my pipe-weed? Pretty good, right? I wanted to speak with you because I heard that you know one of the Eagles.'

You explain that you have met a few of the Eagles throughout your various adventures.

'Oh my, I'm quite excited to hear that! I have the Eagles to thank for my very life. When I was but a small baby, I crawled away from Maddy in the mountain meadows. There, a ferocious wolf found me! Thankfully, before it could eat me an Eagle came swooping down and saved me! Since then, I knew I had to repay the Eagles however I could. I heard that birds like shiny trinkets, so I learned to mine the mountainside for gems which I smooth down into pretty trinkets for the Eagles! I thought you'd like to help since you know the Eagles so well!''Were you talking to that Eagle?! How very exciting! I saw the whole thing from afar. I am sure they will love the trinkets we crafted for them!''There is no need for formalities, ${PLAYER}.

'I did not expect you to journey to the Holbytlan, yet here you are. It seems you have taken part in their tribute ritual. I do not have the heart to tell them that Eagles do not seek out trinkets of any sort. However, we have found these trinkets make great weapons when dropped at height upon our enemies. Now, do not mention this to the Holbytlan. They are a happy and peaceful folk. Let us keep it that way, ${PLAYER}.'There are many occupants of the hidden village of Lyndelby who are curious to meet with you.Frogs can be found in Lyndelby.

You should collect frogs for Odger Túcca.Collect frogs for Odger Túcca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Odger Túcca can be found in Lyndelby.

You should bring Odger Túcca the frogs that you collected.'I like frogs. Always had a frog as a pet... ever since I was little. Now I don't have any. My pet frog, Croaker, just today passed away. I should go down to the river to get another, but I'm too sad right now. You know, you sure would bring a smile to Odger here if you got me a new frog pet.''Oh, look at all these frogs, sitting, and hopping, and croaking! I still miss Croaker, but I'm very happy with all my new friends! I guess I'll have to name them all. Where to start?!'There are many occupants of the hidden village of Lyndelby who are curious to meet with you.Apple trees can be found in Lyndelby.

You should pick apples for Ogiva Túcca.Pick apples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should deliver the apples to the market in Lyndelby.Ogiva Túcca can be found in Lyndelby.

You should talk to Ogiva Túcca.Talk to Ogiva Túcca in Lyndelby'I have never met a stranger before! Greetings, I am Ogiva Túcca. Grandmother says you seem nice enough, so I thought I would greet you myself. I would love to talk more but I must pick the ripe apples in the orchard and bring them to the market. Say, it would be very kind of you to help me out! Kindness goes a long way in earning one's trust, you know!''Oh, it was very nice of you to pick all those ripe apples for me! You do have a lot of kindness for a stranger! Stay as long as you like in Lyndelby!'There are many occupants of the hidden village of Lyndelby who are curious to meet with you.Bait to gather can be found in Lyndelby.

You should gather bait for Ubbo Bolga.Check fish traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gather fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Gather worms for bait (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Bait buckets can be found in Lyndelby.

You should deliver the bait to Ubbo Bolga.Ubbo Bolga can be found in Lyndelby.

You should talk to Ubbo Bolga.Talk to Ubbo Bolga in Lyndelby'Greetings, I am Ubbo Bolga. Fishing is an important part of life for all of us in Lyndelby. There is nothing like being on the lazy river on a sunny day, waiting for a fish to bite! All this talk about fishing makes me want to go fishing right now! Oh what a bother, I've not gathered any bait for the day! Would you be a kind stranger and gather the bait for me while I gather my fishing supplies? That would be ever so kind of you! Worms are found here and there, all around Lyndelby. Traps are by the water's edge for catching the smaller fish that we use for bait.''Oh, that is simply perfect! Look at all of that bait! Time for me to go catch a fish or two! The bigger the fish, the better the meal, that's what I always say!'There are many occupants of the hidden village of Lyndelby who are curious to meet with you.The picnic basket and blanket can both be found in Lyndelby.

You should gather up the picnic items so that you can go on a picnic with Valaric Túcca.Collect the picnic basketGather up the picnic blanketAn adequate picnic spot can be found in Lyndelby.

