You have delivered the antidote to the poisoned warriors at Amdân. You should return to Thorin.'As King Thráin commanded, Edash has prepared more of his antidote for those poisoned by Orkish arrows.

'Several such warriors have taken rest at Amdân, but unless their ailment is soon cured, it is unlikely they will fully recover.

'Here, take this. Deliver it to every poisoned warrior you can find at Amdân!''If the Orcs did not stoop to such underhanded methods, we would have overcome them months ago. But I suppose it is their way, vile as it is.

'You have done well, my friend.'Lóssi needs a helping hand.Injured scouts are scattered in and around Annâk-khurfu.

