Lóssi, who is at Annâk-khurfu, will want to know.'Being able to defend and heal others is a sign of a good soldier. I trust that, with your experience, you've healed many a wound before.

'Several scouts around Annâk-khurfu need aid. Do your best to patch them up, and the healers will do a more thorough job later.''You did well. Seems like they'll sleep soundly tonight.'

