'A scout returned while you were away with news of a Warg camp not far from where you found my clumsy brother. If you are still of a mind to help, make your way to Howlers' Notch and put down as many of those abominations as you can.

'Good luck! Oh, and, I've heard tell of a monstrous Warg in that area, so do be careful.''Welcome back, friend! I heard you made a fine accounting of yourself! I am sorry you have been saddled with my duties, but am most glad that you are more than up to the task until I'm back on my feet.'

