You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Shakal-atrâd'Ah, ${PLAYER}, have you come to join me on a hunt? There's a beast upon the battlefield. They call the beast Azhatar. That is the beast I seek.''Call me to your side when you wish to begin the hunt.''The hunt was a success, as I knew it would be. The kill of Azhatarg is our reward! It has been a day well spent. Come let us return to Shakal-atrâd.''Rest well, for the war carries on. There may be other hunts upon the battlefield before the war's end. Good hunting, ${PLAYER}.'The frigid winds that whip through the valley of Azanulbizar can cut through even the thickest beard. Fires burn brightly but quickly, and fuel for their hungry flames is always in demand.Wood for burning and valley-stalking Orcs can be found in the forests outside of Amdân.

