Bring the wood to Dráttur.Return to Dráttur'Days in this valley are barely warmer than the frigid nights here. While you are out in the forest, gather fallen branches for firewood, that we might not freeze our beards off out here. You will be competing with Orcs who stalk the forests for resources, so mind yourself. Defeat the stalkers as you see them, that we might have less enemies to resist our attacks. You may even find stacks of wood they have already cut for themselves.''A good haul you've brought. Our fires will burn strong this night.'The Angmarim town of Dûn Traikh holds dangerous stores of foul black powder.Dûn Traikh is in western Elderslade.

