Return to Hlóthi.Speak to Hlóthi'Haha! We kicked the hornet's nest now, haven't we, ${PLAYER}? The enemy is frantically swarming out of Gundabad in a paltry attempt to block our forward progress. Do what you can to thin their ranks. Anything you manage will be of great help to the Gabil'akkâ!''Good work! Surely their fear of our might is much increased. We may not rest yet, however, but must continue until Gundabad is ours!'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has asked for your assistance in routing the forces outside Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.Hlóthi has requested your aid in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle'Locate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.Speak to Hlóthi'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind.

