'The Orcs are many, and though we and our cousins are hardy folk, it will take a great effort and a great supply of meat to feed the Haban'akkâ.

'If even a few of our warriors could hunt moose, deer, and boar in the course of their duties, it would ease our burden. Will you aid us, Hermáth?''Well done, my friend. There remain many mouths to feed at Amdân, but our warriors will eat their fill this night!'Shades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure.Shades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure. If combat will lay these spirits to rest, it falls to you to make the attempt.Defeat shades near the abandoned houseShades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure. If combat will lay these spirits to rest, it falls to you to make the attempt.Defeat shades near the abandoned house (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Completed.CompletedShades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure. If combat will lay these spirits to rest, it falls to you to make the attempt.You do not know if your efforts here will last, but for now you have given rest to some of the shades haunting this abandoned house in the Floodfells. Those spirits that remain will serve as a reminder and a warning to those who dare draw near: not all houses that seem empty are truly so....The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort.The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort. Complete 'March on Gundabad: Assisting the War Effort' several times to push forward the effort.Complete 'March on Gundabad: Assisting the War Effort' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Your assistance in completing several sorties for the Gabil'akkâ has been noted. Seek out Stálskeg Ironbeard and inform him of your deeds.Speak to Stálskeg Ironbeard'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has need of your assistance in the ongoing war effort.

