You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam.Raise a banner of the Haban’akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam'The Haban'akkâ has need of your aid, my friend.

'I have received word that our enemies at Rung-shakam again seek to rain boulders on our warriors from above the East-gate. I have no doubt more Orcs with capable enough hands have begun to sound the war-drums once more, but they and their crude instruments must be silenced!

'Let our enemies at Rung-shakam know the wrath of the Haban'akkâ!'Find rare treasure chests in Cirith Ungol.Find rare treasure chests in Cirith Ungol.Find rare treasure chests in Cirith UngolFind rare treasure chests in Minas Morgul.Find rare treasure chests in Minas Morgul.Find rare treasure chests in Minas MorgulFind rare treasure chests in Mordor Besieged.Find rare treasure chests in Mordor Besieged.Find rare treasure chests in Mordor BesiegedFind rare treasure chests in Rath Dúath.Find rare treasure chests in Rath Dúath.Find rare treasure chests in Rath DúathFind rare treasure chests in Thuringwath.Find rare treasure chests in Thuringwath.Find rare treasure chests in ThuringwathThe healer Thrúthug is running out of supplies to ease the pain of injured scouts.Hanksar-mokh is located to the west of Drenghól.

