You should return to Sárgo.Talk to Sárgo'I require your assistance again, friend. The scouts you rescued are recovering from their ordeal. While we wait for their return, we need help covering the other areas they were to inspect.''Excellent work, Hermáth. The information you gathered will be instrumental in planning our attacks upon the enemy.'Explore important points of interest and natural landmarks within Câr Bronach.Explore important points of interest and natural landmarks within Câr Bronach.Explore LeitstáthExplore Crágan BrisExplore GrúmachathExplore EiglinnExplore ClavanailExplore EirichávExplore the dark and dreadful sites that lie within Thuringwath.Explore the dark and dreadful sites that lie within Thuringwath.Explore Falch GurthExplore TorgrisExplore AufaltorExplore UfurokExplore LaugdurshExplore Bâr NírnaethWas the scrap of fabric torn from the fluttering cloak or off the thief? Or could it be some haunted relic of a passing ghost?Aboki is located in Amdân.

