Glóin has asked you to aid him and his scouts in securing the approach to Mount Gundabad.Talk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu'By order of Prince Durin, I have sent a number of my scouts across Elderslade to prepare the way for the Gabil'akkâ.

'None of us know what awaits us at Mount Gundabad, and it is a fool's hope to think Gorgar the Ruthless is not also keenly aware of that fact.

'You are a skilled warrior, a practised adventurer, and wise to the dangers that lurk in unexplored territory. And so, I would have you aid my scouts, ${PLAYER}.''Well done!

'Thanks to you, my scouts have returned to Annâk-khurfu no worse for the wear. The Gabil'akkâ stand ready to march on Mount Gundabad.

