d Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, lies just east of Gundabad. Zhurmat, with his fearsome mount the horrible two-headed troll Groz-and-Ulk, leads a force that threatens the Gabil'akkâ below.Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle-- Tier 4'On the eastern edge of Gundabad, troops are amassing for a flank on the main dwarf-settlement below. Led by Zhurmat, a goblin atop a two-headed troll, this small army poses a grave threat to all within Elderslade.Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle -- Tier 5'A hidden entrance called Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, lies just east of Gundabad. Zhurmat, with his fearsome mount the horrible two-headed troll Groz-and-Ulk, leads a force that threatens the Gabil'akkâ below.Complete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle-- Tier 5'By completing this quest, you will automatically complete the Shakalush, the Stair Battle, tiers 1-5 raid deeds.'Deeds! Get your Shakalush, the Stair Battle Deeds here!

