You should talk to Mother Amma.Talk to Mother Amma'${PLAYER}, I am deeply concerned about these fell rocks. I have consulted the Gem-cutter family tome, and I believe that these crystals are of an element called sarrowstone. The rocks you have found appear to have been altered in some way, however. There is some unholy power in these sarrowstones that seems responsible for the mutations in the Wargs you have been battling.

'I have crushed a few of these stones on my anvil and the corruption dissipates like dust when they are destroyed. I hear that you are heading north to battle more of the enemy at Malkorlash. Whilst there, shatter any sarrowstones you come across, my friend.''A sad business. I am not in the habit of destroying crystals, but in this case we were left with no choice.'The White Company has a small quantity of Motes available.Collect 100 Sigils of Imlad Ithil to trade with the White Company Quartermaster.

