'Let them hearten the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ! Let our banners march with us to the foot of Mount Gundabad!'You have planted banners of the Gabil'akkâ from Zarkul-sulûn to Azgh-buzru, and in so doing, advanced the War of Three Peaks into the very shadow of Mount Gundabad.

