You should talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól.Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól'A few dwarves went on ahead, though I begged them not to. It is too dangerous to the west. I gave them a warning, but I am not here to argue with them. I am here to win this war. I would appreciate it if you would search for them. The last I heard they had found a cave under a statue. Drenghól I think it was called. I am sure they could use assistance. They are behind enemy lines, after all!''How did you know that we were here, ${CLASS}?! Oh, Náth told you? I suppose that is all right then, as we captured  Zudramdân together. A few of us went on to establish this small but very well hidden encampment. What do you think? Yes, it is quite well hidden!

'We are scouting the outer walls of Gundabad. Will you assist us? Good, good!''Did you find any hidden entrances into Gundabad or any weaknesses in the enemies defences? Nor did I! Bah, between these well organized Orcs and impeccable dwarf-craft, we are up against quite an enemy force here!'Across the battlefield, dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ fight against the Orcs of Gundabad. However, even the halest dwarf can be laid low by the underhanded ploys of the Orcs, and those wounded in the field are in dire need of aid.Wounded dwarves can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.

Lági Helmbiter has received word that several wounded dwarves are trapped on the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should aid them and send them to Ifbar-athrâkh.Aid wounded dwarves on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Lági Helmbiter can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.

You have aided several wounded dwarves on the battlefield and sent them to recover at Ifbar-athrâkh. You should report news of your success to Lági Helmbiter.Talk to Lági Helmbiter'I have received reports that several wounded dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ have become trapped on the battlefield.

'It seems many have only sprains and minor wounds, but if they cannot soon get to shelter, the Orcs of Gundabad will put them to death. You must find the wounded on the battlefield and aid them as best you can.

'Do whatever you must to get them back on their feet. Once they are able to stand, send them to Ifbar-athrâkh.

'The Gabil'akkâ leave none behind!''I am glad you have returned, ${PLAYER}.

'Ifbar-athrâkh may not be a house of healing, but the dwarves you rescued will be safe here for a time. I shall see that their wounds are tended at once.

'You have my thanks... and those you aided have offered their truest gratitude!'Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, seeks to hear from Skarding Wargsbane and learn of the difficulties the lone Beorning may face in Misthallow.Misthallow can be found north of the Floodfells.

You should travel to Thokvist in the southern end of Misthallow.Travel to Thokvist in MisthallowSkarding Wargsbane can be found at Thokvist.

You should talk to Skarding.Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at ThokvistFanglind can be found at Thokvist.

