You decide to bring this trophy to Elgur, a skilled taxidermist of the Landorrim, that it might be appraised.'Ah, what is this you have brought me?'

Elgur inspects Skegghorn's horns closely. After a moment, he pauses and his eyes widen.

'I do not believe it. There are traces of mithril! What long-lost seam had this mighty ox unwittingly discovered at Azanulbizar?! What a find, Hermáth!'After encountering the mighty Warg, Zaugnakh, you have claimed a trophy that may be of value to the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.Elgur can be found at Amdân during the Battle of Azanulbizar in T.A. 2799.

