Agnar Brokentooth has ordered you to aid the other veterans of the Sixth War of the Orcs and Dwarves in breaking a stalemate in the battlefield around Zudramdân. You should also scout the eastern and western passes by Zudramdân and learn more of the Orkish trench-tunnel, Ushkútoz.Aid Agnar with 'Ruthless and Ramshackle'Aid Reithvald with 'Embedded in the Battlefield'Aid Lági with 'To Fight Another Day'Scout the eastern entrance to UshkútozScout the western entrance to UshkútozScout the eastern pass around ZudramdânScout the western pass around ZudramdânAgnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.

