'We should follow the road back to Annâk-khurfu and defeat any scouts we come across. Call for me when you wish to begin.''I am ready.''We are done here. I will venture ahead and meet you at Annâk-khurfu. Rékkur may be waiting for you.''${PLAYER}, this stranger -- Aighrig -- claimed that she's the messenger. I'll admit, the bat is awfully friendly towards her. Maybe she's telling the truth.'

