'What a strange turn of events! Normally, I would not so easily trust a stranger, but if she's been tracking Orcs attacking our supply trains, she must be the one who healed me after that ambush. I'll trust her for now. The more help we can get, the better our chances at solving this mystery.'After mysteriously arriving in Elderslade during the War of Three Peaks, a force of Dourhands has occupied the Angmarim settlement of Caivád Sâr.Dourhands can be found at Caivád Sâr and within Tûr Ágal.

