You should talk to Thurindol.Talk to Thurindol'Our scholars have shared with me the final texts they were able to decipher. It would seem there are only five artifacts which we seek to destroy. You have done well in destroying the first four, ${PLAYER}. I am sure that you will be victorious in this final task.

'The final artifact rest upon an altar in the Circle of Death. Quickly now, we must get to it before anyone else.''To think that Thargaun was so closely tied to these artifacts. That explains why he could not leave the Vale nor perish. Now that all five artifacts are destroyed, I do not believe we shall ever see Thargaun again.

'We should rejoice on this day ${PLAYER}! You have torn down the veil of sorcery upon Minas Morgul. Now the evil will surely fade and our reclamation of Minas Ithil will succeed in time. We thank you for your assistance. I do not believe we could have made it this far in our goals without you. For Gondor!''You have been nothing but trouble for me, ${RACE}. No matter! Soon I shall have a servant and a proper body to leave this Vale and lead the dead to conquer Mordor! You are too late this time!'For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of despair has begun.The Altar of Despair can be found in the Circle of Despair in Minas Morgul.

