You should destroy the Orb of Despair.Destroy the Orb of DespairThurindol can be found at Echad Uial.

You should talk to Thurindol.Talk to Thurindol'Our best scholars have learned more from the pages you obtained, ${PLAYER}. They now understand that each artifact assists in maintaining the protective layer of sorcery that envelops the city. If we destroy all the artifacts, the aura of sorcery around Minas Morgul will begin to decay.

'What is more, we now know the location of the fourth artifact. It rests in a chamber upon the Circle of Despair. Quickly now, we must make for the chamber and destroy the artifact!'You show Tordoron the etching.

'I am not sure what to make of this etching. Perhaps I will be able to study it soon. Set it down on our map table for now so I will remember it later.''I thank you for undergoing the difficult task of destroying the fourth artifact. You have done well in your efforts. I hope soon we shall learn more about where the next artifact lies. Until then, we shall continue our efforts in reclaiming Imlad Morgul for Gondor.''You say the gems on that plaque you encountered might be a map? That sounds a worth while investigation! I would recommend searching the location that is closest to us first, just in case your theory is proven false. You are still needed here after all!'For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of madness has begun.Viznak can be found at Barad Elenath.

