You should talk to Thurindol.Talk to Thurindol'You have succeeded in this first trial and the destruction of Orb of Wrath. Now the time has come to find the second artifact. Our scholars have continued their studies of the text and have concluded that it can be found upon the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul. We shall search for it at once!''I grow weary of our confrontations! You must have realized by now that I can not be defeated.

'Yes, I know the artifact you seek. Why ever would you care about such a useless trinket! No matter, you will never find it here in the city, ${CLASS}. I have hidden it away, with Ungwetári's brood. Search for it! That search will only lead to your death. Then I will finally be rid of you!''${PLAYER}, you have returned. It has been a while and I feared you lost! What news of you about the second artifact?

'I see, you travelled to Cirith Ungol and undertook a trial of sorrow. I am glad you were able to overcome a trial such as this. It must have been a heavy burden to shoulder alone.'For those reclaiming Minas Ithil from the grasp of darkness, a trial of wrath has begun.Orcs can be found upon the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.

