'If you come across any Morgul plaster or treated dowels, will you gather them for us? Our crafters have been asking for these items in particular.''You have returned with the items I asked of you? You have my thanks.'From among the ranks of the Wargs who infest the walls of Azanulbizar champions are chosen to bear the enemy's most elite warriors.Defeat Warg champions in Azanulbizar.Valdi can be found in Amdân.

You should talk to Valdi.Return to Valdi'The mountain passes and hillsides are filled with deadly Wargs. Their burrows wind deep under hill and mountain, where they breed faster than Men. From among their ranks, the deadliest and strongest are chosen to bear the enemy into battle. We must do what we can to thin their ranks before the enemy gains these allies.''You have put a sizeable dent in the Warg population, my friend. The enemy will have to walk on their own two feet to the battlefield now, hah hah!'Warg-riders are on the loose throughout the Floodfells, searching for easy prey.Warg-riders are a dangerous threat to the people who live within the Floodfells, and those who must adventure there.Defeat Warg-riders in the FloodfellsWarg-riders from Gundabad threaten the peace and safety of those who live within the Floodfells.Defeat Warg-riders in the Floodfells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You defeated many Warg-riders within the Floodwells.CompletedWarg-riders prowl the hills and valleys of the Floodfells, searching for easy prey and serving as the eyes of their dark masters in Gundabad. They must be defeated before they are able to return to the mountains with report of your movements along the Langflood.The Warg-riders you defeated will not return to Gundabad with report of your movements. That silence may also speak volumes to their dark masters, but that is a risk you have chosen to take. The folk who do live in the Floodfells will be safer for your efforts.Many were the Wargs slain during the Battle of Azanulbizar.Many were the Wargs slain during the Battle of Azanulbizar.Learn of the Wargs slain at AzanulbizarMany were the Wargs slain during the Battle of Azanulbizar.Many were the Wargs slain during the Battle of Azanulbizar.Learn of the Wargs slain at AzanulbizarDefeat many Wargs in Elderslade.Defeat many Wargs in Elderslade.Defeat Wargs in EldersladeDefeat many Wargs in Elderslade.Defeat many Wargs in Elderslade.Defeat Wargs in Elderslade