Thorin has tasked you with collecting animal pelts to help keep warm the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.Collect wolf pelts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect bear pelts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect Warg pelts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Thorin can be found at Amdân.

You should deliver the pelts to Thorin.'Hail, friend!

'The chill of winter is felt by all of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin, though some of our cousins are less accustomed to the cold. The Haban'akkâ has need of pelts that our crafters might make blankets and line the clothing of our warriors.

'Bears, wolves, and Wargs all dwell beyond these walls. Will you aid us and gather some pelts?''Well done! These ought to keep our brethren warm for a time.

