After speaking with Hermáth Stormhammer, King Thorin seems relieved. You should talk to King Thorin.Talk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú'I think that went well, my friend.''Ah, good! Hersegg is home.

'It has been too long since last I spoke to Hermáth....'

King Thorin notes a look of surprise on your face. After a moment, he raises an eyebrow in what seems to be some sort of amusement.

'Hah! Hermáth may have grown old, but he is still a hale warrior—and very much alive! I thought that was clear, my friend!

'Hersegg seems quite engrossed in her reading. Would you find out if Hermáth is around?''Oh, I am sorry, ${PLAYER}. I didn't even hear you come in!'

You ask Hersegg if Hermáth is around, also noting the slight misunderstanding you had with King Thorin regarding her grandfather.

'Grandfather Hermáth? I never said he was dead!

Hersegg chuckles to herself.

'Yes, yes, of course. I'll let him know that King Thorin is here!''A moment, ${PLAYER}?'

King Thorin clears his throat, seemingly a bit uneasy.

'I believe it is time I spoke to Hermáth—both to offer him a proposal and to apologize.''My heart feels lighter this day, ${PLAYER}.

'I am pleased that Hermáth and I could finally speak plainly of our sorrows. And I am even more pleased that he has entertained the idea of joining the Gabil'akkâ!'A messenger bearing deliveries needs help to find their recipients.The messenger Ingvild has asked you to deliver mail to Ekhfás, Kólun, and Svíthi in Amdân.

