'Hm, but you know your way around Amdân, don't you? More than me, at any rate! Could you help me get these sent to... Ekhfás at the Temámir camp, Kólun at the Zhélruka camp, and Svíthi at the Narfanghoth camp? No need to come to me once you're done -- I'll be gone by then. Thanks!''Ah, is this for me? Sweets from my friends... and enough to share! Would you like some?''A letter! I thought this day would never come. I wonder what mischief my son has got himself into this time!''From my wife...? Excuse me, friend. If you don't mind, I'd like to open my package alone. I'm afraid my company won't be as enjoyable the moment I start crying, heh.'You have delivered the mail to their rightful recipients. The messenger is gone by now, but you've carried out her instructions to the letter.The old dwarf-ruins of Shakal-atrâd have been defiled by Gundabad forces for many years.Shakal-atrâd can be found in central Elderslade.

