'When we have subdued the frenzied stone-claws and gathered these strange runes, let us continue to the Steepset. A group of dwarves has recently gained control of the throne of Zidir-nesad.''I do not know what to make of these runes. I am certain they are the cause of frenzy in some of these stone-claws, however. There must be someone of note at the Steepset to whom we can bring these runes.''Hmm, I have not seen these runes before. They look faintly Angmarim, from what I have seen of their buildings and obelisks. If there is any fell sorcery inside of them, then they must be destroyed.'The adventurous Beorning, Varthmath, has accompanied the dwarves in their efforts to reclaim Gundabad.Varthmath can be found at Maergrind, The Noble Gate of Máttugard.

