'Either way I would like to assist Lóssi further and patrol the entrance to Deepscrave for him. Would you like to accompany me?''There are not as many Orcs at the edge of the Deepscrave as I thought there would be, ${PLAYER}. Perhaps we misread those orders after all.'The old gardens of Máttugard lay barren, but with some work, they may once again feed the dwarves within the Mighty Court.A good place to fill up the empty water jug and the planters can be found in south-west Máttugard.

