You should bring the banded gold to Dargumë.'${CLASS}, perhaps you can assist me with something. I have acquired four types of minerals that I have found in Máttugard. I am having a difficult time deciding which one to seek out first. Would you examine the four samples and give me your opinion?''The banded gold you say? Yes I was leaning towards that mineral as well! That amethyst is quite beautiful though. I am torn!

'Ah, what if we each collect one type of stone? I will attempt to collect some more of the amethyst and you can search for the banded gold. What do you say?''Wonderful! I was able to find an adequate amount of amethyst as well! Thank you! These will make fine jewellery in the hands of skilled crafters!'Gazathrug's fear of losing the Upper Reaches of Máttugard are quite warranted.Gazathrug's outpost can be found in the southern part of Máttugard.

You should talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost.Talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpostZidir-nesad, the Steepset, can be found in the western part of Máttugard.

