'We must defeat these hobgoblin brutes and destroy their wards at once. If we are not swift, then the hobgoblins will believe us to be weak, and move to crush us!''You have done well, but we cannot celebrate our victory just yet. I have received some new information from a scout: it concerns the Angmarim.'Will you pledge to lend your aid and your adventuring skills to the Zhélruka and fight on their behalf in Gundabad?The hall of Vérnozal can be found in Máttugard by the Steepset.

