'Have you met Zóva yet? She is Prince Ingór's top advisor. You should speak with her in Vérnozal. The entrance to the hall can be found near the Steepset.''Greetings, ${CLASS}. I am Zóva, advisor to Prince Ingór. I have heard about you from the Prince himself! It would seem you have been very helpful to the Zhélruka cause for these past few weeks. Have you come to Vérnozal to assist the Zhélruka once again, and make certain our goal of complete triumph in Gundabad? Prince Ingór is quite busy but if you hail him, I am certain he will take the time to speak with you.'Something stirs the creatures of Máttugard from within the caverns, deep under the Mighty Court.Varthmath can be found near Ronglagam in Máttugard.

