You should talk to Voina at Zidir-nesad.Talk to Voina at Zidir-nesad'${PLAYER}, while exploring Ronglagam, I noticed a crack leading towards a large underground cavern system. Perhaps whomever placed the runes on the buildings, placed some in the caverns beneath Ronglagam. Should we continue our search within the caverns?''I am ready whenever you are, ${PLAYER}.''There is no doubt in my mind that the obelisk we destroyed was a creation of the Angmarim. I saw such fell structures during the War of Three Peaks. However, I have not seen a single Angmarim outpost in all of Máttugard. We should speak with Voina about what we have learned. While Máttugard is certainly safer, these runes are troubling still.''You destroyed an Angmarim obelisk deep under Máttugard? I have had my suspicions, but nothing I would consider a solid fact. Your find does partially confirm my suspicion, however. I do not believe the Angmarim are yet in Máttugard. I believe that someone else is placing their fell structures for them!'Zidir-nesad, the seat of Gundabad’s lord, has been broken and stripped of its seven sacred jewels.The three types of stone Rísti Graver seeks can be found in Máttugard.

