Gazat-fark and Durbángh sit at the bottom level of Deepscrave.Destroy blacksmithing tools at Gazat-fark and DurbánghDestroying blacksmithing tools at Gazat-fark and Durbángh would briefly halt the progress of arming Gorgar's forces.

