Hórskur has asked for samples from each type of drakeling there.Collect caustic drake-whelp samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Collect chilling drake-whelp samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have collected a few samples from each type of drakeling.

Hórskur is waiting for you in Aslíf on the upper tier to return with the samples.'${PLAYER}, hello! I decided it was time to move on from studying the wildlife in Elderslade. After all, it's been many long years since my people have set foot within Gundabad!

'I have been asked to study the two distinct types of drakelings in Kordh Gúrat to the south-west, a level below the middle tier. I'll need a few samples of each, but I haven't been able to get close to them myself. If you could help me procure these samples, it would be much appreciated!''All of these samples look quite useable, and you've procured enough for me to study. Thank you for your hard work, friend!'Each time the Orcs of Durshulot attack Aslíf, they erode the Gabil'akkâ's resources.Orkish weapons can be found around Durshulot to the north-west, on the middle tier.

