'Ah, this shall make a fine trophy! I shall preserve this rare find. There are many dangerous creatures living in Gundabad. Let us hope fewer creatures trouble us in Gundabad in the days to come!'Shakhajât is full of hobgoblin weapons, and Klúso believes this is a good opportunity to destroy them.Hobgoblin weapons can be found throughout Shakhajât, and should be destroyed.Destroy hobgoblin weapons in Shakhajât (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Klúso is waiting for your report.Talk to Klúso'You probably noticed that Shakhajât is full of all kinds of hobgoblin weapons! They are surely of poor quality, but while we're here we should destroy as many of them as we can! Even a dull blade can do some damage, after all, and we have dwarves to protect!

