'It's a good thing we've got some extra bombs. They'll do the trick, no problem!''Fine work, ${PLAYER}! This will surely set the hobgoblins back! It will take weeks for them to replace all those weapons.''Fine work, ${PLAYER}! This will surely set the hobgoblins back! It will take weeks for them to replace all those weapons.'Kyrstig has asked you to defeat the risen dwarves in Akhaldarâg.The tombs at Akhaldarâg are located in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.Defeat dwarf-wights in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Kyrstig is scouting outside Akhaldarâg.Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg'The Angmarim have already raised wights from the ancient dwarves interred in the smaller tombs, like these ones at Akhaldarâg. They must be defeated and the fell spirits within banished, so the dwarves can return to their rest!''I have had nightmares before, ${PLAYER}, but none so bad as this. We must do what we can to keep our honoured dead from being used against us in this way! Such terrible enemies we face to conceive of such villainy!'The sacred Jewel of Masal has been found.Rísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard.

