You should collect Dourhand supply-crates at Mur Shatraug for the good of the Gabil'akkâ.You have collected many supply-crates at Mur Shatraug, depriving the Dourhands loyal to the Iron Crown of vital resources. These supply-crates will be searched and their contents will be used to aid the Gabil'akkâ in the reclamation of Mount Gundabad.Encamped at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate, the Dourhands loyal to the Iron Crown dutifully guard the pass to Câr Bronach.Defeat Dourhands at Mur ShatraugDourhands can be found at Mur Shatraug in Câr Bronach.

