'Now, I am assisting a cause that aligns with my own. It is currently a bit of a respite as I was about to feed our rescued crows and pick some blood-root. Would you care to assist me?''I thank you, ${PLAYER}. It is good to see some of the Trév Gállorg and Trév Duvárdain working as one.

'Now, if you would give a blood-root to Lúkhag before setting the remaining in a chest. I see Lúkhag eying what you have picked!'You feed Lúkhag a blood-root. Lúkhag looks as grateful as a bat ought to look after being fed, you suppose.Leitstáth, the small encampment of dwarves in Câr Bronach has been tasked with keeping an eye on nearby stone-giants.Leitstáth can be found in south east Câr Bronach.

