You should talk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar.Talk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar'Let us enter the Drearspire and find Ásachal and her devoted followers. There is not a moment to lose.''Hold a moment, ${PLAYER}. This place is a labyrinth of stairways and halls that seemingly go nowhere! We must scale the tower together! Here is a horn. May you use it if we become separated.

'The Dourhands said that while we should defeat as many cultists as we can, only a certain four would topple their hold in Tûr Fúar. High Priestess Ásachal is the obvious target, as is her second in command, Warlord Claghórd. We are also to target two powerful priestesses, Curcúan and Lasairë. Let us hope that we are able to find all four. For Gundabad!''Do you think I would allow you to reach High Priestess Ásachal? If we must fight...''We have done it! There is only but one task at hand for us to accomplish. Meet me at the base of the stairs that lead to the very top of the Drearspire.''Now it is time to secure the powerful artifact the Dourhands speak of.'The Trév Duvárdain at the encampment of Tâg Fógarrach remain loyal servants of the Iron Crown.Tâg Fógarrach can be found in western Câr Bronach.

