You decide to bring this trophy to Belga Defthand, a skilled taxidermist of the Longbeards, so that it might be preserved once Gundabad is reclaimed.'What have you brought me now?'

Belga Defthand inspects Skerla's head closely, holding it up to the light at Steepset.

'Ah, this shall make a fine trophy! I shall preserve this rare find. There are many dangerous creatures living in Gundabad. Let us hope fewer creatures trouble us in Gundabad in the days to come!'Sundered in battles long ago between Angmar and the Zhélruka, Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire looms over Câr Bronach like a twisted, skeletal talon.Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach.

