'If you wish to aid them, you must navigate the Deepscrave. When you have travelled as far west as you are able, you will find Zâram-mekhem, the sacred threshold of Gloomingtarn.''Ah! I almost didn't hear you, ${PLAYER}. As you'll soon learn for yourself, there are strange echoes in this place... strange, indeed.

'It seems I was perhaps misinformed of the state of things in Gloomingtarn. I arrived quite prepared to survey the sacred tarn as it was tasked of me by Prince Durin himself, but I did not expect my studies to be hindered by Orcs and wicked Men of all things!

