Lore-master Rúni has directed you to speak with Málur about the journal.'Glad I am to hear that the crystals’ corruption did not spread to the sabre-tooth cats.

'I was making headway with this cursed journal, but the writing has slipped into what I believe to be the Black Speech. Here, take the book up to Bazanmanar, and find Lore-master Rúni. He may be able to decipher these fell scrawlings. I shall meet you there.''Málur was captured by White Hand Orcs when he was quite young. He learned their speech and one of their captains taught him to read, finding it entertaining to have a slave speaking those foul words. He escaped some years later, having slipped a dagger into the captain's ribs before he left. He is a scholar now, but you should ask him some day about how many Orcs he slew on his way back to our people.''Aye, I am Málur. A journal, you say? Well, give it here.''Ah, welcome to Clovengap, ${PLAYER}! There is a dragon nearby!'

You show him the journal and ask if he can read it.

