'Right, let us return to the map. The honey jar gives me hope that the stories of Zigilmarn, the fabled Clovengap honey-wine, are true! I read that there were vineyards on the far shores of the Kurdushâlak. See what you can find, if you please? I shall meet you across the river, at Hagbuth.''The honey jar gives me hope that the stories of Zigilmarn, the fabled Clovengap honey-wine, are true!''Welcome back! Did you find the vineyards?

