Mother Amma has asked you to see what progress Rúni has made.Talk to Rúni'Now then, I know not what to make of these fragments of torn paper that you collected. They look like they could form a map, but the writing on them is incomprehensible to me. Lore-master Rúni borrowed the journal and its translation as soon as he heard mention of dragons. Bring the fragments to him and see if he can decipher their meaning.''Corrupted drakes? Terrible news! Glad am I that you have dealt with this situation, my friend.

