'The records speak of a grand, open-air museum, full of gems, precious metals, and stone gathered across Gundabad. All I could uncover is that it lies north of here, "above the river, where the gems might glitter in the light of the sun's rays." Well, good luck, friend!''You found Tharrkirîn?'

You tell Gerja about the empty pedestal.

