'These are not conditions we will want our reinforcements to deal with on their way to the peak. We should do something about those grims, ${PLAYER}.''You cleared away the ice grims that threaten the path up the mountain? Good! I thought I felt it getting a little warmer!

'Brrrr, the wind returns. Perhaps it was just my imagination. Still, you did good work against those grims, ${PLAYER}!'The time has come to continue up the mountain in search of Kyrstig, the last of Ausma's apprentices.Kyrstig, the last of Ausma's scouts, can be found further up the Father's Path.

