You should return to Molkha in the valley.Talk to Molkha in the valleyYou have found the remains of a fallen dwarf in a ritual circle. This body is rather fresh, which means it was not taken from an ancient crypt and was likely a Longbeard of the Gabil'akkâ. You cannot allow this dwarf to be dishonoured in this way. You should burn the body and any others in Mullach Cagar before the Angmarim turn them into wights.'The Angmarim had moved recently fallen dwarves to Mullach Cagar, and were using foul rituals to turn them into wights? Those monsters! Thank you for keeping the honoured dead from such a fate.'Many drakes and worms thrive in the cliff-nests of Flogalith. They pose a danger to any who pass through the Welkin-lofts.Drakes and worms nest high in the cliffs above the Welkin-lofts. Their presence endangers your mission here.

