You should talk to Molkha.Talk to Molkha in the valley'The drakes have made themselves some sort of nest high atop the cliffs above this frozen lake. From there they can spy on much of the Welkin-lofts, and fly anywhere their mistress commands. I think it would be wise to thin their numbers before we attempt to bring our army through here. And that is not even to mention how soon they will realize we have set up camp just on the other side of that hill!

'I'm sure Hórin will not mind if you take a break from slaying Angmarim to focus on this new enemy. Trust me: the drakes are just as dangerous, if not more so!''I could see you thrashing those blue lizards from here, and I tell you it was quite a sight to behold, even from this distance! We should take some time to spar when our mission is not so urgent, ${PLAYER}. You could teach me some of your tricks, and I daresay you might learn something of my own combat prowess, as well!'Náth has asked you to clear a den of wolves west of Fellgát.Náth has asked you to find the wolf den called Draurákh west of Fellgát and defeat the wolves within.

