You should talk to Náth in Fellgát.Talk to Náth at Fellgát'I know you are eager to venture higher up the mountain-side with Hórin, but I have one last thing to ask you. Molkha has reported that she found a den of wolves near the drake feeding grounds. In such a location she will need to watch both the skies above and the ground underfoot, and that has me worried!

'Can you clear that wolf-den and ensure, for now, that she has only one danger to worry about? I would really appreciate it.''Did you clear out those wolves, ${PLAYER}? Great work! I was a little worried we might need to wait until our reinforcements arrived to deal with those beasts, but I knew someone of your skill would have no trouble!

