If Hórin is no longer with you, you can find him at Fellgát.Call Hórin and talk to him or speak to him back at Fellgát'The ice-giant leader, Chieftain Hrungrod, lured us into a trap. It will be a tough fight for just the two of us, but I am willing to make him pay for it if you are.''The ice-giant leader, Chieftain Hrungrod, lured us into a trap. It will be a tough fight for just the two of us, but I am willing to make him pay for it if you are.''We have repaid Hrungrod for his treachery, and his fate will serve as warning to others of his people. Revenge is best served when cold, do they say? It gets little colder than the halls of the ice-giants!''Hrungrod has been repaid for his treachery, and the ice-giant chieftain's fate will serve as warning to others of his people. Revenge is best served when cold, do they say? It gets little colder than the halls of the ice-giants!'Kyrstig has noticed some hobgoblins lurking near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.Hobgoblin hunters can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.

