You should return to him.Return to Klúso'It wasn't long after that the hobgoblins and Orcs started fighting. I think they're still fighting right now!''I was scouting near Bazan-medan, the gate to the Clovengap, when I heard the stomping of many heavy feet.'Goblin looters are using the battle as an opportunity to steal from the ice-giants.Goblin looters have been spotted stealing from the ice-giants in Thyrstáth.

