If Hórin is no longer with you, you can find him at Fellgát.Call Hórin and talk to him or speak to him back at FellgátYou found a goblin sneaking around during all the fighting in Thyrstáth, taking advantage of the chaos to steal from the ice-giants. Defeating the looters may help prove your worthiness to the giants.'There's few things I hate more than thieves. Goblin thieves? Now those are just the worst. Hopefully the ice-giants will appreciate this.''There's few things I hate more than thieves. Goblin thieves? Now those are just the worst. Hopefully the ice-giants will appreciate this.'Angmarim enemies perform rituals in the camp of Mullach Cagar. They must be defeated.The Angmarim camp of Mullach Cagar lies south of Fellgát.

