ate the Free People wherever you may find them in the Ettenmoors.Slay Free Peoples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})The battle continues. You are tasked by the War-tyrant with eliminating the Free People to earn greater glory.Battle in the Ettenmoors continues. Your contributions to the battle will earn you a great reward.Fight in the Ettenmoors until you eliminated a great number of enemies. Then you can reap your rewards from the Captain-general at Glán Vraig.Complete Battle Task: To the Front! (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Having beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.Report your efforts to Captain-General TordúrAcross the Ettenmoors, the enemies of the Free People rampage. Take up your arms and defeat the enemy. You shall be rewarded for your efforts.'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. Your deeds echo through the ranks of my forces. You are a formidable opponent and I am grateful to count you as an ally against the growing darkness in this land.'As battle in the Ettenmoors is waged, you are recognized for your contribution to the slaughter.Make your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find.Complete Battle Task: Eliminate the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Go and tell War-tyrant Akúlhun of your deedsBrag of your deeds to War-tyrant AkúlhunDo your part in the battle. Slay the Free People where they are found and earn your place in the army of Angmar!'You are truly a warrior, ${PLAYER}. You are well remembered for these efforts.'Battle in the Ettenmoors continues. Your contributions to the battle will earn you a great reward.Fight throughout the Ettenmoors and continue to purge the enemy from these lands. You will need to defeat several enemies to fulfill this task.Complete Battle Task: To the Front! (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Having beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.Report your efforts to Captain-General TordúrAcross the Ettenmoors, the enemies of the Free People rampage. Take up your arms and defeat the enemy. You shall be rewarded for your efforts.'As always, ${PLAYER}, we can look to you as a beacon of good and decency. The Free People owe you much.'Battle in the Ettenmoors continues. Your contributions to the battle will earn you great reward.You have been tasked with fighting and defeating the enemies out of Angmar. Make your way to the front and see that the enemy is soundly thrashed.Complete Battle Task: To the Front! (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Having beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.Report your efforts to Captain-General TordúrAcross the Ettenmoors, the enemies of the Free People rampage. Take up your arms and defeat the enemy. You shall be rewarded for your efforts.'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. The forces of Angmar will not soon forget the losses they suffer at your hands.'Battle in the Ettenmoors continues. You are tasked with rooting out the enemy and destroying them where they are found.Enemies of the Free People roam throughout the Ettenmoors. Seek them out and defeat them wherever you find them.Defeat enemies out of Angmar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})As the battle in the Ettenmoors continues, you are charged with hunting down the enemy of the Free People by Captain-General Tordúr.Battle in the Ettenmoors continues, and you must contribute to the fight.Make your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find.Complete Battle Task: Eliminate the Free People (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Go and tell War-tyrant Akúlhun of your deeds.Speak with War-tyrant AkúlhunDo your part in the battle. Slay the Free People where they are found and earn your place in the army of Angmar!'This pleases me greatly, ${PLAYER}. Keep slaughtering. Never stop. We wi