ons (${NUMBER}/100)Far under Mount Gundabad lies the Den of Pughlak, the realm of the deepest of the deep toads.Complete the quest Den of Pughlak -- Tier 1Far under Mount Gundabad lies the Den of Pughlak, the realm of the deepest of the deep toads.Complete the quest Den of Pughlak -- Tier 2Far under Mount Gundabad lies the Den of Pughlak, the realm of the deepest of the deep toads.Complete the quest Den of Pughlak -- Tier 3Far under Mount Gundabad lies the Den of Pughlak, the realm of the deepest of the deep toads.Complete Den of Pughlak -- Tier 3Explore important points of interest and natural landmarks within Clovengap.Explore important points of interest and natural landmarks within Clovengap.Explore StókksetExplore KurdushâlakExplore Danakh-khêjExplore TharrkirînExplore AmgaruslunExplore BazanmanarYou have discovered the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest.Discover the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest.Discover the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of RestAlthough it was all but abandoned for a time after the downfall of the False King and Steward of Angmar, Mordirith, the remnants of the Iron Crown have returned to Carn Dûm, seeking to wield a lost artifact of the Witch-king of Angmar to win dominion over the Free Peoples of Middle-earth.Discover the encampment of Bail Avarc overlooking the city of Carn Dûm.Discover the encampment of Bail Avarc overlooking the city of Carn DûmGrants completion of deed: Discovery: Carn DûmBy completing this quest, you will be marked as completing Discovery: Carn Dûm'Now, my little fellows, where be you a-going to, puffing like a bellows? What's the matter here then? Tell me what's your trouble!

