RenewedComplete Quests of Belfalas RenewedComplete Quests of Blackroot Vale RenewedOnce the seat of the Witch-king of Angmar, the dread citadel of Gwathrenost casts a long shadow upon the city of Carn Dûm. All but abandoned after the Steward of Angmar was deposed, the remnants of the Iron Crown have crept forth from the shadows, seeking to master a lost artifact of the Witch-king and reclaim dominion of Angmar.You must overcome the evils gathered within Gwathrenost, the Witch-king's Citadel.

