<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.</rgb>Defeat RádarrígMany dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown.Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.Explore the sewers and confront GárvadachGárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.Defeat GárvadachA heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this "king of rats" will not stand for more trespassers!Defeat RádarrígMany dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown.Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.Explore the sewers and confront GárvadachGárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.Defeat GárvadachA heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.Explore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)Gárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this "king of rats" will not stand for more trespassers!Defeat RádarrígMany dangerous creatures have called the sewers of Carn Dûm home. Some have remained rumours, nothing more. Others, however, may be of interest to the scattered remnants of the Iron Crown.Lágsaith has begun her tale. With the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far.Explore the sewers and confront GárvadachGárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption.Defeat GárvadachA heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers.Explore the sew