You should defeat Fladach.

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.</rgb>Defeat FladachYou have defeated Fladach and cleared the path deeper into Sarch Vorn.

You should continue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey Fear.

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You can use the 'Call Gorwen' skill to call Gorwen to your side at Sarch Vorn.</rgb>Continue deeper into Sarch Vorn and search for Hithrengor, the Grey FearYou have encountered Luilloth in the depths of Sarch Vorn.

