'You helped Othor with the Haradrim back when he was defending the Minlos beacon.

'Now I am here, and you arrived at just the right moment. As the region deals with restoration efforts, more and more insurgent Corsairs keep appearing. We've been notified of a camp nearby, off the road to the west. Could you possibly help us with these brigands?''I knew you would not fail us ${PLAYER}, as expected of a person of your skill.'

The Minlos defender stands firm before you.

