Dingási is in the Harlond.Return to Dingási'Thank you for gathering the crate for Lokhûr. To be honest, I did not really need you for such a menial task. I admit that it was a bit of a test of your character, but the way Arahál said you looked at Lokhûr makes me feel like I can trust you with something of a more delicate matter.

'As you know, I am in charge of the reconstruction of the Harlond. The city's rulers chose us because of the high-quality stone that we bring from our mines in Lower Lebennin. However, I have noticed recently that stone of inferior quality seems to have been mixed in with our perfect blocks. You can easily pick out these lesser lumps of grit by their yellowed colour and delicateness. In fact, I bet you could shatter one of these blocks to dust with a few well-placed blows.

'I suspect someone is trying to sabotage our work. To what end, I know not, but I will not allow it. I would ask you, if you are willing, to search the city for these imposter blocks and destroy them.''You return! Did you find and destroy many of the inferior blocks?'Bagud-dum has become the main stronghold of the Cult of Drugoth in the Welkin-lofts. It is imperative that their numbers be lessened.Angmarim of the Cult of Drugoth and the fell spirits they have summoned can be found in Bagud-dum.

