You have done much to aid those opposing the Iron Crown at Carn Dûm. You should talk to Muirál.

<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Bail Avarc can initially only be accessed via stable-master routes. Bail Avarc can be reached via the stable-masters at Esteldín, Gath Forthnír, and the stables of Rivendell.</rgb>Talk to Muirál at Bail Avarc'Hail, ${PLAYER}.

'Are you here to join the fight against the Iron Crown? There are vile things afoot at Sant Lhoer, Thaurisgar, Sagroth, and within the halls of Gwathrenost.

'If you aid us in hindering the Iron Crown's efforts in Carn Dûm, we would welcome your aid.'


<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: To advance this quest, you must complete one of the following on any group Size or difficulty Tier: 'Sant Lhoer, the Poison Gardens', 'Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary', 'Sagroth, Lair of Vermin', or 'Gwathrenost, the Witch-king's Citadel'.</rgb>'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.

