Talk to Nanthel in Linhir.Talk to Nanthel'I'm not so incompetent a sergeant that I don't know what's been happening with Berion. Nor am I so heartless that I would deprive the lad of his livelihood because he remains haunted by the war.'

He stops to rub the weariness from his eyes. It doesn't work.

'He isn't the only soldier I've known to be troubled in this way.'

Casting his gaze to the south-west, he says, 'I've heard of a healer in Linhir who is interested in cases like Berion's. I would ask that you deliver this letter to her. I want to help Berion, but I don't have the knowledge.'The healer reads the letter before folding it back up and tucking it into the folds of her dress.

