You should bring the pack to Drambor in Calembel.'Pssst, ${PLAYER}. Can I talk to you?'

You take a few steps to the side with Drambor so he can speak quietly to you.

'Having father home has been really wonderful, but even though he left me in charge of Calembel when he went to war, I think he thinks I'm still just a little kid. I've been volunteering to bring messages from the city to the two beacons to show him how responsible I am, but...'

He glances at his father Angbor and lowers his voice so much that you can barely hear him.

'Well, you see, I was on my way back from the beacons with a bag full of missives for my father when I was attacked by some annoyingly aggressive avanc. I managed to get away, but they snatched my bag from me! I haven't told him yet that I've lost it, but maybe with your help I won't have to!

'Can you look for it? Uhm, I admit I'm not sure I remember exactly where I lost it. There was a waterfall nearby! I remember that much! Listen, it was dark, all right? And I was running... anyhow, look for my pack near one of the waterfalls between here and the beacons. Oh, and if you can exact a vicious revenge upon those overgrown lizards, so much the better!''Oh, it's you!'

He coughs to cover his loud voice and then whispers, 'Did you find it? Father is starting to wonder where the missives are!'

You hand over the bite-ridden pack. Drambor's eyes widen when he sees the damage, and he hurriedly opens the pack's flap to peer inside. When he sees the missives within, he sighs dramatically, his shoulders sagging with relief.

'They're intact! And not covered in avanc drool. Oh, thank you, thank you!'River-avanc in Lamedon have grown overly bold, aggressive, and frankly, quite annoying.Drambor has asked you to defeat annoyingly aggressive avanc along the rivers in southern Lamedon.Defeat annoyingly aggressive avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You should let Drambor know that the riverways and roads are safer with fewer annoying avanc laying in wait to chomp on missing bags and traveller legs.

Drambor is in Calembel.Return to Drambor'Since you are heading in that direction anyhow, why don't you do us all a favour and put down as many of those annoying avanc as you can. Not only will I have my revenge, but it will make the waterways and roads safer for other travellers as well.''Thank you for taking care of those obnoxious lizards, my friend. Father is sure to be happy that I took matters into my own hands to deal with this issue.

'Uhm, with your help of course, that is.'The efforts to rebuild the lighthouse have been hindered by the hauntings at Gaerlond.

