Remhir can be found in Barad Rill.Talk to Remhir in Barad Rill'The crabs bother the workers and get in the way of our efforts to rebuild people's homes across Dor-en-Ernil.

'While we can waste away swinging sword and spear at these creatures endlessly, we need a deterrent and perhaps a way to potentially harvest them, but at least my new traps should be able to keep them at bay!''Thank you! Now we can teach those crabs what for!

