Deliver the crossbow bolts to someone in Ethring.As you survey the Bolt-holes, you find many spare quivers of crossbow bolts. Disarming the brigands would help safeguard the passage between Dor-En-Ernil and Ringló Vale.Laerind laughs when you present your bounty of crossbow bolts.

'Hello again, old friend. Now where did you get these?'

You tell her of your encounter at the Bolt-holes. She laughs harder.

'I am glad to see you have not changed since you left Ethring. Always solving problems and helping the common folk, hmm?

'Please make time to speak to Arvaethor while you are here. I am sure he will be as pleased to see you as I am.'Defeat many of the Dead in western King's Gondor.Defeat many of the Dead in western King's Gondor.Defeat many of the Dead in western King's GondorDefeat many of the Dead in western King's Gondor.Defeat many of the Dead in western King's Gondor.Defeat many of the Dead in western King's GondorFaniel is concerned that the crebain are disrupting the workers of Parth Rest.Faniel has asked you to defeat crebain around Parth Rest.Defeat crebain or ravens around Parth Rest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})You have done what you can to quell the encroaching crebain. You should report your success to Faniel.

Faniel can be found in Parth Rest.Talk to Faniel in Parth Rest'The workers are being pestered by crebain. Defeat the crebain and ravens around Parth Rest.

'Should things continue as they are, we will never complete our task here.''Thank you for your help ${PLAYER}.

