'If you are heading that way, take care. If you are inclined to lessen their numbers, even better!''You've done Dol Amroth a great service this day. Thank you for doing what you could to help make the roads to Dol Amroth safer.'Guard Osbenn was supposed to scout the way-crossing west of Tadrent, but he is too tired to do it now.The way-crossing is west of Tadrent.

