Abartârik is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.Return to Abartârik'Though my father has returned to the governance of Dol Amroth, I am still much involved in seeing to the city's many duties and tasks. One of those tasks is receiving daily reports from our swan-knights who patrol the countryside.

'A recent report on the state of Hashadir has given me cause for concern. I ask that you speak with Captain Abartârik about what they found there. I think you could be of help. You will find Abartârik near the Swan-knight's Keep, probably seeing to the training of their fellow soldiers.''Thank you for taking care of our vermin problem. I know it's not a pleasant task, but they often carry disease and can be a great risk to our citizens.''Greetings. You say the Lady Lothíriel sent you? I am not sure if this means she trusts you or wishes to punish you.'

The knight chuckles slightly to themself.

'Oh, it's nothing so bad... it just might not be the most enjoyable of tasks. You see, we were successful in driving the invading Corsairs out of Hashadir, but while they fled, they left behind a most undesirable surprise - rats. Rats of the most unusual size, even. Who knew rats could grow so large?

'In any case, our tasks here in Dol Amroth have kept us from cleaning them out, but if you are willing to do so, there is a reward.'A wily merchant is displeased by the opening of the roads which pass by Ost Amondal.Balgam has asked you to retrieve crates that he has stashed about the ruins of Ost Amondal.

