You should defeat spiders in Lhingroth to aid the people of Sardol.You have defeated a number of foul spiders in Lhingroth and brought a renewed sense of peace to the hamlet of Sardol.In Edhellond, you discovered a vase filled with dead flowers.You should ask the Avorrim around Edhellond what kind of flowers to put in the now-empty vase.Talk to CellinethTalk to BrenirielTalk to LathlornYou have been advised to talk to an Elf named Calendorion.

