'Until then, I want you to seek passage across the seas. We now know that this Khâshap is prone to mistakes when pressured.

'I shall follow the trail to whatever ends. I will make contact with you when the time comes.

'I am grateful for your assistance here.'Hadorion has completed his investigation and needs your help to solve the case.Hadorion wants your help preventing the culprit from making an escape by sea.Talk to HadorionFollow Hadorion in confronting the true culprit to solve the case.Confront IndagirIndagir, or Khâshap has made their escape. Talk to Hadorion for further instructions.Talk to Hadorion'Let us rid ourselves of this place.''This Khâshap has gotten away, but now we know what his goal was: to deliver this Bile of Ifrinn.

