'Good hunting.''That ought to be plenty of meat and bones for now. I'm sure my injuries will heal well before my next outing.'Explore settlements and other important points of interest in Anfalas.Explore settlements and other important points of interest in Anfalas.Find Barad FaenFind Echad LendirFind TumbamálëFind Lond CirionFind ArthiantFind ThombadFind Sadrech's CampFind the Lumber CampFind LothmarFind MelgobasExplore the lands of Anfalas and Pinnath Gelin in Outer Gondor.Explore the lands of Anfalas and Pinnath Gelin in Outer Gondor.Complete Explorer of AnfalasComplete Explorer of Pinnath GelinComplete Perils of the LangstrandComplete Perils of the Green HillsExplore settlements and other important points of interest in Pinnath Gelin.Explore settlements and other important points of interest in Pinnath Gelin.Find Ost ArndírFind IáphelFind MerehamFind CressfeldFind CornworthFind WinburyFind WetcroftFind LeekingFind BergrawNatholan is not confident his waggon will make the rest of the journey.Natholan has asked you to find a spare wheel in Lond Cirion.

