You should free Udnerth from his bindings.You've done what you set out to do.

You should talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.Talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor'None of this feels right.'

She looks down at her father's knife in her hands.

'Take this away from me, please. I don't think Father would want me risking my life to hurt people with it... but what if you used it to free other captives? There must be some still surviving. There must be a chance...

'I'll wait here. If you find any captives, I can guide them to Melgobas.''My name's Udnerth. I'll spare you the trouble of searching for more survivors; I'm the last one.

'You say there's a girl from Melgobas waiting nearby? Get me out of here, and I'll make a run for it.'

He glances at the knife in your hands. Something changes in his weather-worn face, but you can't quite figure out what.

'After you free me from my bindings, could you give me that? I haven't got anything to defend myself with.''The moment I saw you holding that knife, I should have realized it was mine. But I didn't dare hope... hope left me long ago.

'These Corsairs have been allowed to harass us for too long. The rest of the kingdom has moved on from the war, and yet Anfalas has been left to fester.

'Still... not all is lost. A stranger was kind enough to help my son and daughter, asking for nothing in return.' A grin breaks across Udnerth's face before he turns to Hedra.

'Let's go home.'Explore enemy encampments and other dangerous places in Pinnath Gelin.Explore enemy encampments and other dangerous places in Pinnath Gelin.Find KrauzhafFind ShulgmokhFind FarrowfoldFind GnatsteadFind Marsa AdârFind Pahor BohaFind GlaerendalfFind Rasping-cragFind Hunter's RockFind Loeg ThangalfFind MunadhorFind ElberyFind RitherstadExplore enemy encampments and other dangerous places in Anfalas.Explore enemy encampments and other dangerous places in Anfalas.Find KhatsûrFind SnarlwoodFind DelugelFind LoxhallFind Springer's CloseFind Khâla NiketFind FleetmireFind Bel TâkhmarFind the Wreck of the Kêl TezhorFind LithengrisFind the Dun Ox HerdComplete quests in Anfalas in Outer Gondor.Complete quests in Anfalas in Outer Gondor.Complete quests in Anfalas in Outer GondorComplete quests in Anfalas and Pinnath Gelin to aid the peoples of Outer Gondor.Complete quests in Anfalas and Pinnath Gelin to aid the peoples of Outer Gondor.Complete Quests of AnfalasComplete Quests of Pinnath GelinComplete quests in Pinnath Gelin in Outer Gondor.Complete quests in Pinnath Gelin in Outer Gondor.Complete quests in Pinnath Gelin in Outer GondorRindur fishes for the people of Melgobas, not the local sea-gulls!Hungry sea-gulls flock to Melgobas to steal Rindur's hard-earned fish.

