'You are a ${CLASS}, are you not? My daughter and I wish to return to Melgobas, but with Corsairs brazenly roaming so close to the road, I do not like our chances.

'Their encampment lies to the north-east. If you can cause trouble and defeat some of them, I'd feel better about those chances.''I shall rest easier now. Many thanks, ${CLASS}.'Lindil needs your help finding her missing spouse.Lindil has asked you to check "The Brew and Bounty" for her spouse, Tirneldir, in lower Lond Cirion near the northern lift.Search for Lindil's spouse in "The Brew and Bounty" near the docksYou do not see Tirneldir within "The Brew and Bounty" in Lond Cirion. The guard sitting at the table may know where he went.'Greetings traveller, do you have a moment? I am in dire need of help.

