You should slap cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.You have slapped one cow rump, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.

You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.You have slapped two cow rumps, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.

You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.Your hand stings and you have stepped in something squishy and yet - there remain still more rumps that need slapping!

