Any willing adventurers who can help reduce their numbers would be welcomed. If you manage to succeed, report back to Zûfan here in Jadambor and you'll be rewarded for your efforts.

They can be dangerous. You may want to bring some companions.You inform Zûfan about the completed bounty.

'Good tidings you bring me. The shades are surely not to stop any time soon, but your efforts will give us time to catch our breath.

'Be sure to check the board for more requests. We need all the help we can get down here.'A bounty notice asks you to defeat a deadly wasp called Rakhûl in the Gorge of Woe.A bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat the wasp Rakhûl in the Gorge of Woe to the north-east.Defeat RakhûlReturn to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Rakhûl.Return to Neshurga and inform him of Rakhûl's defeatThe bounty notice reads:

