entRescue fourth kidnapped residentReturn to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report.Return to Numûru in Urmâkh'I am Numûru, pleased to meet you outsider. I am the sworn protector and Hand of the Queen, leader of the deadly Subuzûri and — if you ply me with enough wine — singer of songs of Mizâdi's deeds and battles from Urmâkh to the Khûd. But that can wait for happier times, friend.

'I have an urgent matter with which I'd ask your help. Scouts of the All-seeing have been pressing closer and closer to Urmâkh. We captured five this week alone. Regrettably, we missed a raiding party this morning. They made off with several innocent residents of Urmâkh, no doubt to torture them for information on our plans and defences.

'You have proven quite resourceful in accomplishing much for Hamât, and Mizâdi. She has placed her trust in you multiple times, and you haven't let her down. I've been watching you quite closely, friend. This is a mission of great import. I believe you are skilled enough to accomplish what few others could. Please, go to Kûr Anzar, find where they have taken those Urmâkhi citizens, free them, and defeat any Barkhûshim that get in your way. You are the best hope those people have to return safely to Urmâkh, so please, go quickly.''You found them all. That is welcome news indeed! Those people owe you their lives. Be careful, I shall soon have to make a song for your deeds, ${PLAYER}! Thank you for your brave deeds, my friend.'Defeat many darkwaters in Dil-irmíz.Defeat many darkwaters in Dil-irmíz.Defeat many darkwaters in Dil-irmízDefeat a great many darkwaters in Dil-irmíz.Defeat many darkwaters in Dil-irmíz.Defeat a great many darkwaters in Dil-irmíz.Defeat a great many darkwaters in Dil-irmízYou chose the fire-stoker as the foreman that will have a work incident.Provide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.You need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.Visit Othax after 24 hours expireIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the fire-stoker would have a worker's accident.Speak with Othax at RakhatâbWait to see if you won.'If you submit this choice, you will bet on the fire-stoker workers having an accident today. Come back tomorrow to see if you were right.''Let us see which, if any, foremen had a worker accident yesterday.''All right, I will mark this down. Come back tomorrow to see if you won.'You chose the forge-master as the foreman that will have a work incident.Provide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.You need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.Visit Othax after 24 hours expi