t will have a work incident befall his workers.Provide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.You need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.Visit Othax after 24 hours expireIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the safety foreman's workers would have an accident.Speak with Othax at RakhatâbWait to see if you have won.'If you submit this choice, you will bet that the safety foreman's charges will have an accident today. Are you really certain about this? There is almost never a day without an incident. It is highly unlikely that the safety foreman will not have an incident.'

