s delved deep into the stone, hidden by sorcery since the end of the First Age. The Thardúth, one of Morgoth's powerful agents, bred the great Elder Orcs known as the Utûgi. Its denizens have remained in a sorcerous slumber for millennia, but have now awakened, and their lair opened anew with the passing of the threat of Sauron.Be among the first to complete Temple of Utug-bûr -- Tier 3Utug-bûr is home to long-hidden vaults delved deep into the stone, hidden by sorcery since the end of the First Age. The Thardúth, one of Morgoth's powerful agents, bred the great Elder Orcs known as the Utûgi. Its denizens have remained in a sorcerous slumber for millennia, but have now awakened, and their lair opened anew with the passing of the threat of Sauron.Investigate DhórgruthInvestigate DhórgruthDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.Defeat Kulkorth and his petsDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.Defeat Maluchon, the Pale BrotherUtug-bûr is home to long-hidden vaults delved deep into the stone, hidden by sorcery since the end of the First Age. The Thardúth, one of Morgoth's powerful agents, bred the great Elder Orcs known as the Utûgi. Its denizens have remained in a sorcerous slumber for millennia, but have now awakened, and their lair opened anew with the passing of the threat of Sauron.Investigate DhórgruthInvestigate DhórgruthDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.Defeat Kulkorth and his petsDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.Defeat Maluchon, the Pale BrotherUtug-bûr is home to long-hidden vaults delved deep into the stone, hidden by sorcery since the end of the First Age. The Thardúth, one of Morgoth's powerful agents, bred the great Elder Orcs known as the Utûgi. Its denizens have remained in a sorcerous slumber for millennia, but have now awakened, and their lair opened anew with the passing of the threat of Sauron.Investigate DhórgruthInvestigate DhórgruthDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.Defeat Kulkorth and his petsDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.Defeat Maluchon, the Pale BrotherYour pursuit of Azagath and his companion through the Temple of Utug-bûr leads to the inner sanctum. You feel uneasy and unwell as a chill and odorous breeze envelops you. Something is not right here.You must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.Defeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner SanctumAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.Survive the impending attackThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.Stop Azagath from achieving his goalAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.Defeat the Alad defending Gârash
