You should return to Numûru in Nashûbu.Talk to Numûru'We have control of several key footholds in the city and the entrance to the royal palace, but there are still many Ordâkhai soldiers fighting in the streets. They need to be mopped up, and all traces of their leadership structure dismantled. Up for some janitorial work?''With the defeat of their captains, the Ordâkhai are on their last legs. All that remains is to claim the palace, and we will have won this battle. Excellent work, ${PLAYER}.'The time has come to put Mizâdi's strategy into action. The first step is to clear the way to Emax Dûl.Captain Hanâbu has gone ahead to attack the Ordâkhai forward camp, Jolakhúro.

You should meet up with Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro.Talk to Captain Hanâbu outside JolakhúroCaptain Hanâbu needs your assistance clearing the path for the incoming army.

