You should return to Captain Hanâbu.Talk to Captain Hanâbu'Do you see these barricades placed along the road? They will greatly slow the advance of our allied army. See what you can do to remove them.''Ah, good work! I was worried we were going to have to physically pick them all up and move them!'Defeat many dangerous snakes throughout Idagâl.Defeat many dangerous snakes in Idagâl.Defeat many dangerous snakes in IdagâlDefeat a great many dangerous snakes throughout Idagâl.Defeat many snakes throughout Idagâl.Defeat a great many snakes in Idagâl.Defeat a great many snakes in IdagâlTrack down and defeat every formidable enemy in Kighân.Track down and defeat every formidable enemy in Kighân.Defeat KorutáshDefeat NâralargDefeat Jûkhtar the RavenousDefeat Shahâk, Bloodtooth's PupDefeat TârchakhDefeat TodôkhaDefeat LemûlkhanDefeat KhamôshDefeat BloodtoothYou have proven yourself by defeating Bârlat and his brigands inside the Treasure Caves of Hurum Kâna; pushing back the darkness within Kôth Rau, the Wailing Hold; investigating the disturbances inside Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace; and surviving what lay inside the Folly of Nagakhêdi. None can question your tenacity and determination, and by completing all these deeds, you have earned great favour throughout Mûr Ghala.Complete the deeds of the Mûr Ghala instances.Complete 'Renewer of The Treasure Caves of Hurum Kâna'Complete 'Vanquisher of Kôth Rau, the Wailing Hold'Complete 'Vanquisher of Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace'Complete 'Deeds of The Folly of Nagakhêdi'For over a hundred years, the Kintai Elves have battled a mysterious blight, seemingly brought on by the Din of Stone. It has already consumed once-beautiful Adagím, and now threatens the rest of the Elven glades. An investigation by the Rangers Faeron and Rhadrog has tracked the source of the blight to The Folly of Nagakhêdi, but what dangers lurk inside the ancient and abandoned wonder?Many challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.Defeat Badharál the GorgerMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.Defeat MaukhornMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.Defeat the Legion of LhaerethMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.Defeat Zamâktar the PutrescentYou have completed the Folly of Nagakhêdi on Tier 1.Completed: Conquering the Folly of Nagakhêdi (Tier 1)'We know not what awaits us ahead, ${PLAYER}. I pray we are prepared for what might come. Whatever awaits, we will face it together!'

