You should talk to Kotráka Saiya and complete the Session.Complete 'Session: Life on the Other Side'You have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.

You should talk to Kotráka Saiya.Talk to Kotráka SaiyaYou have heard Kotráka Saiya's story.

You should talk to Mizâdi to hear what she thinks.Talk to Mizâdi'Tell Kotráka Saiya I will hear her story. Her words must convince us to put our fates in the hands of an Ordâkhai princess! Will they do this?

'She has risked her life by coming here, and I believe she knows this. This gives me pause enough to hear what she has to say.''Let me tell you what life is like inside Emax Dûl... and why I have chosen to abandon it.''...And that is why I decided to come to you, my enemies, and beseech you for your help.

'Please... you must understand what a desperate mother would do to save her children. Even if it is too late to save my husband... I had to do something!''She believes some dark force now controls her husband, and she must abandon both him and her station to save her children's lives....'

Mizâdi pauses, deep in thought.

'I am not sure I fully understand what is happening in the palace, but I understand her grief and desperation. Those are things I can trust. I will accept her deal, and we will rescue her children.'Kâbtam needs help increasing the camp's supplies if more escapees are on the way.Kâbtam has asked you to hunt the dread-tortoises for their meat.

