You should return to Kâbtam.Talk to Kâbtam'I dare not hope... but if what Arâniz says is true and you mean to help more of us escape, we need more food. We cannot get more people out of Esh Mêkag only to have them starve to death in these ruins!

'Before I was captured by the Ordâkhai, I was a hunter. There is little game in these parched lands, but I believe there may still be tortoises along what remains of the river Agâl. They are decent eating, if you can get through the shell.''This will do. Thank you, ${PLAYER}. The meat is a little tough, but can be cooked into a nice stew. Now, please get as many prisoners out of Esh Mêkag as you can!'Mûlazar has demanded that you defeat some of his foes... and as long as they are your foes as well, you see no reason not to comply.Mûlazar's foes include the were-wolves and their servants throughout Nan Ogol.Defeat Draugrim throughout Nan Ogol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat Khûrz-hai throughout Nan Ogol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Defeat wargs throughout Nan Ogol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})Mûlazar is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Mûlazar in Mur RámtorMûlazar has demanded that you learn what befell his winged steed after he was shot from its back following his escape from Bâr Guruthos.Orthonn is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Orthonn in Mur RámtorMûlazar is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Mûlazar in Mur RámtorMûlazar has demanded that you interfere with the efforts of the were-wolves to mine delothlin throughout Nan Ogol.Mûlazar is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Mûlazar in Mur RámtorGhôl-buri-Prân is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Mûlazar is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Mûlazar in Mur RámtorMûlazar has demanded that you send word to Nurn to tell his consort Nûlbanath of the treachery of the were-wolves, and that he still lives.Harthalín is in Mur Rámtor and wishes to speak with you.Talk to Harthalín in Mur RámtorHarthalín has asked to speak with you upstairs in Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Harthalín upstairs in Koi-mêdh-twarHarthalín is at the cave of Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk to Harthalín at the cave of Koi-mêdh-twarMûlazar is in Mur Rámtor beneath Koi-mêdh-twar.Talk t